window.AKK_SPEND_STEPMOTHER_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_SPEND_STEPMOTHER_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: Keiko Joangdu Mo","paragraphs":["\"Thank you so much for investing in us,\" the producer said out of the blue, leaving Sheng Mumu and Qiao Li staring at each other in bewilderment.","What's going on???","It turns out the secret investor behind Passionate Delusions is Qi Mo???","Under the table, the two clenched their hands even tighter and strained to listen to the conversation at the next table.","From the producer's chat with Qi Mo, Sheng Mumu finally figured it out.","Qi's Media Company was the financial backer of Passionate Delusions.","Quite low-key, not mentioned in the ending credits.","Their strategy was to make big bucks in silence.","The producer briefly reported to Qi Mo about the current theater screening arrangements, then smiled and said, \"Mr. Qi, based on the current market, after deducting all parties' shares, Qi's Media should get at least four times return on investment as the biggest investor.\"","Qi Mo's expression remained aloof and indifferent. \"Okay, you can coordinate with the media company's team,\" he didn't bother with such details.","Sheng Mumu's breath hitched upon hearing this. Her scalp tingled.","Four times!","Four times the 15 million investment, 60 million!!","She could almost hear the sound of coins dropping.","Ding ding dang dang, crisp and pleasant.","And her gaze towards Qi Mo held a trace of resentment towards the rich.","So unfair!!!!","She and Qin Jiaqiu worked hard developing plans and proposals, contacting parties, coordinating promotions.","Their company's monthly revenue probably didn't even amount to the loose change of Qi Mo's investment in a single project.","The tragic plot of the movie didn't make her cry.","But now she truly, sincerely wanted to shed tears of grievance.","Just when she was lamenting Qi Mo's ability to earn big bucks, she heard him mention her.","\"My wife and cousin really enjoyed this film. I wonder if it's possible to get a few signed photos of the leads?\" he asked.","The producer was visibly taken aback.","What was that about?","If Mr. Qi wanted something, just a word from him would get the leads and supporting cast to accompany him to dinners and events.","There was no need to ask them.","\"Of course we can,\" the producer turned and called the new actor and actress leads over, \"Come on...\"","In the next few minutes, Sheng Mumu and Qiao Li transformed into fangirls.","They took photos with the director and leads and got the signed photos.","In the Rolls Royce on the way back, the two sat in the rear seats.","Sheng Mumu mentally replayed what had happened at the restaurant.","She still felt dazed and confused.","The more she thought about it, the more bizarre yet reasonable it seemed.","After a while, she couldn't resist any longer.","Curling her hand into a microphone shape, she held it to the chest of the silent man beside her.","She asked the TV drama line she had been dying to say.","\"Mr. Qi, how many more surprises do you have that I don't know about?\"","Qi Mo lowered his eyes to look at her hand, his gaze flickering briefly.","Then his chest shook slightly as he chuckled lowly.","His warm breath puffed against Sheng Mumu's clenched fist.","He turned to look at her, his eyes stopping on her own smiling ones, and slowly drawled,","\"There's a lot more.\"","Sheng Mumu's hand stiffened.","Looking at the man's raised eyelashes, deep and glimmering eyes, and lazily superior posture, she understood.","Carefully savoring his words, she shook her head and couldn't help teasing,","\"Mr. Qi, I didn't expect you to be this kind of person.\"","Qi Mo's brow quirked up as he asked in a low rumble,","\"What kind?\"","Sheng Mumu sighed, \"Acting cocky, no different than Qi Shaobai.\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","Sheng Mumu smiled again, \"Makes me want to capture your cocky look.\"","The corners of Qi Mo's lips curved up slowly in pleasure.","His long-fingered hand absently straightened his already neat collar.","He sat up straighter, tilted his head to angle his sharp jaw towards her.","In a magnetic voice that could steal souls, he murmured lowly,","\"Go ahead and take it.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"............\"","What was up with this old man???","Endlessly cocky?","Looking at the mature yet childish, handsome CEO fake husband before her, Sheng Mumu's breathing inexplicably slowed.","Damn, he really knew how to pose.","Above was the starry night roof of the Rolls Royce Phantom, outside was the night cityscape, neon lights lazily filtering in.","It accentuated his already striking side profile.","His collar was partly unbuttoned, revealing the sexy curve of his throat.","Please stop being so charming!","Just as she was about to retort, Qi Mo suddenly said,","\"Take a photo together?\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes widened. ?????","What?","Shocked wasn't just her.","Up front, driver Xiao Wang's hands gripped the wheel tightly.","He didn't even dare breathe loudly.","His pupils shook violently.","Was this...was this still the Qi Mo he knew?","Unbelievable!","*","The car entered Xiyu Yue Court.","Large raindrops fell from the sky.","Hitting the car windows with pitter-patter sounds.","The rain had finally arrived.","The stifling heat could finally dissipate.","The luxury car passed through the villa's front iron gates and stopped at the entrance.","Butler Zhang was already waiting outside.","Seeing the car park, he opened an umbrella and walked to the door.","\"Sir, Madam.\"","Qi Mo got out of the car and slightly nodded, \"Mm.\"","Sheng Mumu also smiled at Butler Zhang and casually glanced up at the rain.","In that instant, a window on the second floor, its curtains were swiftly drawn closed, blocking the light.","Sheng Mumu didn't see it initially. When the curtains were pulled shut, it caught her attention.","That window was Qi Shaobai's room.","Once inside, a servant came over with hot towels to wipe their hands.","Sheng Mumu took the towel, looking inquisitively at Qi Shaobai's bedroom direction.","What a coincidence.","The faint light seeping from under his door was suddenly switched off as she walked towards the living room.","Something was off.","Fishy.","She turned to look at Qi Mo and was about to speak.","But noticed the man's gaze narrowed, also looking towards Qi Shaobai's room.","Sensing her eyes on him, the man's eyes slowly shifted to her.","They exchanged looks without a word.","Seeming to understand what the other was thinking.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips, took out her phone from her bag..."]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: The night is thick as ink, the shower is repeated.","paragraphs":["Inside the room.","Qi Shaobai changed into his pajamas and leaned against the bedhead, resting the back of his head on his arm.","His expression was becoming more and more solemn.","This shouldn't have happened.","Just now when he heard the sound of the iron gate in the yard opening, he ran to the window to take a look.","Seeing his dad and stepmom getting out of the car, he timidly pulled the curtains closed and turned off the lights in his bedroom.","Thinking about it now, he regretted it a little.","He often slept with the lights on, but deliberately turning them off this time only increased the feeling of a guilty conscience.","Qi Shaobai's mind was in chaos, continuously guessing whether he had been discovered acting strangely or not.","The screen of his phone on the bedside table suddenly lit up.","Sheng Mumu: \"Young Master Qi, if you're not sleeping, want to come out for a bite?\"","Qi Shaobai looked at the screen, his heart tightening.","Sure enough, deliberately turning off the lights just now was very suspicious behavior.","Could it be that he had been found out?","What should he do?","Should he pretend he was already asleep or go out nonchalantly to eat something?","He hadn't eaten much for dinner, and was a little hungry now.","In the living room.","Qi Mo leaned lazily on the sofa, long legs crossed, posture casual and relaxed. He took the tea handed to him by the butler Zhang.","Sheng Mumu sat next to him holding her phone, staring at the screen suspiciously.","Above the WeChat dialog box.","A line displayed: The other party is typing...","It quickly disappeared.","Sure enough, not sleeping!","She suddenly turned her head and glanced at the elegant, tea-drinking man beside her.","The man nodded gently.","Sheng Mumu's fingers tapped the screen as she typed out a message.","\"Kid, I know you're not sleeping—\"","Before she could finish typing, the door to Qi Shaobai's room slowly opened.","The seventeen-year-old boy wearing pajamas walked out, hair tousled.","He came to the living room, yawned and said, \"You're back? Was the movie good?\"","As soon as he finished speaking, a hint of amusement flashed through Qi Mo's eyes.","Of course, Qi Shaobai didn't notice it.","Nor did he notice Sheng Mumu wink at his dad.","Sheng Mumu pushed forward the bag on the coffee table.","\"We went out for Cantonese food and packed up the leftover fish ball congee.\"","\"Oh.\" Qi Shaobai sat down on the sofa as if nothing had happened and opened the takeout bag.","Sheng Mumu began her performance, answering Qi Shaobai's earlier question as if inadvertently.","\"The movie was quite good, it's a pity you didn't get to see it.\"","Qi Shaobai drank a spoonful of congee and vaguely said,","\"It's okay, there will be a chance to see it when it's released.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Sheng Mumu casually continued the conversation, then turned to look at Qi Mo, \"Oh, right, I didn't quite understand the ending, didn't the female lead leave a letter for the male lead? Why didn't the male lead find out the truth until later?\"","Qi Mo's long lashes hid the joyful glint in his eyes as he said in a deep voice, \"The one who saw the letter wasn't him.\"","\"Huh?\" Sheng Mumu looked surprised, \"Then who was it?\"","Qi Mo gently slowed down his tone, patiently explaining, \"It was his enemy's son.\"","Sheng Mumu spoke doubtfully, \"That can't be, that back view was clearly the male lead, their hair color was exactly the same.\"","Qi Mo said, \"Mm, the hair color is the same, but they gave a two second shot to hint at it to the audience.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"That's too subtle, who could understand that without an explanation.\"","Qi Mo: \"Mm, most people can't see it.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly had a look of realization: \"Ah—could it be that scene where he was holding chopsticks? His right hand?\"","Qi Mo said gently, \"That's right.\"","\"No, it was the left hand, the mole on the ring finger, it was shown in the second shot of the opening scene.\" Qi Shaobai casually chimed in.","After he finished speaking, the air seemed to freeze for a moment.","The teenager's eyes suddenly widened, and the hand holding the spoon stiffened.","He felt the surrounding air seeming to slowly turn to ice.","Damn!","What did he just say????","He really wanted to hit himself, how could he not keep his mouth shut!","Clinging to a shred of hope, he slowly raised his eyes.","Two sharp gazes looked over at the same time.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo almost spoke in unison:","\"How do you know about that?\"","Qi Shaobai: .........","In the end, he honestly confessed the whole story about sneaking off to watch the movie premiere.","And repeatedly assured them that before deciding to go see the premiere, he had already done several sets of practice tests in advance, he really really hadn't taken up any study time.","In the process of giving an honest account, he kept his head lowered, not quite daring to meet his dad's gaze directly.","After speaking, he didn't say a word, waiting for the reprimand he knew was coming.","However.","He waited for a long time, but they didn't say a word.","Unable to resist, he snuck a glance up.","His pupils suddenly constricted.","???","Sheng Mumu had an \"I told you so\" expression as she looked at Qi Mo, stifling laughter while speaking:","\"See, I told you this kid would give himself away with the first sentence he said.\"","Qi Mo's lips curved slightly as the smile in his dark eyes grew thicker and thicker. \"Mm, you were right.\"","Sheng Mumu stood up and yawned in imitation of Qi Shaobai's earlier manner, saying,","\"He even faked a yawn, laughable.\"","Qi Mo shook his head lightly with a faint smile, giving a concise evaluation:","\"Better without the yawn.\"","\"Right.\" Sheng Mumu affirmed, \"I dare bet this kid deliberately messed up his hair a bit before coming out of his room.\"","Listening to his dad and stepmother's conversation, Qi Shaobai: \"????\"","This...this...was even harder to take than a scolding!","The damage wasn't high, but the humiliation was extreme!!!","After a while, Sheng Mumu finally stopped laughing and walked around to the stunned Qi Shaobai, circling him as she looked him up and down. She leisurely said,","\"Young Master Qi, you should have at least hidden the t-shirt under your pajamas, it's sticking out.\"","Qi Shaobai stared wide-eyed, hastily looking down at himself.","There was nothing, he had already changed out of the t-shirt he had worn going out after coming back.","Lowering his head this time, delighted laughter suddenly rose up around him.","Qi Shaobai: \"............\"","He had fallen into their trap!","\"You really can't lie at all, little Qi.\" Sheng Mumu laughed until her cheeks were sore.","Qi Mo's gaze shifted between Qi Shaobai and Sheng Mumu, the smile in his deep eyes growing thicker and thicker.","Night time.","The night was thick as ink, with repeated torrential rain.","One a.m.","Qi Shaobai suddenly opened his eyes as he lay in bed, lips pressed in a straight line.","Damn it.","He had been schemed against together by Dad and Stepmom.","So annoying.","On the other side.","Inside the master bedroom.","Another man surnamed Qi was also wide awake.","Three minutes ago.","He suddenly felt a pair of delicate, soft hands touch his waist.","His abdomen instantly tightened and he opened his eyes.","In the darkness, he felt her move a little closer.","Shallow breaths blew onto his back.","Her breathing rhythm was slow and steady, she should be asleep.","The next second, he felt as if she lightly sniffed, then mumbled a few sounds, burying her head in his back, seeming to fall into an even deeper sleep.","Qi Mo didn't move at all, the hands at his waist gave off warmth.","The soft touch made his throat tighten.","Impossible to ignore.","Sensing his breathing become hotter, his throat rolled.","He took a deep breath trying to calm down, but the rise and fall of his chest only made the breaths behind him closer.","In the darkness, the gaze of those eyes like a secluded pool dispersed all coldness, seemingly about to ignite a flame.","Sheng Mumu dreamed that she was in a movie theater, Qi Mo draped his coat over her.","The faint pleasant scent enveloped her and she couldn't help sniffing.","It was fresh, smelled nice.","She unconsciously moved a little closer.","Coveting this scent that made her feel at ease.","7:30 a.m.","Morning light leaked in through the cracks in the curtains. The woman grunted and turned over, as if having had a good night's sleep.","The man's slender fingers pulled back the quilt.","He walked lightly into the bathroom.","Turned on the shower head.","He braced one hand against the tiled wall, turning the water to the cold side.","Water poured down, following the tight, smooth lines of his muscular body, disappearing into the depths.","A few drops of water slid down his long lashes.","Those good-looking eyes were half-lowered.","Yet unable to conceal the murky, gloomy light churning deep within.","Floating, sinking."]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: The daughter-in-law brings her a little sweet","paragraphs":["\"What? It's still not fixed?\"","The next afternoon.","Sheng Mumu had just brought two cups of taro milk tea with red bean and half sugar to her mother-in-law's house, when she heard an almost plaintive voice coming from the living room.","After walking through the foyer, Feng Yaoqin had just hung up the phone.","Seeing her daughter-in-law come in, she pursed her lips and complained:","\"Mumu, the sound system still isn't fixed. I can't go dancing again today.\"","Sheng Mumu handed her a cup of milk tea with a straw inserted.","\"Mom, drink something sweet to ease your frustration.\"","Feng Yaoqin looked very upset, but her hands didn't hesitate as she quickly took the milk tea and drank a few sips.","With no dancing, life was so boring.","Luckily her daughter-in-law brought her some sweetness.","As she drank, a gleam flashed through her eyes, as if she had suddenly thought of something important.","\"Right, I forgot to ask, how was the movie yesterday? Did Li and Little Cheng get along well? Can the two of them be together long term?\"","Seeing her mother-in-law's expectant face, sincerely caring about the younger generation, Sheng Mumu felt a twinge of guilt inside.","She couldn't tell her mother-in-law that Li and Cheng were just pretending.","Nor could she honestly say their relationship was going very smoothly.","After thinking it over, Sheng Mumu could only skirt the issue and reply:","\"Mom, don't worry about Li, she's still young and not in a hurry at all.\"","\"Even if she dates a few more people before settling down, that's totally normal, don't you think?\"","\"The more impatient you are, the more you need to slow down and keep your eyes open.\"","Feng Yaoqin thought Sheng Mumu's words made sense too, and slowly nodded, saying:","\"You're right, Li is not even 25 yet, I really am too impatient.\"","As she spoke, she put the milk tea down on the coffee table, and suddenly solemnly put her hand over Sheng Mumu's.","Changing the subject.","\"Compared to Li, I'm actually more worried about you, Mumu—\"","Sheng Mumu's body stiffened: \"...\"","Oh no, she had inadvertently shifted the focus to herself.","Now the topic was going to change from \"rushing marriage\" to \"rushing to have kids\".","Last time her mother-in-law asked her to explain why she wasn't having children, and she had been putting it off.","Now it seemed there was no getting around it.","\"—Mumu, it's not your mother saying this, but having children earlier is better.\"","Feng Yaoqin looked worried, patting her hand.","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips in a faint smile, silent, thinking about how she could smoothly change the subject again.","Feng Yaoqin: \"While you're still young, I can still help you take care of the kids. Shaobai grew up following his grandmother when he was little, and now his relationship with his grandmother is closer than with me as his grandmother. I've always regretted that. So for your child, I really want to raise them while they grow up.\"","Feng Yaoqin spoke earnestly.","She was so eager for her son and daughter-in-law to have children, mainly because she had learned from experience.","In the past, in the first few years after she got married, she didn't want children. By the time she did want them, she found out her body was not suitable for pregnancy, and in the end could only adopt from an orphanage.","Although nowadays the family was harmonious, and to her Qi Moyu was no different than her own child.","But she couldn't help thinking sometimes, what if she had taken care of her health properly in her early years, wouldn't she also have been able to have one or two of her own.","That unlucky late husband never said it was a pity, but she knew he still longed to have a child of their love.","Her regret was something she could not make up for in this lifetime.","She didn't want her daughter-in-law to miss the best childbearing years now because she was busy with work.","After listening for a while, Sheng Mumu finally thought of a solution.","She moistened her lips, pulled her hand out from her mother-in-law's grasp, and put it over the back of her mother-in-law's hand instead, suddenly saying:","\"Mom, I just thought of an idea.\"","Feng Yaoqin: \"What idea?\"","\"We could buy a new sound system, then you can go dancing tonight, right?\" Sheng Mumu said naturally. \"I'll sponsor a new set of audio equipment for your square dancing team. What do you think?\"","Feng Yaoqin was stunned: \"...\"","Oh?","Why didn't she think of buying a new one before.","And here she had been waiting impatiently for several days without dancing.","\"Good idea! What a great idea!\"","Seeing Feng Yaoqin's look of sudden realization, Sheng Mumu knew her plan had worked. Her mother-in-law had indeed been distracted.","Feng Yaoqin's face lit up with a smile, eager to go into the \"Garden Square Dance Team\" WeChat group and share the good news.","The screen immediately filled up with messages.","-[Now we can dance tonight, thanks to Little Feng's daughter-in-law.]","-[Smile][Thumbs up][Coffee cup]","-[Oh Auntie, Little Feng's daughter-in-law, thank you!]","-[Public account article [News Noon Express]]","-[Good afternoon [Sun] friends who love life, just woke up from an afternoon nap to learn of this news, words cannot express my excitement. Thank you to Sister Feng's daughter-in-law for the new equipment for us old aunties. Here, I wish our group an even better year ahead [Fists together][Handshake][Rose]]","-[Thank you! [Flower blooming, fortune.jpg]]","\"Look, everyone is thanking you,\" Feng Yaoqin smiled and held her phone out to Sheng Mumu.","Sheng Mumu pressed the voice message button and politely told the uncles and aunties they were welcome, this was just a small token of her filial respect, nothing much.","And very sensibly used Feng Yaoqin's phone to send a reply:","-[May all the aunties and uncles be healthy and happy, free from worries, safe and never grow old [Rose][Rose][Rose]]","The tone was perfectly in line with the chat history.","Around 7pm, Sheng Mumu accompanied Feng Yaoqin to the garden square.","The driver took the new luxury sound system out of the trunk and unpacked it.","As he adjusted the settings, he explained to the surrounding aunties and uncles.","\"This sound system has an AI assistant. Uncles and aunties, you can talk to it to quickly change songs.\"","As he spoke, Sheng Mumu joined in the demonstration, calling out to the speakers:","\"Xiao Ai!\"","A robotic voice came from the speakers: \"Here~\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Open the square dancing playlist.\"","\"OK, opening playlist [Most Popular Square Dancing Songs 100] for you—\"","Soon, familiar music sounded.","\"No matter how I fly,","I can't leave this","flower-filled world","Turns out I'm just","a drunken butterfly\"","The crowd around stared wide-eyed, murmuring to each other.","\"Wow—\"","\"Little shorty!\"","\"Old Li, your hearing's not good, it's Little Ai.\"","\"Oh oh, Little Ai!\"","\"It's Xiao Ai!\"","\"Oh, Xiao Wei.\"","\"It's Xiao Ai!\"","\"Oh, Xiao Ming.\"","Sheng Mumu listened amused, unable to hold back her smile.","The aunties and uncles were all so cute.","\"I know how to use it, I have one at home too,\" one tech-savvy uncle came over. \"Xiao Ai, play 'West Sea Love Song'...\"","\"Uncle Hu, that's old news,\" another trendy auntie interrupted. \"Xiao Ai, play 'Magic Potion'...\"","Avant-garde music sounded.","\"Oh you young people would know.\"","\"Of course, I'm only 57, still young, my 7-year-old granddaughter sings it at home all the time, even I know it now.\"","\"Then sing us a line.\"","\"What's so hard, give me a magic potion~\"","\"It's bottle, right, Sister Yan? A pot would knock you out.\"","At that, laughter rang out across the garden square.","Listening from afar, watching from a distance.","These people, average age around 60, aunties and uncles, were really no different from little kids gathered in alleyways clapping or playing marbles.","Just their age was increasing, while their attitude remained young."]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: Qi Shaobai: Another Day as a Tool Man","paragraphs":["The park square was divided into several areas.","Normally, the square dancing groups would occupy one area, the old men who played chess or chatted leisurely occupied another area.","Those who wrote Chinese characters on the ground with brushes took up a quiet corner.","People who fanned themselves and chatted were gathered under the shadiest tree.","Everywhere exuded the atmosphere of worldly lives.","Sheng Mumu actually really liked this kind of atmosphere.","Sometimes when she accompanied Feng Yaoqin to the park square, she would not rush to go home, but would stroll around leisurely instead.","As time went by, many people got to recognize her.","\"Yo, the daughter-in-law of the Feng family is here!\"","While strolling casually, she was called out by a voice.","Looking in the direction of the voice, it was Grandpa Zhou who liked to walk his parrot at night, carrying a bird cage and calling out to her.","\"Hello Grandpa Zhou.\"","\"Oh.\"","After walking a few more steps:","\"Mumu, Sister Feng's daughter-in-law, come, come, auntie has cut up some watermelon, come have a piece?\"","Sitting in a bamboo chair listening to the radio broadcast, Aunt Yang kindly called her over to eat watermelon.","It seemed Sheng Mumu had a natural charm that made people like her.","Even people who did not know her long, needed only to chat with her a little, and they would be attracted by the optimism and liveliness she exuded from the inside out. Even if the other party was two to three decades older than her.","Because there was such a pretty, filial and likable daughter-in-law, Feng Yaoqin quickly became the most enviable old lady at the park square.","She was extremely happy every day, and her movements were much more agile and cheerful when dancing.","Becoming more and more satisfied with her daughter-in-law, somehow, her dissatisfaction with her son deepened.","That day, Feng Yaoqin called Qi Mo.","The call was quickly picked up, and Qi Mo's steady, low voice came through, \"Mom.\"","Feng Yaoqin got straight to the point: \"What's wrong with you?\"","There seemed to be some confusion on the other end of the phone, and silence for a few seconds.","Feng Yaoqin said reproachfully:","\"Mumu is busy with work, but she can always find time to accompany me at the park square. You, on the other hand, can never seem to find time. You tell me, I've been back for so long, and which day have you not-\"","\"Mom, I'll come tonight,\" came a low, gentle laugh from the other end of the phone, coaxing her in a deep voice, \"I'll come with Mumu tonight to accompany you.\"","Feng Yaoqin's hand holding the phone tightened.","She had only wanted to complain a little, and did not expect her son to agree so readily.","Instantly, her face lit up with joy:","\"Great, that would be wonderful.\"","Before hanging up, Feng Yaoqin added:","\"Bring Shaobai along too. Don't let him stay home alone doing test papers every day, he must be bored to death. Today is Saturday, let him take a break and relax.\"","\"Alright, anything you say.\"","That afternoon.","Zhang Housekeeper knocked on Qi Shaobai's room door and relayed what he just received in the young master's phone call.","\"What? Dad wants me to go square dancing with grandma?\" Qi Shaobai rubbed his ears, frowning.","Suspecting that he had misheard.","Zhang Housekeeper looked embarrassed.","\"Yes young master. On the phone just now, the master said to let you go over if you're free tonight. I guess...probably...maybe... it's likely for dancing.\"","\"I still have test papers to do,\" Qi Shaobai leaned against the door, intending to close it. \"I won't go.\"","Ridiculous. What seventeen-year-old starts square dancing?","Moreover, even if he was seventy he still wouldn't dance.","Zhang Housekeeper pushed against the closing door and squeezed in:","\"The mistress told me to tell you not to be late tonight. She and the master are waiting for you at the park square.\"","Qi Shaobai's hand paused, and he gradually let go, opening the door a little wider.","\"They want to go too?\"","Zhang Housekeeper answered truthfully: \"I'm not sure, possibly.\"","Maybe the mistress was tricking the young master, who knows.","After all, for this mistress with strange thought processes who was difficult to fathom, one could not make guesses based on common sense.","Qi Shaobai sank into deep confusion.","His clear eyes revealed a huge question mark.","No way.","What were they thinking?","Had they earned enough money and were ready to retire early? Forming a square dancing group???","With how busy they usually were with work, this guess didn't seem plausible.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's utterly confused expression, Zhang Housekeeper smiled imperceptibly.","As expected, it worked.","Another useful housekeeper technique gained.","That night.","The good-looking family of three appeared at the park square, attracting the attention of the uncles and aunties.","Feng Yaoqin stood proudly in front of the three, introducing them to her square dancing friends.","She looked at Sheng Mumu first.","\"This is my daughter-in-law, you're all very familiar with her already.\"","People around her laughed and chimed in: \"Very familiar, Mumu is known all over this park square, ask anyone who Mumu is and they'll know!\"","Feng Yaoqin laughed, wrinkles appearing at the corners of her eyes, unable to conceal her pride.","She then looked at the two tall men standing to Mumu's left and right, \"This is my son Qi Mo, grandson Qi Shaobai.\"","Qi Mo nodded slightly, his expression mild and composed.","Sheng Mumu struggled to hold back her laughter beside them.","It was just too weird. Usually chilly and keeping everyone at arm's length, now in front of his mom's friends, Boss Qi was actually so polite and refined.","Interesting, very interesting.","She turned her gaze to Qi Shaobai's side, no longer able to hold in her laughter.","\"Pfft-\" she laughed out loud.","Faced with the warm greetings from the elders around them, Qi Shaobai's arrogant and aloof face showed a very unnatural smile. The corners of his mouth were pulled up mechanically as if being lifted by someone, greeting people around stiffly:","\"Hello grandpa.\"","\"Hello grandma.\"","\"Hello grandpas and grandmas.\"","Sheng Mumu went over to rescue him, handing her bag over as she passed by, \"Little Qi, let me take you around, I'm familiar with this area. Help me hold my bag.\"","\"Okay, okay.\" Qi Shaobai shot her a grateful look, eagerly taking her bag.","Just then, music sounded throughout the square.","It was eight o'clock, and AI assistant Little Ai started playing music.","The previously scattered groups of people started gathering in one place.","Moving their arms and legs, getting ready to dance.","Behind her, the man with the relaxed and gentle posture walked up a few steps and stood beside her.","He shifted his arm sideways a little, tilted his head to look at her gently, and said in a low voice:","\"Let's go, take me around too.\"","Sheng Mumu looked back into his misty, warm eyes, her gaze lowered to the arm he stretched out.","She hesitated for only a second before dutifully linking arms with him, smiling charmingly.","\"Alright, let's go.\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned for a moment before slowly catching up with dad and stepmom.","Carrying the bag lazily in his hand, he trailed behind them.","This time, it only took less than half a minute for him to accept reality.","Ok, fine.","Another day of being a prop.","Used to it."]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: Look at you, the tail's gonna fly.","paragraphs":["As Sheng Mumu walked past the grandfather playing chess under a nearby tree, her name was suddenly called out.","\"Hey, little Mumu, out for a stroll in the park with your husband?\"","The three of them turned towards the voice to see an old man with a full head of white hair smiling at them.","Sheng Mumu was the first of the three to react.","She smiled back brightly, \"Yes, Uncle Chang.\"","Uncle Chang was the best chess player in the whole square.","Although he was usually aloof, he had somehow become friendly with Sheng Mumu and affectionately called her \"little Mumu\".","Uncle Chang looked Qi Mo up and down with his hands behind his back, as if scrutinizing him.","Behind them, Qi Shaobai couldn't help but feel amused.","He hadn't expected his famous bigshot dad to not even warrant a name here in the park square, just like when they were on vacation at the resort in Shen City.","Out of the corner of his eye, Qi Shaobai secretly observed his dad.","His dad remained calm and unruffled at the indignity of losing his name.","On the contrary, he politely nodded and smiled at the old man.","Eager to play a game of chess, Uncle Chang asked,","\"Son-in-law, do you play?\"","At this question, all three of them paused briefly.","Sheng Mumu looked to Qi Mo.","Her habit of feeling embarrassed for others suddenly acted up.","She didn't know Qi Mo's skill level, but she knew Uncle Chang was the undisputed chess king of the area.","What if Qi Mo accepted Uncle Chang's challenge but lost the game in front of Qi Shaobai?","Would it damage his majestic image in Qi Shaobai's mind?","Sheng Mumu grabbed Qi Mo's arm and tugged him aside, just about to politely decline Uncle Chang's proposal.","But she found the man at her side was like a mountain, completely unmoving no matter how she pulled.","Looking up, he was gazing gently at Uncle Chang with a humble expression.","\"Not very well.\"","Uncle Chang promptly sat back on the stone bench and beckoned him over with a smile.","\"It's fine if you're not very good, I'll give you a handicap. Come, let's play a game.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Sheng Mumu squeezed the man's arm next to her and whispered,","\"I advise you not to play. Uncle Chang has dominated the park square, earning him the nickname 'Lonely Seeking Defeat'.\"","Hearing her amusing description, Qi Mo let out a soft laugh.","His eyes seemed to light up, glinting with specks of light. He raised his eyebrows at her in return and asked,","\"Why not try trusting me for once?\"","Sheng Mumu was taken aback.","So this is...a man's inexplicable competitive spirit.","She had just experienced it firsthand.","Not wanting to diminish Qi Mo's image in front of Qi Shaobai, she stiffly nodded.","Trying to ease the tension with humor, she gave Qi Mo a big thumbs up and jokingly said to Uncle Chang,","\"Uncle Chang, you're doomed! My husband has been playing chess in history class and studying history in chess class since he was little. You're no match for his unorthodox moves!\"","Uncle Chang seemed already quite familiar with Sheng Mumu's quirky sense of humor.","He just laughed and waved his hand, playing along,","\"Alright, then I won't give him a handicap.\"","Sheng Mumu froze in place.","Hey, Uncle Chang, you're not following the script!","It seems I've made things worse????","Soon, this impromptu chess match began.","Qi Mo strode over and sat on the stone bench.","The bench was a bit short, making his long legs look cramped and uncomfortable as he bent them. But his posture remained relaxed and deferential.","As the junior, he declined Uncle Chang's offer to play red.","He gently raised his hand, signaling for Uncle Chang to make the first move.","Uncle Chang thought for a bit. The man opposite was little Mumu's husband.","He shouldn't use any devious or difficult chess tactics from books.","He would start simply then.","\"Cannon two squares up to five,\" Uncle Chang said as he made his move.","After he placed the piece, Qi Mo's slender, well-shaped fingers moved over the stone table without much thought, making black's first play.","Uncle Chang's neck jerked back and he couldn't help but stroke his chin.","In his mind he thought:","Pawn three squares up to five.","He actually opened with a Flying Horse variation.","It shows little Mumu's husband has a steady and composed personality.","The two of them continued, move after move, soon reaching the middle game.","More and more onlookers gathered around them.","People started discussing animatedly.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai stood behind Qi Mo, growing tense.","Glancing at the man sitting steadily on the bench, his handsome face was free of any panic.","Uncle Chang across from him had gone from being full of confidence initially to looking quite serious.","With Qi Mo's final offensive move, Uncle Chang's shoulders sagged in disbelief.","Qi Mo nodded, \"Thank you for the game.\"","\"I actually lost to a squeezed chariot!\" Uncle Chang looked at the young man opposite in disbelief and said, \"Boy, you planned to use this move from the very start didn't you? Luring me step-by-step into your trap?\"","Qi Mo didn't deny it and nodded.","Uncle Chang's face showed chagrin at being outsmarted. \"Ah, I'm getting old. My mind just isn't as nimble as you young folks.\"","Qi Mo propped his elbows on his knees and gave a mild, refreshing smile.","\"It's not that, don't say the laurels are late when they are still full in the sky.\"","At his words, Uncle Chang was visibly stunned. He didn't expect the young man who had just beat him to take the initiative to console him.","Sheng Mumu also bent down, standing shoulder-to-shoulder with Qi Mo, and said to Uncle Chang:","\"Alright Uncle Chang, this was all part of my scheme. I've been observing your chess style for some time and purposefully brought my husband to challenge you.\"","It was clearly meant as a joke.","But it instantly put Uncle Chang, who had lost the chess game, at ease.","After the three left, one old man scratched the back of his head and looked puzzledly at Qi Mo's straight back as he walked away. Hesitantly, he said:","\"Brother Chang, that son-in-law of little Mumu looks a bit familiar.\"","Uncle Chang looked back. \"Oh? Where have you seen him before?\"","\"I remember now!\" The other suddenly exclaimed, \"More than 10 years ago, I went to watch a competitive go match. I saw this young man then, he was still a teenager but extremely skilled.\"","Uncle Chang: \"Oh? A professional go player? So he was hiding his ability.\"","\"No no, just an amateur hobbyist. I remember very clearly, in a match between amateurs and professionals, with the skill of a three stone amateur he only lost by half a point to a five stone professional.\"","Uncle Chang was shocked, then suddenly realized and chuckled.","I thought I was just testing little Mumu's husband's chess skill.","Didn't expect to kick an iron plate.","A person familiar with go can quickly grasp chess after shifting dimensions.","Ah, in the end I just embarrassed myself!","Watching little Mumu's family of three walking farther and farther away.","Uncle Chang waved his fan, eyes narrowing slightly.","Gradually, his heart settled back in his stomach.","A person's chess skill reflects their character.","With his decades of experience and discernment,","That young man is skilled in strategy and planning, has great vision, and most impressively remains modest and respectful.","He should be a trustworthy partner.","No need to worry too much for little Mumu.","On the other side, Sheng Mumu, who had just watched Qi Mo play chess, peeked out from the side.","The man in front of her had clear, piercing eyes, and his handsome, aloof face held a trace of hard to detect pride.","Sensing her gaze, the man's eyes flicked to the side, a smile in his raised brow.","His tone was still low and magnetic, but had a pleased, drawn out lilt.","\"You can trust me, can't you? I wasn't wrong.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked, then laughed softly, \"Mr Qi, turn around and let me see.\"","Although unclear why, the man's tall figure very naturally pivoted slowly.","Sheng Mumu smiled, her brows arching into two shallow curves.","\"Look at you, your tail's about to wag off!\"","Following behind, Qi Shaobai, who was carrying a bag, froze in place.","Qi Shaobai: \"......\" He could hear his dad's low, delighted laughter mixing with his stepmom's playful teasing up ahead.","\"I'll take that as you praising me?\"","\"It's praise, don't be modest.\"","\"Thank you.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"???\"","In the seventeen-year-old's mind,","He gained new understanding of the phrases \"loving couple\" and \"mutual respect\"."]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: This man is amazing","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai didn't know if it was because he saw his dad accidentally showing off in front of his stepmom, or if it was because the atmosphere of the three strolling in the park was too warm and comfortable. But the idea of wanting to show off a bit emerged in Qi Shaobai's mind. One should know that aside from being good at Lego and basketball, he also had a skill.","The cocky boy walked to Sheng Mumu's side with his schoolbag, exaggeratedly pointing to an area up front and said:","\"Hey, aren't those people over there writing calligraphy?\"","Qi Mo glanced over indifferently. He immediately saw through what Qi Shaobai was thinking.","Before Sheng Mumu could react, she replied:","\"Yes, many elders like to use sea sponges as calligraphy brushes to write words on the ground. What, do you want to go over there and learn?\"","Qi Shaobai walked towards that direction nonchalantly, casually responding:","\"Let me go take a look.\"","Qi Mo hid his all-seeing eyes, and let them go over.","\"Hello grandpa, may I try writing something?\" Qi Shaobai's expression was still cocky, but his tone had suddenly become well-behaved and docile.","He said to an elder who was writing.","The old man was surprised and turned his head. He didn't expect such a young boy to take the initiative to try writing calligraphy. This was a rare occurrence.","He smiled and handed the brush over.","\"Give it a try.\"","Before Sheng Mumu could react to what was happening, she had already heard Qi Shaobai's low \"hmm\".","He took the sea sponge brush, dipped it in the water from a nearby plastic bucket, and started writing stylistically.","She was shocked and lightly nudged the man beside her, asking:","\"Little Qi knows how to write calligraphy?\"","Qi Mo's mouth curled up slightly, his eyes gentle.","\"Mm, when he was little he grew up with grandma. Grandma's calligraphy was very nice, so he picked up a thing or two.\"","Sheng Mumu slowly nodded.","Oh, just the basics. But the basics were still good. Nowadays most young people type on their phones, those who can write their name beautifully are already very rare.","Especially boys, who are impatient. Many of their writing looks like chicken scratch.","She didn't know why, but she suddenly thought of the little guy who had stuffed a note under her car outside the Qi Corporation building.","He had three words wrong in a single sentence, and his handwriting was atrocious.","Just as she was thinking this, the lanky seventeen year old in front of her was already assuming a pose.","Although it was a large brush, his brush holding posture still revealed some practice.","He pursed his lips slightly, pouting a little, looking very focused.","Under his control, the sea sponge brush traced light and dark strokes on the ground.","The brush strokes were strong and varied, flowing smoothly.","He wrote seven large characters on the ground -","Qi Shaobai is invincible.","He put down the brush, cocked his waist and curled his lips looking at his dad and stepmom beside him.","He didn't say anything, just using his expression to say: Praise me quickly.","Sheng Mumu slowly turned her head to meet Qi Mo's gaze, her expression difficult as she spoke:","\"Mr Qi, I was wrong about you.\"","Qi Mo raised his brows, understanding her meaning, \"It's fine.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"In terms of cockiness, Qi Shaobai is the dad amongst dads.\"","Qi Mo's eyes darkened for a moment: \"......\"","Qi Shaobai: \"?????\"","Was she praising him?","Not receiving the expected praise, Qi Shaobai was disheartened as he found another dry spot on the ground, and tilted his chin saying:","\"Watch me write a 'forever' character. My grandma always said that once you can write a good 'forever' character, you can write good calligraphy. Watch me show off a bit.\"","Sheng Mumu stared wide-eyed: \"Little Qi, where did you learn all these weird idioms?\"","Qi Shaobai's unruly eyes blinked, and he honestly replied: \"I learned them from you.\"","Sheng Mumu was rendered speechless for a moment, and slowly said:","\"You're very good at learning, don't keep learning in the future.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Oh.\" Having said that, he started writing spiritedly.","Sheng Mumu sighed slightly, and heard the faint laughter emanating from the chest of the powerful man beside her.","Low and pleasant sounding.","They watched Qi Shaobai write intently.","A light breeze blew by, the temperature just right.","Sheng Mumu suddenly realized that her bag was somehow in Qi Mo's hands.","The man's long fingers were slightly bent, holding onto the bag's strap casually and lazily. His side profile was handsome and compelling.","Sheng Mumu somehow had the fleeting illusion that the man beside her was her husband, and the boy opposite was her son.","Everything was so natural, so much a part of daily life.","She seemed to have gradually gotten used to the role of Mrs Qi.","And was happy to be in it.","Not far away, children were playing tag and laughing loudly in the square.","Further away, a vendor was pushing his cart and hollering to sell chilled mung bean soup.","A few people jogged over under the shade of the trees to buy the chilled soup.","Because they suddenly started running, the little puppy napping under the tree was startled awake. It let out a few vigilant barks, and after seeing nothing amiss, laid back down again.","Even further away, was the music from the square dancing team.","Nearing the end, a classic old song was played.","The melody was soothing, gentle.","\"The most romantic thing I can think of,","Is slowly growing old with you,","Collecting all the bits of laughter along the way,","Keeping them to slowly reminisce when we sit in rocking chairs in the future-\"","The powerful man with the overwhelming aura beside her noticed her gaze from the corner of his eyes.","He didn't turn his head, still looking ahead, when the corners of his eyes suddenly curved up slightly.","His magnetic, low voice carried by the early autumn night breeze gently floated to her ears.","\"Days like this are great, don't you think?\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment.","She subconsciously looked at him.","The man's eyes were as deep as ink, unfathomable.","She couldn't tell if it was just a casual remark, or meant something more.","Sheng Mumu was silent for a few seconds, and felt the air around her become soft.","She curved her eyes slightly, responding:","\"Mm, I think so too. Taking a stroll, feeling the breeze. If it was evening, we could even see the sunset and the clouds edged with gold.\"","The man's eyes shifted slightly, and the softest part of his heart was filled with endless gentleness.","He suddenly turned his head to look at her, gazing into her bright eyes, and slowly said:","\"Taking a stroll, feeling the breeze, watching the sunset.","Before meeting you,","these were called walking, wind blowing, and the coming of night.\"","As his clear, low voice faded away, Sheng Mumu felt her mind buzz.","Oh my god!!!!!","How does this man know how to speak so smoothly?!!","This is too amazing!!!!"]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: It means, I like you.","paragraphs":["That night, Sheng Mumu kept thinking about what Qi Mo's words really meant.","Could it be that he liked her?","When this thought popped up, she instinctively shook her head.","How could that be?","They were in a purely contractual relationship!","If she was contaminated by something as vulgar as feelings, how could she still accept his money with a clear conscience?","She paced back and forth in front of the floor-to-ceiling window in her bedroom.","No matter how hard she racked her brains, she couldn't figure it out.","After a long while, with her lips pursed tightly, as if she had made a very important decision, she took out her phone.","\"What exactly did you mean by what you just said?\"","After typing this line, she closed her eyes and heavily pressed the screen.","Sent.","Her heart suddenly beat erratically.","Qi Mo was in the study next door. When he received the message, a hint of inscrutable light flashed across his ink-black pupils.","He then got up.","Intending to answer her question face-to-face.","Sheng Mumu held her phone nervously, watching the screen intently.","There was no \"typing...\" on the screen.","Strange, could he have not seen it...","Suddenly, she heard the faint sound of the study door next door opening.","Her eyebrows furrowed sharply, and she frantically tapped the screen.","\"Just say it on WeChat.\"","Sheng Mumu held her breath, suddenly feeling nervous.","She who always boasted of her boldness, was timid at this moment.","From the crack under the door, she could see faint shadows and light.","Finally, after hearing the chime of a phone notification, the shadow outside the door stopped.","She also breathed a sigh of relief at last.","Just then, she felt her phone vibrate in her palm.","The screen lit up.","\"It means I like you.\"","Her jumbled thoughts settled down at this moment.","Staring at the succinct line on the screen.","Sheng Mumu only felt her throat tighten, and a shallow heat flowed across her cheeks.","An indescribable emotion silently climbed into her heart.","It was as if a movie was playing in her head, bringing up all the bits and pieces of their time together.","As if to discern whether he was telling the truth.","All the segments that could be used as evidence appeared one by one.","It was the phone call on the rainy day when he wanted to come to the mall to pick her up.","It was his hand brushing past her hair and briefly lingering on the back seat of the car.","It was the clothes he draped over her at the gym.","It was tucking her in over and over.","It was the repeated hesitation to speak out.","Then how about her?","What role did she play in all the segments she could think of?","All along, she had intentionally or unintentionally ignored the subtle feelings between them.","She had randomly grouped all the inexpressible emotions together and stuffed them under the pretense of their \"contract marriage\".","Not imagining any other possibilities.","The more she thought about it, the more confused she became.","The line on the screen burned her earlobes.","She hesitated for a long time before replying.","Outside the door.","The tall, handsome man leaned against the wall, his eyes lowered, the color in his eyes deepened as he looked at the phone screen.","The shallow light shone on his chiseled face, and his expression was solemn.","He was nervous.","The man who was always in control in the business field had never experienced such torment.","Time ticked by second by second.","The last sentence in the chat box still remained the one he had sent.","He loosened his tie.","Otherwise, he would surely be suffocated by the helpless feeling.","He didn't know how long he had been waiting like this.","Finally, the phone lit up.","But the moment he saw the message, he was stunned.","\"Are you trying not to give me money anymore?\"","Qi Mo: ......","In the room across the wall.","Sheng Mumu also knew this response was ridiculous.","But right now, she didn't know what else she could say to make the atmosphere less awkward.","If everything was brought out into the open, how could they still interact day and night? At least at this moment, she was not ready to entrust herself to someone else.","But this reply obviously didn't hold water.","She pursed her lips and wrapped herself in a quilt, burying her face in the pillow as she sent a response that catered to her heart's desire.","Her earlobes slightly red, her cheeks burning hot.","Lying on the bed, her legs flailed randomly a few times.","She didn't make any other sounds, afraid of revealing even a hint of her girlish thoughts.","Yet she also mocked herself inwardly.","She was already twenty-eight, yet she could still become flustered and panic like a little girl at times like this.","Sheng Mumu, Sheng Mumu.","You're done for.","Outside the door.","The smile on the man's lips grew thicker and thicker.","The pitch black pupils became increasingly fiery, like two flickering sparks.","Downstairs in the living room.","Qi Shaobai, who had just gone to the kitchen to get some ice cubes, happened to glance upstairs on his way back.","He suddenly stopped in his tracks, stunned.","Why was Dad standing outside the door being punished?","Just as he was thinking that.","He heard two very soft knocks upstairs.","Followed by Dad's voice laced with laughter, asking, \"Can I come in now?\"","Qi Shaobai's eyeballs shook: ..................","Oh my god.","What did he see?","Dad was locked out by Stepmother and not allowed to enter the room?","He quickly shifted his gaze, hugging the ice bucket.","Trying his best to minimize his presence.","Silently chanting in his heart: You can't see me, you can't see me, you can't see me, you can't see me......","\"Young Master, it's not good to keep drinking cold drinks in the summer.\"","Zhang the housekeeper came up from the wine cellar after taking an inventory and dutifully showed concern when he saw Qi Shaobai holding the ice bucket.","Qi Shaobai's body stiffened, and ten thousand grass mud horses galloped through his heart.","He reflexively glanced upstairs at where Dad was standing punished.","Caught off guard, his gaze met Dad's.","Qi Shaobai blankly scratched the back of his head, \"Dad.\"","Just as Qi Mo was about to respond, he heard her softly reply from inside the room, \"You can come in now.\"","The coldness on the man's face became gentle, and he said deeply, \"Okay.\"","Qi Shaobai was completely stunned.","He couldn't hear Sheng Mumu's voice from the master bedroom.","Nor could he infer the reason for Dad's punishment.","But he couldn't help but be shocked by what he had witnessed.","Dad was actually... smiling after being punished to stand outside?","Tsk tsk, so clingy.","Simply amazing.","He nodded at Dad and ran back to his room at a sprint.","Behind him, the housekeeper's nagging still chased relentlessly after him.","\"Young Master, you can't drink too much cold now.\"","\"Young Master, open the door. Let me tell you about the benefits of drinking more hot water...\""]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: Pack your Bags","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu's discomfort and uneasiness only lingered for a few days.","She soon adjusted her attitude back to what it was originally.","On one hand, thanks to how busy she was.","Busy with work, tutoring Qi Shaobai in English and keeping up with his academic performance, and squeezing out time here and there to accompany her mother-in-law Feng Yaoqin.","All these kept her from putting any energy into herself.","On the other hand, it was all due to Qi Mo's calm and composed personality.","Even after everything was out in the open between them, he didn't make her feel pressured at all.","He didn't get too close to her without a sense of propriety, nor did he suddenly become a different person.","This made Sheng Mumu feel exceptionally comfortable.","She was someone who feared change a lot.","Especially subtle changes in interpersonal relationships.","The reason she had never fallen in love before was because she could always keenly sense that boys she felt slightly interested in would change to some extent after confessing their feelings to her.","This discovery greatly diminished their charm in her eyes.","Her slight interest would escape as if for dear life.","Qi Mo was as steady as Mt Tai, his behavior and conduct no different from before at all.","On the contrary, this left her feeling somewhat doubtful.","Old man, playing hard to get huh?","A trace of rebellious thought emerged, \"Let me see how you plan to pursue me.\"","The seemingly normal, tranquil life had undercurrents quietly welling up.","*","That day,","Sheng Mumu received a phone call from Feng Yaoqin.","On the call, Feng Yaoqin said that she and several good sisters she knew from square dancing made plans to go on a trip together.","In recent years, she had been to many foreign cities.","But she still hadn't properly appreciated the vast and beautiful landscapes of her homeland.","This time, they planned to go west.","First to Tekes County in Xinjiang to visit the picturesque Chaka Salt Lake, then to Lanzhou to eat beef noodle soup.","Then continue northwards, and swing by Xinjiang to eat fruits.","After having their fill of fun, if they still didn't want to head back, they would continue southwards, and loop around to Sichuan, to go to Daocheng Yading.","If they were in high spirits, they might even stay in Lijiang and Erhai Lake in Yunnan for a while.","Sheng Mumu: \"Mom, going like this would take at least a few months right?\"","Feng Yaoqin made a judgement based on experience:","\"More than that, I reckon half a year. That's what my several elder sisters and their families said.\"","Sheng Mumu glanced at the digital clock on her office desk, \"Mm, then you'd need to bring a lot of stuff. I'll order some things online for you, and when they arrive I'll go over to help you pack.\"","After hanging up the call, she hurriedly placed orders at online stores for all sorts of travel gadgets, before the shipping cutoff time.","The next day, the packages large and small were delivered to her home.","She carried seven or eight boxes upstairs, and sat on the carpet to start unpacking the deliveries.","While happily unpacking, the door was opened from outside, and Qi Mo walked in.","Sheng Mumu looked back, their gazes collided, and both froze briefly.","\"You're back now already?\"","It was only 2pm in the afternoon.","For him not to be working overtime at the company was already quite rare, coming back at 2pm in the afternoon could be considered playing truant already.","\"I have a business trip, tonight's flight, back to pack.\"","\"Oh.\" Sheng Mumu responded absently, then turned her head back to continue unpacking the packages.","Qi Mo's gaze swept over the items on the floor, \"What are these?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled and started explaining these common travel gadgets to the sheltered CEO.","She pointed to her left, \"This is a folding clothes hanger, for hanging clothes when staying at hotels, the hangers they provide are never enough, bringing a few of your own helps avoid trouble.\"","Then she pointed to her right, \"This U-shaped pillow, silk eye mask, elderly people have poor sleep quality, especially when staying at hotels, they sleep even worse.\"","Then she patted a bag vacuum sealed into a thin sheet, \"I also got a pillow for mom, in case she can't sleep well using hotel pillows.\"","There were also compartmentalized storage bags, and toiletry bags that could hang in the bathroom.","Basically anything she could think of, she prepared.","In the past, when she had nothing to do she liked tidying up her room, organizing everything neatly.","Tidying up allowed her to clear her thoughts and not think about anything, it was very relaxing.","Ever since coming here, the housekeepers took care of arranging everything.","She hadn't personally organized anything for a long time now.","Taking this opportunity to help her mother-in-law pack gave her a chance to satisfy her urge to organize things.","Qi Mo leaned against the door frame of the walk-in closet, his deep dark eyes watching the back of her head intently, and suddenly spoke up, \"I'll be gone for 5 days this time.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't turn her head, \"Oh, okay.\"","She was already used to him leaving on sudden business trips.","She didn't stop unpacking the packages.","When she heard the man enter the walk-in closet behind her, and the sound of him pulling out a suitcase, her eyes narrowed belatedly.","Hold on.","Was he dropping hints at her?","Sheng Mumu tilted her head in puzzlement, craning her neck to take a peek into the walk-in closet.","She saw Qi Mo standing casually, his distinguished eyebrows deeply furrowed, seemingly conflicted.","There was an opened suitcase on the floor.","A few shirts were messily placed on top, unfolded.","Sheng Mumu's eyebrows immediately wrinkled.","How could he pack clothes like that, it was triggering her obsessive compulsiveness.","The man then randomly grabbed a tie from a drawer and carelessly tossed it on top of the suitcase.","Sheng Mumu's frown deepened further, finally unable to resist, she got up and went over.","She didn't hide the distaste in her tone at all,","\"Can't do it like this, let me help you pack... tsk...\"","Upon hearing this, the man immediately retracted the hand that was still randomly rummaging through the clothes rack, and gently responded, \"Alright.\"","Sheng Mumu started skillfully, \"How many days?\"","Qi Mo: \"Five days.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"What's the temperature there?\"","\"Let me check.\" Qi Mo took out his phone to look up the weather before telling her.","\"Okay, got it, move over.\" Sheng Mumu impatiently waved her hand for him to get out of the way.","The corners of Qi Mo's eyes curled up slightly, obediently moving over to sit on a stool, watching her pack.","As Sheng Mumu packed, she muttered to herself,","\"One shirt per day, five shirts in total. No, prepare one extra as backup.\"","She suddenly turned and asked him, \"Do you want me to help pack your watches too?\"","Qi Mo's lingering gaze in his eyes receded, his low voice responded, \"Yes.\"","Sheng Mumu nodded, \"Okay.\"","Finally she could take a look at the tycoon's watch case.","She was really looking forward to it.","It turned out to be a watch case full of brand name watches. She reined in her unsophisticated reaction, tapping her chin as she carefully selected two watches whose styles matched well with the shirts and ties.","Satisfied after finishing this, she patted her hands and placed them on her hips, taking in the neat and orderly suitcase contently.","Letting out a satisfied breath, \"Done.\"","Then, ignoring Qi Mo's expression that seemed to want to chat with her, she hurriedly gathered the packages, calling out, \"I'm going over to mom's place!\"","Not long after Sheng Mumu left, there was a knock on the bedroom door from outside.","Opening the door, the head housekeeper Zhang stood outside.","\"Sir, I've come to help you pack for your trip.\"","Every time the master went on a business trip, he was the one who came to pack and prepare the luggage.","He was long accustomed to what needed to be brought, what went well together.","Just now he heard from Executive Assistant Dong that the master had a business trip tomorrow, so after finishing up his tasks he immediately came upstairs.","He was about to go straight to the walk-in closet as usual.","When he was suddenly interrupted by a voice,","\"No need.\"","Zhang the housekeeper was puzzled, his gaze happened to land on the suitcase by the door.","Oh? Did the master happen to be in a good mood today and packed it himself?","Just as Housekeeper Zhang was about to turn and leave, he heard the dignified and prestigious man beside him add in a faintly delighted or boastful tone,","\"Mumu has already helped me pack everything nicely.\""]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: The Old Fox","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu seriously suspected that her phone's battery was drained by a certain man surnamed Qi, who would send her messages every now and then.","8:45 AM","Qi Mo: \"[Image] Morning breakfast.\"","Just after waking up, with sleepy eyes and unwiped eye boogers, Sheng Mumu's appetite was enticed by the exquisite breakfast in the photo.","The picture was taken at an outdoor restaurant on a high-rise building in Central. In front of her was a sumptuous breakfast prepared by a hotel's star chef.","Beside the slender, pale hand was a cup of authentic *** milk tea steaming hot.","Sheng Mumu gnashed her teeth in anger.","She quickly tapped her fingers to reply.","\"Mr. Qi, do you have any sense of limits? Showing off breakfast is one thing, but the milk tea is going too far!\"","She had just sent the message not long ago.","Her phone vibrated.","Qi Mo: \"Get up and brush your teeth.\"","Sheng Mumu: ???","What does that mean?","Is he remotely commanding her from such a distance?","Just when she was puzzled, there was a knock on the door from outside.","Zhang Housekeeper was pushing a small cart.","\"Madam, the master asked me to bring you breakfast.\"","Sheng Mumu stared in surprise.","\"He asked you to prepare breakfast for me? When did he say that?\"","Zhang Housekeeper lowered his head slightly, concealing his obvious smirk, and replied:","\"The master gave the order an hour ago, saying that you would want to eat after waking up, Madam.\"","On the small cart were freshly made cream pig-shaped buns, shrimp dumplings, and scrambled eggs prepared by the chef at home.","In the cup, *** milk tea emitted the same steam as the one in the photo.","Zhang Housekeeper placed the food on the table one by one and left the master bedroom.","Now Sheng Mumu understood the meaning behind the man's words, \"Get up and brush your teeth.\"","She walked to the window and slowly opened the smart curtains.","The sunlight slanted onto the white wool carpet in the room.","She stepped barefoot on the carpet.","The fair tops of her feet basked in the sunlight.","A warm and pleasant mood spread throughout her body.","Under the sunlight, her eyes were bright, clear, and appeared both bright and gentle.","Leaning her porcelain-like arms against the terrace, one hand supporting her cheek, the other hand replied to the message.","\"I can't tell... Tsk, tsk.\"","Meanwhile, the man in Hongcheng had already finished breakfast and was sitting at a business table discussing with his partners.","He saw the message on his phone.","Throughout the morning negotiations, he was distracted several times.","What does she mean?","What can't he tell?","And the meaning behind \"tsk, tsk\"?","The culprit that disturbed his thoughts, after enjoying a delicious meal and picking up her bag, headed to the company.","She had no intention of explaining the words she left halfway.","12:00 PM","Just as he bid farewell to his partners, Qi Mo furrowed his brow and picked up his phone.","He asked the question that had been bothering him all morning: \"What can't I tell?\"","At that moment, Sheng Mumu was in a product iteration meeting with the members of the product department.","Her phone was on silent mode, placed on the table.","She stood with her hands behind her back, facing away from the table, attentively watching the screen projection and listening to her subordinates' reports.","The phone screen lit up and then dimmed.","Then it lit up again.","When she finally finished the meeting and picked up her phone, she had received several messages.","Qi Mo: \"?\"","Qi Mo: \"It's not a good habit to leave a conversation hanging.\"","Qi Mo: \"Are you busy?\"","Qi Mo: \"Then you go ahead.\"","Sheng Mumu burst into laughter.","As if one could imagine the aura of that man, with his icy and stern demeanor, feeling inexplicably wronged as he uttered those words.","A flicker appeared between her eyebrows, and suddenly she didn't feel like giving him a proper response.","Raising an eyebrow, she replied, \"You're only halfway through your sentence. It should be something like, 'If you don't have a partner in the future.'\"","Little did she know.","As soon as this joke was made.","The person on the other end of the line called directly.","His voice was low, husky, and slightly faster-paced than usual.","\"I didn't intend to ask further, but since you said it like that, I must hear the whole story. I don't want you to be without a partner in the future.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes were filled with amusement as she said, \"I'm not afraid.\"","\"I am,\" the man's magnetic voice responded abruptly, almost as soon as she finished speaking.","His words echoed in her ears, staining the tips of her ears red.","Unconsciously, she picked up a ballpoint pen from the table and played with it, casually asking, \"Qi Mo, why didn't I notice your dominance before? Are you afraid, so you're forcing me to say it?\"","On the other end of the phone, a low laugh came through, and his tone slowly said,","\"It's not about dominance. The main issue is that if you don't have a partner, I don't know whose name to put on my assets.\"","Sheng Mumu instantly froze: \"............\"","This guy.","This man.","He knew she wouldn't yield to hard or soft tactics, but he had a particular fondness for making money and spending it.","He had started using this trick.","He was truly cunning.","She took a shallow breath and leisurely replied, \"Stop it, you're cheating.\"","The man on the other end of the line seemed to have anticipated her response long ago. His voice was low and deep, with a hint of laughter as he asked,","\"Can the judge make an exception?\"","The man's enchanting voice left her momentarily speechless.","After a while, she finally responded.","And so, two workaholics who were both usually very busy ended up chatting about this meaningless topic for over an hour on the phone.","When the call ended.","Her phone was already slightly warm.","Sheng Mumu's cheek, pressed against her phone, also felt a slight warmth.","She opened the food delivery app, intending to order a sandwich and salad to quickly get through lunch.","Little did she know, before she could even press the confirm order button, a message from him popped up on the screen.","Qi Mo: \"I had the chef at the revolving restaurant prepare some dishes you like, and they'll be delivered to your office soon. Don't settle for just any meal.\"","Sheng Mumu widened her eyes and looked around.","She wondered if she was being monitored.","This was too incredible.","It was as if this man had the ability to read minds from miles away.","How could he have anticipated that she was planning to settle for a simple meal?","They had just been on the phone a moment ago.","When did he instruct someone to deliver food to her?","She hadn't noticed at all.","Ten minutes later.","The manager she had met at the revolving restaurant last time personally delivered the meal to her.","Six dishes and a soup, all of them her favorite dishes at home.","\"Madam, if there's anything you'd like for dinner, you can let us know in advance.\" The restaurant manager knew that Mr. Qi doted on his wife, so whenever there was an opportunity to deliver a meal to her, he wanted to make a good impression. He wished he could deliver meals to her every day.","Sheng Mumu shook her head and declined the restaurant manager's kindness.","When she was alone in the office, she messaged Qi Mo.","\"Mr. Qi, I'll answer the unfinished half-sentence from this morning.\"","\"Who would have thought that you're so good at making girls happy, tsk tsk tsk tsk tsk [shaking head]\"","\"You're quite something, buddy.gif\"","After sending the message, he picked up his chopsticks and started eating.","Just after a few bites, his phone lit up.","Qi Mo: \"Indeed.\"","Upon reading this message, somehow, a faint trace of disappointment flashed through Sheng Mumu's eyes. She couldn't explain why.","The next second,","Another message came through.","Qi Mo: \"If we consider Mom and Grandma as girls.\"","Her dimples slightly sank, and the clear gaze flickered with a momentary sense of loss, only to be replaced by a gentle smile.","Realizing how her mood had changed within a short span of time, she paused with the chopsticks in her hand.","Suddenly, she realized that she seemed to be gradually falling under the spell of this cunning old fox.","He was maneuvering in his own way, step by step.","With this in mind,","She pressed her lips together.","And put her phone aside.","She warned herself.","Before leaving work, she would absolutely ignore any messages from this man.","Cunning old fox.","She wanted him to know that she wasn't that easy to chase after."]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: The Rich Woman's Meeting","paragraphs":["The second day Qi Mo went on a business trip.","Sheng Mumu was invited to Su Tingran's house to get her beauty treatment done.","Mrs. Sun and Mrs. Qian also came along.","The four women wore the same spa robes and face masks, lying on separate beds.","Four beauticians sat next to them, skillfully massaging their heads professionally.","Since she started her flower shop business, Sheng Mumu had not purely enjoyed wealthy housewife life for a long time.","The beautician removed the face mask from her face and put a hot towel over it.","The steam brought extreme comfort.","Then the beauticians left the beauty room one after another to prepare essential oils for the full body spa later.","They also left space for the ladies.","The beauticians who often provided home beauty services for wealthy madams knew well.","The beauty spa was just an excuse. What these ladies loved most when getting together was the time to chat and complain.","When there were only the four of them left in the room, Mrs. Qian pushed herself up from the bed and patted the bed angrily, “I’m so fed up!”","Her loud voice startled Sheng Mumu, who was attending such a group beauty event for the first time.","She blinked in shock.","She thought something serious had happened.","Just as she was about to ask “What happened, Mrs. Qian?”, she shut up instantly when she saw Su Tingran and Mrs. Sun's reactions.","Su Tingran took the tea pot from the small tea table beside her and poured flower tea into four cups.","Mrs. Sun took out a fruit platter and some melon seeds from the small fridge even more skillfully and put them on the tea table.","Then the two of them quietly looked at Mrs. Qian.","Their eyes said: Go ahead, Mrs. Qian.","Sheng Mumu was stunned by the scene.","Silence speaks louder than words now.","She took a deep breath, suppressed her surprise, and silently joined the melon-eating and complaining team.","She also indicated with her eyes: Go ahead. I'm ready too.","Mrs. Qian took a sip of the flower tea, clutched her fist and started complaining,","“Old Qian has been saying he would take me on a honeymoon in the UK ever since before we got married. He made it sound so nice. I even started learning spoken English for travel in advance, worrying that I might have trouble shopping there...”","Mrs. Sun and Su Tingran seemed to have heard this story many times. When Mrs. Qian paused, they did not ask further questions.","Sheng Mumu, a newbie who had stumbled into a high-level quest, was confused and asked, “So what happened?”","“What happened?” Mrs. Qian frowned, “Well now, our son is about to learn multiplication and division, but a honeymoon is still nowhere in sight.”","“Oh–”","As Mrs. Qian finished speaking, Su Tingran and Mrs. Sun sighed heavily in unison.","Sheng Mumu: “...”","After venting, Mrs. Qian passed the baton to Mrs. Sun. Mrs. Sun pulled Sheng Mumu’s arm and asked,","“Do you know what I hate most about Old Sun?”","Sheng Mumu blinked in confusion, “Um... Everything?”","Mrs. Sun: “...”","Su Tingran smiled and glanced at Sheng Mumu, “Mumu, be serious.”","“Oh, oh.” Sheng Mumu nodded slowly, her expression suddenly turned serious. She looked at Mrs. Sun, “Which thing?”","Mrs. Sun sighed, her face full of melancholy, “Old Sun, he never wears his wedding ring when he goes out. Tell me, what is he thinking? He must be trying to annoy me.”","Mrs. Qian put on an expression that indicated the situation was very serious, “This cannot do. With so many little vixens out there, if he doesn't show that he is a married man, isn't he just telling others 'come hit on me'?”","Mrs. Sun agreed, “Right, right, don’t you think so too?”","Mrs. Qian: “This is a big deal that needs to be taken seriously.”","The more Mrs. Sun thought about it, the more inappropriate she felt. She even wanted to rush home immediately to catch her husband and interrogate him carefully.","Suddenly, a voice interrupted her train of thought.","“Is there a possibility that he has grown fat and the ring is too tight?”","Sheng Mumu casually said while popping a strawberry into her mouth.","Middle-aged men tend to gain weight.","Uh, no, that's not rigorous enough.","Most middle-aged men gain weight, while a small number manage their physique well, like, um, someone.","The image of a certain man on a business trip in Hong Kong suddenly appeared in her mind. Sheng Mumu's gaze guiltily shifted aside.","She took a sip of tea.","Hearing Sheng Mumu say this, Mrs. Sun found it made sense and her eyes lit up.","“Chi~ Old Sun has gained 10 kg this year. There is indeed such a possibility...”","Mrs. Qian also looked thoughtful, helping Mrs. Sun consider whether this possibility was valid.","The more Mrs. Sun thought about it, the more she felt she had wronged her husband. Her furrowed brows finally relaxed and she breathed a sigh of relief.","Seeing that Mrs. Sun's worries were gone, Mrs. Qian changed the subject and asked Su Tingran, \"Mrs. Song, your husband still hasn't returned from overseas?\"","Upon hearing this, Su Tingran slowly lowered her eyes, her shoulders sank slightly.","After a while, the corners of her mouth curled up in a reluctant smile.","“I'm used to it. Out of 365 days a year, he is away from home for about 300 days.”","Mrs. Sun's relaxed brows furrowed again. She asked caringly, \"So busy? I'm not making random guesses, but aren't you worried that he might have found a mistress abroad? Have you investigated?\"","Sheng Mumu was also intrigued by Mrs. Sun's words.","She knew Su Tingran's husband was always overseas but didn't know his homecoming frequency was so low.","Su Tingran always had a smile on her face and never complained about her husband in front of her.","Turned out she kept all the bitterness to herself.","She held Su Tingran's hand worriedly.","The two women exchanged a look. Su Tingran slowly said,","\"Before we got married, he told me that due to the nature of his job, he couldn't always be with me,\"","\"I understand and accept it.\"","\"I thought things would slowly get better after his overseas trade projects got on track in two or three years.\"","\"But year after year, after year...\"","\"I also don't know for sure if he has someone else abroad. If a man wants to deceive, you can't get the truth from asking.\"","\"And I don't want to secretly investigate him either. After all, there is still marital affection between us. If I go that far, it would mean I don't trust him.\"","Su Tingran's expression grew heavier and heavier, her eyes reddened as she forced out a smile.","Sheng Mumu tightened her grip on Su Tingran's hand and suddenly asked,","\"Tingran, when is he coming back to Beijing next time?\"","Su Tingran looked up blankly, \"Well... it should be around the New Year.\"","\"Hmm...\" Sheng Mumu murmured thoughtfully, biting her lip, \"Then I'll borrow the reason of paying New Year's greetings to come to your house and take a look. My judgement of people is quite accurate.\"","A touch of delight appeared in Su Tingran's eyes. \"Okay, Mumu. Thank you.\"","Sheng Mumu said, \"Psh, we are sisters. What's with the thanks?\"","After Su Tingran's topic ended, Mrs. Qian and Mrs. Sun looked over at the same time.","Mrs. Qian said, \"Mrs. Qi, what about you? Feel free to vent. We sisters will think of ways to help you.\"","Mrs. Sun said, \"Right, what married woman doesn't have complaints about her husband? They just force themselves to endure. Go ahead, what are your grievances, Mrs. Qi?\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned, \"...\"","The atmosphere was gradually becoming strange now.","If she couldn't badmouth Qi Mo, it would seem a bit petty.","But if she forced it, she wouldn't know what to complain about.","Her eyes rolled as she thought for a long time. Finally she came up with something.","She shook her head and slapped her thigh with a sigh, \"Oh, our Old Qi—\""]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: What's Too Slow","paragraphs":["\"Ah, our old Qi is too slow,\" Sheng Mumu complained discontentedly as she tapped her chin with her finger and started to grumble:","\"Last time, it took him so long to finish and he just wouldn't come out.\"","\"Dragging his feet.\"","Su Tingran, Mrs. Qian, and Mrs. Sun were completely confused.","Their faces grew redder and redder as they listened.","Was this the part they could hear without having to pay?","What's too slow?","What took so long?","Even with the rich experience of these three married women, they were still shocked by Sheng Mumu's \"bold remarks.\"","Su Tingran tugged at Sheng Mumu's clothes and politely coughed.","\"Mumu, okay, okay, it's still daytime now.\"","Sheng Mumu looked over in puzzlement and asked uncomprehendingly: \"Huh? You can't say this during the day?\"","\"Oh my!\" Mrs. Qian glared reproachfully at Su Tingran. \"Mrs. Sun and I are both mothers. We won't be choked to death by dog food. Go on, keep talking.\"","Mrs. Sun chimed in, \"That's right, that's right. Mrs. Qi, tell us more.\"","Mrs. Qian and Mrs. Sun sang in chorus.","They left Sheng Mumu completely confused.","It seemed she didn't quite understand what they were talking about.","When had she lost track of their conversation?","Two pairs of expectant, story-hungry eyes stared at her.","She finally belatedly asked:","\"I was talking about shaving. What did you think I meant?\"","Mrs. Qian: \"............\"","Mrs. Sun: \"Shaving?\"","Mrs. Qian: \"Shaving is too slow?\"","Mrs. Sun: \"It took so long to finish?\"","Mrs. Qian: \"Wouldn't come out? Does that mean he couldn't get out of the bathroom?\"","Sheng Mumu blinked her limpid eyes, her long lashes fluttering. \"Yeah, didn't I just tap my chin earlier? I meant shaving. Did my gesture not come across clearly enough, or is my ability to...express myself a bit lacking?\"","Mrs. Qian took a deep breath and patted her shoulder. \"No, Mrs. Qi, it's not your problem, it's our problem.\"","Mrs. Sun pulled up the corners of her mouth in a smile. \"Yes, there was a deviation in our understanding.\"","Sheng Mumu was still completely confused. \"What did you think I meant? Eating too slowly?\"","\"Pfft~\" Su Tingran covered her mouth and laughed. This was the Mumu she knew all right.","It wasn't until the four women had finished their essential oil spa and Mrs. Sun and Mrs. Qian left early to pick up their kids from school that Su Tingran told Sheng Mumu about their \"mistaken understanding.\"","Sheng Mumu's face instantly turned red and she stammered as she spoke.","\"This, I...he...I...\"","She could swear to the heavens.","She really didn't have the slightest intention of alluding to bedroom talk.","Just then, her phone buzzed twice.","Qi Mo: \"[Picture]\"","The photo showed a shirt laid out on the bed with two ties beside it, one patterned and the other a solid color.","Qi Mo: \"I have a friend’s dinner party tonight. Which tie looks better?\"","Sheng Mumu rolled her eyes, though not maliciously.","She couldn't help but blame this man who had shown up at just the right moment for the embarrassment she had just suffered, and replied impatiently:","\"They both look good. Don't drag your feet. If you want to go out and have fun, then get out the door!\"","On the other side.","The man standing leisurely by the bed, a smile on his face, waiting for a reply. His gaze suddenly froze.","His brow furrowed slightly in puzzlement.","Just then.","The hotel room doorbell rang.","The man was still pondering the meaning of that message. He casually responded, \"Come in.\"","Assistant Dong walked in holding stacks of documents, using the spare key card.","\"Mr. Qi, I've organized all the materials for you to review.\"","The man's tone was impassive: \"I'll look at them later. Just put them down for now.\"","\"Yes, Mr. Qi.\" Assistant Dong put the stacks of important documents in the hotel safe.","He turned and saw his boss standing in front of the two ties, his face cold and stern as if deep in thought.","He was surprised.","Upholding his determination to share his boss's worries, he walked over.","\"Mr. Qi, is there anything you need me to do?\"","The words fell, and the man with the steady, dignified aura turned around, his gaze fixed on his subordinate for a few seconds. Then he spoke:","\"Little Dong, do you have a girlfriend?\"","Assistant Dong halted. He answered truthfully: \"I've had them before.\"","In his heart he couldn't help but feel strange.","Mr. Qi had never asked him personal questions unrelated to work before.","Why was he suddenly asking this? Did he have some purpose?","He held his breath and carefully observed his boss's every move.","Then he heard Mr. Qi say: \"Never mind, it's useless to ask you.\"","Next, he saw Mr. Qi stride over to the floor-to-ceiling window on his long legs.","He stood there for half a minute, murmuring a few sentences in an extremely low voice.","He couldn't make out the words clearly.","It sounded like he was listing the attendees of the dinner party tonight.","When he vaguely heard the names Miss Jiang and Ms. Yuan,","Mr. Qi's tone paused.","As if having figured something out, he gave a low, deep laugh.","Then he turned and instructed:","\"Tell Mr. Ou I won't be going to the dinner party tonight. Let's meet one-on-one next time I'm in Hong Kong.\"","\"Yes, Mr. Qi.\"","Having received his orders, Assistant Dong left the suite.","He had just closed the door behind him from outside.","Still not understanding, he scratched his head.","After working under Mr. Qi for so many years,","Lately,","He was unable to figure out Mr. Qi's thoughts more and more often.","It seemed the road to becoming a competent assistant who could share his boss's worries was still long.","He still needed to work hard.","When Sheng Mumu left Su Tingran's house and had just walked up to the door of her own villa,","She received a message that bewildered her.","Qi Mo: \"Not going out to play anymore.\"","Sheng Mumu: ???","Didn't he just pick a tie and was about to head out? Why wasn't he going anymore?","What a fickle man.","Sheng Mumu didn't bother guessing what had made him change his mind. She casually replied:","\"Okay, if you don't feel like going then don't go. I'm planning to meet Li Li for dinner later. My mom's away traveling and she's bored home alone.\"","Qi Mo: \"Sure, go ahead.\"","Seeing the quick reply on her phone screen, Sheng Mumu suddenly halted and pursed her lips.","Strange.","It felt like the wife home alone reporting her plans to her husband away on business.","At that moment, on the other end of the invisible waves linking their phones.","The man's pitch-black eyes flashed with a smile appearing and disappearing.","He got up from the sofa and walked to the hotel safe.","His long, well-proportioned fingers spun the combination lock and pulled it open.","He flipped through those documents.","A confident curve pulled at the corners of his lips."]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Qi Shaobai has been hired again.","paragraphs":["\"Qiao Li, where are you? Want to grab dinner? My treat,\" Sheng Mumu said cheerfully over the phone to Qiao Li.","On the other end of the line, there was silence for a few seconds before a hesitant response came. \"Uh...I'm sorry sister-in-law, but Cheng Zhuo and I happened to be out eating together today...\"","\"Ok ok, we'll make plans another time,\" Sheng Mumu initially didn't notice anything strange about the response.","After getting home and flopping down on the couch, she suddenly sat up straight as if a thought had occurred to her.","Something wasn't right.","Mother-in-law had already left the city to travel.","Qiao Li didn't need to keep pretending to date Cheng Zhuo anymore.","Why were they still planning to eat together?","A gossipful smile spread across her fair and radiant face.","Could it be...","\"Madam, the young master's school called for a parent to go over immediately,\" the voice of Zhang Housekeeper suddenly rang out, interrupting her train of thought.","Looking towards the source of the voice, Zhang Housekeeper's face was filled with anxiety.","\"What happened?\" Seeing his expression, Sheng Mumu suddenly had a bad feeling.","\"The school didn't say much over the phone...\" Zhang Housekeeper hesitated before continuing, \"They just mentioned...they just mentioned...\"","\"Mentioned what?\" Sheng Mumu's brows furrowed slightly.","\"They vaguely brought up, puppy love,\" Zhang Housekeeper finally got the words out, clasping his hands in front of him with a pained expression as he looked to the lady of the house.","In the past, the young master had caused quite a bit of trouble, but it was nothing more than conflicts with classmates or teachers.","None of it was ever too serious.","Recently the young master had been studying hard and turned over a new leaf.","It had been so long since Zhang Housekeeper had received a call from the school asking for a parent that he had almost forgotten that the young master used to be an unruly brat.","\"What?\" Sheng Mumu couldn't believe her ears. \"Puppy love? How is that possible?\"","In the original book, Qi Shaobai didn't start his naive schoolyard romance until university.","And now, he hadn't even finished 12th grade yet.","Who was he in love with? And with whom?","Sheng Mumu hurried upstairs to change into a sensible and appropriate outfit, then drove to Beijing No. 1 High School.","On the way over.","She considered calling Qi Mo to give him a heads up.","But on second thought.","Blindly making a call without knowing the full story would not only worry the busy man away on business, but the little one at home probably wouldn't be thrilled either.","So she decided against it.","Better to get clear on what exactly happened first.","Sheng Mumu parked her car familiarly and entered the classroom building.","After knocking twice on the office door and hearing a \"Come in,\" she pushed the door open.","As soon as the door opened, she saw Qi Shaobai with a look of disdain on his face, arms crossed and gaze aloof as he leaned against the wall.","On the other side, a girl with her hair in a high ponytail was bowed over with quiet sobs.","Next to her stood a middle-aged couple, likely the girl's parents.","Qi Shaobai turned his head when he saw Sheng Mumu come in, a fleeting look of relief flashing across his face.","It was as if he was saying: Thank goodness you're here.","Just then, a teacher wearing thick glasses came over. Seeing how young the new arrival was, he pushed his glasses up on his nose and politely asked:","\"You are Qi Shaobai's...?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled. \"I'm his mother.\"","Calling herself his stepmother wasn't too inaccurate.","Sheng Mumu took this chance to observe the situation in the office.","The teacher in front of her clearly wasn't Qi Shaobai's homeroom teacher.","From the corner of her eye, she caught a glimpse of the class written on the workbook sitting on the desk behind the teacher.","The grade column read: Senior Year Class 9.","If she remembered correctly.","At the college entrance exam rally last time, the head teacher had introduced that Senior Year Classes 1-8 were science classes, while 9-17 were arts classes.","She guessed that the teacher before her must be the homeroom teacher for Senior Year Class 9, an arts class.","\"Ms. Qi Shaobai's mother, hello. The reason we called you in today is mainly because we discovered that your son Qi Shaobai and Pan Jia from our class seem to be engaging in puppy love,\" the homeroom teacher said.","As he spoke, he pulled open a drawer and took out a stack of envelopes, handing them to Sheng Mumu.","Sheng Mumu was taken aback for a moment.","She reflexively glanced at Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai's expression was extremely calm as he shook his head back, \"I'm not in any puppy love relationship.\"","Just as he finished speaking, the middle-aged father among the girl's parents cut in:","\"Young man, you've been caught red-handed, your excuses are useless.\"","Sheng Mumu looked towards the source of the voice and saw the ponytailed girl looking at Qi Shaobai tearfully, her lips moving as if wanting to say something but then glancing at her parents and forcing back her tears, bowing her head once more.","Qi Shaobai's gaze indifferently swept over the father, who immediately flared up, voice rising, \"What are you looking at? Did I say anything wrong?\"","Sheng Mumu's tone abruptly became stern: \"Sir, please watch your temper. This isn't your home. Until we get clear on what exactly happened, it isn't your place to be lecturing my son.\"","\"You--\" The man wanted to continue but was pulled back by his wife next to him.","\"Okay, Old Pan, let the mother understand the situation first.\"","Sheng Mumu withdrew her gaze and frowned, starting to carefully go through the envelopes in her hand.","Opening the envelopes, they were all love letters.","Around seven or eight in total.","She didn't read the contents in detail, just skimmed through them briefly.","The signature at the end of each letter was: Pan Jia.","That sobbing girl.","The homeroom teacher came to stand in the middle of the office, as if to mediate the disagreement. He said:","\"Ms. Qi Shaobai's mother, as you can see, this is evidence of Qi Shaobai and Pan Jia's puppy love. Our school strictly prohibits students from puppy love, especially since they are 12th graders in the most important year of school...\"","\"Wait, teacher.\" Sheng Mumu looked through the names on the envelopes one more time to confirm, then asked, \"Isn't this a bit rash as evidence of puppy love?\"","These were just love letters written by a girl to Qi Shaobai.","If it was really a romantic relationship, there would be more than just one love letter.","The teacher explained:","\"These letters were found in Pan Jia's possession by me.\"","\"At first, I thought the same as you, that it was just kids, confused feelings.\"","\"But after calling Pan Jia in to ask, I found out they've been in a relationship for a long time.\"","\"...???\" Sheng Mumu was more and more confused as she listened.","She slowly turned her head to look at Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai shook his head calmly.","Sheng Mumu's gaze moved to the other side.","Seeing her glance over, the girl called Pan Jia averted her eyes nervously, twisting her fingers together anxiously.","Seeing this, Pan Jia's mother shifted sideways to shield her daughter behind her, stepping forward.","\"Ms. Qi's mother, our Jiajia has always been so good and sensible. If not for someone else's bad influence, she would never engage in puppy love.\"","\"Earlier we discovered Jiajia was frequently sneaking off to lock herself in her room to talk on the phone for one or two hours at a time.\"","\"Her dad noticed something fishy and forced her to admit that she was actually dating your son.\"","After hearing the other side's story, Sheng Mumu felt like something wasn't right.","Just then, the homeroom teacher spoke up:","\"According to school rules, puppy love results in a warning demerit for both parties.\"","Upon hearing this, Pan Jia's father's expression suddenly darkened as he got agitated.","\"Teacher, Jiajia was led astray by this brat. She shouldn't be punished along with him. If someone should be punished, it should only be this brat.\"","As he finished speaking, Pan Jia who had stayed silent until now wiped her tears and timidly tugged at her father's sleeve.","\"Dad, I--\"","\"Keep your mouth shut, stand aside. Disgraceful child.\"","Pan Jia didn't even get a full sentence out before being cut off by her father. She shuddered in fright.","Her mother quickly pulled her into an embrace, tugging her back.","\"Don't talk anymore, you'll upset your father.\""]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: Carrying bags for the ladies in the family is a good tradition of the Qi family.","paragraphs":["Pan Jia's father pulled up a chair and sat down, clearly intent on bargaining with the head teacher.","\"Teacher, when it comes down to it, our Jiajia is also a victim here. Any punishment or demerit should only go to this young man.\"","As he spoke, the man pointed at Qi Shaobai.","The indicated Qi Shaobai was clearly already very impatient. He met the man's gaze directly.","Now it was the man who had been speaking arrogantly who was taken aback. He turned his attack towards the school authorities, saying to the head teacher:","\"We sent our daughter to No. 1 High School in the hopes that she would have a good learning environment. Now that an incident like this has happened, shouldn't the school give us parents an explanation?\"","Sheng Mumu had been standing to the side for quite a while now, piecing together fragments of information. She finally realized what was wrong.","She slowly walked over to Qi Shaobai and said unhurriedly:","\"Have you seen these love letters?\"","Qi Shaobai's eyebrows furrowed slightly and his cold, aloof eyes flickered as he recalled.","He would find girls' love letters in his drawer every now and then.","But he would never open and read them.","He also couldn't confirm if he had received any of the ones here in front of him now.","Leaning lazily against the wall, he glanced at the crying girl he didn't know and lazily said:","\"I've never read any of them.\"","Sheng Mumu naturally believed his words. She pursed her lips:","\"I see. I understand now.\"","Then she went over to the girl called Pan Jia.","The man sitting in the chair stood up warily, \"What are you doing?\"","Sheng Mumu turned her head and revealed a polite smile:","\"Don't worry, I just want to ask your daughter a few questions to understand the situation.\"","\"The situation is already very clear. If there's anything else to ask, ask me.\" The man said.","Sheng Mumu raised her eyebrows, \"The love letters weren't written by you, so it's not very suitable to ask you.\"","Having said that, she ignored the dumbfounded man and went straight over to Pan Jia.","Her tone became softer and gentler. She handed over a tissue.","\"Don't be nervous. As a parent, I want to understand the situation.\"","Pan Jia trembled as she took the tissue. Her body was unnaturally tense and she didn't dare meet Sheng Mumu's gaze.","Sheng Mumu's gaze was sharp. She slowly and deliberately spoke:","\"You said you were dating our Qi Shaobai, correct?\"","\"Uh...\" Pan Jia hemmed and hawed. Suddenly her arm was shoved.","Her mother beside her urged, \"Your parents are right here. Speak up boldly.\"","Pan Jia bit her lip. It seemed she had summoned up great courage before nodding almost imperceptibly and saying in a tiny voice: \"...Yes.\"","Sheng Mumu asked again: \"Other than the letters you wrote, did Qi Shaobai ever write back?\"","Pan Jia's head drooped lower and lower. \"...No, none.\"","\"Mrs. Qi, are you finished with your questions?\" Pan Jia's father cut in loudly. \"Lack of replies doesn't prove your son's innocence. My wife and I saw Jiajia hiding in her room talking on the phone every night with our own eyes.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"How can you be sure it was with Qi Shaobai on the phone?\"","\"You... this...\" The man couldn't answer and waved his hand to avoid the question. Instead he retorted, \"What are you saying, we're the injured party here. What is there to be afraid of saying?\"","Sheng Mumu raised her eyebrows. She also didn't address his words directly, and continued:","\"There's one thing I don't quite understand. According to what you just said, you discovered long ago that your daughter was potentially dating my son. Why didn't you contact the school earlier, or contact us parents, but instead waited until the school discovered the letters before saying you wanted to hold someone responsible?\"","When she finished speaking, Pan Jia's parents' bodies stiffened.","Sheng Mumu's eyes narrowed slightly and her gaze grew sharp:","\"Every time your daughter wants to speak, she gets interrupted. Is that unintentional, or are you worried she will tell the truth?\"","The man across from her was flustered with guilt and raised his voice, \"What are you talking about? We're the injured party here. What is there to be afraid of saying?\"","Sheng Mumu took a light breath and slowly laid out her judgment:","\"The school discovered the letters and called you to the school. You were worried your daughter would get a warning or demerit on her record during this critical time in 12th grade. So you plotted for her to push the blame onto my son who knew nothing about it and make him take the fall.\"","When she finished speaking, the office fell into a brief silence.","The head teacher's eyes grew wider and wider as he mulled over her words, increasingly feeling that was the truth.","Pan Jia's parents looked at each other, then simultaneously looked back at Sheng Mumu, just about to continue equivocating, when they heard the girl who had cried herself hoarse suddenly speak:","\"Auntie...I'm sorry...\"","The girl's tears pitter-pattered onto the office floor.","Having the entire truth laid bare, she didn't dare look again at the boy she loved in her heart.","She hated that she couldn't find a crack in the floor to crawl into, her face flushing bright red as she cried:","\"You're right...Qi...Qi Shaobai was wrongly accused. We were never dating. From start to finish it was entirely one-sided on my part...\"","Pan Jia's throat tightened and her nose soured. She choked up and couldn't get out the words that followed.","Beside her, as soon as the parents saw their daughter confess everything, they were completely flustered. Each grabbed one of her arms.","The father's tone was severe: \"Jiajia, what's the matter with you? Getting a disciplinary warning in 12th grade is very serious. Weren't you told not to say anything?\"","The anxious mother said, \"Jiajia, you...\"","Sheng Mumu lightly shook her head and went to Qi Shaobai's side. \"Let's go home.\"","Qi Shaobai's hands that had been folded in front of his chest finally dropped. The sharpness in his eyes disappeared inch by inch. He nodded his chin and followed her out.","Inside the office, the girl's sobs and parents' chatter still hadn't stopped.","Sheng Mumu reached the door and her footsteps paused.","She slowly turned her head to look back.","Her tone wasn't harsh, but each word rang clearly:","\"It is parents like you who cannot face problems directly and teach your daughter to lie, that are the biggest punishment for your daughter.\"","Having said that, she left the office without looking back.","On the road from the classroom building to the parking lot,","Qi Shaobai walked leisurely with his hands in his pockets.","Sheng Mumu glanced at him. Seeing his completely carefree appearance, she couldn't help but complain:","\"What's with you? Qi, you're usually quite talkative. How come when you were wrongly accused today you didn't make a peep?\"","Qi Shaobai lazily turned his head.","A hint of mockery flashed through his cold, aloof eyes.","\"I knew you would come, so what was there to say?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"............\"","She grabbed Qi Shaobai's schoolbag and forced him to stop.","Craning her head up to look at her discount son who was a head taller than her, she said impatiently:","\"You brat, waiting for me to stand up for you while hiding behind me to enjoy the show, is this your business or my business?\"","Qi Shaobai had a perfectly justified expression as he shrugged:","\"I'm just too lazy to waste words with people I'm not familiar with.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","She really wanted to point at his nose and give him a talking-to.","But then she felt some pity for the boy who had just been freed from a false accusation.","She sighed helplessly, letting go of his schoolbag.","\"Nevermind you, let's go, let's go.\"","The corner of Qi Shaobai's mouth quirked up slightly. He put his schoolbag back on properly.","His gaze went to Sheng Mumu's bag in her hand. He jutted his chin out and said casually as if it was nothing:","\"It was so kind of such a busy woman to make a trip here. Let me carry your bag for you.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a second before giving him the side-eye and handing over the bag:","\"Consider it you being self-aware.\"","Dusk was falling and students were coming and going across campus.","Among them were classmates who recognized Qi Shaobai.","Seeing this scene, they were shocked and opened their eyes wide, but didn't dare react too obviously. They watched covertly.","Qi Shaobai was actually carrying his stepmother's bag?","Unbelievable. Simply unbelievable.","But Qi Shaobai himself was completely nonchalant about it.","Carrying bags for the women of the house was a fine tradition in the Qi family.","His dad did it too.","He was just a high schooler. What was the big deal about carrying one for a bit?","The two who had become the center of attention on campus remained oblivious to the eyes on them.","Chatting all the while, they walked towards the parking lot.","\"Little Qi, have you grown taller again?\"","\"Haven't measured, don't know.\"","\"I rushed over and didn't eat. Take me for a meal.\"","\"Let's go.\"","\"I'll pick the place.\"","\"Okay.\""]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: This time, Keyes's lies are not bad at all.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu called Zhang Housekeeper and told the chef at home not to cook dinner.","In the big pot of the roadside malatang food stand, the ingredients gurgled and tumbled.","The warm light from the light bulb overhead shone down, making the skewers that had already absorbed flavor look even more appetizing.","The aromatic hot steam kept drilling into Sheng Mumu's nostrils.","The boss lady wearing an apron smiled and tidied up the table surface, enthusiastically greeting:","\"Take whatever you want, thick skewers are 4 yuan each, thin skewers are 2 yuan each, there are condiments over there.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes curved as she nodded her head and said, \"Okay boss.\"","She then reached out and took a seaweed skewer and a crispy tofu skin skewer and put them in her bowl.","She ate them in a few bites without dipping them in any condiments.","Satisfied, she patted her stomach and sighed contentedly: \"Ah...so delicious!\"","Just as she was about to take more skewers from the pot, she caught a glimpse of Qi Shaobai sitting still as a statue out of the corner of her eye, with his eyebrows slightly furrowed and a hint of disdain flashing through his eyes.","\"Aren't you going to eat?\" Sheng Mumu blinked and asked.","Qi Shaobai tilted his neck back and said plainly, \"I'll wait a bit.\"","He needed to psych himself up a little more.","He didn't want the boss lady to see his reluctance, yet he really couldn't get past the barrier in his mind.","So he remained frozen, stretching his hand out a little, about to grab a skewer, then suddenly turning midair and grabbing his drink instead, tilting his head back for a sip.","Sheng Mumu held back a laugh, patting the proud and stubborn boy's shoulder as she got up.","\"I'll go make you a special secret ultimate dipping sauce, guaranteed to make you unable to stop eating.\"","Back when she was in college, she and her roommates loved eating street food skewers like these.","They were delicious and lively.","She also had a good grasp on making sauces.","Soon, she placed a small bowl in front of Qi Shaobai.","\"Try it.\"","Qi Shaobai reluctantly accepted the small bowl and murmured, \"Oh.\"","He told himself inwardly: I'm already here, so I'll just eat a few skewers to give my stepmom some face.","Twenty minutes later...","Steam rose faintly above the evening roadside food stand.","\"Boss lady, do you have any more cooked beef skewers?\"","Qi Shaobai called out to the boss lady who was busy inside, panting from the spiciness, yet still wanting more skewers.","Seeing that the tall young man had swept thirty beef skewers she had just cooked clean in one go, the boss lady's eyes smiled into a line. She called out loudly:","\"Yeah, I have more, just a moment!\"","Sheng Mumu was already full, so seeing that Qi Shaobai showed no sign of stopping, she also slowed down, taking another potato skewer and slowly eating it.","She turned her head and cocked a brow. \"How is it? Pretty good right?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Delicious.\"","By the time the two finally finished their hearty meal and returned to Xiyu Yue Ting, the hour hand was nearly pointing at nine.","As usual, Sheng Mumu parked not far from the entrance of the villa district.","They took a stroll to walk off the food on the way back.","Sheng Mumu thought about what had happened today, and after thinking it over, decided to subtly probe Qi Shaobai.","She casually asked in a natural tone:","\"Little Qi, you're always getting love letters from girls at school right?\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned, not expecting the conversation to suddenly turn to this topic.","He turned to her blankly and said in a flat tone: \"Yeah, it's annoying.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes turned shrewdly. \"Then...you've never responded to any of them?\"","\"Of course not,\" Qi Shaobai raised both hands as if to prove his innocence. \"I don't even have enough time to do all the practice tests every day, the ones you bought last time, I still have over half left unfinished, it's killing me.\"","\"Oh, I see.\" Sheng Mumu tapped her chin pensively.","From what she knew of the plot, this boy didn't seem to be lying.","She felt relieved, and earnestly added:","\"Those love letters you receive, don't pass them around to your classmates, you understand? Not even a good friend like Wei Zhaonan.","Qi Shaobai put on a mature expression. \"I know that already, it would be in poor taste.\"","Sheng Mumu looked at him approvingly. \"Right, exactly.\"","The future domineering CEO was destined to become the crush of many girls in his student days. And this young heartthrob was destined to only have eyes for the future female protagonist.","Even so, Sheng Mumu still didn't want him to unintentionally hurt too many innocent young girls in their budding youth.","Naive, confused crushes were precious.","Even if unable to reciprocate.","Don't leave scars.","She had thought Qi Shaobai wouldn't understand.","But now it seemed.","He was much more sensible and mature than she realized.","As they neared the villa entrance.","Qi Shaobai's listless eyes suddenly lit up, and he halted in his steps.","Sheng Mumu noticed his abnormal behavior, and looked in the direction he was gazing.","She saw an elderly person with white hair, ringing their doorbell.","The next second, Qi Shaobai practically leapt forward, sprinting eagerly toward the elder.","As excited as a seven or eight year old child.","Calling out:","\"Grandma, you're here!\"","The white-haired elder slowly turned around. The moment she saw her great-grandson, a smile spread across her face.","Each wrinkle brimmed with benevolent joy.","She stamped her wooden cane vigorously twice. \"Rascal.\"","Sheng Mumu also smiled and went up to greet her.","This was her first time seeing the old lady in person.","She was even more spirited than when Sheng Mumu had seen her on video calls.","Sheng Mumu went over to support the old lady's arm and affectionately called: \"Grandma~\"","The old lady patted her great-grandson's arm signalling him to move aside. She then gave Sheng Mumu a big hug.","Sheng Mumu was enveloped in the soft embrace, the faint floral scent of the old lady's 4711 Eau De Cologne wafting into her nose.","\"Mumu, Grandma has missed you all so much.\"","Zhang Housekeeper and the servants successively came out from the villa, taking the old lady's small bag from her.","Zhang Housekeeper looked around concernedly and asked in puzzlement:","\"Old Lady, where are the people accompanying you?\"","Upon hearing this, the old lady reluctantly let go of her grandson's wife. Like a mischievous child, she stamped her cane again and said stubbornly:","\"Sitting in cars all day, my limbs will atrophy. I told them to let me off to walk over.\"","Right after she finished speaking, a luxurious nanny van slowly pulled up to the entrance.","Some of the old lady's private caregivers got out.","Sheng Mumu supported the old lady as they walked inside, Qi Shaobai propping her up on the other side.","The old lady looked left and right at her most beloved great-grandson and the daughter-in-law she approved of getting along harmoniously. Her mood grew even better.","She patted Qi Shaobai's hand.","\"Rascal, Grandma is making fried meatballs for you today. You loved eating the meatballs I made when you were little.\"","A rare docile and obedient look appeared on Qi Shaobai's face. He nodded eagerly:","\"That's wonderful Grandma, I just happened to be hungry, thinking of the meatballs you make makes my mouth water.\"","Sheng Mumu listened in from the side, the corners of her eyes slowly curving up as a warm current rippled through her heart.","Only she knew how stuffed Qi Shaobai had been from their roadside feast.","Yet to make the elderly happy, he still told this tiny harmless lie.","This time, little Qi's fib wasn't clumsy at all.","It was full of filial piety and sincerity."]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: So Everyday","paragraphs":["Kitchen.","The golden meatballs just came out of the pot, and the aroma filled the air.","Qi Shaobai wanted to grab one, but Sheng Mumu slapped his hand away and glared at him.","\"Did you wash your hands?\"","Qi Shaobai's brows instantly furrowed as he said aggrievedly, \"I already washed them earlier.\"","The old lady who was putting meatballs into the pot chuckled at this.","\"Little one has been like this since he was small. I would fry these while he tried to steal bites. Can't blame him though, he ate so many but never got fat.\"","Seeing the old lady laugh, Sheng Mumu also laughed.","Qi Shaobai's lips tightened slightly, not laughing.","Hearing Grandma mention the past instantly sent him into recollection, and his eyes even grew somewhat wet.","The Qi family of the past was not well-off, just an ordinary family.","But he was raised by Grandma and never suffered any hardship.","Grandma loved to laugh and was kindly yet nagging.","She used almost her entire retirement pension on him.","He still remembered Grandma's most common phrase—\"If other kids have it, our little one should too.\"","When he was seven or eight, there was a remote control car craze at school for a while.","He originally had one, but during a race with classmates, it accidentally fell into a ditch.","The engine got soaked and was completely totaled.","A genuine remote control car plus the engine was not cheap, and he didn't dare tell Grandma.","Yet a few mornings later, he saw a brand new one sitting on his bedside table.","Before third grade, he was on the skinny side compared to other students.","When the school ordered new uniforms, even if he got the normal size, what he received was always a little big.","Grandma would personally tailor and reinforce them with dense stitching.","He still remembered once when there was a parent-teacher conference at school.","He sat by a flowerbed on the sports field waiting for Grandma to come out so they could walk home together.","Some boys from the next class came by and mocked him maliciously,","saying he was the only one in school without parents there, that he was an unwanted child.","He raised his fist to hit back when his small head was suddenly covered by a pair of warm hands.","Grandma appeared behind him and sternly scolded the boys away with her cane.","The next day, those students' parents brought them to their home to apologize.","After that, no one mocked him again.","They knew that while Qi Shaobai did not have parents by his side, he had an even more formidable Grandma.","Qi Shaobai only recalled a little, and scene after scene from his childhood surfaced in his mind.","The Grandma before his eyes now was still the same as in his memories, with a kindly smile and lively spirit.","A warmth swept through his heart.","Qi Shaobai and Sheng Mumu flanked the old lady on either side.","Sheng Mumu was lending a hand.","Since Qi Shaobai couldn't help, he diligently ate.","The more fragrant and approving he was of the food, the wider Grandma smiled.","During this time, Qi Shaobai heard Sheng Mumu's phone ring.","She answered, spoke briefly, then hung up.","Then he saw Sheng Mumu make another video call to the same number.","Holding up her phone to record, she included Grandma and him in the frame.","With hands on her hips, she gleefully said to the person on the call:","\"Look, Grandma's frying meatballs, so fragrant. Too bad you can't have any~ \"","As she finished speaking, Grandma and he laughed.","Dad's low laughter could be heard from the phone.","Grandma glanced sideways at the screen and said, \"Big guy, don't crave it. Grandma will freeze some for you in the fridge.\"","A gentle \"Okay\" came through the phone.","Qi Shaobai's mouth curled up unconsciously.","The fragrant kitchen.","Grandma frying meatballs happily.","The young stepmother filming with her phone.","Dad on the other end of the call, unable to eat the freshly fried meatballs.","Everything was so ordinary and tranquil.","He really liked this kind of uneventful, simple life.","Zhang Housekeeper tidied up the largest guest room.","During renovations, this bedroom was set aside for when Grandma came to stay.","The bathroom had handles everywhere, and soft pads lined the walls.","The mattress was an elderly spine-protecting kind.","Many landscape potted plants grew on the small balcony.","Inside was a calligraphy desk with racks displaying expensive brushes and ink sticks collected from various places.","Because they had learned during a previous video call that Grandma had recently enrolled in a tai chi sword class at a senior activity center.","Qi had specially found some tai chi swords handcrafted by artisans.","Early next morning.","Sheng Mumu was awakened by the melodious music drifting up from the courtyard downstairs.","Rubbing her eyes, she leaned over the balcony railing to look down.","Old Lady was dressed in a loose-fitting moon white long-sleeved shirt and pants, wielding a sword.","Bow stance, push hands, straight thrust, upward parry...","Each movement was practiced and structured.","Sheng Mumu suddenly remembered the promise she had made to Grandma earlier.","To record Grandma practicing tai chi sword and make a colorful electronic photo album for her to share with her senior center tai chi group, making her the coolest granny there.","Just as she was thinking this,","a crisp and powerful voice floated up.","\"Mumu, come down and join me.\"","In a right bow stance, as Old Lady looked up, she saw her pajama-clad granddaughter-in-law yawning on the balcony upstairs.","So young yet already yawning after just waking.","Clearly lacking exercise day to day.","It was time to impart some moves.","Sheng Mumu smiled and waved downstairs, sweetly responding:","\"Okay Grandma, I'll come right down!\"","After washing up, Sheng Mumu changed into lightweight exercise clothes and shoes.","As soon as she arrived in the courtyard, a tai chi sword was shoved into her hands.","Grandmother and granddaughter faced each other, moving slowly to the music.","The grandmother over ninety was steady and composed, posture standard.","The granddaughter-in-law not yet thirty was unsteady on her feet, hands and feet in disarray.","Beside them, Zhang Housekeeper silently shook his head.","Seeing the young lady's extremely uncoordinated limbs, he wanted to laugh but did not dare.","Just managing to get somewhat proficient at the first eight moves out of thirty-two, Sheng Mumu was already drenched in sweat.","She waved her hand, sitting down on a nearby chair and taking a sip of water. She said,","\"Grandma, I can't anymore, I need to rest a bit. Let me record you.\"","Upon hearing this, the old lady became even more spirited.","She tidied her collar and specially chose the front courtyard fountain as a backdrop.","Very seriously, she performed another set.","To capture the best effect, Sheng Mumu half-squatted, steadily filming.","Afterwards, she selected twenty to thirty of the best photos from the footage, filtering and editing until about fifteen remained. She made these into a digital photo album and sent it to Grandma's WeChat.","The old lady put the sword back in its sheath and placed it on the outdoor table.","She hurriedly drank a sip of the tea a servant handed her, then eagerly shared the photo album she had just received to the WeChat group titled \"Tai Chi Sword Class 2 of the Senior Center\".","Still feeling it wasn't enough, she had her granddaughter-in-law choose the best looking photo and posted it with a status update, changing it to her new profile picture.","Sheng Mumu very patiently operated the phone, speaking to the old lady with laughter in her voice:","\"Grandma, look at the live background I set for you.\"","The old lady with silvery white hair leaned over, eyes curving into a smile.","\"Ohoho, this is good, it moves too!\"","Just as she was about to return the phone to the old lady, a \"1 New Like\" notification popped up on the screen.","Clicking in, it showed the person listed as \"Big Guy\" had liked the post."]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Keyes the Chosen One","paragraphs":["The old lady's eyes were smiling as she sent a voice message, her tone complacent:","\"My grandson's wife made this for me, isn't it nice?\"","In the WeChat group \"Tai Chi Sword Class 2\" at the senior citizen university, thumbs up emojis floated by.","- [Thumbs up][Thumbs up][Thumbs up]","- [Very nice!]","- [Grandchildren around your knee, life's greatest joy [Flower][Flower][Flower]]","- [[Flower] What's best? A strong body is best, caring family is best, having a descendant who cares for you is best, good morning! [Flower][Sun]]","- [Like this animated version]","At that time.","Jing City No.1 Middle School.","Qi Shaobai was sitting lazily leaning against the wall, playing on his phone.","Seeing the circle of friends just posted by Old Lady, his eyes softened slightly and he liked it.","A long ring for class sounded.","The other students gradually returned to their seats.","When the bell completely stopped, the head teacher walked to the podium holding a textbook.","He took out a form from the textbook, looked around the classroom, and slowly opened his mouth:","\"Classmates, the annual Arts Festival is about to begin. The school encourages high school seniors to actively participate this time too, to ease the tense test preparation atmosphere.\"","The classroom immediately buzzed with cheers and whispers.","The head teacher pushed his glasses and got to the key point:","\"Each class needs to put on two performances. Any volunteers?\"","His words instantly quieted the noise.","The head teacher awkwardly pulled his mouth.","Alright.","He knew it.","Asking these students choked by schoolwork to participate in the Arts Festival, everyone was excited.","But if asked to actually perform, they'd rather kill themselves.","But there was no choice.","It was a task from above that had to be completed.","The head teacher's gaze suddenly became sharp as he looked over everyone.","The students who met his eyes either casually looked away,","Or directly stared blankly, pretending to daydream.","Some even calmly took out a test paper and pretended to think about the questions.","As for Qi Shaobai, he simply closed his eyes, propped up his head, and feigned sleep.","Head Teacher: ......","The head teacher waited and waited, and relayed the school's intentions again in official language, before the art committee leader finally volunteered under pressure.","After volunteering, they immediately regretted it.","Mentally cursing that they'd soon give up this \"good\" student position that always got the bad jobs first and never the good ones.","Having settled one act, there was still no one willing to do the other.","Left with no choice, they decided to draw lots.","In less than 10 minutes, the class president prepared small strips of paper and dumped them in a box.","Starting from the first seat of the first row, each student would draw one.","Whoever got the paper with a star pattern was the \"lucky\" chosen one.","The head teacher crossed his arms and gleefully announced:","\"Let's start, completely fair. Whoever is picked cannot decline anymore, you must participate in the Arts Festival performance.\"","The papers in the box were picked out one by one.","Those who picked blank strips quietly breathed a sigh of relief.","Seeing the class president had brought the box to their row, Wei Zhaonan anxiously turned his head.","He said to Qi Shaobai behind him:","\"Qi Shaobai, I have a bad feeling. I feel the \"chosen one\" will appear in our group—\"","\"Shut your jinx mouth.\" Qi Shaobai frowned and glared at him.","Soon it was Wei Zhaonan's turn to \"draw\".","He took three deep breaths with a grave expression, blew on his palm, rubbed it several times, full of ritual sense as he reached into the box.","He carefully took out a strip of paper and gingerly unfolded it.","Squinting, not daring to look directly.","\"Yes!\"","Upon confirming it was blank, he excitedly pumped his fist and cheered.","Then he turned and encouraged his good friend Qi Shaobai.","\"Go for it, Daddy already passed, you can definitely pass too. I'm passing my good luck to you.\"","Qi Shaobai's cold eyes slightly glared as he lazily took a paper from the box and casually retorted:","\"Piss off, Daddy's luck has always been good.\"","As he spoke, he confidently unfolded the paper.","Suddenly, his eyes widened.","\"Damn!\"","Just a second ago still calm and composed, the next second he deflated.","Wei Zhaonan craned his neck to look.","On the paper was a star pattern.","He immediately laughed nonstop, not forgetting to mock:","\"Qi Shaobai, your luck really is pretty good.\"","Seeing the \"lucky one\" had appeared, the students behind who hadn't drawn yet breathed a sigh of relief and high-fived celebrating.","The lively cheers of the crowd sounded particularly grating to Qi Shaobai.","The head teacher handed Qi Shaobai the registration form for him to fill in what act he would perform before submitting it, deadline three days.","That night.","Qi Shaobai walked home with heavy steps.","He changed shoes silently.","He had racked his brains but still couldn't think of what act to put down.","He certainly couldn't perform Lego building in front of the whole school right?","Passing through the living room, he was still pondering this matter, and didn't notice Old Lady knitting yarn while watching TV with Sheng Mumu.","The old lady had a whim that afternoon to knit a sweater, and asked the butler to buy yarn.","When Sheng Mumu saw it, she was very interested and kept asking the old lady to teach her.","So the elderly and the child sat with legs crossed on the sofa, knitting away.","Sheng Mumu heard the sound from the doorway and glanced over.","She casually greeted \"Xiao Qi classmate is back\", but didn't get a response.","Puzzled, she called louder:","\"Qi Shaobai!\"","The preoccupied teen finally heard someone calling him.","He slowly turned his head.","The old lady's mind was still sharp. With one look she could tell Qi Shaobai was worried about something.","She waved him over to ask what was going on.","Only then did she find out her great grandson was fretting over an act to perform for the Art Festival.","The old lady smiled knowingly like someone who had been there before, and said:","\"Xiaodi, I remember you performed on stage before.\"","The old lady paused, squinting as she recalled.","After a while, she slapped her thigh.","\"That's right, when you dressed up as Nezha with a red dot on your forehead, the little red tasseled spear is still at my place.\"","Sheng Mumu couldn't help but burst out laughing when she heard this.","She really couldn't imagine what the aloof and fierce Qi Shaobai would look like with a red dot on his head acting as Nezha.","The more she thought about it, the more bizarre yet funny she found the picture.","She laughed so hard she messed up the yarn she was holding, and could only set it aside to re-knit later.","Qi Shaobai slowly inhaled and spoke plaintively, as if complaining to the old lady:","\"Grandma, you said that was for Children's Day in kindergarten senior year. I'm almost 18 now.\"","The old lady was stunned, blinking her eyes. \"Oh? It was that long ago? It doesn't feel like it to me.\"","Then she chuckled.","Sheng Mumu took the registration form from Qi Shaobai to look at it.","At the bottom were small words — The school strongly encourages family participation in performances for the Arts Festival.","Sheng Mumu's eyes shifted between the old lady and Qi Shaobai.","Suddenly she put down the form and tilted her head to look at Qi Shaobai.","\"Xiao Qi classmate, I know what you can perform!\""]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: The Birth of Grandma","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai, I've thought of what you can perform!","As soon as she finished speaking, Madam Qi and Qi Shaobai turned to look at her simultaneously.","Qi Shaobai: What?","Could it be that he has talents even he himself doesn't know about?","A meaningful smile spread across Sheng Mumu's face as she narrowed her eyes and raised her eyebrows. \"You can perform Tai Chi Sword with Granny.\"","\"I can perform with Little One?\" Madam Qi's eyes lit up as she abruptly turned to look at her great grandson. \"Really?\"","Qi Shaobai froze as if struck by acupuncture. \"......\"","He looked at Sheng Mumu, then at Granny Qi.","Although his mind screamed \"no\" ten thousand times, he couldn't utter half a \"no\".","He couldn't bear to see the hopeful expression on Granny's face dashed.","Sheng Mumu also looked at him expectantly, blinking as she awaited his response.","A smile slowly spread across Qi Shaobai's stiff, aloof face. He enunciated word for word:","\"Excellent suggestion.\"","Granny giggled as she hurriedly took out her phone.","She eagerly showed off to her fellow seniors in the elderly university group chat that she would be performing with her great grandson.","Sheng Mumu briskly got up and swiftly asked an attendant to fetch a pen.","She quickly filled out the registration form and handed it back to Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai: ......","Fake smile boy.jpg","Who could have thought that just a few minutes ago when he was worrying about what to perform, someone would help fill out the form for him just like that?","This stepmother is truly considerate...","In fact, Sheng Mumu had an ulterior motive for this suggestion.","According to the plot in the book, Granny didn't have more than a year left to live.","These past two days, she always felt like something was stuck in her heart. Every time she was with Granny, she would involuntarily think of this.","In addition to chatting and keeping Granny company, she had subtly brought up accompanying Granny to get a checkup several times, but was always gently rejected by Granny with a laugh.","She couldn't forcibly trick her into going, she could only wait for Qi Mo to return.","She knew Qi Mo had already made an appointment with the doctor beforehand.","When he returned, there would surely be a way to bring the stubborn old lady to get examined.","Granny currently looked quite hale and hearty.","But because she harbored this concern, Sheng Mumu inevitably felt sad.","What if... what if this wonderful Granny didn't escape that ordained disaster? What then?","Little Qi who was so close to Granny would surely be heartbroken.","The elderly depart this world eventually.","Even if she escaped this disaster, what about the future?","She thought to herself.","Sheng Mumu's gaze slowly shifted.","Granny had already eagerly taken out two tai chi swords and handed one to Qi Shaobai to have him follow her movements and get a feel for it.","With a look of utter despair, Qi Shaobai nodded. He clumsily imitated the motions along with the melodious music.","His attitude was proper, but the movements clumsy.","Granny assumed the stance with the sword held behind her back. She turned to correct her great grandson's posture.","She nitpicked every detail without any carelessness.","Sheng Mumu silently raised her phone and sneakily snapped a photo of the old and young backs.","The corners of her lips lifted slightly, her gaze softening.","If... nothing can be changed.","She hoped little Qi would have more heartwarming memories of Granny in the future.","Sheng Mumu scheduled sword practice times for Qi Shaobai.","Three and a half minutes in the morning, and half an hour at night.","He would spend three and a half minutes practicing with Granny before leaving for school in the morning. At night when he returned, there would be half an hour of concentrated practice.","To increase Qi Shaobai's enthusiasm for sword practice and reduce the idol burden of a young person learning tai chi, Sheng Mumu also participated and practiced with him.","Accompanied by the morning birdsong.","Granny assumed the stance of a strict teacher before the two \"students\", enthusiastically demonstrating the moves.","At night, Sheng Mumu would help Qi Shaobai polish the details.","Granny sat to the side waving her fan, occasionally instructing and pointing out areas for improvement. After just two days, Qi Shaobai had completely memorized the motions.","Seeing there was nothing more that could be improved, Sheng Mumu started looking online for hanfu outfits.","She said she wanted to customize a set of old-fashioned parent-child clothes for the grandfather and grandson pair.","It was Sunday and there was no school.","In the afternoon, Qi Shaobai took the initiative to ask for extra practice.","After two rounds with the sword, he let Granny rest first while he went through the motions alone.","Sheng Mumu kept Granny company as they sat watching him.","As Granny held her daughter-in-law's hand watching her great grandson practice the sword, she chuckled and turned to say to her daughter-in-law:","\"Mumu, thank you.\"","Sheng Mumu was startled. \"Granny, what are you talking about?\"","A gentle light appeared in Granny's eyes. \"For accompanying me and Little One these past few days to practice, instead of going to work. I've delayed you.\"","Sheng Mumu hugged Granny's arm tightly and gently said:","\"Accompanying you is the most important thing. As long as you're happy, we as your juniors are willing to do anything.\"","Granny patted the back of her hand blissfully then suddenly narrowed her eyes as her tone changed.","\"I'd be even happier if I could see you and Big One have a little baby.\"","As she finished speaking, Sheng Mumu's body froze imperceptibly. \"......\"","Oh my.","The nagging about having a baby from mother-in-law had just ended, now it was starting from granny.","What was worse was,","Granny's nagging was more powerful.","It was hard to refuse and even harder to fool her.","Granny sensitively noticed her hesitation. She suddenly grabbed her hand with a solemn expression, frowning as she asked:","\"Mumu, is everything alright between you and Big One?\"","Sheng Mumu blankly nodded. \"Everything's fine.\"","Granny's worry didn't diminish but rather increased. \"Then why after being married so long, you still don't have plans for a child?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Granny pressed her, \"Mumu, is it because Qi Mo is too busy with work and doesn't have time to accompany you, so your relationship has faded?\"","Sheng Mumu quickly shook her head. \"It hasn't faded.\"","Granny looked incredulous, with an \"is that so, I don't believe it\" expression.","Just then, the front gate of the villa slowly opened.","A black Rolls-Royce Phantom appeared at the entrance.","The car steadily parked by the garden fountain.","Before little Wang could get out to open the door,","the man in the backseat had already pushed the door open himself.","The man who hadn't been seen for days appeared before them.","The lazy afternoon sunlight shone between the man's heroic and compelling brows, unable to conceal his innate edge.","He casually glanced to the side, and his gaze that was inherently a bit cold happened to meet hers.","Their eyes locked in midair. Sheng Mumu's eyes tightened.","A relieved expression appeared on her fair and clear face.","Her eyes curved into a delighted arc.","Almost in an instant, she thought of how to dispel Granny's doubts and put on an affectionate married couple act.","She beamed radiantly, opening her slender fair arms to welcome her returning husband.","Unexpectedly embracing the man who had just stepped out of the car.","Her voice was soft and sweet.","\"Dear, you're back!\""]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: I am.","paragraphs":["Her breath surrounded him.","Qi Mo's breathing hitched, his heart thumping like a drum, pounding heavily.","A hint of pleasant surprise flashed through his dark pupils.","Scorching and profound.","He lowered his long lashes, gazing down at the woman nestled against his chest.","His eyes lingered gently on the corners of her eyes, the tip of her nose, the edges of her lips.","Further down, her exquisite clavicles rose and fell.","His throat rolled unexpectedly and he averted his eyes.","Unconsciously, his large palm came to rest on the woman's back.","He patted it twice.","The icy aura around him suddenly turned gentle.","The air was suffused with the pleasantly crisp scent of him.","His voice was low and mellow, the final note lingering, concealing a smile.","\"I'm back.\"","Anyone who saw this scene would feel the affection was almost overflowing.","Only Qi Mo himself knew.","Sheng Mumu had secretly pinched his arm, lowering her voice to say:","\"Help, you're back just in time, I was almost interrogated by Old Lady.\"","Qi Mo chuckled lowly, his chest rising and falling slightly. \"I'm here.\"","Not far away, Old Lady couldn't hear their whispers, she only saw this intimate scene like newlyweds.","Her smile instantly filled her face.","Just now she had been worried the relationship between her grandson and granddaughter-in-law was not good.","Now seeing it with her own eyes, her concerns were gone.","Qi Mo's gaze moved past Sheng Mumu's head, looking at Old Lady with a gentle, humble smile. \"Grandma.\"","Old Lady called out loudly, \"My big boy is back!\"","Sheng Mumu appropriately ended the embrace, a performance of affection also needed to hit the right note, too much would be excessive.","Just as she was about to return to Old Lady's side, her wrist was grasped by the man's warm large palm.","His hand slid down her slender porcelain wrist, holding her hand.","He led her to stand in front of Old Lady.","Qi Mo's tone was calm and ordinary, \"Grandma, I ran into Doctor Jiang earlier, she said she misses you a lot.\"","Old Lady smiled, eyes curving, \"Little Jiang ah, oh that's right, she opened a clinic in Jing City, I almost forgot about that.\"","Qi Mo said, \"I'll take you to visit Doctor Jiang's clinic tomorrow?\"","Old Lady clasped her hands together, \"Good, show Little Jiang the sword practice photos Mumu took of me.\"","Qi Mo nodded slightly. \"Mm.\"","Sheng Mumu glanced at the man beside her with the serene, gentle smile.","She secretly marveled.","As expected of Qi Mo.","With just a few words he got Old Lady to agree to get a check up.","Just as she was thinking this, the hand holding hers tightened slightly as the man turned his head, looking over with gentle eyes.","\"Are you going?\"","Sheng Mumu didn't even need to think before nodding her head, \"Going of course, I'll go with Old Lady for the check up.\"","The corners of the man's lips quirked up as he rubbed her soft fingertips, his low voice rumbled,","\"Good, we'll go together.\"","As the three of them were speaking.","Suddenly Qi Shaobai squeezed his furry white head between Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu.","The boy didn't have much tact, lazily piping up,","\"Dad, I'm performing Tai Chi sword with Great Grandma for the arts festival.\"","Qi Mo's brow twitched as he glanced at him, his tone neither light nor heavy,","\"Mm, I know, go practice.\"","\"Okay!\" Qi Shaobai withdrew his head.","Dinner was very simple.","The chef cooked several bowls of homemade noodle soup with meatballs Old Lady had frozen earlier.","Qi Shaobai had practiced sword for several hours and was starving, drinking up all the soup.","Sheng Mumu left some room in her stomach, taking up two bowls of bird's nest soup after dinner.","She brought one to Old Lady.","When she left Old Lady's room, she happened to see the servant Mother Yu knocking on the door to enter.","Old Lady familiarly pulled Mother Yu into the room to chat.","Sheng Mumu carried the soup bowl as she left Old Lady's room.","A trace of doubt quietly arose in her heart, eyebrows faintly furrowed.","Until she entered the master bedroom, she suddenly seemed to realize something, her eyes lighting up sharply.","She frowned deeply.","That time Qi Mo came home late at night, and she had secretly watched him from the moonlight but he discovered her.","At the time, embarrassed, she had suggested going to sleep in the next room.","Qi Mo stopped her, saying \"It would raise suspicions.\"","So he had known all along!","This man had long known Old Lady had arranged for someone in the house to keep an eye on things, yet he didn't expose it.","But used his own methods to reassure Old Lady.","Suddenly, Sheng Mumu's cheeks flushed red.","Heavens.","That time...","After Qi Mo said that.","She had actually short-circuited and responded like that...","Too embarrassing.","Thinking about it now, she hated herself and wanted to change her name and flee overnight.","She had originally planned to drink some bird's nest soup, put on a face mask, and sleep beautifully.","Now she had completely lost the mood.","She kept replaying the awkward scene that day.","Completely unaware the sound of the shower had already stopped.","Until the man walked out of the bathroom in a bathrobe, she was still standing by the window, berating herself alone.","Why did she have to think so badly!","Qi Mo noticed her abnormal mood and walked over to her quietly, footsteps light.","\"What are you thinking about?\"","Sheng Mumu didn't turn her head, reflexively answering, \"Feeling down, want to pack up tonight and bury myself in a place where no one knows me.\"","After she spoke.","She heard the man's low, magnetic laughter by her ear.","She gathered her thoughts and turned her head.","Qi Mo's exquisite and sculpted features were within kissing distance, having just gotten out of the shower, his eyes still hazy with faint mist.","So handsome it seemed unreal.","A hidden gleam passed through his deep pupils.","He suddenly reached out from behind her and placed a quite heavy file folder in her hands, slowly opening his mouth,","\"Take a look at this, hopefully it improves your mood.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked at him in confusion, not knowing his intention. She looked down at the file folder in her hands,","\"What is this?\"","Qi Mo lowered his eyes, long lashes fluttering, \"Open it and see.\"","She didn't know if it was her imagination, but Sheng Mumu felt the man in front of her seemed a little nervous.","She opened the file folder in puzzlement.","She quickly browsed through the thick stack of documents.","The letterhead on the pages showed a law firm in Gang City.","Looking down.","Tens of pages, meticulously listing this man's personal assets.","Real estate, equity, foreign exchange, collectibles...","The liquid assets had clear numbers.","The illiquid assets were labelled with approximate value ranges.","The more Sheng Mumu read, the more confused she became, completely unclear on Qi Mo's intention in showing her these.","Qi Mo's scorching and certain voice, carrying the scent of the complimentary bath product they shared, slowly drifted over.","As low and magnetic as always.","But the unsteadiness could be clearly heard.","\"I've given serious thought, just telling you I like you so rashly on WeChat was too hasty.\"","\"These...are everything I've earned over the years.\"","\"All given to you.\"","\"I hope you can believe my sincerity.\""]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: He keeps stepping on the line.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu's expression froze slightly, her breathing slowed.","She felt that the scene before her was particularly unrealistic.","Qi Mo's bathrobe was loose and casual.","But his tone was unprecedentedly serious.","After he finished speaking, he kept looking at her.","The deep, layered light and shadow in his dark, rich eyes undulated.","His tall figure completely enveloped her.","At this moment, he was all she could see.","She had to admit, the deer in her heart was crying loudly and stomping violently,","Leaving her at a loss and her mind in chaos.","For a while, she didn't know what to say in response, she just looked at him fixedly.","From his brow bone to the bridge of his nose, and then to the crisp, rugged jawline.","The mature and steady man before her was clearly calculating her every step,","Like a hunter with the prey in hand, and like a successful businessman enclosing his territory.","Unexpectedly, even with this faint feeling,","Sheng Mumu didn't feel fear or pressure.","On the contrary, her curiosity about him was growing little by little.","After a while,","A strand of hair slipped down beside her ear, her eyes flashing slightly, red lips parting lightly.","\"Mr. Qi, you're really cheating like this, bribing the referee.\"","The depths of the man's dark pupils were unfathomable. He suddenly bowed down to her eye level.","His voice took on a hint of hoarseness, and he slowly quirked his brow.","\"Well, I cheated, I'll take the punishment.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"!\"","Sheng Mumu blinked blankly, looking at the shockingly handsome face before her, secretly holding her breath.","Damn, he had been pushing the line and cheating all along.","Not only with money, but also with his face.","How sly.","She took half a step back, keeping some distance between them.","She tucked back the stray strand of hair, took a light breath, and heard her heartbeat getting clearer and clearer.","That strand of hair was disobedient, having just been tucked behind her ear, it loosely fell down again.","Sensing her move to retreat, the man straightened up, looking at her unblinkingly, his shoulders sinking slightly.","With his knuckle-prominent fingers, he lightly hooked up the strand of her hair and tucked it behind her ear for her.","What fell along with his hand was the man's magnetic, deep voice.","\"I won't ask you about it, or force you to accept it. I'm patient, you can consider it slowly.\"","The man's fingertips were slightly cool, barely discernible as they brushed past her earlobe.","An electric sensation spread from her earlobe throughout her body, and her petite earlobe quietly flushed pink.","Her long lashes trembled softly as they lowered, Sheng Mumu quietly nodded her head.","The corners of her lips pursed, then she slowly spoke:","\"...The referee will seriously consider the words of this player, but now the referee wants to take a bath.\"","After she finished speaking, she escaped into the bathroom with a red face.","She didn't dare look at him again.","It was really strange.","The one being confessed to looked more nervous than the one confessing.","Leaving only the handsome and tall man, looking at her fleeing back, a smile appeared in his eyes.","*","The next morning, Sheng Mumu was awakened by the sound of Qi Mo entering the walk-in closet.","The sound was actually very soft.","But she had slept lightly last night, so the faint noise was enough to wake her up.","The man came out of the closet, lazily standing at the foot of the bed, putting on his watch.","His gaze casually glanced over, seeing that she was awake, his brow moved, and he asked softly:","\"Did I wake you?\"","Sheng Mumu heavily sunk her head into the soft pillow, her tone somewhat groggy, with cute hoarseness.","\"No, it was about time I got up anyway.\"","Today she had agreed to accompany grandma to get a physical exam.","The metallic sound of the watch band's buckle came as the handsome man put on his watch. He lowered his eyes to look at her.","\"You can still sleep for a while, I'll call you later. It's ten o'clock with Dr. Jiang, there's still plenty of time.\"","Sheng Mumu rubbed her eyes, her fair arm stretched out from under the quilt.","She made a grabbing motion in the air, stretched lazily, and cheered herself on, \"I won't sleep anymore, time to get up!\"","She didn't know her current stretch looked exactly like an adorable little cat. The man's gaze was gentle and soft, the corners of his eyes raised. \"Alright.\"","After breakfast, the driver took the three of them to Dr. Jiang's private clinic located downtown.","Dr. Jiang had been notified in advance and was already waiting outside the clinic.","As soon as she saw the old lady get out of the luxury sedan, she hurriedly went up and hugged her.","Back when she worked in Guangcheng, she had been the old lady's private nurse for many years.","The old lady was kind and easy-going, treating her like family. The two were very close.","After chatting with the old lady for a bit, she looked towards the two with outstanding temperament and appearance next to the car, and greeted:","\"Mr. Qi, Mrs. Qi.\"","Qi Mo slightly nodded his head as a response.","Sheng Mumu smiled back with crescent eyes, \"Hello there.\"","Back when the rumor of Qi Mo's affair spread among the madame circle, Sheng Mumu had heard Dr. Jiang's name mentioned.","From Wang Qin's slightly exaggerated description at the time, she imagined Dr. Jiang to be the weak and clingy type.","But meeting her today, she realized it was completely different from what she imagined.","The Dr. Jiang before her with short hair, wearing a white coat, looked professional and easy to get along with.","The moment her eyes met Sheng Mumu's, Dr. Jiang was also surprised.","This was her first time seeing the rumored Mrs. Qi.","She vaguely remembered when Mr. Qi gave her a ride once, in the car, she saw the usually taciturn and aloof man's expression instantly become gentle upon seeing a message from his wife.","At that time she was a little curious.","Just what kind of woman could make such an unapproachable, intimidating man reveal an expression like that.","She didn't have much contact with Mr. Qi.","A few times because of the old lady's sake.","In her memory, Mr. Qi was like a god-like existence in the business world.","Like an iceberg, cold and aloof.","The closer a person got to a god, the further they got from being human.","But at this moment, she clearly saw the appearance of an ordinary person full of the breath of life on Mr. Qi's face.","Her gaze moved, and Dr. Jiang looked at the woman beside Mr. Qi.","All her doubts found the answer.","Mrs. Qi had a vivid and beautiful appearance.","Lightness and liveliness emanated from those smiling eyes, shimmering with friendly smiles.","Her chestnut hair draped behind her, the ends slightly curly, setting off her fair, delicate neckline.","Faint dimples, skin as white as porcelain under the sunlight.","Beautiful in a natural way, radiant.","She saw Mr. Qi shift his arm closer towards Mrs. Qi.","Mrs. Qi naturally slipped hers through.","A breeze blew between the two.","The woman's slightly curled hair tips were blown onto the man's shirt.","At this time, only one thought crossed Dr. Jiang's mind.","A perfect match.","In her life so far, this was the first time she had seen such a well-matched, elegant couple.","And she was certain that from now on, no other couple would be as well-suited as Mr. and Mrs. Qi.","After a simple greeting, Dr. Jiang brought the old lady upstairs for the exam.","There were many test items, so it wasn't until after lunch time that they were only halfway done.","During this time, Mr. and Mrs. Qi accompanied them.","If there were situations inappropriate for a man to be present, Mrs. Qi would stay with her the whole time.","Dr. Jiang sincerely felt that the old lady had found a thoughtful, dutiful grandson's wife.","It wasn't until two in the afternoon that all the checks were finally completed.","When the exam results came out, Qi Mo happened to take a work call and went into the hallway to answer it.","Sheng Mumu accompanied the old lady into the room, Dr. Jiang pushed the report in front of them.","\"Old lady, Mrs. Qi, after thorough examination, the old lady is in excellent health.\""]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: The Changing Status of the Family","paragraphs":["“The old lady is in extremely good health—”","As soon as she finished speaking, Sheng Mumu's eyebrows moved imperceptibly.","Under the table, her hands secretly clenched her clothes.","Sure enough.","Just as described in the novel, the old lady was suddenly diagnosed with a tumor that rapidly deteriorated.","Prior to this, there were no signs that she might be ill.","Sheng Mumu's thoughts were slightly chaotic.","Knowing how things would unfold in advance gave her a sense of powerlessness, and her palms tingled slightly.","She leaned forward a little, holding on to the table corner. \"Dr. Jiang, are there any other tests that weren't done this time?\"","Dr. Jiang paused briefly, carefully reviewed everything, and replied with a serious expression:","\"Hmm, this time the old lady's tests covered many aspects—lung CT, head CT, 15-item liver function test, 7-item blood lipid test, thyroid...\"","When he said the words \"tumor screening,\" Sheng Mumu's eyes suddenly narrowed sharply. She asked:","\"Is it possible that there are areas that can't be detected with current domestic medical capabilities?\"","Dr. Jiang was taken aback for a moment, then raised a professional smile. \"That can happen. Usually—\"","Dr. Jiang's reply was very professional, informing Sheng Mumu of the limitations of physical examinations, which could only understand the current physical condition to a certain degree, and could not completely uncover the onset of illness.","From Sheng Mumu's concerned expression, Dr. Jiang sensed her worry, and added:","\"I have a senior classmate who has been researching tumor prevention abroad. He happens to be coming back next month. If you feel it's necessary, Madam Qi, I can set up an appointment with him. When he returns, he can examine the old lady again in more detail from the perspective of tumor prevention.\"","When Sheng Mumu heard this, the worry between her brows finally dissipated somewhat.","\"Thank you, Dr. Jiang. That would be best.\"","Dr. Jiang smiled and nodded. \"You're welcome, Madam Qi. I'll arrange it right away.\"","The old lady saw how concerned her daughter-in-law was about her health, and felt warm inside.","But she didn't want to trouble the young people further, and tugged at Sheng Mumu's clothes, saying:","\"Mumu, Dr. Jiang said I'm fine, so I must be fine. There's no need to bring me for another checkup.\"","Sheng Mumu had a faint smile on her face, coaxing her like a child:","\"Granny, look, Dr. Jiang just said physical exams can't fully understand your health. We have to listen to the doctor and get you checked more times.\"","Sheng Mumu's voice was gentle, but her attitude brooked no refusal. Seeing she couldn't persuade her, the old lady had no choice but to agree.","As they left Dr. Jiang's office, Qi Mo had just finished a call and walked over.","His voice was gentle and low: \"What did the report say?\"","Sheng Mumu concealed her worries in her heart, smiling brightly as she replied:","\"Granny is very healthy.\"","The man's brows and eyes relaxed, the corners of his mouth curving up slightly. \"That's good.\"","Sheng Mumu paused, then added frankly:","\"I'll bring Granny for another checkup later. More frequent checkups will put my mind at ease.\"","Qi Mo's eyes narrowed almost imperceptibly, but he didn't think much of it, simply saying \"Alright.\"","By the time the three of them returned to Xiyue Manor, it was close to 4pm.","As soon as they stepped through the front door, they saw Butler Zhang carrying a large cardboard box from the yard into the house.","Seeing them return, Butler Zhang beamed and shook the cardboard box.","\"Granny, Sir, Madam, a package from Madam has arrived.\"","Feng Yaoqin was sharing her travel experiences in real time on social media.","Two days ago she was posing for scenic photos in a red dress at Chaka Salt Lake, and yesterday she had already arrived in Lanzhou.","After trying the local beef noodles, she was astounded.","She bought over a dozen vacuum-packed bags of beef noodles to send back.","That night, the family sat together eating beef noodles.","The aromatic chili oil was drizzled over them, then poured into the noodle soup.","With a sizzling \"chi\" sound, the aroma overflowed.","Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai ate the beef noodles slowly and carefully.","Napkins were on their laps, and tall glasses of iced water beside their hands.","They ate the authentic local noodles as if they were in a 3-star Michelin restaurant.","\"Elegant, truly elegant,\" Sheng Mumu couldn't help sarcastically commenting. As she finished speaking, the two Qi men looked over at the same time.","Sheng Mumu said, \"Elegant, but unnecessary. Look at me, this is how noodles should be eaten to bring out the flavor.\"","With that, she picked up her bowl, mixed some noodles with the rich soup stock, and slurped it up.","The old lady laughed heartily, pointing at her grandson and great-grandson:","\"Right, the way Mumu eats noodles is correct. You two need to learn from her.\"","Qi Mo: \"...\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","Amid the happy atmosphere, Sheng Mumu's phone rang.","It was a video call from Feng Yaoqin.","As soon as the screen appeared, she saw her daughter-in-law and the old lady eating the beef noodles she had sent back. Her smile could not have been more radiant.","\"You're all eating it! Does it taste good?\"","Sheng Mumu showed her the empty soup bowl to the camera lens, giving an enthusiastic thumbs up:","\"Mom, it's amazing. I finished all the soup.\"","Feng Yaoqin grinned from ear to ear, saying she would send back more local specialties from the next stop.","Qi Shaobai ate with his head down, imperceptibly glancing around at everyone's faces.","He was surprised to realize that in this family, people's positions seemed to have changed unknowingly.","Take right now for instance.","Even though Dad and Granny were there, Granny had chosen to video call her young stepmother.","She chatted with her the whole time without even mentioning Dad once.","It was obvious who she felt closer to.","Ten minutes passed.","Just as Feng Yaoqin was about to hang up, Qi Shaobai finally heard his father's name mentioned in the call.","\"Oh right, I almost forgot the main thing. Qi Mo, do you still remember Uncle Fang who used to live next door to us?\"","Sheng Mumu tilted the phone camera slightly to include Qi Mo in the frame.","Qi Mo knitted his brows, pondering the name his mother mentioned.","After a long time, his elegant eyebrows quirked up slightly. \"That's Uncle Fang in 303 who worked at the newspaper, right?\"","Before his business success, he had lived with his parents Qi in an old, shabby apartment complex inside the 3rd Ring Road.","Over a decade ago when the complex was demolished, many childhood names he often heard had not been mentioned again for a long time.","Feng Yaoqin's voice came from the phone:","\"That's right, that's 303 Uncle Fang who worked at the newspaper. He used to be your dad's colleague. After the apartment demolition he moved his whole family to Yun City.\"","\"Today I got a call from Uncle Fang. He said his daughter got married and moved to Beijing. They're hosting a wedding banquet this weekend and invited me to attend.\"","\"Since I'm traveling out of town, I can't make it back. Go and represent me on Friday afternoon, okay?\""]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: What are you Thinking, Distracted","paragraphs":["Receiving the wedding invitation sent by Old Fang for his daughter, Feng Yaoqin felt quite surprised.","Since the old neighborhood was demolished, Feng Yaoqin has had little contact with the old neighbors.","The year when the old school district was demolished, smartphones were not yet prevalent.","When the old neighborhood was torn down, most of the connections between the old neighbors were also broken.","If it weren't for the year when her husband passed away, when Old Fang sent condolence money through someone, Feng Yaoqin would have almost forgotten this name.","In addition to feeling surprised, Feng Yaoqin thought it was necessary to go.","First, to return the favor.","Second, as fellow parents, Feng Yaoqin clearly understood Old Fang's intention in specially sending her an invitation.","On the phone, Feng Yaoqin learned that Old Fang had a stroke a few years ago and had difficulty walking.","For his daughter's wedding in Yun City, he could barely attend in a wheelchair, but for the banquet in Jing City, he really could not make it.","The reason for inviting all the old neighbors from long ago was nothing more than to let the groom's family know that although his precious daughter married far away, she still had some connections in Jing City.","He hoped the groom's side would not neglect his darling daughter.","That night before going to bed, Sheng Mumu was applying essence to her face, and Qi Mo came out of the bathroom with a towel draped around his neck, casually rubbing his hair.","From the reflection in the mirror, Sheng Mumu casually asked him,","\"Are we going separately or together this Friday?\"","She recalled that at the previous banquet they attended, they had met at the venue.","Qi Mo's hand rubbing his hair paused, his gaze shifted over, \"Of course we'll go together.\"","Sheng Mumu uttered an \"oh\", and continued applying eye cream.","The man behind her walked over and sat down on the stool at the foot of the bed.","His long legs were casually bent, his posture lazy.","Continuing to rub his hair, Qi Mo's low voice carried a faint smile,","\"Fang Uncle is a warm-hearted person. I still remember when I was first brought to the Qi family, not familiar with the other children in the yard, he took me downstairs to the convenience store to buy a case of soda for all the kids in the yard, saying it was my treat. \"","After he finished speaking, a low chuckle escaped from Qi Mo's chest.","The sudden memory made his pitch-black eyes shine softly.","That time felt so far away, as if it was in his past life.","Sheng Mumu looked at his reflection in the mirror.","The distance between them was not far nor near.","Talking about his childhood at this moment.","It made her inexplicably feel a sense of intimacy.","Sheng Mumu curved her eyes, \"Fang Uncle is really nice.\"","Qi Mo's gaze was fixed, his tone became more serious and solemn, losing the faint smile from earlier:","\"No childhood engagement, just a neighbor girl, don't worry.\"","Sheng Mumu looked away, \"Oh.\"","After a few beats she reacted to the strangeness in his tone with that \"don't worry\".","Matched with the meaningful, laughing look in his eyes.","The more Sheng Mumu thought about it, the more inappropriate she felt. She pursed her lips and added, \"I'm not worried.\"","Her voice was neither loud nor soft, and her eyebrows quirked slightly.","She was clearly trying to appear casual, but to Qi Mo, it took on a completely different meaning.","He sat up straight from his reclined position, leaning forward, abruptly closing the distance between them.","The pleasant scent of his shower gel suddenly filled Sheng Mumu's nostrils, and she stiffened, tilting her head slightly.","Their heads were only two fist widths apart. She felt the surrounding air become sweet and ambiguous.","Her heart thumped heavily.","As if to conceal her inner turmoil, she randomly grabbed a small jar from the table and casually twisted it open.","Qi Mo's gaze fell on the jar she had just opened, and his handsome brow quirked slightly.","His magnetic, bewitching voice was tinged with faint confusion as he suddenly spoke,","\"Didn't you just apply that one?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Looking down, she froze.","She did already apply eye cream...","She had grabbed the wrong one.","But he was facing away from her, how did he know about this?","\"You already forgot what you applied,\" Qi Mo's magnetic voice sounded again, slowly and gently enveloping her, seemingly in surround sound, \"What were you thinking about, too distracted?\"","Sheng Mumu's breath hitched, her ears instantly turning red.","Taking a light breath, she casually said as if nothing had happened, \"Thinking about what to wear Friday to match the occasion.\"","\"Oh?\" Qi Mo lazily propped himself up, increasing the distance between them, the laughter in his eyes completely undisguised, \"Is that so?\"","Sheng Mumu nodded firmly, \"Yes, what else could it be?\"","The smile in Qi Mo's eyes grew thicker. He saw through everything but didn't expose it.","Unhurriedly getting up, looking at the fluffy wisps of hair behind her ear, he said,","\"Then when you figure out what to wear, also help me think about what I should wear that day.\"","Sheng Mumu was startled, turning her head back to look up at him.","Her gaze collided head-on with his.","At this moment, the mature, sly old fox had a matter-of-fact expression on his face.","Sheng Mumu blinked at him, her eyes saying: Huh?","The man's brow quirked slightly. He gazed at her, not feeling his request was unreasonable at all.","Sheng Mumu slowly typed out a string of question marks in her mind.","???","What's with this guy?","How does he seem to be...","Becoming more and more presumptuous?","She hadn't even accepted his confession yet.","Yet here he was, demanding more intimacy, even asking her to help pick out his clothes!","In Sheng Mumu's eyes, choosing outfits for a man to wear out was only something those in an extremely intimate relationship would do.","Last time, seeing him clumsily packing, she kindly helped organize his luggage.","And now he directly makes this request?","Upholding the notion \"can't spoil men\", Sheng Mumu glared at him, her red lips parted, launching a barrage of attacks:","\"Pick it yourself!\"","\"Weren't you selecting your own outfits everyday just fine before this?\"","\"What, going to your neighbor girl's wedding has you so confused you can't even coordinate an outfit anymore?\"","Qi Mo: \"......\""]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Sheng Mu Mu: \"You like this, will make me think...\"","paragraphs":["\"What, going to the neighbor's sister's wedding, feeling too flustered that you can't even pick out an outfit?\"","She had just blurted that out when Sheng Mumu realized something was off about the atmosphere.","However she listened, it sounded like...jealousy?","The steady, composed man before her visibly tensed his shoulders.","Then, let out an almost imperceptible low chuckle.","His broad shoulders and chest lightly trembled with the laughter.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips, propping herself against the table corner as she stood up.","She was going to end this topic.","Go to the bathroom to take a shower.","But as soon as she turned around and took a few steps, her wrist was suddenly caught by a faint strength.","The man's broad palm encircled her wrist, forcing her to stop.","Warm sensations slowly crept up from her wrist.","\"Mumu...\" Qi Mo bent his lips, a trace of smugness in his expression, but his tone weakened as he looked into her eyes and slowly spoke.","\"I've thought about it, and I was indeed wrong about this.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked, lightly arching her brows, \"Where were you wrong?\"","As soon as she spoke, she regretted it again.","This tone was just like those online skits between couples that she had seen before.","- When a man says \"I'm wrong\" to his girlfriend, she will likely ask \"Wrong where?\" and \"Will you dare do it again?\"","Sigh~","The inexplicably brought up topic tonight seemed to be going in an increasingly bizarre direction.","She wanted to take it back but it was too late.","Qi Mo's pitch black pupils reflected fragmented warm lamplight, with still damp bangs hanging over his forehead after his shower, looking very different from his usual aloof and unapproachable image.","He seemed especially...gentle.","His eyelashes lowered as he looked straight at her, his tone gentle.","\"I've reflected that I should have told you earlier about all women around me, even a neighbor from over a decade ago.\"","He didn't have experience with charming women.","He had never pursued anyone before.","Or rather, he had never been attracted to any woman before.","Previously, he had never even considered that he should report all his female friends and acquaintances to her honestly.","Fortunately.","It wasn't too late to confess now.","Sheng Mumu felt the warm palm around her wrist tighten slightly.","Then, the man's steady, low voice sounded.","\"You've met Qiao Li, she's my cousin--\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned, blankly looking at him.","\"--At the company, I interact more with three female executives for work.\"","\"...\"","\"--But only limited to work.\"","\"...\"","\"In the old neighborhood, there were two neighbor's sisters, one was Fang Uncle's daughter, and another was from the alley...\"","\"...\" Sheng Mumu's gaze gradually tightened as he spoke.","\"--Since moving to Xiyu Yue Ting, there are no more familiar neighbors.\"","\"...\"","As their gazes met, she felt her heartbeat getting faster and faster.","The man's low and steady voice was gradually completely drowned out by the clear sound of her heartbeat.","The sounds around her ears became blurred.","Her heart pounded like thunder.","Compared to when Qi Mo had given her a complete list of his assets,","His current earnest appearance made her unable to look away.","The bedroom lighting was soft.","With his back to the light, Qi Mo's silhouette was indistinct, but still rugged, his fair skin seeming to be covered by a layer of soft light.","Handsome, beguiling.","Perhaps because his expression and tone were so sincere, Sheng Mumu somehow felt a stir of guilt well up.","In all honesty.","She really hadn't expected that the authoritative Qi Mo Group CEO would seriously reflect just because of her casual remark.","To be fair.","Was she curious about Qi Mo's romantic history?","Yes, she was curious.","But now that they were only contract spouses, she wasn't ready to start a real relationship yet. She could still restrain that slight curiosity.","Yet unexpectedly, with her unintentional words, that tiny hidden thought had slipped out.","Even she herself hadn't noticed.","After a while, Sheng Mumu breathed lightly and finally spoke his name.","\"Qi Mo...\"","The man who had been speaking stopped and looked at her.","It was quiet for a moment.","Sheng Mumu's eyes were misty, she paused briefly, then said, \"You being like this--\"","\"--Will make me want more and more.\"","Qi Mo was stunned, clearly not expecting her to say this.","Or perhaps he didn't fully understand the meaning behind her words, a hint of indiscernible emotion flashing through his deep eyes.","Sheng Mumu slowly retracted her hand, her gaze meeting his as she slowly curled her fingertips and spoke.","Her tone was extremely patient.","As if introducing her true self to him, and also pushing him away.","\"I know I've always been an insatiable person, just like with making money - even though I'm now financially secure, I'll still think about doing better and better, and then...\"","She stopped, gazing into his attractive eyes.","Qi Mo's eyes were deep and unfathomable, his voice a little hoarse. \"Then what?\"","Sheng Mumu steeled herself and finished the second half of her sentence:","\"I guess this is just my nature.\"","\"If I readily accept even a little bit of your kindness to me, I'll become greedy and want more and more.\"","\"...More and more.\"","So you see.","I'm hard to move, and very greedy.","Do you still want to like someone like me?","As her words fell, the sounds around them seemed to still.","One second passed.","Two seconds.","Three seconds.","The gaze fixed on her grew more and more scorching.","It was the only thing with substance in this tranquil world.","His pleasant scent drifted over strand by strand.","Burning the air around her until scalding hot.","He took a step forward.","His tall figure obscuring her slender shadow.","The next second.","The scent of the man's shower gel enveloped her overwhelmingly.","He stretched out his arms, leaning down.","Sheng Mumu's body stiffened as she was trapped in a warm, powerful embrace.","Qi Mo's breathing became shallow as he lightly rested his chin on top of her head.","It was a restrained, gentle hug.","As if she were a treasured item that he cherished but didn't dare touch, extremely careful.","The boundary between contract spouses was on the verge of being broken through but not quite.","Sheng Mumu's cheek collided with his chest, hearing the muffled thumping within.","Her heart was also racing wildly, her nose full of his clean, crisp scent.","It made her dizzy and overwhelmed.","Amidst the booming heartbeat, Qi Mo's low voice, wrapped in lingering warmth, sounded above her head.","\"You can try being more greedy.\"","\"I can afford it.\"","*","Sheng Mumu couldn't remember how she had escaped from that warm yet suffocating embrace.","Not until she fled into the bathroom and shut the door.","Her cheeks remained burning hot for a long time.","Just thinking about Qi Mo's hug from earlier.","Made her feel like a faint electric current was coursing through her body, leaving her short of breath.","She soaked in the bathtub again.","She had already showered and done her skincare earlier, but now her palms and back were covered in fine beads of sweat, forcing her to wash again.","She submerged her head in the water.","Blocking out all ambient sounds.","Abruptly, that sentence echoed in her ears again.","--\"You can try being more greedy.\"","--\"I can afford it.\"","Along with the splashing water sounds, she lifted her impossibly red face.","Rubbing her cheeks vigorously.","No matter how hard she rubbed.","That voice lingered.","Her phone suddenly vibrated.","She picked up her phone from the ledge beside the bathtub.","Clicked open.","Qi Mo: \"Seeing how honest I'm being, will you consider helping me pick out clothes?\""]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Thank you, my lady.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu wiped the water from her face and bit her lip as she sent her reply.","\"I didn't expect you to not only be handsome...\"","In the bedroom just one wall over, Qi Mo was leaning against the bed holding his phone. His hair, naturally stiff, had completely dried and the previously soft, drooping locks had silently stood back up.","The delight and confusion in his eyes flashed by together.","Before he could ponder the meaning, his phone buzzed with a new message.","Sheng Mumu: \"But you think too highly of yourself.\"","Qi Mo's eyes curled up slightly at the corners, casting a glance towards the bathroom door.","He felt like every word in her message was like a reading comprehension question.","Hard to understand.","What did it mean?","Had she agreed or not?","But this feeling of not being able to see through her while still desperately wanting to get close to her and understand her was addictive.","Just as he was about to reply, his phone lit up.","Sheng Mumu: \"But, since you've been so upfront, albeit clumsy, I'll just go ahead and help you out with this favor.\"","Followed quickly by an explanation tinged with some pretense: \"Since this young lady has good taste after all.\"","The darkness in the man's eyes was completely saturated with laughter as his slender, well-proportioned fingers pressed the voice message button.","Inside the bathroom.","Sheng Mumu was leaning over the edge of the bathtub.","Her fingertips dipped in the water, drawing circles on the tiles one by one.","Her hair was messily bundled into a ball, with a few strands falling loose and sticking to her petite face.","One strand was stuck to her red lips, adding a touch of allure to her already exquisite features.","She blinked her long lashes, her gaze shifting back and forth between her phone screen and her fingertips a few times.","As if waiting for his reply on the other end of the line.","Her screen buzzed with a green voice message bar.","She blinked.","It was her first time receiving a voice message from him.","What was there that he couldn't express clearly through text?","Her finger hovered over the screen and she tapped it lightly.","The man's magnetic, low voice, tinged with laughter, came through.","\"Thank you, my young miss.\"","Her hand slipped on the edge of the bathtub and her whole body sank into the water a bit.","She nearly choked on a mouthful of water.","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","She pursed her lips and climbed out of the huge square bathtub, leaning over the edge once more.","Her petite chin rested on the back of her hand.","Her earlobes flushed red as she opened the voice message again.","\"Thank you, my young miss.\"","This time she was certain she hadn't misheard.","Her ears burned hot.","Qi Mo's message was clearly in response to her referring to herself as \"this young lady\" earlier.","That old fox.","He's so good at seizing opportunities.","She bit her lip and stared at her phone, her brows furrowed.","The screen darkened but her gaze didn't move.","She wondered silently.","Did Qi Mo really not have any relationship experience?","Why didn't she believe that!","After thinking it over, Sheng Mumu felt she couldn't keep speculating like this.","She was the one holding the initiative here, she should maintain her composure.","When she emerged from the bathroom, Sheng Mumu had regained her usual calm.","She crooked a finger at the man lounging on the bed watching her.","Her tone was decisive, like she was giving an order:","\"Come here.\"","Qi Mo's eyes flashed, an intrigued arch appeared at his elegant brow, and his eyes held a trace of confusion.","But Sheng Mumu had already turned and headed for the walk-in closet by herself.","The intrigue in his eyes grew as he got up and followed her into the closet.","Sheng Mumu had already decided what to wear to the wedding banquet while soaking in the bath earlier.","Now she just needed to pick out clothes for Qi Mo based on the color of her own outfit.","Though it was called picking, there really wasn't much variety to choose from.","His clothes were mainly dark-colored.","Nearly half the closet was black.","All kinds of black.","Ivory black, jet black, charcoal black, carbon black, gleaming black...","The other half were also low-key colors like deep brown and navy, barely different from black.","Sheng Mumu couldn't help but complain, \"I feel like you should be called Qi Mo, mo as in ink. Ink black.\"","The man chuckled lowly, gazing at her with a pampering look, not arguing.","Sheng Mumu flipped through the monotonous closet, then turned to look at the man beside her whose lips were quirked up at the corners.","A mischievous idea suddenly popped into her head.","She tapped her chin with one finger, frowning and murmuring:","\"I feel like none of these are really suitable. People getting married should wear something more festive.\"","Qi Mo looked at her silently.","He had a bad feeling about this.","It suddenly reminded him of that bright red ski suit.","Soon, his premonition came true.","\"Anyway, there's still a few days until the banquet.\" Sheng Mumu blinked innocently. \"Why don't we get a custom-made suit made? I think bright yellow or smokey purple would be really unique.\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","Sheng Mumu tilted her head to the side, smiling brightly, and pushed her luck further: \"Or what do you think about fluorescent green?\"","Qi Mo took a deep breath, feeling his temple throbbing.","He folded his arms across his chest and looked at her, arching a brow, speaking lowly:","\"If you don't mind me standing next to you looking so garish and drawing attention, then I don't care. You wear it, I'll wear it.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Now it was Sheng Mumu's turn to be stunned.","She couldn't even scare him with fluorescent green.","No fun.","Old men were no fun.","It was like he was certain she wouldn't dare to be so bold.","Sheng Mumu narrowed her eyes at him for three seconds, then glared at him.","Then she obediently started looking through suits and shirts again.","When she turned her head, she heard the man beside her ask, whether intentionally or unintentionally:","\"Not going with fluorescent green? I think you'd look great in that color too. If you need, I can have Assistant Dong contact a designer right now.\"","Sheng Mumu turned back again, took a deep breath, \"......Let's not disturb Assistant Dong's rest this late, let's just pick something from the closet.\"","Qi Mo's eyelids lowered slightly, his expression natural. \"Alright, it's up to you.\"","In the following fifteen minutes, Sheng Mumu held up the candidate outfits in front of him.","He would very cooperatively lift his chin and stand up straight, allowing her to check the effect.","After fifteen minutes...","\"Done, this is it.\"","Sheng Mumu held a set of low-key, exquisitely tailored charcoal gray suit, paired inside with a black dress shirt with subtle patterns.","Low-key, reserved.","Suitable for attending a wedding banquet without standing out too much.","Although...with his looks, not stealing others' thunder would be difficult.","But she could only start with the little details, toning down his innate charm a bit.","She hung his clothes on the outside hanger, next to her clothes.","There was a strip of soft lights on the closet ceiling.","Faint beams shone down from above, falling on the man and woman's two outfits.","The man's gaze slowly shifted over, a pleased arc appearing at his sharp jawline.","The tie's color matched the handbag's color.","The woman's blouse's dark accents matched the man's shirt's subtle patterns.","No matter how you looked at it, they were a pair."]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: Attend the Wedding Reception","paragraphs":["On their wedding day, Xiao Wang drove the couple to the venue.","The wedding banquet was near the Third Ring Road, right by the old residential area where the Qi family used to live.","Xiao Wang drove straight into the underground parking garage.","Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu got out of the car and walked side by side towards the elevator hall.","When they first got on the elevator, they were the only two people on it. But when the elevator display jumped from -2 to G, the doors opened and four more people got on - two women in their fifties and a younger couple.","The younger woman had her arm hooked through the man's. Chin tilted up, she stood by the elevator buttons and glanced around with her eyes. When she saw Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu, she seemed surprised by their exceptional looks and aura.","Her eyes brightened a little.","Then she looked them up and down in a not so friendly manner. Seeing no familiar designer labels on them, she shook her head silently and smiled smugly before slowly averting her gaze.","The young woman felt Qi Mo looked somewhat familiar but couldn't remember where she had seen him.","And for some reason she felt smug when she saw their clothes weren't as lavish as hers.","Hmm, people have to own some designer clothes and accessories once they reach a certain age.","Otherwise, no matter how good-looking they are, it's useless, she thought to herself.","She was secretly glad she had chosen the bag with the most obvious logo when leaving her home earlier.","Attending a wedding was a miniature arena for competing over fame and gain.","It was a chance to show her distant relatives and friends she rarely saw that she was doing very well.","That was the main purpose of attending wedding banquets.","Birds of a feather flock together.","The fat man next to her had a big paunch. As if worried people wouldn't notice the obvious \"H\" logo on his belt, he kept his hands on his waist from the moment he entered the elevator, pushing his suit jacket open to one side and sticking his belly out.","He just happened to stand in front of Sheng Mumu.","With the four additional people, the already not so spacious elevator became even more cramped.","The fat man in front seemed to have restless leg syndrome. He kept shaking his leg even while standing.","Sheng Mumu frowned unconsciously and took a small step back to distance herself from the fat man.","Her back touched Qi Mo's arm. She looked up at him.","It was just an unconscious glance, but it made her pause.","Qi Mo's expression was frighteningly cold. His already hard jaw tightened even more, his lips pressed in a straight line, and his displeased eyes flicked over the fat man.","Then, Sheng Mumu felt an arm encircle her waist and pull her into his embrace.","Qi Mo reduced the space he occupied, giving her more room to move around.","Sheng Mumu blinked and, without thinking too much, happily leaned towards him.","Only when she turned her head back and lowered her eyes did she smile to herself belatedly.","Thinking of Qi Mo's impatient look, she found it amusing.","Executives like him usually had private elevators in the places they went to.","Having to share an elevator with strangers like this must be suffocating for him.","The banquet hall was on the eighth floor. The elevator rose slowly.","The other two middle-aged women didn't care that this was a public space. They kept chatting the whole time.","Sheng Mumu was forced to listen to their conversation.","\"I heard the bride is from Yuncheng.\"","\"Oh? She's not from around here?\"","\"She must be an outsider. I also heard that the bride's side is only bringing three tables of relatives and friends to the wedding in Jing City.\"","The speaker tutted and shook her head, lowering her voice slightly but still loud enough for everyone in the elevator to hear.","\"Bringing so few people, it seems the bride's family doesn't think much of marrying their daughter off.\"","The other woman responded dramatically. \"This marriage clearly favors the groom. I heard Liu Hui just got hired by a major company this year, and his monthly salary is 20,000 after tax.\"","\"Wow, that much?\"","\"You bet.\"","The elevator dinged open. The two women in front continued their idle chatter as they walked out.","Sheng Mumu didn't pay much attention to the overheard conversation.","Not until she stood in front of the sign for the \"Marriott Hall\" did she freeze in surprise. On the sign were the words \"Congratulations to the Wedding of Liu Hui and Fang Ting.\"","She didn't expect the gossipers in the elevator to be talking about the family her Uncle Fang's daughter was marrying into.","Sheng Mumu's brows furrowed slightly. Recalling those women disparaging Uncle Fang's daughter, she tugged Qi Mo's sleeve and grumbled softly,","\"The groom's family has no class.\"","Qi Mo's expression was inscrutable. He responded with an \"Mmm,\" and led her into the banquet hall.","A host came to greet them. After checking their invitation, they were brought to the seats for the bride's family.","There was still an hour until the official start of the wedding. The banquet hall was filled with chatter.","Their tablemates were the bride's colleagues. They were talking amongst themselves in groups of two or three. When Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo sat down, they smiled politely in greeting before continuing their conversations.","Sheng Mumu scanned her surroundings. Her gaze landed on the table beside them and she paused.","What a coincidence.","Sitting at the next table were the four people they had run into in the elevator.","Perhaps because they were now in a crowded venue, the two women were more restrained.","Their shameless prying had turned into hushed whispers.","Though she couldn't hear what they were saying, Sheng Mumu could tell from their expressions it was nothing nice.","She lazily retracted her gaze.","Out of sight, out of mind.","Just then, the bride and groom emerged from the dressing room, walking slowly towards the hall.","The bride wore a white satin wedding dress and held the groom's arm, smiling and greeting the guests who had gathered around them.","The atmosphere was joyful and warm.","The lovely scene swept away Sheng Mumu's bad mood.","Resting her cheek in her hand, a faint smile appeared on her elegant made-up face as she gazed towards the bride and groom.","She had attended many weddings before. Scenes like this always moved her.","Whether it was the bride's father giving his daughter's hand to the groom, or the bride and groom exchanging rings and vows.","Moments like these never failed to make this girl, who placed particular emphasis on ceremony, feel her nose sour with the urge to shed tears.","Following her line of sight, Qi Mo's sharp eyes softened a touch. The corner of his lips tilted up slightly. He leaned towards Sheng Mumu and asked in a low, deep voice,","\"Why are you smiling at someone else's wedding?\"","Sheng Mumu looked at him. \"You wouldn't understand,\" she said, drawing out her words.","From her observations, Qi Mo was a man of habit.","It was as if he was adhering to some invisible code of conduct.","He went to the office on time, had virtually no hobbies, ate only until seventy percent full, and worked out three times a week.","His self-discipline was unreal.","While she knew self-discipline was a good habit and a trait common among most successful people, Sheng Mumu still felt it shouldn't be that way.","She believed life should have a sense of ceremony.","One should embrace sudden little changes and indulge impulsive whims.","Watching the snow in winter, the ocean in summer.","Appreciating spring scenery and autumn leaves.","Making each day different even if the routine is the same.","So she felt Qi Mo couldn't understand why she was feeling emotional.","Just thinking that she could witness what was likely the most important moment in a couple's lives, even if she didn't know them well, made her a little excited.","She was contradictory like that.","Most of the time hardhearted, yet prone to amplifying emotions at things that left most people indifferent."]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Qi Shaobai: \"I took the liberty\"","paragraphs":["The bride and groom were standing beside the dessert table as instructed by the wedding photographer, posing for typical wedding photos.","Sheng Mumu withdrew her gaze, waiting for the wedding to start with utter boredom.","Her phone that was placed on the table lit up and vibrated continuously.","Qi Shaobai: \"School ended early today for the anniversary celebration. When I came back I realized none of you were home?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Oh...I forgot you guys were going to a wedding banquet.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Huh, how come no one asked if I was going or not?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Forget it, why would I expect to be asked.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"You're acting like you have a terminal illness.jpg\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Nevermind about bringing me back food.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Sheng Mumu turned to look at Qi Mo, an expression of confusion on her face. She asked:","\"Is Qi Shaobai really almost eighteen?","The corners of Qi Mo's eyes lifted slightly. \"Yeah, why?\"","\"I suspect he's eight years old,\" Sheng Mumu passed her phone to Qi Mo. \"Look, are these words an eighteen year old would say? Eighteen year olds aren't kids anymore right?\"","Qi Mo lowered his gaze to look at the screen. His sharp brows softened as he slowly raised his eyes to look at her, a smile appearing in his eyes.","\"He doesn't act this way towards other people.\"","It's because he feels close and familiar, that's why he's being cheeky.","\"I see—\" Sheng Mumu tilted her neck back and shrugged generously.","\"—He's taking advantage of our familiarity. I understand, I learned it from you.\"","Lately whenever Qi Mo makes requests of her, he acts like it's a given.","The younger one has probably been influenced subconsciously.","Although the two Qi men aren't blood related father and son.","But they're somewhat similar.","She didn't expect the similarity to manifest in this kind of bad habit.","Looking into his eyes, Sheng Mumu let out a soft sigh.","Qi Mo's smile froze slightly: \"......\"","Suddenly, his long slender fingers moved up.","Naturally taking the phone from her hand.","Sheng Mumu: \"???\"","Before she could react...","She saw the intimidating man beside her already pressing the voice message button in her WeChat conversation with Qi Shaobai.","\"What are you going to do if I don't bring you food.\"","His tone was indifferent, but a hint of threat could be detected.","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","This...","At the same time.","In the Xiyu Yue Courtyard Villa.","Qi Shaobai practically shot up from the sofa.","Blurting out \" holy sh*t\".","A sudden chill went down his back.","His fingers frantically typed on the screen.","After Qi Mo sent that voice message.","He calmly looked at the phone.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips, a worried expression on her face: \"Is it appropriate to scare a child like this?\"","Qi Mo spoke calmly, \"You said he's not a child anymore.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Qi Mo's voice was composed. \"I'm just teaching him not to take advantage of our familiarity in the future.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Very quickly, a reply came from Qi Shaobai on the phone.","Just from the words, one could imagine how cowardly he was acting right now.","Qi Shaobai: \"Dad, I was out of line, shouldn't have spoken carelessly.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"You guys have fun, don't mind me.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"I can take care of myself, won't starve to death.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Smiley face.jpg\"","Sheng Mumu: ......","Awesome.","Her earlier conclusion was too hasty.","It wasn't both Qi men who picked up this presumptuous bad habit.","Just the older one.","Looking at it this way, little Qi is still very well-behaved!","Qi Mo passed her phone back to her, leaning in closer.","The distance between them shrank.","Qi Mo's deep voice was casual: \"If Qi Shaobai dares to order you around again in the future, just tell me.\" Seeing that handsome face up close, Sheng Mumu blinked her eyes, muttering an \"umm\" softly.","Just as she was about to say something more, a shriek came from the direction of the dessert table, not far from their table.","Sheng Mumu craned her neck to look towards the sound.","The bride Fang Ting had a large cake stain on her wedding dress amidst the crowd.","The colorful frosting dirtied her originally pure white gown.","Next to her was a five or six year old boy, holding a plate in his hand. He appeared to be the culprit behind the dirtied dress. Not only was there no hint of remorse on his face, he was even shoving the legs of the woman who looked like his nanny, yelling and making a fuss nonstop.","\"I want to eat cake, I want to eat cake!\"","The shrieks were piercing. The nanny seemed accustomed to it, unable to control him. She only tugged him to the side.","This tug made the unruly child even more out of control.","He rushed in front of the bride, pointing a finger. \"You compensate me for my cake!\"","Two people walked over after making their way through the crowd.","Sheng Mumu recognized them as the couple she had bumped into at the elevator.","The woman knitted her brows, pulling the unruly child to the side. She impatiently took out some napkins from her designer handbag to wipe the remaining frosting off the child's hands.","\"You're so messy when you eat, really.\"","Afterwards, she turned to look at the child's nanny.","Harshly reprimanding: \"I told you to take him outside, how could you let him come over here?\"","The nanny wrung her hands in front of her, an awkward expression on her face. \"Ma'am, I...I couldn't hold him back.\"","The fat man behind walked forward, finally lowering his hands that had been akimbo. He patted the child's head:","\"If you want cake, daddy will buy it for you when we get home. The cakes here aren't any good.\"","After speaking, he casually nodded towards the bride whose dress was dirtied.","\"Sorry about that, kids don't understand things. Don't take it to heart.\"","From amidst the crowd, Sheng Mumu saw the bride's eyes reddening, extremely aggrieved, seemingly on the verge of tears.","The bride looked at her groom, then looked at her own dirtied wedding dress, not saying anything.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips, silently clenching her fist.","That family was too outrageous!","Dirtying someone's wedding dress and not even sincerely apologizing.","Just lightly saying \"kids don't understand\" and that's it?","She saw the groom patting the bride's shoulder, whispering something in her ear.","Sheng Mumu saw the bride's body stiffen as she bit her lip and turned away, silently entering the dressing room.","The moment she pushed open the door to the dressing room, she dabbed at the corners of her eyes.","She probably cried.","Afterwards, the groom walked to the fat man. After exchanging a few words, the fat man led his wife and son away, back to their seats.","As they passed Sheng Mumu, she heard the fat man saying to the woman beside him:","\"I knew Liu Hui wouldn't dare offend me. His job was obtained through connections I helped him make, the interview opportunity was hard-earned. If he wants to get promoted in the future, he still needs me to put in a good word with his superiors.\"","The woman clung to the fat man's arm, her tone extremely fawning:","\"Hubby you're so capable!\""]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: Qi Dull Sense Silence","paragraphs":["A few minutes later, the newlyweds came out of the dressing room again.","The cake stains on Fang Ting's wedding dress could not be completely cleaned, so she had to change into the dress she had worn when she went out in the morning.","Fang Ting still felt resentful as she looked at Liu Hui, who had walked out of the dressing room a step slower than her.","Sensing her dissatisfaction from her eyes, Liu Hui hurriedly put his arm around her and gently coaxed her.","Liu Hui knew that his actions earlier had upset his wife. He repeatedly promised that after getting through this wedding banquet today, she could vent her anger on him however she wanted when they got home, and he would not complain at all.","It was just that today, in addition to the aunts and female relatives from both sides of the family, the direct supervisor from the company he had just started working for not long ago would also grace the occasion with his presence.","He hoped to get through today smoothly.","He would properly apologize and make amends to his wife when they got home.","Seeing her husband looking sincerely apologetic, Fang Ting's resentment gradually dissipated.","In the end, she swallowed the small upset from earlier.","As the wedding banquet was about to begin, a man in a suit walked in at the entrance to the banquet hall.","Sheng Mumu saw the fat man at the next table hurriedly walk over to the sturdy man in three steps, looking particularly obsequious.","\"President Zheng, you finally came.\" The fat man's face, covered in sagging flesh, was all smiles.","The protruding belly, which had been sticking out all this time, was no longer sticking out. Bending slightly at the waist, he held out his hand to usher the man in the suit.","As they walked, he said,","\"President Zheng, I got that kid Liu Hui to arrange the main table for you.\"","\"It's really giving Old Man Liu face that you came today.\"","\"The fund you recommended to me last time made a huge profit. If there are any other money-making opportunities in the future, I'll still rely on President Zheng to give me more referrals.\"","The man referred to as President Zheng seemed to be used to this kind of flattery. His expression was unchanged, and he did not respond.","The groom's parents at the main table smiled and greeted him, shaking hands when they saw the fat man leading President Zheng over.","Sheng Mumu wondered to herself.","What was this person's background?","Not only did he arrive late, he didn't seem to be a relative of the groom's side.","Just as she was speculating, she heard the two gossipy women at the next table start to chat away again without any scruples.","\"Hey, look, the one who just came in is Liu Hui's top boss. I heard he's a big shot at a huge company!\" The woman with red curly hair shook the woman in the cheongsam's arm dramatically.","The woman in the cheongsam looked over and laughed knowingly. \"No wonder he gets to sit at the main table. Old Man Liu is eager to have prestigious tycoons like him come and give his son face in front of the bride's relatives and friends.\"","\"Oh, this tycoon is so powerful. Should I go over later and toast him to get acquainted?\" The curly-haired woman's eyes gleamed. \"My youngest son and daughter-in-law are still living off me at home without jobs. I'm so worried.\"","\"Forget it,\" the cheongsam woman chuckled lightly. \"Although he's a tycoon, not just anyone can get into his company. Liu Hui was able to get in because someone referred and mentored him, and also because of his own good academics and abilities.\"","Sheng Mumu stopped listening carefully after that.","She already had a general understanding.","She suddenly felt a little hungry, and her eyes scanned the table, falling on the platter of assorted cold appetizers.","Before she could reach out, Qi Mo noticed where her gaze was and had already stretched out his hand to rotate the lazy Susan, bringing the small dishes in front of her.","Sheng Mumu smiled charmingly at Qi Mo, thanking this considerate man.","She also put a piece in his bowl.","The corner of the man's mouth raised imperceptibly. He glanced at his watch.","According to what was written on the invitation, it was already time for the start of the wedding banquet.","But the venue was still noisy, without the slightest sign of beginning.","Used to strictly keeping to the time, his displeasure showed on his face.","His eyebrows were just lightly furrowed, but he emitted a silent, intimidating aura.","Sheng Mumu turned her head and smiled. \"Stop looking at the time.\"","Qi Mo's eyebrows twitched slightly. He looked directly at her. \"Oh?\"","His deep eyes showed faint puzzlement.","Sheng Mumu leaned toward him a little.","\"You clearly have never attended a wedding banquet before, have you?\"","Qi Mo nodded slightly, answering truthfully, \"That's right.\"","He did indeed lack experience in this area.","Strictly speaking, this was the first time he had attended someone else's wedding banquet.","In the past, when he received similar invitations, he would just have his executive assistant prepare a thick red envelope to send over to settle it.","Sheng Mumu chuckled.","He was just as she had guessed.","The grand President Qi Mo, capable of making waves in the business arena, lacked experience in many little matters of daily life.","Sometimes he would inadvertently reveal a side that did not match his steady appearance and powerful aura at all.","Sheng Mumu's bright eyes blinked. She explained to him,","\"In my experience, at any banquet, things are dragged out a bit. None can start on time.\"","As if thinking of something, she added,","\"It's a bad habit. If I ever host a celebration or banquet for my company in the future, I will definitely not make guests wait.\"","Who knows, there may come a day when A Yue Ji has grown big enough to host a bell-ringing ceremony to entertain business partners.","Upon hearing this, an imperceptible emotion flashed in Qi Mo's eyes, which were dark and deeply curled.","Then the corners of his eyes slowly lifted, and he said in a low voice, \"Alright.\"","At the main table on the groom's side.","The man referred to as President Zheng lazily looked around, then slowly retracted his gaze.","Suddenly his eyes paused, lighting up, as he stared fixedly in a certain direction.","He couldn't believe his eyes.","The others at the table were still perfunctorily praising him.","\"President Zheng, our family still has to rely on you to mentor Liu Hui in the future.\"","\"It really gave us great face that President Zheng came to my son's wedding banquet today.\"","\"...\"","Oblivious to being the center of attention, the man stood up.","He carefully straightened out his shirt and suit, making sure he was presentable. Then he strode directly toward where his gaze had been,","As he walked, he nervously cleared his throat, afraid his tone and manners would be inappropriate.","The fat man had been keeping him company all along. Seeing President Zheng suddenly get up, he thought he wanted to look for a server. Eager to miss no opportunity for fawning, he hurriedly followed along.","Then, President Zheng walked over to a table among the bride's guests.","He respectfully bowed his head and said to one person,","\"President Qi, I didn't expect to run into you here. What a coincidence.\"","Qi Mo looked up and glanced at him.","His expression unchanged, he casually asked, \"And you are?\"","\"It's me, Little Zheng. I'm the fund manager of the subsidiary fund company under Group Third Division.\"","Qi Mo's eyes narrowed slightly. His gaze was distant and cold, as if he could not recall having this person in the group.","\"President Qi, with your busy schedule, you must not remember me. Three years ago at the group annual meeting, I had the honor of toasting you.\"","The fat man was completely dumbfounded. His not exactly nimble brain CPU worked furiously.","Analyzing the superior-subordinate relationship between President Zheng and that man with the steady aura.","As his train of thought gradually became clear, his cloudy eyes bulged wider and wider.","President Qi?","Qi...","Could it be Qi Group's President Qi Mo!?"]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: Rich Wives don't do so well.","paragraphs":["The second before still being President Zheng, the next second turned into the man of young Zheng, the line of sight slightly deflected, and saw Sheng Mumu beside Qi Mo, paused slightly.","He greeted with a professional smile:","\"Good morning, Mrs. Qi!\"","Sheng Mumu took a look at that young Zheng, and took another look at Qi Mo.","The bewilderment on her face only lingered for half a second, and she calmly replied, \"Hello.\"","Unlike the indifference of Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu, the guests at the surrounding tables had already started talking upon seeing this scene.","Someone was puzzled: \"Huh? Liu Hui's boss's boss?\"","Someone acted as a know-it-all, \"I knew that man didn't look ordinary all along, he must be someone important, I have such a poisonous eye.\"","A male relative of the bride whispered, \"Is he an acquaintance of the bride's side?\"","\"That can't be right, didn't they say the bride was from Yuncheng and married far away to Jing City?\"","The obese man who had figured out the situation rolled his eyes and took a step forward. He carefully opened his mouth and reported his identity:","\"Good morning Mr. Qi, I have long admired your great name, I am...\"","Qi Mo heard his words, but it seemed as if he hadn't heard them at all, and looked away in another direction.","At the end of his sight, a pair of newlyweds walked towards them.","Fang Ting lifted her wedding dress and her expression gradually changed from surprise to delight.","When she got to Qi Mo, she looked extremely happy.","\"Brother Qi Mo, I didn't expect you to come. Since our old neighborhood was demolished, I moved to Yuncheng with my dad, and I haven't seen you for many years.\"","In Fang Ting's memory, Qi Mo was the neighbor who was good at his studies, taciturn, and the most outstanding big brother in the yard.","She never expected to see him at her own wedding.","\"Brother Qi Mo, you still look the same as before—\"","She stopped mid-sentence, and changed her words:","\"No, you look even more handsome than before!\"","With a glance, Fang Ting saw the beautiful woman beside Qi Mo, and was slightly surprised and even more delighted.","\"This gorgeous sister must be Brother Qi Mo's wife, right?\"","Fang Ting made no attempt to conceal her fondness for the beautiful lady. Her smile was radiant. \"Hello, beautiful sister~\".","She thought to herself: So pretty, what a perfect match.","When she was little, she felt that Qi Mo was the most outstanding and excellent big brother in the yard.","His future wife would definitely be a great beauty.","Now that she saw her today, it was indeed the case.","She started shipping them before she knew it.","Sheng Mumu smiled, showing her easy-going personality, waved hello, and greeted in a sweet and lilting tone:","\"Hi~!\"","At this moment, Qi Mo, who had been sitting steadily, also stood up with a faint smile on his face. He said to the neighbor's little sister:","\"Uncle Fang was very kind to me. Now that you're back in Jing City, I should take more care of you. If anyone bullies you in the future, be sure to tell me.\"","Fang Ting didn't stand on ceremony. She took the bridesmaid's phone and asked for Qi Mo's number.","Qi Mo told her his work number, and they chatted for a few more sentences.","Fang Ting hooked her husband's arm and leaned sweetly against him. She introduced to Qi Mo:","\"Brother Qi Mo, this is my husband, Liu Hui.\"","Qi Mo's gaze slid over the groom indifferently.","The faint smile still on his cold face didn't reach his eyes at all. He murmured \"hmm\" and said to the neighbor's sister:","\"Uncle Fang was very kind to me, so I should take good care of you when you are back in Jing City. If anyone bullies you in the future, be sure to tell me.\"","Fang Ting was very clever. She understood that Qi Mo was implying that he would help discipline her husband. Following Qi Mo's lead, she glared at her husband and emphasized with a smile:","\"Did you hear that? Don't bully me.\"","Liu Hui shuddered. Under the powerful aura of the man opposite him, he nodded obediently and hurriedly smiled and responded:","\"I will! I will! I will treat Tingting well and not let her suffer the slightest grievance.\"","Beside them, the obese man who had wanted to speak with Qi Mo but failed, awkwardly took half a step back, intending to wait until Mr. Qi finished talking with the bride, then find a chance to curry favor.","After all, being able to meet the president of Qi Group was an opportunity many people begged for but could not get. If he could flatter and compliment this important figure and get him to let slip a few minor projects, he wouldn't have to worry for the rest of his life.","Around them, the discussion among the crowd continued.","\"Oh, so the bride is a local? I thought she was from Yuncheng.\"","\"Yes, didn't you hear her say she moved to Yuncheng after the old neighborhood was demolished, and now she's married back here, so she has roots in this city.\"","\"I see, that makes sense.\"","\"Now it doesn't look like she married up at all.\"","\"Given that the bride knows such a distinguished tycoon, perhaps she has an extraordinary family background. It's possible this was a marriage down, not up.\"","Among the people nearby, only the obese man's wife remained silent.","She eyed Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu covertly.","She suddenly recalled seeing them earlier in the elevator.","A hint of doubt appeared in her eyes.","Can this be real?","The bride just said she was a neighbor of Mr. Qi in their old neighborhood.","If he was rich, how could he have lived in an old neighborhood?","Her gaze fell on Sheng Mumu, scrutinizing her inch by inch.","From her top, skirt, to shoes and handbag.","None had a brand logo.","She felt Sheng Mumu didn't look as flashy as herself.","It seemed that even the wife of a rich family didn't have it so good.","Just sounded impressive but wasn't really.","Suddenly her thoughts were pulled away by two young girls talking behind her.","\"Look, isn't that a Delva handbag?\"","\"It looks like it. I saw it introduced in a magazine. It's a luxury brand pioneer that only makes ten handbags a year. Low-key yet extravagant. Even the rich can't buy it.\"","\"Wow~ The world of the wealthy is unimaginable.\"","\"That Mr. Qi is the president of Qi Group. He's top-tier among the rich circle.\"","\"Oh my, dream material for tonight.\"","\"Let's hurry back and sleep after the banquet, to dream sooner.\"","\"Hahaha...\"","The two young girls joked and laughed. The woman in front of them grew increasingly sullen, flushing red then white, shocked and chagrined.","Shocked that no wonder she felt that man looked vaguely familiar.","She had probably seen that handsome face in magazine interviews before.","Chagrined that she was so ignorant.","She thought the beautiful woman didn't have any branded items on her.","But the brand was so exclusive she simply didn't recognize it.","Suddenly, a childish voice rang out.","\"Mommy, I want more watermelon. Find me watermelon, I want to eat it now—\"","Following the child's voice, Sheng Mumu was startled.","It was the naughty kid who had stained the bride's dress. He had half a slice of watermelon in his hand, waving both arms as he ran over here.","He was about to get his hands, dirty with watermelon juice, all over her skirt.","In the nick of time...","Sheng Mumu heard a crisp \"slap!\""]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: A Lesson to the Child","paragraphs":["\"Slap!\"","The clear slap rang out along with the hand that landed on Sheng Mumu's shoulder.","She was pulled into a firm embrace, dodging the juice-covered hands of the naughty child.","Colliding into the man's sturdy chest, Sheng Mumu lifted her eyes.","She saw Qi Mo's gaze tighten, his brows knitted together impatiently, his lips pressed in a flat line, emanating a bone-chilling coldness.","Slap, slap.","Two more slaps sounded out.","Only then did Sheng Mumu look over.","The naughty child's face was red, though it was unclear if it was from anger or being hit. His cheeks were puffed out, tears welling up in his eyes, and he wailed loudly.","\"Wahhhhh!\"","The sound was shrill and grating, with great penetrating power.","The obese man beside showed not an ounce of pity. His hand still suspended in the air, he slapped the child's bottom again.","He sternly rebuked:","\"What are you crying for? Stop crying! Apologize to Auntie!\"","The obese man pressed the child's head down and twisted it to face Sheng Mumu.","His expression changed in a second, now wearing an obsequious smile, the fat on his cheeks deforming.","\"Mrs. Qi, the child was wrong to disturb you.\"","As he spoke, he roughly grabbed the child's arm and urged:","\"Quick, apologize to Auntie!\"","After all, children are afraid of their parents.","Having been spoiled since young, rarely seeing his father so angry, the child shrank back at once, not daring to cry out again. His cheeks still puffed out, he lifted his head.","Suddenly he froze.","Before him, Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo had lowered their gazes.","Backlit.","Their faces devoid of any extra expression.","Not that they meant to scare the child.","Simply that Qi Mo's tall and upright stature, together with his overbearing aura, unintentionally made the child feel afraid.","The child timidly took a step back, his lips moving as he tried hard to squeeze out a few words.","\"Au...Auntie—\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly strode forward.","The child hung his head down, watching his own shadow on the ground be gradually overlapped by another slender one.","He felt even more afraid in his heart.","In the crowd.","The obese man's expression was worried.","Unsure what Sheng Mumu planned to do to his precious son, he hastily spoke up:","\"Mrs. Qi, children are young and ignorant—\"","\"Indeed,\" Sheng Mumu cut him off. She squatted down, meeting the child eye to eye.","Her cold eyes slowly swept over the child's parents' faces. Her tone was neither aggressive nor deferential as she said:","\"Children don't understand propriety and only learn by example. Ill-mannered and rude, it's all learned from adults.\"","Her words fell.","The obese man's body stiffened.","Most of the men here were his relatives and he was usually well-respected.","But now, in front of them, he was being implicitly scolded by a woman much younger than himself.","He felt awful but didn't have the courage to retort.","He didn't dare to, and moreover couldn't.","Out of consideration for the silent yet deadly man by her side.","Even if he was being insulted to his face today, he could only obediently listen.","Seeing her husband had no response, the obese man's wife also dared not speak.","She wished she could find a hole in the ground to hide in.","There were whispers around them.","Most were from people who had been bothered by the child's rambunctious behavior.","Hearing Sheng Mumu's words, they felt vindicated.","They cheered her on in their hearts.","—\"The brat deserved to be taught a lesson.\"","—\"Mrs. Qi is right. The child may be small but are the adults also small?\"","—\"That's right. If the child makes a racket, I'll make a bigger racket and see who goes crazy first.\"","—\"Yes, his mom said he's too young. Please, there are so many well-behaved children at a young age. Don't lump all children together.\"","Some wise parents took the chance to pull their own children close and educate them:","\"Baby, don't learn from that fat uncle when you grow up.\" \"This is a public setting, not home. You have to behave.\"","Feeling that he had lost face, the obese man took out his anger on his son. He roughly shoved the child's shoulder.","\"You little brat, apologize quickly!\"","Sheng Mumu slowly stood up. \"No need to apologize to me since you didn't bump into me.\"","She glanced at the silent bride, Fang Ting.","Then she turned back to the child.","Perhaps feeling some pity for the child in this family, her tone softened a little.","But she still calmly said:","\"Little one, you got cake all over the new bride's dress just now. Don't you think you should say sorry?\"","The child timidly lifted his head, tears brimming in his eyes as he stared blankly at Sheng Mumu.","All the arrogance from before had vanished from the little overlord.","His hands curled into fists and he took small steps towards Fang Ting. Bowing his head sincerely, he said:","\"I'm sorry, Auntie. I was wrong.\"","The farce finally ended with the obese couple taking their son away.","The onlooking crowd gradually dispersed.","The bride and groom returned to the wedding stage to prepare for the banquet.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo declined the offer from the groom's side to sit at the main table, returning to their previous seats.","The lights in the banquet hall suddenly dimmed.","Several spotlights shot towards the entrance.","Sweet and solemn music sounded.","Following the spotlights, the bride slowly emerged from behind the doors.","Her wedding gown was pure white, two patches of shy yet anxious crimson on her face, delicate and moving.","The hem of her skirt swayed as she walked, one step after another, towards the man she had chosen to spend the rest of her life with.","Without a doubt, she was the most beautiful woman here today.","Sheng Mumu was infected by the atmosphere and smiled sincerely, applauding enthusiastically.","There were cheers from the guests' tables.","\"The bride is so beautiful!\"","\"Oooo~\"","\"Newlywed happiness!\"","\"A match made in heaven!\"","\"Woooo~\"","Amidst the warm atmosphere, Qi Mo turned his head. His gaze as dark as ink slowly fell upon Sheng Mumu's face.","The pink and yellow lights swirled around the banquet hall.","Setting off her fair complexion even more strikingly.","Her bright eyes and white teeth, long fluttering lashes.","Her eyes filled with sincerity and joy for others.","Sometimes propping up her cheek, smiling with upturned brows.","Sometimes cupping her chin in both hands, utterly moved as she watched the ceremony.","A gentle smile, sparkling eyes.","The bride was perhaps the most beautiful woman today.","But she was the most dazzling woman in his eyes.","At the moment when the bride and groom read their vows and embraced each other.","Cheers and congratulations erupted in the banquet hall.","All the lights focused on the stage.","Everyone's eyes followed the new couple.","It was at this time that Sheng Mumu felt her left wrist encircled by a gentle force.","Qi Mo's warm and broad palm slid down her slender wrist.","Prying open her fingers and holding her hand.","His grip gradually grew tighter.","As if afraid she might slip away.","The slightly rough pads of his fingers squeezed her soft fingertips.","The motion was light, like caressing, yet also cherishing and carefully confirming.","He turned his head, the usual coldness in his eyes melted away, flickering with warmth...","The crowd was noisy, the lights dazzling.","The music switched to Canon in D, piano version.","Amidst the cheers, his eyes were only on her.","Thump thump.","Sheng Mumu turned her head and their eyes met.","She could clearly hear the pounding of her heart, heavily and rhythmically leaping."]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: Qi Shaobai can not fail","paragraphs":["When they came out from the wedding venue, it was already two o'clock in the afternoon. Having just experienced a sincere and touching wedding ceremony and seeing the warm sunshine outside again, Sheng Mumu felt somewhat dizzy.","Stepping out of the revolving door of the hotel, she stopped in her tracks at the entrance. While waiting for Xiao Wang to drive the car over, she blankly looked up at the sky for a while. The faint warmth on her face was blown away by the gentle autumn afternoon breeze. This finally stopped her from constantly recalling Qi Mo's hot and lingering gaze at her inside just now.","\"Going to the company in the afternoon?\"","Qi Mo suddenly turned his head and asked.","Sheng Mumu looked back at him, thought for a moment, smiled and answered, \"No, with Jia Mu sister and Cheng Zhuo there, I can slack off for half a day.\"","As she spoke, her eyes lowered and she saw that Qi Mo was holding the complimentary gift box distributed at the wedding banquet.","The small square box in lake blue had a butterfly knot tied with pearl white satin ribbons.","The man with the aura of being in high position was casually holding a gift box in such a delicate and cute style.","It gave a strange sense of disharmony for some reason.","But Qi Mo didn't seem to feel that way at all and his expression was as usual. Then he asked again,","\"Then come with me for a walk?\"","\"Okay,\" Sheng Mumu said, \"Where to?\"","Qi Mo looked towards the not too far away place.","That area had already been developed into tall buildings.","\"I'll take you to tour the place where I grew up.\"","Sheng Mumu followed his gaze and looked over. She then remembered that on the way here, Qi Mo had said that the wedding hotel happened to be near the old neighborhood where he used to live.","At this moment, a black luxury sedan stopped steadily in front of the two.","Xiao Wang got out of the driver's seat and opened the rear door for Boss Qi and his wife.","Qi Mo handed the gift box to Xiao Wang, \"Put this in the car. My wife and I will walk around first, we don't need the car for now.\"","Xiao Wang was confused but professional. He responded in one second, \"Yes, Boss Qi.\"","After leaving the wedding hotel and crossing a road junction, winding through a shady path.","It was a street full of strong living atmosphere.","There were shops lined on both sides of the street.","Many of the shop signs had faded in color.","You could tell at a glance that they hadn't been renovated for a long time.","There were many such old neighborhoods around. Although some had been demolished, quite a few still remained.","Even on an ordinary weekday afternoon, the pedestrian flow was still very large.","The noodle shop owner lifted the pot lid, and steam instantly rushed up.","Schoolchildren with schoolbags lingered in front of the stationery store.","Debating whether to use their pocket money to buy notebooks or new colored highlighters.","Elderly people pushed their grocery carts slowly past the produce store. Attracted by the discounted vegetables being called out through a small loudspeaker inside, they stopped to take a look in.","At the corner bakery, the young shop assistant in an apron placed freshly baked bread on the shelf near the shop window.","The aroma of wheat drifted over.","\"Ding ling ling--\"","Behind them came the sound of a bicycle bell.","Qi Mo's hand gently touched Sheng Mumu's lower back, leading her inwards while taking a step to the outer side.","Two students wearing middle school uniforms sped through the crowd on bikes.","Their school uniforms were blown up by the wind, bending into the arc of youthful abandon.","\"Ride faster, the first class in the afternoon is Teacher Ban's lesson,\" the boy in front urged.","The girl lagging behind pouted and complained, \"I shouldn't have gone out of the way to get you. If we're late, we'll have to copy the school rules again as punishment.\"","The boy's voice faded away, \"I'll copy it for you then...\"","The old streets have a special magic.","Walking on them.","It would give people the illusion that time had stopped.","Unknowingly, the two slowed their pace.","Proceeding at an extremely leisurely pace, walking slowly down this street shaded by the ginkgo trees.","The coldness in Qi Mo's eyes became gentle.","The smells, sounds here, and even the loose feel of the ground bricks.","Were all exactly the same as before.","Only before, he would always rush through alone. Rarely observing the people around.","Returning after so many years, he finally realized how lively this street was.","No.","It may have always been so noisy, it was just that his past self had never noticed it before.","His eyes dimmed slightly, and Qi Mo silently curved the corners of his lips.","That's not right either.","He should say, his past self didn't have the ability to pay attention to little things in life.","Apart from work, there was only work in his mind.","The world was vast, waiting for him to break new ground.","Since she appeared in his life.","The world had become diverse, tiny and soft.","For him, she was reconstruction, and also subversion.","Sheng Mumu glanced at the man by her side.","Seeing the undisguised tenderness on his handsome face.","Her mind suddenly became curious.","What was little Qi Mo like?","Was he the child who hesitated in front of the stationery store with pocket money?","Or the unconstrained and carefree teenager riding a bicycle?","Looking at his handsome profile, her guesses grew more and more.","The two lazily strolled along.","When they encountered familiar shops, Qi Mo would talk to her in a low, reminiscent tone for a few sentences.","Such as: \"I once had a stomachache after eating in this noodle shop\", or \"I didn't expect the beancurd seller uncle's hair to be all white now\" and so on.","Sheng Mumu listened quietly, sometimes teasing him: \"I didn't expect the boss to get stomachaches too.\"","Sometimes on a whim, she would pull him back to buy a bowl of cold taro and beancurd dessert.","In just an afternoon, she understood this man she slept with every day a little more.","He showed his sensitivity and childhood memories to her.","Unreservedly, in full.","When they returned to Xiyu Yue Ting, it was dinnertime.","The two had already eaten.","Butler Zhang stood at the door with a smile on his face:","\"Welcome back, Sir and Madam.\"","Qi Mo nodded slightly, while Sheng Mumu touched her very full stomach and smiled slightly in response.","In the room.","Qi Shaobai's ears perked up when he heard Butler Zhang's loud voice outside.","He leaned back into the computer chair a little.","In fact, when he was texting with his little stepmother at noon, there was one thing he didn't get a chance to say.","The school had scheduled a senior prom for the 12th grade on Wednesday next week.","They invited parents of students to attend together.","Qi Shaobai was about to ask which of them had time to go.","But he was silenced by his father's intimidating voice message.","He was debating when to casually mention the prom to them, when there were two knocks on the door outside.","\"Knock knock--\"","Opening the door, Sheng Mumu was standing outside, waving the bag in her hand.","\"Little Qi, don't say your dad and I ate deliciously without bringing you any. I bought freshly baked chocolate toast for you.\"","Qi Shaobai didn't stand on ceremony and reached out to take it, \"Thanks.\"","Sheng Mumu turned to go upstairs and heard Qi Shaobai's lazy voice calling her.","\"Oh right, the school is holding a senior prom on Wednesday next week, in the auditorium. Do you guys have time to come?\"","Sheng Mumu turned her head and saw the aloof little Qi absently rubbing the back of his neck, chin slightly raised.","His expression was casual, his tone carried a touch of indifference, then he added,","\"It's fine if you're busy, it's not a very important event anyway, just a unified school activity. Most classmates in my class aren't eighteen yet.\"","\"We'll go,\" Sheng Mumu said without thinking, \"I love lively events, of course I have to go.\"","Qi Shaobai's cold piercing eyes glanced away.","The piercing look was gone, his sarcasm unchanged, he retorted,","\"No need to be so proud of loving lively events.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"???\""]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: Qi Shaobai's Rite of Passage","paragraphs":["When Sheng Mumu encountered a mischievous child at the wedding banquet, she was secretly relieved that being a stepmother was easier than she had anticipated.","Qi Shaobai was a tall and robust man, not as difficult to handle as a child.","But now, she deeply felt that she had underestimated the challenges of dealing with the stubborn and temperamental young master of the prestigious Qi family.","Not only was he difficult to deceive due to his age and wit, but he also frequently criticized and attacked her.","Sigh.","She had endured too much.","Fifty thousand yuan as her monthly allowance.","It was what she deserved!","Feeling in a good mood today, Sheng Mumu couldn't be bothered to argue back. Instead, she smiled kindly and gently patted the back of Qi Shaobai's head, saying:","\"As everyone knows, not criticizing others will not land you in jail.\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned by the patting and remained speechless, \"...\"","Before he could recover and prepare to retaliate, Sheng Mumu leisurely climbed the stairs without looking back, saying to him:","\"I'll ask your dad if he's coming.\"","Qi Shaobai's head still throbbed from the patting, but his voice concealed a faint smile as he lazily replied, \"Oh.\"","That evening, Sheng Mumu told Qi Mo about the coming-of-age ceremony at Jing City No.1 Middle School.","Qi Mo checked his schedule and found that he had free time on that day, so he agreed to accompany them.","Sheng Mumu felt like a messenger between the two Qi men and sent a message to Qi Shaobai:","\"Your dad is going too.\"","Qi Shaobai felt happy inside but didn't want to show it. He coolly replied with a single digit, \"1.\"","Looking at the indifferent \"1\" on the screen, Sheng Mumu's lips twitched.","She regretted that she had slapped him too lightly.","*","Qi Shaobai knew that both his father and stepmother would attend the school's coming-of-age ceremony, and his good mood lasted until Monday.","His usually straight lips were slightly upturned.","He was attentive during class, and he even broke his usual habit and asked the physics teacher for help with a difficult problem after class.","At noon, it started raining outside.","Raindrops pattered against the windowsill.","Qi Shaobai leaned against his desk, lazily looking out the window.","His mouth sank, and a hint of bitterness appeared on his usually aloof face.","Speaking to himself:","\"I hope it won't rain on Wednesday.\"","Wei Zhaonan, sitting in the front row, had already noticed that Qi Shaobai was acting strange today.","Upon hearing his remark, his eyebrows furrowed in confusion.","The usual Qi Shaobai wouldn't even bother to carry an umbrella when it rained.","He always adhered to the belief of \"deal with problems as they come, never anticipate difficulties.\"","Yet today, he was here, seemingly bothered by the light rain.","Wei Zhaonan turned his head, leaning against the backrest of his chair, and asked:","\"Qi Shaobai, what's wrong? Feeling sentimental today?\"","The corners of Qi Shaobai's eyebrows lifted slightly, and he lazily glanced at Wei Zhaonan, \"Are you... concerned about my dad?\"","Wei Zhaonan lowered his eyelids halfway, as if he had already expected that Qi Shaobai wouldn't have anything nice to say. He responded with a mouth-shape, \"...Bro, you're right.\"","Around them, classmates who had finished lunch gathered in small groups, chatting away.","Almost everyone was discussing the coming-of-age ceremony.","Two girls from the neighboring group sat in their seats, unable to hide their excitement in their voices:","\"My mom said she'll give me a set of T-brand lipstick in all shades for the coming-of-age ceremony.\"","\"Wow! Your mom is so great!\" the girl next to her exclaimed. \"My dad said he'll buy me a basic platinum bag. I'll finally have my own designer bag.\"","Jing City No.1 Middle School was an elite school, where it seemed necessary to mention gifts of such value.","A few boys sitting in the back row also joined the conversation with the two girls.","\"I won't receive any gifts. My parents won't come, so most likely they will just give me some red envelopes as a perfunctory gesture.\"","\"Sigh, my dad plans to give me his old car as a coming-of-age gift and buy a new one for himself. Can you believe it?\"","As the words fell, laughter filled the air.","Wei Zhaonan shifted his gaze and asked Qi Shaobai:","\"Did your aunt and uncle prepare any gifts for you?\"","Qi Shaobai lifted his eyelids indifferently and shrugged, \"Doesn't matter.\"","It had to be admitted that when he found out that his dad and stepmother were coming, there was a flicker of anticipation in his heart.","But it passed in an instant. Based on his understanding of his dad, he never treated any special occasion differently.","Anticipating a gift from his dad was no different from anticipating the sudden cancellation of the English subject, which was his most dreaded part of the college entrance examination.","And what about his stepmother?","There was some anticipation, but not much.","After all, she was the person who gave him a stack of past exam papers as a gift.","Let's not dwell on that memory.jpg","At the same time that Qi Shaobai was feeling sentimental and conflicted, Sheng Mumu came out of the company.","She gracefully sat in a red Porsche, purposefully started the car, and drove out of the parking lot.","Today, she had already informed Jia Mu and Cheng Zhuo in advance that she had some personal matters to attend to in the afternoon and wouldn't be returning to the company.","She arrived at the mall where she had previously bought skiing equipment.","After parking the car, she entered the elevator hall and pressed the floor button for the men's clothing section without hesitation.","She wandered around this floor for a long time.","Looking for a coming-of-age gift for Qi Shaobai.","Her expression went from relaxed to increasingly troubled.","It was so difficult to choose!","It seemed that the men's section of the mall only targeted adult, wealthy men.","Suits were a waste of money since Qi Shaobai rarely had a chance to wear them.","Leather shoes didn't match his youthful vibe.","As she was pondering, she walked into a shop with a slow pace.","Suddenly, her sparkling eyes widened.","She saw a gift that was perfect for Qi Shaobai.","Out of habit, she flipped open the price tag.","Astounded.","As expected, her sense of aesthetics was still excellent.","The desired item had an exorbitant price.","Outrageous.","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath and pursed her lips.","A coming-of-age ceremony only happened once in a lifetime.","It was worth spending the money on this.","With determination in her heart, she took out her own bank card and made the purchase.","*","The day of the coming-of-age ceremony arrived.","In the villa, apart from the butler and servants, Qi Shaobai was the first one to wake up.","The school had relaxed the rules for today, allowing the third-year high school students to attend the collective activities without wearing the school uniform.","He searched through the wardrobe, skimming over the various black and gray T-shirts he usually wore, and picked a dark blue shirt.","Qi Shaobai, like Qi Mo, had naturally pale skin.","Wearing dark blue, a color that complemented his complexion, made him appear even paler.","After changing into the shirt he rarely wore, Qi Shaobai stood in front of the mirror, examining himself from different angles, feeling like something was missing.","The young man nodded slightly, raised his eyes, and looked at his somewhat unkempt hair in the mirror.","Yes, he needed a matching hairstyle.","It took Qi Shaobai about twenty minutes to come out after he finished styling his hair in the bathroom.","Sheng Mumu was having breakfast in the dining room when she heard some noise and turned her head to look.","Her eyes widened abruptly, and a mouthful of porridge got stuck in her throat, neither going up nor down.","Sensing her gaze, Qi Shaobai raised an eyebrow slightly, looking somewhat embarrassed as he touched his nose.","\"What are you staring at?\"","Could it be that his first attempt at styling his hair was not bad at all?","Sheng Mumu took a shallow breath and said, \"Qi Shaobai, how much do you want to make your hair look like an adult?\"","Does he... need half a pound of hair wax for that?"]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Thinning Your Hair like an adult.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu put down her bowl of porridge and walked over to Qi Shaobai.","She looked him up and down with distaste, focusing on his head which looked hard and stiff.","Sighing, she shook her head.","\"Come with me,\" Sheng Mumu instructed.","Qi Shaobai followed her with a confused look on his face as they entered the first floor bathroom.","Sheng Mumu lifted up the faucet and pushed Qi Shaobai's head down under the running water.","\"Wash your hair yourself,\" Sheng Mumu glanced at her phone, \"You have twenty minutes to change your hairstyle, hurry up.\"","Qi Shaobai obediently lowered his head and wetted his hair that he had been quite satisfied with just minutes ago, washing it thoroughly.","After Qi Shaobai quickly blew his hair dry, Sheng Mumu rubbed a little hair wax into her palms and transformed into Sheng Tony, messing his hair up a bit.","She pushed some of his bangs off to the side, revealing his good-looking forehead.","Restrained, making him look just a little more mature.","Not losing his boyish charm, yet different from his usual style.","After finishing with his hair, Sheng Mumu tilted her neck back to look Qi Shaobai up and down.","\"Not bad, after my makeover your handsomeness has doubled,\" she said.","\"Was what I did earlier really that bad?\" Qi Shaobai blurted out. \"I just wanted to look a little more mature.\"","Sheng Mumu patted him on the shoulder sagely.","\"You had good intentions, but I advise you not to have them anymore.\"","Qi Shaobai: ......","Qi Shaobai held back from retorting. His gaze happened to glance at himself in the mirror and he paused, pleased at what he saw.","Nodding in satisfaction, he casually lifted his chin at Sheng Mumu standing with her arms crossed to one side and couldn't help praising:","\"Not bad.\"","Sheng Mumu rolled her eyes at this kid. \"Don't get cocky.\"","It's not like he's seen a pig run without ever having eaten pork before.","The money she spent at the salon each month was not for nothing.","When the two of them came out of the bathroom, Qi Mo was just coming down the stairs.","He had his suit jacket casually draped over his arm, descending the stairs with steady steps.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's unusual outfit and hairstyle compared to normal, and Sheng Mumu's self-satisfied expression, he guessed what had happened.","Qi Shaobai called out, \"Dad.\"","Qi Mo's gaze slowly settled on him, the corners of his lips curving up slightly as he nodded approvingly.","\"Your outfit today suits the coming-of-age ceremony,\" he said.","Qi Shaobai's happiness was evident on his face as he smiled.","After breakfast, the family of three left the house on time.","They didn't have the driver take them.","Qi Mo drove, with Sheng Mumu in the passenger seat and Qi Shaobai in the back.","Sheng Mumu knew that Qi Mo didn't drive often and wasn't used to navigating without GPS, so she naturally turned on the navigation app on her phone to serve as a human GPS voice prompt.","\"Turn right at the next traffic light,\" she said.","Qi Mo's voice was gentle. \"Okay.\"","Hearing this, Qi Shaobai leaned forward in his seat, sitting up straight.","He moved to the middle of the back row and held onto the headrests of the front seats.","\"I know the way to school well, I could direct with my eyes closed. Let me navigate,\" he offered.","Upon hearing this, Sheng Mumu turned off her phone. \"Alright, then you can—\"","But before she could finish speaking, she was interrupted by Qi Mo's seemingly casual words.","\"No need,\" Qi Mo looked at Qi Shaobai via the rearview mirror. \"Use your spare time to review vocabulary words instead.\"","Qi Shaobai: ......","Hearing their conversation, Sheng Mumu didn't think much of it.","She thought Qi Mo made a good point and turned her phone back on.","\"Your dad's right, if you have nothing to do, review vocab,\" she said.","Sheng Mumu suddenly seemed to remember something. She took out a pair of earphones from her bag and handed them to Qi Shaobai.","Adding,","\"Wear earphones to listen, don't play it aloud. I'm afraid it'll make me fall asleep.\"","Qi Shaobai: I...this...","He had only kindly offered to help navigate.","Why did it seem like he was being a nuisance...","He wanted to argue in his defense for a couple sentences.","But then he heard the leisurely conversation from the front seats.","Qi Mo: \"You only had a bowl of porridge for breakfast?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"And two fried eggs.\"","Qi Mo: \"Let's get you some snacks on the street by your school after we drop you off?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"I was thinking the same!\"","Qi Shaobai silently retracted the hand he had on the front seat headrests and sat leaning against the side.","Nevermind.","What else was there to misunderstand?","He felt like a 500-watt lightbulb.","Perhaps...most likely...","His dad hadn't kicked him out of the car and told him to take a different one to school - that was already showing him face because of the coming-of-age ceremony today.","Qi Shaobai put in the earphones.","He opened his music app and chose a rock song.","Listening to music, he gazed out the window at the passing scenery.","The car drove onto an overpass and entered a road along the lake.","It was a road he took everyday.","He hadn't noticed until now, but the scenery was quite nice.","Despite being disliked by both his dad and stepmom, he wasn't in a bad mood. Rather, a hint of warmth appeared in his clear, cold eyes.","His naturally stern face looked unexpectedly happy for some reason.","Sensing the upturned corners of his mouth, he scolded himself in his heart:","Masochist, still smiling after being rejected.","After this interior monologue, his brows suddenly furrowed and he was stunned for a few seconds.","Something wasn't right.","He was about to turn eighteen, yet he was still scolding himself in his thoughts.","How immature.","Today his dad had praised him for being like an adult.","But his current thoughts were the complete opposite.","He straightened his expression and resumed normal, continuing to look out the window.","But the straight line of his lips only lasted a few minutes.","Unknowingly, it curved up again.","Oh well.","There were still a few months until his official coming-of-age.","He would indulge in immaturity for a few more months.","The two people in the front didn't know Qi Shaobai's little calculations.","They thought he was actually listening to English vocabulary.","They continued chatting casually about random topics, saying whatever came to mind.","When they mentioned Qi Shaobai's school coming-of-age ceremony, Sheng Mumu's hand unconsciously moved to touch the gift box shape that could vaguely be felt through her bag. The corners of her lips imperceptibly curved up.","They arrived at the school.","After parking, the three got out of the car.","Qi Shaobai had been voted the school heartthrob by the girls at Beijing No. 1 High School.","Dressed in a shirt today with some of his forehead revealed, his admiring fangirls' faces were even redder than usual.","Just from getting out of the car to walking to the auditorium,","Sheng Mumu had already noticed seven girls sneak glances at Qi Shaobai before shyly running away.","Sheng Mumu looked left and right.","On her left was a handsome, mature man, on her right a handsome youth.","Walking between the two of them, she somehow felt a sense of basking in their glory.","When they reached the school's large auditorium where the coming-of-age ceremony was being held, it was already packed with people.","\"Testing, testing, 123,\" the sound of the microphone check echoed through the auditorium.","Looking in the direction of the voice, the speaker was that same homeroom teacher from the high school entrance ceremony rally.","After the third-year students and parents were seated by class, the homeroom teacher smiled brightly and adjusted the mic.","His opening remarks were still the familiar formula.","\"Ah...let me just say a few words—\""]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: No Hurry, No Delay, Year after Year Chang 'an","paragraphs":["\"At eighteen, it is the perfect time to pursue your dreams.\"","\"I sincerely wish every high school senior a bright future ahead.\"","\"Go all out, at this most beautiful age, head towards farther places, see brighter light...\"","The words of the grade director, who usually nags the most, trailed off.","Rarely was there no clamor below the stage.","The group of sixteen, seventeen, eighteen year old boys and girls looked earnestly towards the stage.","They had never listened so attentively to the grade director's speech.","Their appearances were all different, but the blazing light shining in their eyes was the same.","Perhaps infected by the atmosphere, Sheng Mumu also turned her gaze to the stage, listening quietly.","After the speech, it was time for the class advisors to give their blessings.","Qi Shaobai's class advisor thoughtfully prepared photos of each student from when they first entered high school.","And on the back of the photos, he wrote about the growth, highlights, and congratulatory message he saw in each student since they entered school.","Following that, underclassmen representatives presented each senior with a bouquet of sunflowers.","The entire coming-of-age ceremony lasted an hour and a half.","If it were a normal day, this group of impatient boys and girls would have been distracted long ago.","But today, they were exceptionally immersed and attentive.","When the grade director announced the end of the ceremony and they were free to take commemorative photos, cheers of abandon rang out in the auditorium.","In chorus, they yelled:","\"We're adults now!\"","The sound was loud enough to almost flip the roof off.","Against the flow of the crowd, a slender and upright figure walked.","The youthful Qi Shaobai ran towards Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo, smiling freely, waving the bouquet in his hand.","His exceptionally good-looking eyebrows and eyes shone brilliantly, brimming with spirit and vitality.","The very image of natural boyish charm.","It was as if a breeze flowed within the enclosed auditorium.","Filled with the air of youth, it hit you in the face.","Sheng Mumu unconsciously turned on her phone and quickly snapped a photo.","Capturing this rare scene.","Seeing Sheng Mumu taking photos of him, Qi Shaobai ran up to her.","\"Let me see.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"I'll send it to you.\"","Qi Shaobai was in great spirits. He stood before Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu, smiling as he took out his phone from his pocket.","Only to find several congratulatory messages inside.","The first one he opened was from his grandma.","His grandma's voice sounded -","\"My little one, my little one who has followed me since young has finally grown up. Grandma selfishly doesn't want you to grow up so fast, yet I really want to see what you look like as a grown man-\"","The voice message cut off with a slightly choked laugh.","Followed by another one.","After settling her emotions, Grandma's voice trembled as she solemnly blessed:","\"My little one, I wish you bravery, I wish you to stay true to yourself, neither rushed nor slow, peace every year.\"","Qi Shaobai's nose instantly soured up.","He lowered his eyes.","Stopping the tears that kept welling up.","The light in Qi Mo's eyes also dampened, clouding over with a layer of mist.","Of the three, Sheng Mumu who was least able to conceal her emotions, most straightforward, couldn't hold back her tears and they flowed out.","Smiling while wiping the corners of her eyes.","Moved by the bond between Qi Shaobai and his grandma.","Feng Yaoqin also sent Qi Shaobai her blessings.","Treating Qi Shaobai like a child, nearly half of her long message was filled with emojis.","Various [Sun][Thumbs Up][Coffee Cup][Flowers][Smile]...","Encapsulating the essence of square dancing WeChat groups.","Finally, she didn't forget to input the iconic emoji: 18-flower-bloom-prosperity.jpg","Qi Shaobai: ...","He had just finished his coming-of-age ceremony, yet it felt like grandma was eager to pull him into the middle-aged group.","Qiao Li's message was the simplest, just two parts.","\"Happy Coming-of-Age Ceremony! Kiddo.\"","\"Image\"","The image was a silly certificate she made herself. It said:","\"Dear Qi Shaobai:","In view of you being handsome and extraordinary, confer upon you","[Spirited Youth] Award","To specially commend and encourage you.\"","Since Qi Shaobai and Qiao Li weren't too far apart in age, they didn't treat Qiao Li as an elder. Their relationship was more like siblings.","The tears that flowed from his grandma's voice message had just been stopped by Qiao Li's [Spirited Youth Award].","His handsome face showed complex emotions.","Like laughing yet also crying.","He passed his phone to his dad, \"Dad look, this is what Qiao Li sent me.\"","Qi Shaobai took a step towards Qi Mo, tilting his head closer.","Closing the distance.","Qi Shaobai's smile contained tears.","Qi Mo's usual composure faded a bit, his crisp jawline slowly lifted, smiling.","After looking at the phone screen, he raised his eyes to glance at Qi Shaobai.","Their gazes met.","Behind them, a ray of light shone in through the auditorium window, generously grazing both their faces.","One was a mature and elegant man.","The other a pure and handsome boy soon to become a man.","The halo of light made their unique temperaments even more eye-catching.","Extremely moving.","Sheng Mumu seized the opportunity, raising her phone.","Capturing this rare touching scene.","Snap, a photo taken.","Putting her phone back in her bag, Sheng Mumu conveniently took out a prepared small box.","Handing it to Qi Shaobai, she smiled brightly.","\"Your coming-of-age gift, little Qi.\"","Qi Shaobai turned to look.","Surprise was evident in his still misty eyes.","\"For me?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled lightly and nodded.","\"Mm, open it quickly and see if you like it, I spent a long time choosing it.\"","Qi Shaobai casually squeezed the sunflowers under his arm, and accepted the gift box.","It wasn't big.","Definitely not test papers.","Nor could it be Legos.","What could it be?","Filled with anticipation, he opened it. Qi Shaobai's expression was pleasantly surprised.","It was a tie.","Navy blue, with subtle patterned ridges.","Toning down the formality, yet not dreary.","A style fitting for a seventeen, eighteen year old boy.","This was the first tie in his life.","Qi Shaobai stroked the high-quality fabric with his fingertips, instantly feeling like he had really become an adult.","He took out the tie and looped it around his neck.","Qi Mo tilted his head. Seeing Qi Shaobai's clumsy motions, his dark eyes tightened as he slowly rumbled:","\"Let me teach you how to knot it.\"","Qi Shaobai blanked briefly.","Subconsciously straightening his back, standing in military posture before his dad.","Listening to his dad's steady voice calmly rise up, patiently teaching him.","How flat and pointed ties should be paired with dress shirts, where on the shirt the tie clip should be placed for formal occasions in the future.","This moment.","Was Qi Mo's coming-of-age gift to Qi Shaobai.","Suddenly, Sheng Mumu strode forward to stand in line with Qi Shaobai.","The corners of her lips quirked in a mischievous smile as she looked at Qi Mo.","Noticing her expression, Qi Mo's rich dark eyes looked over.","His brow quirked, using his gaze to express confusion: ?","Sheng Mumu held out her hands to him, as if indignant on Qi Shaobai's behalf, slowly saying:","\"Everyone has prepared gifts and blessings for little Qi, what about yours?\"","As her words fell, Qi Mo paused briefly.","Qi Shaobai's eyes swiftly shifted between his dad and young stepmom.","Just as he was about to say something, he felt a pat on his shoulder. Hearing Sheng Mumu righteously continue:","\"Don't be afraid little Qi, I'll get it from him for you.\""]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Qi Mo's Gift to Qi Shaobai","paragraphs":["\"Qi Shaobai, don't be afraid. I'll ask him for you,\" Sheng Mumu said, as if encouraging Qi Shaobai. Qi Shaobai's gaze drifted toward his silent father.","Qi Mo laughed softly and asked directly, \"Alright, what gift do you want?\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned. Ever since he could remember, he had never received a gift from his father before.","Seeing that asking for a gift was working, Sheng Mumu's face revealed joy. She hurriedly nudged Qi Shaobai with her elbow. She strategized, \"Quick, your dad agreed. Make a bold wish, ask him for a small goal first.\"","Qi Shaobai was skeptical, looking at his father, \"Can I really choose whatever I want?\"","The handsome, composed man's eyes gradually softened, his tone light but firm: \"Yes, you can.\"","After hesitating for a few seconds, Qi Shaobai carefully said, \"I want...a watch.\"","Qi Mo replied, \"Okay, what kind of--\"","\"I want dad's first watch,\" Qi Shaobai interrupted Qi Mo before he could finish, expectancy in his eyes.","At the same time, a memory flashed in his mind--","A few years ago, he had accidentally seen his father's watch case.","There was a watch that wasn't the usual valuable brands like Patek Philippe, Vacheron Constantin, Earl in the watch case.","But his father had solemnly placed it in a separate drawer.","Qi Shaobai suppressed his curiosity, simply remembering what that watch looked like.","Later, when flipping through a magazine, he saw an exclusive interview with his father.","In the inset picture, it showed his father leading the founding team of the group to ring the bell at Nasdaq.","In the photo, the watch on his father's wrist was exactly that seemingly unremarkable mechanical watch.","Qi Shaobai took the opportunity of his father's executive assistant coming to the school for a parent-teacher conference, and asked the executive assistant about it.","Having followed Qi Mo for many years, the executive assistant naturally knew the story behind the watch. He spoke admiringly,","\"That watch, I remember Mr. Qi said it was the first watch he bought after earning his first pot of gold.\"","\"In the years when Qi Group was just starting to grow, Mr. Qi would always wear it when attending important events.\"","\"I guess Mr. Qi wanted to remind himself not to forget his original aspiration, and remember the hardships of building his career bit by bit. Mr. Qi is truly my idol in life!\"","These scenes flashed through Qi Shaobai's mind.","His thoughts returned to the present, and he felt somewhat apprehensive.","Asking for this watch that held such great significance for his father as a gift, would that be inappropriate?","He had just blurted it out in the heat of the moment.","Now he suddenly regretted speaking too hastily.","Just as he was feeling remorseful, Qi Shaobai heard his father's deep voice.","\"Alright, I'll bring it to you when I get home.\"","The teenager's eyes slowly widened, unable to conceal his excitement.","Sitting in the car on the way home, he was still full of anticipation, with no decrease in excitement.","Not wanting to appear too childishly happy, he put on his earphones and clicked on his high school English vocabulary playlist.","Listening to English would calm his excitement.","As he expected, it was quite effective.","After listening for just ten minutes, his eyelids started drooping.","He hugged himself, leaned back into the seat, tilted his head, and let his heavy eyelids fall shut.","Back at Xi Yu Yue Ting.","Qi Shaobai held the watch he had just gotten from his father, looking at it again and again.","He carefully tried it on his wrist, but was afraid of scratching it so took it off without buckling the strap, gently placing it in the cabinet.","He cleared out a separate drawer.","He put the watch from his father and the tie from Sheng Mumu side by side in the drawer.","Satisfied, he closed the drawer. From outside the door came a muffled knock.","Qi Shaobai's brows rose in puzzlement.","Usually when Sheng Mumu knocked on his door, it was two crisp, short sounds, very cheerful.","When Butler Zhang knocked, it was slow and accompanied by a \"Young Master\".","This knock now, with no voice and just one muffled sound, who could it be?","Opening the door, Qi Shaobai was a little surprised to see the visitor.","\"Dad.\"","Qi Mo was no longer wearing the suit and dress shirt from this morning, but had changed into a light gray open shirt, with a black t-shirt underneath, standing casually at the door. His bearing was very different from his usual silent, stern image.","Qi Shaobai's gaze lowered.","He saw his father holding a six pack of beer cans.","The beer was chilled, with droplets rolling down the cans and falling faster toward the floor.","Just as the droplets hit the floor, a mellow voice said,","\"You're an adult now, have a drink with me?\"","Qi Shaobai suddenly raised his eyes, stunned for a few seconds. In the teenager's proud, bright eyes flashed a trace of hard to detect emotion.","Because of the surprise, his breath hitched.","His jaw angled up slightly, then lowered.","He nodded, responding in a tone between that of a teenager and a grown man, crisp and straightforward, \"Sure.\"","With just this simple exchange, a certain tacit understanding rapidly formed between this \"father and son\".","Qi Shaobai knew this was the real coming of age gift his \"dad\" had prepared for him.","In the past, Qi Mo didn't have the habit of celebrating occasions, and rarely used certain actions to give special meaning to a particular day.","Until a few days ago.","One night before bed, he saw Sheng Mumu frowning at her phone, mumbling to herself,","\"So hard to decide, what kind of gift would an eighteen year old brat like...\"","\"Can't not give him anything.\"","\"But what to give? So hard to decide...\"","Sheng Mumu rested her cheek on her palm, tapping her chin as she seriously pondered...","In that moment, Qi Mo suddenly realized.","As Qi Shaobai's \"dad\" now, shouldn't he also give something to mark this coming of age day?","To give the ordinary day a sense of ritual, like she did.","It was almost instantaneous.","He decided what to use as the gift.","Qi Mo thought back to his own eighteenth birthday.","On the day he came of age, his parents had gone out of town to take care of a sick relative, leaving him home alone.","On the way back, passing the small shop at the alley entrance, he had only wanted to buy a bottle of mineral water, but his attention was caught by the beer in the cooler.","When checking out, on impulse he grabbed two cans and put them on the counter.","Back home, he climbed up to the rooftop.","The rooftop of the old housing complex had the smell of dry cement bricks.","In the evening breeze, accompanied by the brick smell and scents of cooking drifting up from downstairs,","He drank the two cans of beer in one go.","Raising his hand to the pitch black night sky, as if toasting.","In his heart, he said to his parents and sister who had passed away,","\"After today, I'll be eighteen. Don't worry, you don't have to think of me anymore.\"","Qi Shaobai closing his bedroom door pulled Qi Mo's thoughts back to the present.","The darkness in Qi Mo's eyes gradually dispersed, the corners crinkling up slightly.","He lifted his sharp, handsome jaw toward the second floor balcony.","Stepping forward, fingers loosely curled around the beer cans, he said to Qi Shaobai,","\"Let's go, kid.\""]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: You Big Man find you","paragraphs":["The night was quiet, and the sky resembled a canvas soaked in ink.","Occasionally, a gentle breeze brushed by.","On the terrace, an empty beer can lay on the small table.","Mr. Zhang, the butler, attentively brought chilled glasses for Mr. Qi Shaobai and Young Master Qi Mo.","He wanted them to have the best beer-drinking experience.","However, neither Qi Shaobai nor Qi Mo used the glasses.","They had some slices of ham and peanuts instead.","Qi Shaobai leaned against the terrace railing, his hands resting on it, holding a can of beer. The breeze brushed over his broad shoulders.","Qi Mo sat on an outdoor chair, crossing his long legs lazily, his posture relaxed. His distinct knuckles flexed.","With a crisp sound, he effortlessly pulled open the tab with one hand.","He brought the beer to his lips, tilted his head back, took a sip, and felt a slight roll in his throat.","Both father and son were not talkative by nature.","Most of the time, they clinked their glasses in silence.","Occasionally, they exchanged some laughter.","Qi Shaobai felt an unprecedented sense of ease.","He used to think of his father as rigid and serious.","He had never noticed this relaxed side of him.","The glass door of the terrace was left open, and laughter from the living room faintly drifted up.","Sheng Mumu accompanied Grandma in the living room, watching TV.","On the screen, a compilation of sketches from past Spring Festival Galas was playing...","From the TV came the familiar lines: \"Imperial Court Jade Liquor—\"","\"A hundred cups!\" Sheng Mumu and Grandma spontaneously completed the next line.","Then, they looked at each other and burst into laughter.","Grandma: \"Mumu, you've even watched such an old sketch?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Not only watched it, I can recite it backward.\"","As the words fell, the laughter grew louder.","It floated up to the second-floor terrace.","Qi Mo tilted his head slightly, a faint smile appearing at the corner of his lips.","\"Dad, shall I go get more beer?\"","Qi Shaobai placed the empty beer can on the table, still wanting more.","Just at that moment, the sound of a sketch came from downstairs.","\"One cup opens your appetite, two cups won't harm your kidneys—\"","Sheng Mumu couldn't help but sing the second half, her voice clear and pleasant, with a comical tone:","\"Three cups, five cups, down the hatch, guaranteeing your rosy cheeks~\"","Qi Mo's eyes sparkled as he nodded at Qi Shaobai. \"Sure.\"","As Qi Shaobai's footsteps faded as he ran downstairs, Qi Mo leaned back in his chair, slowly tilting his head up to gaze at the dark sky.","The sharp jawline softened inch by inch.","His voice turned low, hoarse, and gentle.","\"Qi Shaobai has grown up. You can rest assured.\"","He said this to his sister Gu Wan in the sky.","Another wave of joyful laughter drifted up from downstairs.","The man's eyes flickered slightly.","More intense and profound than the night without stars and moonlight.","A tender and lingering glow swirled in his eyes.","\"I'm doing well too...\"","The second half of the unspoken sentence remained in his heart.","Because she was there.","*","The next day.","As soon as Sheng Mumu arrived at the company early in the morning, Cheng Zhuo came running towards her with a bright smile.","\"Sis, I have good news.\"","Sheng Mumu kept walking, heading towards the office. She swiftly opened the door and hung her bag and light jacket on the hanger.","\"What good news?\"","Cheng Zhuo's face was filled with excitement as he spoke rapidly, \"Financial Weekly wants to interview you.\"","Sheng Mumu paused for half a second, not understanding. She sat down on the chair and asked, \"Is that considered good news?\"","According to what she knew, there have been numerous recent special reports in the magazine media promoting self-confidence. Most of them were handled by Cheng Zhuo. She had also sporadically participated in a few interviews, so she didn't think there was anything different about being interviewed for the \"Finance\" weekly magazine.","Cheng Zhuo: \"Sis, you don't know, but the \"Finance\" weekly magazine releases an annual ranking list at the end of each year. It's selected by authoritative figures in the industry. In previous years, CEOs of companies on the list have always been highly favored by major investment institutions in the following year. It's a great opportunity for business expansion and growth.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked and continued listening to Cheng Zhuo.","Cheng Zhuo: \"And starting from the third quarter, the monthly feature interviews are often seen as strong contenders for the list, like nominations.\"","Upon hearing this, Sheng Mumu became excited and leaned forward slightly.","\"So, you mean I have become a candidate for the \"Finance\" weekly magazine's annual ranking list?\"","Cheng Zhuo nodded confidently, his eyes burning with excitement. \"Yes! That's exactly what I mean!\"","As soon as the words fell, Sheng Mumu pushed her chair back and stood up, placing her hands on the table, unable to believe it, murmuring to herself while pinching her own face.","\"I can actually make it onto such a prestigious list? No way.\"","\"Ouch~ It hurts. It's not a dream.\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"Sis, I'll compile the interview questions asked by the \"Finance\" weekly magazine over the past decade and send them to you to prepare in advance.\"","\"Thank you.\" Sheng Mumu raised her eyebrows, feeling pleased.","Cheng Zhuo smiled and said, \"Sis, it's not a trouble. It's part of my responsibility.\"","Sheng Mumu sat back down, in a great mood, gazing at Cheng Zhuo's deep dimples. Suddenly, she remembered something and spoke up.","\"Cheng Zhuo, recently, it's become more and more natural for you to call me 'sis.' A while ago, the administrative assistant from the tech company downstairs, Ay, bumped into me in the elevator and asked if it was really you calling me 'sis.' She wanted your WeChat contact.\"","Upon hearing Sheng Mumu's words, Cheng Zhuo was taken aback.","\"How did you answer her, sis?\"","Sheng Mumu smiled. \"How else could I answer? I told her that you have a crush on a girl you're currently talking to.\"","She thought Cheng Zhuo was great in all aspects and a perfect match for Qiao Li, so she selfishly didn't give Ay Cheng Zhuo's WeChat contact.","\"No.\" Cheng Zhuo's expression became somewhat nervous as he said, \"I meant, regarding what she said about us seeming like siblings.\"","\"Hmm?\" Sheng Mumu looked puzzled, her eyes fixed on him. \"If we seem like it, then we seem like it. There's no need to specially answer that.\"","Cheng Zhuo curled his hand at his side, as if making a big decision, and looked directly at Sheng Mumu.","\"Sis, actually...\"","Just as Sheng Mumu noticed Cheng Zhuo's sudden change in tone, she raised her gaze. \"Yes?\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"Actually, I have a sister who is the same age as you, and even the character 'Mu' is in her name.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't think too much of it, finding it coincidental, and raised her eyebrows lightly.","\"Oh? Really, that's quite a coincidence.\"","Cheng Zhuo clenched his fist nervously, \"But she—\"","\"Your boss is looking for you, your boss is looking for you, your boss is looking for you—\"","Before he could finish his sentence, an extremely abrupt phone ringtone interrupted him.","The sound came from Cheng Zhuo's pants pocket.","Sheng Mumu was taken aback.","Sheng Mumu had no idea that this ringtone was exclusively set by Cheng Zhuo for his older brother.","When spoken in Cantonese, it sounded urgent, stern, and also a bit playful.","Cheng Zhuo had mustered up courage for a long time, only to let it all drain away in an instant.","He reached for his phone.","On the screen, the caller ID displayed the name \"Cheng Xin\" flashing.","Just seeing his brother's name made him feel a sense of nervousness, as if he was being summoned.","Ever since he was very young, his fear of his older brother surpassed even that of his school teachers.","After hastily saying a few words to Sheng Mumu, he hurriedly went outside to answer the call.","He pressed the answer button.","Cheng Zhuo's voice was timid and weak:","\"Brother...\"","It didn't mean \"big boss\" in the literal sense, it was just the way people from the small southern city where he grew up communicated in Cantonese.","\"Big boss\" actually meant \"older brother.\"","Through the receiver, Cheng Xin, the CEO of Fangcheng Group, had a mature and deep voice that didn't match his age.","His tone was full of reprimand.","\"How much longer do you plan to stay in Jing City?\""]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: My Wife urges me Home.","paragraphs":["In the evening, Sheng Mumu returned to Xiyu Yuetin.","As she bent down to change her shoes, her phone vibrated.","She received a WeChat message from Qi Mo.","\"I have a friend's dinner tonight, won't be back for dinner.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a few seconds.","What is she doing?","Should she inform her?","With a smile, Sheng Mumu tapped the screen and replied, \"One point for your gentlemanly behavior.\"","Just after she sent the message, her lips gently pursed.","Her long lashes concealed the faint flicker in her eyes as she added another message:","\"One point for your likability.\"","On the other side,","Qi Mo was on her way to the dinner gathering.","When she saw Sheng Mumu's message, her chest trembled slightly, and her laughter became low.","Her slender fingertips hovered above the screen as she pressed the reply button:","\"Are you so cautious with giving points? Should the referee consider it again?\"","Sheng Mumu was still changing her shoes when she noticed her phone lighting up, so she sat on the shoe-changing stool.","Leaning against the soft cushion behind her, she opened the chat box and arched her eyebrows suddenly.","The man in the back seat of the luxury car had been staring at his phone.","After a short sound effect of \"xu,\" the screen received her message:","\"This contestant, if you say more, points will be deducted.\"","In the villa,","Zhang Housekeeper stood by with hands behind his back, wearing an expression that said, \"I understand everything.\"","He handed over a warm towel and wiped his wife's hands properly.","Sheng Mumu was about to take the warm towel when a new message arrived.","Her hand, still in mid-air, paused and then retreated as she lit up her phone.","Qi Mo: \"No, even one point is a point. I'll slowly accumulate them.\"","Unable to help herself, Sheng Mumu imagined how Qi Mo would sound saying this sentence in his deep voice.","Just the thought of it made her clear eyes curve, and her dimples deepen slightly.","It's a bit funny.","At this moment, footsteps came from behind.","Dragging and lazy.","Just by listening, she knew that Qi Shaobai had returned.","Sheng Mumu changed into her indoor slippers and turned her head to look.","\"Xiao Qi, your dad has a business dinner tonight, and I have a big plan. I invite you to join.\"","Qi Shaobai, with a backpack slung over one shoulder, furrowed his brow in alertness upon hearing her words.","\"What plan?\"","The more serious Sheng Mumu appeared, the more he felt that something was amiss.","Last time, when she received that stack of test papers, her expression was almost the same.","Thinking of this, Qi Shaobai wanted to slip back into his room.","Departing from his usual laziness, he quickly changed his shoes and headed inside.","Casually, he tossed out a remark:","\"I'll go put my backpack away.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyebrow arched, seeing through Qi Shaobai's clumsy little tricks.","Normally, when he came back, Qi Shaobai would casually throw his backpack onto the sofa and head straight to the dining room.","But today, he suddenly had to put his backpack away.","Such poor acting!","\"Come back!\" Sheng Mumu suddenly called out.","Her tone wasn't heavy, but it carried enough seriousness to make Qi Shaobai's footsteps pause, and he turned his head leisurely.","On that cold and aloof face,","At this moment, it looked innocent, vulnerable, and pitiful.","Sheng Mumu slowed her speech, using a coaxing tone:","\"Xiao Qi, isn't it turning towards autumn now?\"","Qi Shaobai didn't understand the meaning of her opening statement.","The less he understood, the stronger his sense of caution became. He subconsciously tilted his neck back, looking at her with suspicion.","Sheng Mumu continued, her tone gentle and persuasive:","\"The weather is gradually getting cooler. Our bodies know this signal and will start storing fat in advance to prepare for winter.\"","Qi Shaobai raised an eyebrow, \"So?\"","Sheng Mumu was taken aback and took a shallow breath, \"I heard your English has improved, no need to show off right off the bat.\"","Qi Shaobai suppressed his smile, \"Fair enough.\"","Sheng Mumu continued to explain her \"grand plan\":","\"So, I was thinking, why don't we learn from your dad and make good use of the gym at home? Exercise twice a week... or maybe once a day?\"","\"You want to lose weight?\" Qi Shaobai hit the nail on the head, then thought for a moment and added, \"You're not even overweight. Why bother losing weight? Besides, I don't need to lose weight either. I'm just too lazy to move.\"","\"Exercise! Exercise! It's not about losing weight,\" Sheng Mumu squinted her eyes and looked him up and down, \"Haven't you noticed that you've been mentally exhausted from your studies lately?\"","\"...\" Qi Shaobai, \"...huh?\"","Is that so?","Where did he become mentally exhausted???","Sheng Mumu wasn't making it up. She had recently noticed that Qi Shaobai's mental state was not as good as it was during the summer vacation.","During the summer vacation, Qi Shaobai would often go out to play basketball with Wei Zhaonan.","But since the start of their senior year, she hadn't seen him go out to play basketball once.","After evening self-study, he would lock himself in his room. The only time he would briefly come out was to go to the kitchen for drinks or snacks.","So, on her way back, Sheng Mumu seriously considered that Qi Shaobai must join the exercise routine.","Studies are important, but physical health is even more important.","Sheng Mumu nodded to herself.","Hmm.","It definitely wasn't because she weighed herself in the morning and found that she had gained two pounds.","It wasn't because she found exercising alone too boring and wanted a workout partner.","Seeing that Qi Shaobai still had the expression of \"I don't want to move,\" Sheng Mumu didn't force him like a stepmother would. Instead, she tried a different approach to persuade him.","\"Classmate Xiaoqi, think about it. In a way, exercising regularly every week is a display of self-discipline. Once a person achieves self-discipline, what else in life can defeat them?\"","\"That's not it, from a certain perspective,\" Qi Shaobai remained unmoved and shrugged his shoulders.","With confidence, he said, \"Not maintaining self-discipline is also a form of self-discipline.\"","Sheng Mumu: ...","Wow...","That...","Makes sense.","For a moment, she couldn't find a reasonable argument to refute him.","Qi Shaobai's eyebrows lifted confidently as he stared at her, conveying through his expression, \"I told you I was right, didn't I?\"","Sheng Mumu's temple throbbed, and she sighed helplessly.","She finally understood why Qi Shaobai always lost points in reading comprehension exams.","With this kind of thought process, it's a miracle to get it right.","Since reasoning and persuasion didn't work, Sheng Mumu had to resort to her last move.","\"Well then, a forced melon doesn't taste sweet.\"","She casually shrugged her shoulders, took a step towards the dining room, and said casually, \"It's okay, I'll talk to your dad and let him know that the plan to take you to the gym is off.\"","\"Huh? Dad said he wants to take me to the gym?\" Qi Shaobai was taken aback by her words and caught up with her steps.","\"Yeah,\" Sheng Mumu didn't even turn her head, \"I'm just the messenger. Since you don't want to, there's no need to force it.\"","With that, she nonchalantly turned her head and glanced at him, \"Actually, I think your dad's proposal is quite boring. Who's as... dedicated as him?\"","\"Fine,\" Qi Shaobai interrupted Sheng Mumu, \"I'll go.\"","Sheng Mumu stopped in her tracks and turned her body completely towards Qi Shaobai. \"Hmm?\"","Qi Shaobai averted his gaze, playfully and meekly casting his eyes upwards.","Raising his chin slightly, he said, \"Now that I think about it, what you said makes sense. I have been looking a bit thin lately, like I'm not in human form.\"","Sheng Mumu suppressed a laugh, putting on a show with a serious expression. \"Alright, I'll go along with it.\"","After finishing dinner and returning to the bedroom, Sheng Mumu remembered that she wanted to talk to Qi Mo about this matter.","She sent him a message.","\"Guess what? Without your knowledge, I've arranged a task for you.\"","*Coyly biting a handkerchief.jpg*","At the dining table, the man was toasting and exchanging cups with his business partners.","From the corner of his eye, he noticed his phone light up.","After reading the message, Qi Mo didn't put the phone back on the table. Instead, he pocketed it and calmly set down his wine glass.","Those around him noticed his actions and turned their gazes towards him.","A faint smile appeared on Qi Mo's handsome face as he politely addressed his longtime friends in the business field, \"Sorry, guys. You enjoy yourselves, I have to leave first...\"","The people at the table had never seen Qi Mo, who was usually aloof and distant, show such an expression, one could even call it a \"smug\" expression.","They exchanged bewildered glances. They saw Qi Mo stand up and walk towards the private room.","A soft and airy voice drifted down.","\"My wife is urging me to go home.\""]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: I wanted to eat melon, And I ate it on my head.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu explained the situation to Qi Mo on the phone.","She didn't mention that she wanted to take Qi Shaobai along to exercise together.","Instead, she asked in return:","\"President Qi, you wouldn't want young Qi to become weak and frail at a young age due to the pressure of academics, right?\"","\"Anyway, you go to the gym three times a week. Taking a day or two off to bring along little Qi should be easy for you, right?\"","\"I happen to have free time recently. I'll tag along and observe.\"","The black Rolls Royce Phantom glided down the road.","In the back seat, Qi Mo's handsome face was illuminated by the faint glow of a phone screen.","His eyes narrowed as he suddenly recalled a scene he saw last night.","Last night, when he came out of the bathroom after a shower, Sheng Mumu was standing with her hands on her hips, head lowered, and gaze fixed on the scale, looking vexed.","Then, as if angry with herself, she lightly kicked the scale.","Murmuring: \"This scale is broken.\"","Recalling what he saw last night, Qi Mo quickly guessed Sheng Mumu's intention of asking Qi Shaobai to exercise together.","Although he figured it out, he didn't expose it.","Delight flickered across his attractive eyes, and the corners of his lips slowly curved up.","For no reason, a hint of amusement surfaced as he tapped to reply.","In the villa master bedroom.","Sheng Mumu sat leisurely on the canopy bed, scrolling through her phone.","A headband held her long hair back, revealing her fair and smooth forehead.","In the middle of the headband was a small flower ornament that swayed as she lowered her head to look at her phone.","Ten minutes ago, she only intended to buy a new workout outfit.","Unexpectedly, ten minutes later, her shopping cart was filled with all kinds of fitness gadgets.","A sports water bottle, knee pads, resistance bands, foam rollers, yoga blocks, fascia blasters...","After successfully checking out, she leaned back in satisfaction.","She thought to herself: This must be what they call students with poor grades buying lots of stationary.","Just then, her phone buzzed with a vibration.","She rolled over, reached out and grabbed her phone.","Seeing the message, she froze and slowly blinked her eyes.","Qi Mo: \"Will completing this task increase favorability?\"","Sheng Mumu: ???","What kind of person is this.","So impatient to cash in.","Simply outrageous.","While mocking in her mind, she couldn't help smiling.","Instead of replying with a text, she pressed the voice message button.","Bringing the phone close to her lips, she responded word for word.","In the luxury car backseat.","Seeing the little voice message bubble pop up on the screen, a flash of delight crossed Qi Mo's face.","He lightly tapped play.","-\"Don't be so calculative.\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","The phone volume wasn't high, so he didn't hear clearly.","Or perhaps his brain subconsciously refused to accept it.","He turned the volume up a few notches and played it again.","Sheng Mumu's clear, decisive voice, tinged with laughter, transmitted from the receiver once more:","-\"Don't be so calculative.\"","Qi Mo paused briefly: \"......\"","He heard it clearly this time.","Not only him, even driver Xiao Wang in the front seat heard it clearly.","In the silent car, that \"Don't be so calculative\" sounded especially loud.","Xiao Wang held his breath, pupils trembling, gripping the steering wheel tightly.","He secretly glanced in the rearview mirror.","The powerful man's cold, handsome side profile gradually softened.","The slanting streetlamp light outside the window shone in.","It illuminated his faintly upturned lips and seemingly smiling expression clearly.","Xiao Wang quickly retracted his gaze.","He suppressed the shock in his heart.","Xiao Wang understood.","So this was President Qi's position in the family...","*","A week later, Sheng Mumu received a call from Jiang Doctor.","Jiang Doctor told Sheng Mumu that her mentor, who researched tumor prevention, had returned to China.","\"Mrs. Qi, let me know when you're free to bring granny in for another detailed exam.\"","Sheng Mumu answered without hesitation: \"I'm free now. Is it convenient on your end?\"","The call went silent for a few seconds. Jiang Doctor didn't expect it to be so soon. She laughed:","\"Yes, convenient. I'll arrange time with my mentor right away to keep the afternoon open.\"","\"Thank you for the trouble.\" Sheng Mumu replied gratefully.","Jiang Doctor: \"No trouble at all.\"","After hanging up, Sheng Mumu immediately grabbed her coat and left the company.","She drove back to Xiyue Courtyard, picked up granny who was cooling off with a fan in the yard, and went to her mentor's research institute.","The procedure was much more complex than last time.","With cutting-edge tumor prevention techniques, Jiang Doctor's mentor examined granny extremely thoroughly without overlooking any details.","The results would take a few days.","When leaving the institute, Sheng Mumu was worried that today's exhaustive examination would make granny suspicious and worried about her health.","To prevent the elderly from overthinking, she didn't drive straight home.","Instead, she called Qiao Li to meet up and accompany granny for dinner to distract her.","\"Sure.\" Qiao Li readily agreed over the phone.","Sheng Mumu detoured to Qiao Li's band practice room to pick her up.","Upon arriving, Sheng Mumu's gaze suddenly paused.","Apart from Qiao Li, there was another familiar face walking out of the practice room.","\"Sis——\"","Cheng Zhuo's enthusiastic greeting already floated over before he got closer.","Sheng Mumu lowered her eyes to glance at the car clock.","Wow.","Just half an hour after getting off work.","This brat Cheng Zhuo actually rushed straight to Qiao Li after work!","What's the deal with these two...","Sheng Mumu's gossip spirit raged fiercely.","As Cheng Zhuo approached, he bent down to peek into the car and greeted granny.","\"Granny, I'm Cheng Zhuo. I've heard sis and Li Li mention you. I'm finally meeting you and it feels so familiar.\"","Cheng Zhuo had a warm and straightforward personality, and a bright, fervent voice.","Along with his signature dimpled smile.","He was the type elders adored.","Although it was Qi Granny's first time meeting Cheng Zhuo, she also felt an instant connection. Wrinkles gathered on her face in a kindly smile.","Sheng Mumu was dumbfounded...","Cheng Zhuo's social skill...","No.","It should be called social rampancy.","Even more adept than her.","Truly the next wave surpasses the last.","On the drive to the restaurant, throughout the meal, Cheng Zhuo kept the conversation flowing.","Chatting with granny, making her chuckle uncontrollably simply by listening to his jokes.","She seemed to completely forget about the physical exam that afternoon, distracted by Cheng Zhuo's amusing stories.","When no one was looking, Sheng Mumu quietly took out her phone to type a message.","When she put her phone away, Qiao Li's phone on the table lit up.","Thinking it was her bandmates chatting in their group, she didn't take much notice. She took a sip of her drink and picked up her phone.","\"Pfff—\"","The drink went down the wrong pipe. She coughed violently, pounding her chest.","Seeing this, Cheng Zhuo immediately handed her some napkins, asking with concern, \"Are you okay?\"","Qiao Li waved her hand to indicate she was fine.","Cheng Zhuo said uneasily, \"Your ears are coughing red. How can you be fine?\"","The instant Cheng Zhuo's gaze shifted, Qiao Li quickly turned off her phone screen.","The message Sheng Mumu sent her was—","\"Li Li, consider it carefully if you encounter a filial man who can make elders happy. wink.jpg\"","After the little commotion settled, Cheng Zhuo and granny resumed their chat.","Only then did Qiao Li secretly reply under the table:","\"Sis-in-law, is this why you chose my cousin from the vast sea of people?\"","Sheng Mumu was eating mango ice at the moment. Seeing the reply, her eyes froze, the ice instantly chilled her teeth.","Yet her cheeks were suffused with warmth.","Sheng Mumu: ......","Trying to eat melon but getting hit on the head instead..."]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Qi Mo Happy House, Sheng Mu Mu Execution Site","paragraphs":["Gym.","In different people's eyes, it has different meanings.","For example, it can be called Qi Mo's Happy House.","It can also be called Sheng Mumu's Execution Ground.","As for Qi Shaobai, two hours at the gym is a father-son tacit understanding bureau.","After an hour, Sheng Mumu was already done for.","Panting on the floor in a sprawl.","\"I'm dying, tell me quickly, are my legs still under my waist?\"","Qi Mo was dressed in all black workout clothes, looking more casual and relaxed than a suit.","The T-shirt and sweatpants were loose styles, vaguely outlining his sturdy physique.","He strode over to Sheng Mumu with his long legs.","Looking down at her with a smile:","\"Don't worry, they're still there.\"","Sheng Mumu breathed a sigh of relief at his words, panting as she closed her eyes to rest.","Qi Mo bent down, reaching out his sculpted, powerful arm towards her.","The distance between them lessened.","His low voice rang out:","\"Break time's over, get up.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly opened her eyes, colliding with Qi Mo's pitch-black pupils.","She had always thought Qi Mo's voice was low and magnetic, very nice to listen to.","But now, it sounded to her like a demon's whisper.","Frightening.","Too frightening.","Before she could make up an excuse to escape, Qi Mo had already leaned down to grasp her wrist.","With the stern demeanor of an instructor, his tone had softened somewhat:","\"Just two more sets left.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","She took a shallow breath in resignation, allowing him to pull her up gently.","Encouraging herself mentally:","You chose this! Sheng Mumu.","A decision made must be seen through, even if crawling!","Nearby, Qi Shaobai glanced their way, averting his gaze as he silently shook his head.","He couldn't help but mutter to himself:","It's just working out, yet they have to stick together.","Tsk tsk tsk.","Silly adults.","The next day, Sheng Mumu felt like her limbs didn't belong to her.","Walking on flat ground was still alright, but going down stairs nearly killed her.","She held onto the railing, inching down step by step.","With each step, her leg nerves felt twisted and tingling.","This scene was witnessed by Qi Shaobai, who had just exited his room to go to school.","Qi Shaobai stood in place, still nibbling on half a piece of toast.","He hesitated for a few seconds, reaching into his backpack.","At the same time, he took a few steps forward.","Sheng Mumu was surprised, realizing what he intended to do.","Emotion welled up in her eyes instantly.","Good boy, he's going to come help her down the stairs?","The child has grown up!","It really made this \"old lady\" gratified.","She already had her hand half extended, but saw him stop at the top of the stairs.","Only to see, Qi Shaobai took out his phone from his backpack.","After tapping a few times, he held it up.","\"Click—\"","Sheng Mumu: \"............????\"","Having found the optimal shooting angle, Qi Shaobai nodded satisfactorily and looked to the screen.","Then he slung on his backpack, turned around, and left.","Without looking back, he waved his phone.","And threw over his shoulder: \"I'll send the photo to you on WeChat.\"","The boy's voice echoed in the spacious, empty mansion.","Sheng Mumu: \"............\"","A myriad of curses flew through her mind in multiple languages!","However, Qi Shaobai sent another message before she could fire off her angry words:","\"Wow! Rare historical image of early human domestication of the limbs!\"","Sheng Mumu's fingers froze: .........","Both exasperated and amused.","What a silly boy.","Can't believe he's nearly eighteen...","She pursed her lips.","Thinking perhaps it was Qi Shaobai's traumatic childhood that led to his overly gloomy personality, and now he had finally been set free, even to the point he couldn't rein himself in.","Viewing it this way, her heart inexplicably softened.","Too lazy to quibble with the brat.","She forcibly slapped her thigh to vent her frustration.","But as soon as her hand made contact, the soreness and tingling pain radiated from her thigh.","With the point of impact at the center, the stabbing sensation quickly spread through her body.","Oh boy...","The pain left her speechless, only able to curse silently.","Once the worst had passed.","She suddenly thought of something, frowning.","Wait a minute.","Why did Qi Shaobai's message seem so familiar???","Had she done something similar before?","*","Three days later, Beijing No. 1 Middle School's art festival was held as scheduled.","According to tradition, all classes were canceled after dinner today.","After eating, the students carried chairs to the sports field under the teachers' organization.","In fact, Beijing No. 1 Middle School had several indoor gymnasiums that could be used for the art festival gala.","But the students unanimously felt that outdoors had a better atmosphere.","Especially after nightfall, the stage lights accompanied by the stuffy evening breeze on the sports field was particularly atmospheric.","An indescribable feeling that could vaguely be called \"youth\" or \"unrestraint\".","Even if they got bitten by mosquitoes, it was worth it.","The school respected the students' opinions, only requiring that: they must carry their own chairs.","Not only their own, but also prepare chairs for the parents coming to attend the art festival.","Evening.","The setting sun dyed the horizon crimson fire.","The clouds were gilded with golden edges, drifting by gently.","On the campus paths lined with camphor trees on both sides.","Students walked in groups of three or two, chatting while carrying chairs.","Qi Shaobai and Wei Zhaonan each held a chair, strolling lazily.","Wei Zhaonan lifted his chair slightly, asking casually:","\"Qi Shao, you're going to show off your Tai Chi Sword later right?\"","Qi Shaobai shot him a glare, \"It's called performing Tai Chi Sword.\"","Wei Zhaonan: \"Oh, showing off.\"","Though Qi Shaobai's hands were restrained, his legs were not.","He quickened his pace by two steps, going to kick Wei Zhaonan.","Wei Zhaonan shifted his butt to the side, nimbly and adeptly dodging.","Qi Shaobai gave him an annoyed look, too lazy to follow up with another kick.","At this moment, more important than quipping with Wei Zhaonan, was to mentally review the Thirty-Two Tai Chi Sword Forms again.","He absolutely could not embarrass Grandma Tai during their joint performance."]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: He Wants to keep This moment private.","paragraphs":["The setting sun sank below the horizon, and the sky took on a clear, pale blue-grey hue.","A crescent moon peeked in and out of sight.","As the stage lights came on, the students who had been waiting on the field for some time erupted into raucous cheers.","Many students had bought whistles and glow sticks.","The host had barely uttered the first syllable when the glow sticks were waved and the cheering squad blew their whistles.","Backstage, Qi Shaobai had already changed into his costume.","Hearing the host's voice coming from the field, he took a deep breath.","\"Little one, feeling nervous?\"","Grandma drew the tai chi sword from its sheath, asking as she waved it around a few times.","Her relaxed, untroubled expression contrasted sharply with Qi Shaobai's tense look.","Qi Shaobai: \"Not nervous.\"","Grandma smiled silently and rapped his back with the sword sheath:","\"Back straight.\"","At her words, Qi Shaobai straightened his lazy spine and rolled his shoulders.","He then peered out from behind the stage curtain as if nothing had happened.","Searching for his dad and stepmom amongst the vast crowd.","Even with so many parents here today to see the arts festival, Qi Shaobai spotted them right away.","Sheng Mumu held a bag of snacks in her hand, spearing a dumpling with a skewer and popping it into her mouth, her cheeks instantly bulging out.","It looked to be fried crab apple dumplings from the street behind the school.","Qi Shaobai glanced away.","He saw his dad leisurely removing the wrapper from a disposable straw.","He also held a milk tea in his hand, naturally passing it to the right after inserting the straw.","Sheng Mumu took the milk tea, smiling at her father-in-law as she took a big sip.","\"Did you see your dad and Mumu?\"","Grandma's voice sounded from behind.","Qi Shaobai turned his head and answered truthfully, \"I saw them.\"","Grandma grasped Qi Shaobai's shoulder, standing on her toes and squinting into the crowd, \"Aren't they looking expectantly at the stage trying to find us?\"","Grandma squinted, straining to make out their faces.","But her eyes weren't what they used to be, and she gave up.","\"Um...\" Qi Shaobai scratched the back of his head, unsure how to respond.","He didn't know how to tell Grandma that his dad and stepmom showed no signs of anxious anticipation.","Instead, they were chatting happily while eating and drinking.","Just then, the curtain separating the backstage was lifted.","The teacher in charge of coordinating poked her head out and called loudly,","\"Students from Class 2 and Class 5 of 12th grade, get ready for your performance. Class 1 is going on stage now.\"","There was a flurry of activity backstage as everyone prepared their costumes, checked props, and got ready to perform.","Qi Shaobai cleverly changed the subject:","\"Grandma, shall we go over the moves again?\"","Grandma frowned in pretend anger.","\"You little one, you're this close to writing 'nervous' on your face. What are you afraid of? It's just a performance. Even if you mess up the moves, Grandma's here in front to lead you.\"","In the stands.","The host had just announced \"Class 1 of 12th Grade\" when Sheng Mumu couldn't wait to pass her unfinished milk tea to Qi Mo.","\"Hold this for me.\"","She then took out a small DV camcorder from her bag.","Qi Mo glanced over and reminded her:","\"It's not Class 4 yet.\"","\"I know,\" Sheng Mumu said as she adjusted the DV.","\"I'll record a short clip to test it out, get some practice in. I have to get the best shots of little Qi and Grandma later.\"","\"Mm,\" Qi Mo smiled, a soft spot in his heart suddenly warming up.","He nodded slowly, then asked,","\"Do you need my help?\"","Sheng Mumu looked up, meeting his gaze, and reflexively handed over the DV camera.","Without an ounce of pretense, she smiled, eyes curving.","\"Yes.\"","To get the best shots, she had purposely not brought an SLR or mirrorless camera today.","The vintage quality of DV footage went perfectly with a high school campus.","But she still wasn't very familiar with all the function keys.","Since someone had volunteered, she had no reason not to give him this chance to impress.","Qi Mo took the DV camera from her hand and after just a quick look and a few presses, figured out how to adjust the aperture and focus.","After a while, he tilted his head to the side.","The distance between them suddenly shrank.","His low, magnetic voice drifted gently to her ear, carried on the night breeze.","Patiently and meticulously, he told her which buttons to press.","To see the keys clearly, Sheng Mumu also scooted a little closer to him.","Earnestly focused, she kept nodding as she listened.","After a moment...","\"Was I clear enough, or do you need me to explain again?\"","Qi Mo suddenly lowered the DV camera and turned to ask.","At his words, Sheng Mumu instinctively looked over.","Her breath caught.","Qi Mo's handsome, sharp features were right before her eyes, the pitch dark pupils shimmering.","The air seemed frozen for a couple seconds.","Their noses were barely an inch apart.","She blinked blankly, long curled lashes fluttering, her body unconsciously tensing up.","The next second, Sheng Mumu jerked her neck back, widening the distance between them.","She took the DV camera from Qi Mo's hand and lowered her head to fiddle with it.","Her tone carried a hint of fluster as she spoke faster than usual:","\"You were clear, I'll try it myself.\"","Qi Mo let out a belated \"Mm\".","His hand was still extended, the DV camera no longer there.","Lingering on his palm was the ephemeral sensation from earlier, when her soft fingertips had brushed past as she hastily grabbed the camera.","He leaned back into his chair.","His posture seemed casual and lazy.","But only he knew.","His heart was pounding heavily against his chest.","Like a drum.","His gaze moved, then halted abruptly.","At the end of his line of sight were Sheng Mumu's faintly flushed earlobes.","Qi Mo's eyes darkened, lips quirking up ever so slightly.","His broad palm gradually tightened, then flipped over to rest lightly on his thigh.","Long lashes lowered, concealing the swirling emotions in his eyes.","Wanting to keep this moment private...","At that time, behind Beijing No. 1 High School.","Two girls followed the crowd walking in.","One girl with a bun grasped her companion's arm, as if afraid she would run away, and said:","\"Xia, you have to come with me, I don't dare to go alone.\"","Chi Xia's fair, unadorned face showed some hesitation.","\"I'll go with you, but we should at least think about what to say if the security guards catch us.\"","The girl with the bun was Xia's best friend. A few days ago, upon hearing Beijing No. 1 High School was holding an arts festival, she immediately started planning how to sneak in with the crowds.","Not for anything else — she just wanted to catch a glimpse of a boy she was quite interested in, whom she had met at an extracurricular class outside of school.","Last week, she found out he went to Beijing No. 1 High School after overhearing him mention to others that he would be performing the guitar at the arts festival.","Xia was dragged along purely because her bestie didn't want to go alone and needed moral support.","Just then, the speakers sounded with guitar strumming.","\"Let's not think about that now,\" the impatient bestie hurriedly wrapped her arm around Xia's and pulled her along, \"That might be him playing. Let's hurry up and run.\"","Before Xia could even respond, she was already being dragged by her bestie into the Beijing No. 1 High campus."]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: A Little Surprise","paragraphs":["When Sheng Mumu watched the footage she was using to practice her filming skills over and over again several times, she finally found the best filming angle. The host slowly walked onto the stage.","Laughing heartily as he announced:","\"Next up is the Tai Chi Sword performance by Class 12 Grade 3, performed by: Qi Shaobai—\"","\"And Qi Shaobai's grandma—\"","\"Let's give a round of applause for grandma!\"","The last sentence was an impromptu flourish by the host.","Grandma was the oldest among all the students' family members participating in the event.","The host's voice on the speakers stopped.","Suddenly, enthusiastic applause rang out from below the stage.","The glow sticks kept shaking.","Firstly, the students of Jing City No.1 Middle School had all received good education on respecting the elderly, so when an elderly person came on stage, they had to show their warmest support.","Secondly, Qi Shaobai was the most popular figure in the school, and the girls' cheers in the crowd were clearly louder than the boys'.","There were even many girls who secretly had a crush on Qi Shaobai, and had been waiting all night just for Qi Shaobai's performance.","Sheng Mumu had already squatted down in the best filming spot.","Hearing the host's introduction, she smiled radiantly and cheered excitedly:","\"Woo~~ Go for it~~\"","Her lively, melodious voice was all recorded by the video camera.","Qi Mo was holding her bag in his left hand, and the half-finished cup of milk tea in his right hand, standing behind her.","Also infected by the lively atmosphere, he said in a low, deep voice:","\"Go for it.\"","His voice wasn't very loud, and had a hint of gentle laughter.","Because he was close by, it was also recorded.","The next second.","The stage lights changed, and the spotlights swept towards the edge of the stage curtain.","Serene Tai Chi music sounded from the speakers all around, reverberating around the school field.","At the end of the spotlights, Qi Shaobai walked out slowly from backstage, arm in arm with Grandma.","When they reached the middle of the stage, the two tacitly turned to face the audience, and drew out their Tai Chi swords in sync, holding their fists against palms as they bowed slightly towards the audience.","Then, Grandma took a step forward, and stood diagonally in front of Qi Shaobai.","Following the rhythm of the music, they started wielding their swords.","Pushing hands, raising up, bow stance, looking back...","It was the same 32 Tai Chi Sword set.","But it had completely different styles in the hands of the old and the young.","Grandma's silver hair was stylishly permed into curls, looking especially good under the colorful stage lights.","Her moves were skilled and standard, softly yielding when needed, and crisp and decisive when force was required.","From her moves and postures, you couldn't see her actual age at all.","Qi Shaobai's lips were pressed in a straight line.","He had a serious and stubborn look.","Previously in school, the impression he always gave others was casual and lazy, seeming indifferent towards everything.","But today, even with the slow movements, each pose was executed decisively.","It had a kind of indescribable sense of grace and ease.","The girls' cheers below the stage had already completely drowned out the boys'.","When the performance ended, the applause was the loudest and most enthusiastic of the night.","After leaving the stage, the two of them changed out of their costumes, and sat together with Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo.","Sheng Mumu eagerly squeezed next to the old lady, and showed her the video she had just recorded.","\"Grandma, look, this is what I just recorded, I filmed you so well!\"","The old lady laughed loudly, and tilted her head back to look at the small screen of the video camera, as her eyes weren't good.","\"Filmed so nicely, Mumu really knows how to film.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes crinkled charmingly, and she spoke in a melodious, cheerful tone:","\"It's mainly because you look good, it's not that related to my filming skills. I only pressed the record button.\"","Qi Shaobai silently walked to his father's side instead.","Glancing over, he saw his father was still holding Sheng Mumu's bag and half-finished cup of milk tea.","Wanting to uphold the mentality of \"I'm grown up now, I should help adults share the load\", after hesitating for a few seconds, he asked:","\"Dad, shall I help you hold those?\"","Qi Mo looked towards Qi Shaobai, and chuckled softly, \"No need.\"","Qi Shaobai replied with an \"Oh\", and withdrew his gaze, turning his attention to the singing performance happening on stage.","Suddenly, he heard his father's steady, affirming voice beside him:","\"You performed well.\"","The teenager was stunned for a moment.","In his bright eyes, a smile gradually spread.","The arts festival performances went on for about three hours.","Nearing the last few acts, Grandma started yawning repeatedly.","Seeing this, Qi Mo got up from his seat.","Although Grandma hadn't spent a long time with Qi Mo, she understood this grandson very well.","He was a man of few words, and often used actions rather than speech.","Him standing up now must be because he saw her yawning sleepily, and wanted to offer to send her home.","And as expected, Qi Mo spoke.","\"Grandma, let me send you—\"","\"No need, don't leave early just to accompany me back.\" She had barely spoken a few words when Grandma waved her hand to stop him.","Lowering her voice, Grandma said to Qi Mo:","\"It's rare that the little one gets to enjoy himself properly on a day like this for the arts festival, since he's so busy studying intensively in his last year of high school. Let him have fun to his heart's content.\"","Qi Mo's tone was gentle: \"I'll go back with you, and let him stay here to have fun, it doesn't delay things.\"","Grandma: \"Oh you, when did you become such a nag?\"","Qi Mo didn't say anything more, just looked at Grandma with a gentle smile.","Grandma: \"Little Zhao and Little Fei are waiting in the car outside, let them send me back, you keep Little Mumu company.\"","Little Zhao and Little Fei were Grandma's chauffeur and personal caretaker. Now that Grandma was advanced in years, she was accompanied wherever she went.","Usually when she had nothing to do, they would wait in the car for her.","In the end, Qi Mo still couldn't persuade Grandma, and could only see her off as she was picked up by the caretakers' car.","After a while longer, the last performance of the arts festival ended.","On stage, the principal of 12th grade gave a closing speech as a representative:","\"The Jing City No. 1 Middle School Arts Festival has ended perfectly—\"","\"Let me say a few words—\"","He had barely finished speaking when the crowds below started getting restless.","Students in the last few rows were already standing up, horsing around noisily.","No one wanted to listen to a long speech from the most long-winded principal in the school.","\"Ahem—\" The principal cleared his throat meaningfully, and deliberately dragged out his words.","\"The school has prepared a little surprise for everyone today.\"","The students listlessly turned their gazes back to the stage.","It was quiet for just a few seconds below the stage.","In an instant, the hubbub sounded again.","It was as if the principal had just burped out that long string of words.","No one had high expectations for this \"surprise\" he mentioned.","After all, this principal had a track record.","He had once said he would prepare an \"Enrollment Gift\" for each current 10th grader.","The result was parents being called for \"Home-School Collaboration Gift Packs\".","Another time, he had led the new 7th graders on military training at an outdoor base.","One day, he suddenly said he understood the students were tired from training in the hot weather, so he specially picked a day to take them by bus to a nearby indoor sports stadium for training instead.","However, the day he chose just happened to pouring rain heavily.","The students could have gotten to rest in the dorms from training!!!","It was hard not to suspect the principal had checked the weather forecast beforehand on purpose to prank them.","Because of things like this, in the eyes of all the students from 7th to 12th grade, this principal would never appear as someone who truly wanted to give the students something nice.","A little surprise?","Better without it.","Suddenly.","A long, shrill sound rang out.","A streak of fire shot up into the night sky.","It exploded.","The pitch-black night was lit up in an instant."]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Fireworks Night","paragraphs":["Firelight tore through the ink-black night sky.","Fireworks, like shooting stars in reverse, blossomed open in the heavens.","Rays of light shot out brightly and colorfully.","At that moment, everyone on the school field looked up, faces illuminated.","Sounds of surprise could be heard all around.","It was obvious no one had expected the principal to actually keep his word this time.","This was a real surprise.","Many people took out their phones to take photos and record the moment.","Seeing this, Qi Shaobai's eyes suddenly shifted.","Going against the flow of people's gazes, he turned to look at his dad and stepmom.","The two of them stood side by side, heads tilted back looking at the sky.","Their eyes reflected the same shimmering light.","Qi Shaobai walked over and suddenly said:","\"Let me take a picture of you two.\"","Hearing his voice, Sheng Mumu looked over and saw Qi Shaobai had somehow made his way behind them already.","It looked like he wanted to take a photo of their silhouettes against the fireworks.","Before Sheng Mumu could respond, the steady, rich baritone of Qi Mo rang out next to her:","\"Okay.\"","The next second.","Sheng Mumu felt a warm, sturdy palm envelop her shoulder as Qi Mo put his arm around her. His other hand was tucked casually into his pant pocket as he gazed upwards.","It seemed perfectly natural for him to have his arm around her.","Sheng Mumu looked up and saw his refined, superior profile.","His nose was straight and proud, his jawline sharp and rugged.","Just then several bursts of fireworks shot into the air.","Their glow washed over his fair skin in layers of shimmering light.","In his deep eyes, pinpricks of light gathered and dispersed again.","Like stars falling into a lake.","Utterly captivating.","\"Look at the sky—\"","Without turning his head, the hand on Sheng Mumu's shoulder tightened slightly as he suddenly spoke, laughter evident in his voice:","\"—save ogling me for later.\"","Sheng Mumu's breath hitched as she saw the aura of the powerful man before her curl his lips up slowly.","The brief stab of guilt at being caught staring was gone in seconds.","The next moment, Sheng Mumu raised her hand.","\"Slap!\"","She lightly flicked the side of his neck.","Her tone was perfectly casual as she said:","\"There was a mosquito.\"","To cover up her embarrassment, she blurted out the first excuse that came to mind.","She wasn't looking at him, she was looking at a mosquito.","Having been slapped for no reason, Qi Mo's body stiffened in surprise and he froze for a few seconds.","He slowly turned his head to look at her.","Their gazes collided in midair.","Sheng Mumu blinked innocently, shadows swirling in her eyes.","She didn't back down one bit from his stare.","In the static moment.","Qi Mo's brows quirked up slightly, amusement entering his eyes, as he meaningfully nodded his chin.","His expression said he didn't believe her flimsy lie for a second, yet he wasn't going to call her out on it.","Of course Sheng Mumu could read him easily.","She raised her hand again.","Using her index finger, she poked his chin and gently pushed his head to face forward once more.","Her red lips parted lightly as she mimicked him:","\"Eyes skyward, ogle me later.\"","With that said, she too looked up at the fireworks overhead.","No more eye contact for this sly man.","Yet even without looking, she could feel the intensity of his gaze lingering on her face.","Scorching. Yearning.","Behind them.","Qi Shaobai the human tripod squatted, holding up his phone.","His thumb tapped furiously.","Taking continuous shots to capture this scene.","Just outside Jing City No.1 Middle School.","The limousine had just driven out of the school gates.","The old lady was leaning into the spacious seat, eyes closed in drowsiness.","Light snores drifted out softly.","Firework lights shone in through the car window, illuminating the old lady's sweet sleeping state clearly.","She smacked her lips a few times, shifting in her seat.","A faint smile appeared on her face.","She was dreaming of many long-ago memories—","A fifteen-year-old Qi Mo, just after his sister had passed away. The lean yet stalwart youth stood in the doorway of the hospital room.","Eyes rimmed red, lips pressed in a straight line as he gritted his teeth to keep the tears from falling.","She walked down the pungently sterile hallway of the hospital and embraced her grandson.","Gently consoling him:","\"Don't be afraid, you still have Grandma—\"","The boy finally couldn't hold back any longer. He buried his head in her arms as his shoulders started to shake.","Tears dropped down, splashing onto the tiled floor.","They also splashed into her heart, stirring up endless heartache.","She patted her grandson's back, \"Grandma will take care of your sister's child. Don't cry, don't be afraid.\"","The dreamscape skipped around in fragments.","Next, it suddenly transitioned to a summer afternoon.","The wind billowed the curtains outwards.","The old fan was juddering away, the TV replaying the midday news.","A series of urgent rings from the telephone startled her out of her doze.","She lazily picked up the old corded handset.","\"Grandma, I got in!\"","Delight spread across her face.","She heard her grandson's excited voice over the phone.","He was sharing the good news with her, promising that in the future he would definitely earn lots and lots of money to provide her and Xiaobudian with a comfortable life.","She had lived through more seasons than he had eaten bowls of rice.","How could she not see through his forced smile?","The scene sped up.","Flashes of her interactions with Xiaobudian over the years appeared.","She went to pick up Xiaobudian from school and heard him getting mocked by the brats from the class next door for not having parents.","Xiaobudian whipped his head around to glare at those boys, his gaze far too gloomy and cold for his age.","She was frying dumplings in the old house's kitchen. Xiaobudian came home from school and immediately grabbed for them without washing his hands first.","She frowned and pried open his hands, urging him to go wash up.","After that, Xiaobudian went to live with his uncle.","Whenever they video called, he would always laugh and say \"Don't worry Grandma.\"","But she had lived through more seasons than he had eaten bowls of rice.","How could she not see through his forced smile?","Suddenly, the colors in her mind shifted to warm tones.","The scene transitioned to the Jing City villa.","She sat at the exquisite, expensive dining table. Across from her were Xiaobudian and Dabudian.","In the span of seconds, their appearances gradually matured.","The grandson who once choked back tears in a hospital hallway became a man capable of shouldering a family.","The once gloomy and repressed great-grandson finally wore the carefree, unrestrained expression of an ordinary seventeen-year-old.","A slender figure came down the stairs of the mansion lightly.","She looked over.","Sheng Mumu bounded over brightly, pulling out the chair next to her and affectionately calling her:","\"Grandma~\"","The dreamscape stretched on and on.","Spanning over a decade.","Yet the limo had only passed a few blocks.","Inside were three private nurses.","Xiao Fei stole a concerned glance at the sleeping old lady.","She lowered her voice to say to the person beside her:","\"The old lady seems really happy today, even smiling in her sleep.\"","After the festivities, the school field of Jing City No.1 Middle School regained its tranquility.","School staff organized students to clean up.","The decorations on stage were removed one by one.","Students dutifully picked up chairs to return them to the auditorium.","Qi Shaobai declined his dad and stepmom's offer of help, insisting boastfully:","\"No need to help, I can carry all this back myself in one go. Meet you guys at the school back gate later, just wander around for now.\"","With that said, as if to prove his vitality, he picked up two chairs and jogged to catch up with Wei Zhaonan ahead.","He called out loudly to Wei Zhaonan: \"Hey, walk slower, wait for Daddy.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Qi Mo: \"...\"","The two exchanged a tacit glance.","They shook their heads silently.","Qi Shaobai was dropping all pretenses of propriety around them more and more...","It made them feel, well, not accustomed to it..."]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: Love Talk","paragraphs":["School playground.","The faint smell of rubber tracks mixed with the scent of autumn grass and trees floated in the air.","Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu strolled leisurely along the inside lane of the track.","A gentle evening breeze blew by.","Sheng Mumu closed her eyes comfortably, enjoying the cozy tranquility.","\"You're so annoying - so boring -\"","A slightly impatient shout suddenly came from afar.","Looking in the direction of the voice, towards the stage, two students arranging props started horsing around.","The boy took advantage of the girl's inattention and stuck the decorative ribbons he had just taken down onto the girl's back.","The girl noticed, grabbed a foam board from the props box, and chased after him to hit him.","The boy had a naughty expression, deliberately slowed down, but laughed when he was hit on the head.","Watching this, Sheng Mumu couldn't help but smile softly.","She felt the campus was so nice.","Youth was so nice too.","She slowed her pace, leisurely turning her head.","Looking at Qi Mo walking behind her with his hands behind his back, looking like an old cadre.","A trace of curiosity bubbled up in her mind.","Sensing her gaze, Qi Mo tilted his head to look over.","Qi Mo: \"?\"","His brow lifted lightly, a questioning look in his eyes.","Sheng Mumu had no intention of suppressing her curiosity. She asked directly:","\"Did you have someone you liked when you were a student?\"","Hearing this, Qi Mo's brow twitched. Without thinking, he said in a low voice:","\"No.\"","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips, blinking unbelievingly, and asked again:","\"What about unrequited crushes?\"","She held out her hand, making an inch gesture with her thumb and pinky.","\"Or even just a tiny bit of affection for someone?\"","Her hand gestures were too vivid. Qi Mo couldn't help but laugh softly, his eyes narrowing gently. He answered firmly and calmly:","\"Really none.\"","After his sister died harboring resentment from a failed relationship.","For a time, he was steadfast in believing that one didn't need a partner to live in this world.","Feelings would consume one's reason, bringing unnecessary complications to an otherwise tranquil life.","\"What a pity—\"","Sheng Mumu sighed languidly, turning her head to look ahead.","\"Missing out on young love during the best time for it.\"","As Sheng Mumu walked and talked, Qi Mo remained silent listening.","His gaze fell on their elongated shadows cast by the street lights.","His steps slowed, and he suddenly turned to look at her, his low voice asking:","\"It's not too late now.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't react, looking over puzzled, \"What?\"","Qi Mo's shoulders sank, his tone casual and composed:","\"What you said, the best time for romance, it's actually not too late even now.\"","His icy aura was completely gone.","The surrounding air seemed to be cloaked in a layer of gentleness.","The warm lamplight sculpted his features even more defined, his brow quirked up lightly.","Looking straight at Sheng Mumu, he said slowly:","\"I've seen a line before that I always think of, on the day I confessed to you.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Sheng Mumu was a little surprised by Qi Mo's sudden words.","Her fingers curled unconsciously by her side, eyes meeting his. She saw churning emotions in his dark pupils, growing increasingly heated.","Qi Mo's low, husky voice carried by the evening breeze reached her ears, reciting like a poem.","\"This is the first time I've liked someone of the opposite sex,","Like a secluded valley suddenly laid bare,","Great winds blow in ceaselessly.\"","He paused, and the aggressiveness he had always suppressed floated up in his darkened pupils.","His voice also took on a touch of petulance he'd never had before:","\"Sheng Mumu, once the valley is open it can't be shut again. You have to take responsibility.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","Buzz.","She felt something unnamed explode in her head.","Then the sound of bubbles rising.","Pop pop pop.","Then the small deer in her heart madly kicked up a dance.","Too noisy for her to think calmly.","How could this man be so smooth with words!","A faint blush crept up her cheeks unconsciously.","Warmth spread from her earlobes all the way to the roots behind her ears.","After a long pause, she lightly pursed her lips, averting her gaze.","As if a thought suddenly occurred to her, she took out her phone from her bag and walked several steps away.","Casually saying:","\"Wait for me, I have something to take care of right now, immediately.\"","As her voice fell, a fleeting darkness flashed through Qi Mo's deep eyes.","He murmured in acquiescence, standing aside with his hands clasped behind his back, his gaze wandering into the distance.","His posture was casual, but his heart felt like it was being squeezed by invisible hands.","Tightening ceaselessly.","Perhaps he shouldn't have said it like that.","Shouldn't have let her see that aggressive, possessive side of him.","Did it make her uncomfortable?","Did it...","Suddenly.","His phone vibrated a few times in his pants pocket.","He took it out and lit up the screen.","His gaze abruptly condensed.","It was a WeChat message from her:","\"Favorability +66\"","Qi Mo froze.","Pleasant surprise slowly rose in his eyes, and the corners of his mouth curved up unconsciously.","He swiftly raised his eyes to look at Sheng Mumu.","\"Ahem—\"","To hide her embarrassment, Sheng Mumu cleared her throat.","She quickly strode forward several steps.","Away from the lamplight it was darker.","But strangely, the blush on her ears seemed even more prominent.","She briskly turned around, awkwardly changing the subject:","\"Let's go, I want to buy ice cream at the school's back gate.\"","Right now, she felt a little hot.","Qi Mo's brow quirked lightly. He answered in his low voice:","\"Okay.\"","With his long legs, just a few steps brought him to her side.","The man who had just earned points seemed to be emboldened. His long arm reached forward to grasp her slender wrist.","Sheng Mumu's body stiffened slightly, only feeling the warm touch creep up her wrist inch by inch. She let him hold her hand as he wished.","But...","It was just her wrist he grasped, so why did it feel like her neck instead?","Her breathing inexplicably grew tight.","Sheng Mumu could clearly hear her own quickening heartbeat.","Relying on the last shreds of her prided clarity of mind, she pressed down the stirrings in her heart without revealing a thing.","She selfishly wanted to draw out this hazy ambiguity before it was brought to light.","She had always felt that falling in love should come from an irresistible moment.","One where no matter what, you just want to be with him.","She faintly sensed that moment approaching.","The winds in her heart.","Were already blowing uncontrollably toward the valley beside her.","[This is the first time I've liked someone of the opposite sex, Like a secluded valley suddenly laid bare, Great winds blow in ceaselessly. —A Ying]"]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Sheng Mu Mu Inner os: Man, Childish","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai took a shortcut to the back door of the school.","There was a big clock on the main building of the teaching building.","The hour hand pointed to ten o'clock.","Qi Shaobai dragged his lazy pace, playing with his cell phone as he walked.","\"Hey you, wait a minute, which class are you from?\"","Suddenly, a thick and puzzled voice came from not far away.","Qi Shaobai lazily lifted his eyes.","He saw the guard poking his head out of the window at the iron gate beside the back door, beckoning to a female student.","He seemed to suspect that the girl was not a student of Jing City No.1 Middle School.","Chi Xia now regretted this a lot in her heart.","Her best friend had successfully found the boy she liked from the tutoring class, bravely went up to chat with him, and talked happily.","Without her best friend sending an eye signal, Chi Xia tacitly walked away, ending today's \"moral support\" trip.","Unexpectedly, things went wrong.","She followed the crowd to the back door.","There were obviously fewer people leaving from the back door than the front door.","She wasn't wearing a school uniform, which made her stand out in the already small crowd.","Murphy's law is always extremely accurate at times like this.","She was caught by the eagle-eyed guard.","\"Student, which class are you from?\"","The guard came out of the security room suspiciously, looked her up and down, and wanted to find a guilty conscience on her face.","Chi Xia was not timid, and calmly answered irrelevantly:","\"Science class.\"","After she spoke, the air fell silent for a short while.","The uncle guard had a complicated expression.","Inner OS: Uh...is that what I asked? This kid doesn't seem to have good comprehension skills.","Seeing the uncle guard staring blankly and scratching the back of his head, Chi Xia figured she had fooled him with her gibberish.","She smiled politely at the uncle, took a step, and was about to slip away.","Unexpectedly, as soon as she moved, the suspicious voice of the uncle guard came again.","\"Hey wait, student, which grade and class are you in?\"","Chi Xia's footsteps stopped, and various responses flashed through her mind at high speed.","The uncle guard was obviously suspicious now, and even if she reported a random class, there was no guarantee that he wouldn't ask her more questions.","Just as she was thinking about how to respond, a lazy voice came from the right.","\"Hey, you ran off before you finished organizing?\"","She looked up in surprise.","Chi Xia was stunned for a moment.","She saw a familiar, handsome yet impatient face.","It was the younger brother of Qi Duo, the boy called \"Qi Shao\".","He made a very subtle eye signal to her, then added impatiently:","\"I had to move the chairs by myself, aren't you ashamed.\"","Chi Xia's eyes slowly widened: \"???\"","After hesitating for a few seconds, Chi Xia got the signal.","She went along with his act, glanced at him and said:","\"What's wrong with letting you move them yourself, last time during the big cleanup you slipped away early and I didn't say anything.\"","Upon hearing this, Qi Shaobai was taken aback, his neck involuntarily leaned back a bit as he looked at Chi Xia.","His eyes revealed slight astonishment.","Damn.","She spit out lies so smoothly without any hint of acting, much better than him.","The guard glanced back and forth between their faces.","His confusion dissipated somewhat.","Although this female student had an unfamiliar face and wasn't wearing a school uniform, Qi Shaobai was someone he recognized.","Not only because he was a popular senior student, he often heard other students talking about him.","More so because of his trademark sullen face.","He always had an arrogant look like others owed him five million.","It was hard not to leave a deep impression.","The two who had successfully fooled the guard walked out naturally as if nothing had happened.","The guard scratched his head again and shouted at their backs:","\"Students, remember to wear your school uniforms next time, or else I'll have to deduct points.\"","Chi Xia looked back, smiling sweetly, \"Okay, I'll definitely remember.\"","After speaking.","Qi Shaobai couldn't help but chuckle softly, lazily looking to the side, sarcastically saying:","\"You can't even remember the way, how are you going to remember anything.\"","Chi Xia's body stiffened, and slowly turned her head to look at him: \"......\"","???","Hmm???","Was he mocking her for having a bad sense of direction?","Just as she was about to say something, she saw Qi Shao lazily wave his hand and curtly utter two words.","\"Let's go.\"","After saying that, he walked in the other direction.","\"Wait a minute, Qi Shao.\"","Chi Xia called out to him.","Qi Shaobai's eyebrows moved, a question mark rose in his heart.","How did she know his nickname Qi Shao that his classmates liked to call him?","He suddenly narcissistically thought of one possibility.","Could it be, their chance encounters weren't coincidences?","This thought only flashed for a second before he dismissed it.","No other reason.","He just felt this girl didn't seem very smart, so she probably didn't have the brains to think that much.","Chi Xia held up one finger, speaking faster:","\"Wait for me for a minute.\"","After saying that, she ran to the convenience store across the street.","When she came back, she was holding two cans of soda.","\"Thank you.\" She handed him one of the cans, her eyes curved into crescents, \"Although your lying skills are terrible, you still helped me get past the guard.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","His eyebrows lightly furrowed as he looked down.","The soda can was covered in condensation droplets.","Coincidentally, it was grape flavored, which he loved to drink.","At the intersection near the snack street.","A black Rolls-Royce was parked under a street lamp.","Qi Mo was half-leaning against the front of the car, his body slightly bent, just the same height as Sheng Mumu.","Sheng Mumu was standing to the side eating an ice cream bar.","The mung bean ice cream bars made by the auntie at the school gate had an old-fashioned flavor that you couldn't buy at supermarkets.","When Qi Shaobai walked over, she had just finished eating the last small bite, and casually threw the stick into the trash can as she walked to the passenger seat.","Sheng Mumu's gaze was lowered, and she saw the lazy soda can in Qi Shaobai's hand.","She suddenly looked up and said in an interrogative tone:","\"Qi Shao, are you eating alone?\"","Why did you only buy one can when getting drinks?","Qi Shaobai walked to the back seat door of his own accord, too lazy to explain what had just happened, and subconsciously retorted back:","\"You're the same, eating an ice cream bar alone.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned: \"............\"","Before she could think of a rebuttal, Qi Mo's deep voice came from the front:","\"That's different—\"","She and Qi Shaobai stopped opening the car doors at the same time, looking towards Qi Mo as he walked to the driver's seat.","He glanced lazily at Qi Shaobai, as he walked and loosened his tie a bit, his expression softening a little:","\"——I didn't want to eat, she's not eating alone.\"","After speaking, his gaze stopped on Qi Shaobai's face, and his eyes became stern, \"What you did counts.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"............\"","After getting in the car.","Qi Shaobai voluntarily kept quiet.","In the front row, Qi Mo was driving.","Sheng Mumu was using her phone to browse nearby restaurants.","She had only eaten some snacks for dinner and hadn't eaten a proper meal yet, so she was a little hungry now.","She turned her head and asked, \"Qi Shao, do you have any food you want to eat?\"","Qi Shaobai was sitting by the window, spacing out looking at the scenery outside, not knowing what he was thinking about.","Hearing Sheng Mumu call him, Qi Shaobai's gaze shifted over, \"Hmm?\"","He had a look like he didn't hear what she said clearly.","\"We're going to get supper now.\" Sheng Mumu patiently repeated it again, and asked, \"Do you have any good suggestions?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"I'm full. Eating the dog food you guys feed me made me full.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"............\"","At the red light ahead.","Qi Mo had his hand resting on the steering wheel, and his fingers absently tapped on it.","Hearing Qi Shaobai's words, his fingers paused.","His tone was a little playful as he said:","\"Then I'll take you back to Xi Yu Yue Ting first, and we'll go get supper.\"","\"Huh?\" Qi Shaobai immediately stuck his head out from between the front seats, his face full of disbelief, \"No, Dad, I was just joking.\"","Qi Mo's head turned slightly to look over, and the corners of his eyebrows lifted lightly. His stern face gradually softened, seemingly in a very good mood, and said with a hint of laughter:","\"I was just joking too.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","He blinked a few times, with three parts shock, three parts bewilderment, and four parts discomfort in his eyes.","Did he hear wrong?","Joking, right? Dad makes jokes now?","He silently took a deep breath, retracted his head, and sat back by the window again.","Ok, fine.","He was making a fuss over nothing.","He just wasn't used to the jokester dad yet.","Ms. Sheng, an innocent bystander to this childish conversation, sighed.","Inner os: Men, childish."]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: Can't Keemer read minds","paragraphs":["Morning.","Sheng Mumu was still fast asleep, tossing and turning restlessly.","Her feet kicked out, sending the already loosely tucked-in blanket sliding down.","Qi Mo woke up right on time due to his biological clock.","By reflex, he reached out with his long arm to pull the blanket back up and tidy it.","Next, he got up, washed up, and changed clothes.","Stepping out of the walk-in closet, Qi Mo braced his wrist to leisurely buckle his watch strap.","His gaze inadvertently swept over the bed and a hint of helplessness flashed across his handsome face as he let out an amused sigh.","The blanket he had just tucked Sheng Mumu in was now bunched down around her lower back again.","He walked over.","The soft mattress sank down a little as he sat at the edge of the bed.","He tucked her in properly again.","Sheng Mumu's breathing was light and steady. She must have been dreaming about something pleasant, because the corners of her lips curved up slightly.","Her eyes were closed, long lashes quivering lightly with each breath.","Her long hair was loose and messy on the pillow, looking like a disheveled little cat after a good head scratching.","Qi Mo's intent gaze lingered on her, the endearing tenderness in his eyes seeping out strand by strand.","Unconsciously, he raised his hand and reached out,","his long, tapered fingers bending as they neared her fair, smooth cheek.","Just as the back of his hand was about to make contact, Sheng Mumu's lashes fluttered and her brows furrowed lightly as she mumbled something in her sleep,","\"Hmm...blah blah...\"","The pale hand hovering in midair froze abruptly.","Confirming that she was still asleep and just restless, the handsome hand moved up along the contours of her face instead.","His fingertips hooked a loose strand of hair bothering her face and gently brushed it back.","Perhaps it was this unruly lock that had disturbed her sleep.","The phone on the nightstand vibrated.","Dong Assistant sent the scheduled itinerary for the day as usual, at eight in the morning every day.","Qi Mo picked up his phone.","Dong Assistant: \"Chairman Qi, the morning meeting at nine has been notified to all departments. At two in the afternoon, you have a meeting scheduled with Chief Ji of the Yahong Group at Dianyun Teahouse...\"","Qi Mo scanned it briefly without reading it all.","His fingertip lightly tapped the screen as he typed back:","\"Postpone the meeting.\"","He put his phone down.","Qi Mo's gaze fell on Sheng Mumu again.","Her brows were still lightly knitted and her breathing alternated between slow and rapid.","The shadows cast by her long lashes were light and wispy beneath her eyes.","Qi Mo leaned in closer, shifting his broad palm to rest on her back.","Gently patting her, one after another.","After about a minute, when her breathing had evened out, he finally got up to leave.","But just as he was about to head out the door, her sudden mumbled words in her sleep stopped him in his tracks.","Lying curled on her side, cheek smushed against the pillow, Sheng Mumu murmured softly:","\"Yacht...\"","Qi Mo paused, raising a puzzled brow.","Yacht?","She was dreaming about a yacht?","She likes that?","The next second -","Sheng Mumu's blurred voice came again:","\"...fried dough sticks.\"","Confusion spread across the man's face.","Yacht or fried dough sticks?","Still feeling puzzled, he left for work.","It was half an hour later before Sheng Mumu finally woke up.","She jolted up abruptly from the bed.","Rubbing her bleary eyes, she vaguely recalled the dream she just had and tilted her head, scratching her messy hair.","Muttering softly:","\"Bizarre, so bizarre.\"","She had dreamed about Qi Mo.","In the dream, they were high school students.","Together they rode bikes to school, went to the breakfast stall to buy pancakes with eggs, and the bookstore to buy study guides...","All the scenes she had described yesterday played out vividly in her mind.","Dreams often deviate from reality.","In the dream, they looked like their adult selves.","Yet they were wearing high school uniforms, and the uniforms were even a gaudy pink color.","So...weird.","The last scene she dreamed of before waking was P.E. class.","Qi Mo was drenched in sweat as he twisted open a bottle of mineral water and handed it to her.","Perhaps her dream-self had also sensed something amiss, because she teased him with a laugh:","\"Old fried dough stick, why are you wearing something so flashy and pink?\"","In the dream, Qi Mo was stunned, raising his brows as he repeated her words, \"Old fried dough stick?\"","She nodded affirmatively in response:","\"Mm-hmm, old fried dough stick.\"","Sheng Mumu flipped off the blanket cover and shook her head.","No point dwelling on such a fantastical, absurd dream.","After washing up, she went to the dining room.","Accepting the hot milk handed to her by a servant, she took a big gulp.","Just as she was about to ask what was for breakfast today, she didn't see Housekeeper Zhang around.","Soon, she saw Housekeeper Zhang emerge from the kitchen carrying a tray. He set the plate down on the dining table.","Lifting the cover, he respectfully said:","\"Mistress, your breakfast.\"","Sheng Mumu jerked her head up in surprise, choking abruptly.","Because inside was...","Fried dough sticks???","Say fried dough sticks and fried dough sticks appear?","Housekeeper Zhang smiled and said, \"Madam, the Master ordered the kitchen to prepare these fried dough sticks for you before he left this morning.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Unable to decipher Sheng Mumu's bewildered expression, Housekeeper Zhang relied on his many years of experience as a butler to analyze for himself.","Soon, a thought flashed in his mind.","He turned and instructed the servant behind him:","\"Have the kitchen bring out the freshly ground soybean milk.\"","\"To go with the fried dough sticks.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","After breakfast, she headed to work.","Her mind was still on the fried dough sticks.","What a coincidence.","Could Qi Mo possibly have telepathy?","After all, transmigration itself has occurred, so telepathy wouldn't be anything strange either.","\"Knock knock-\"","Just as she was pondering this, her train of thought was interrupted by two knocks on the door.","Sheng Mumu looked up.","Cheng Zhuo was standing at the open office door with a cheerful grin.","Cheng Zhuo came in and placed the company's quarterly sales report on her desk. But instead of leaving immediately, he curiously asked:","\"Sis, something on your mind?\"","He had noticed her leaning on her hand looking pensive at the door just now.","The corners of Sheng Mumu's lips curved up lightly as she shook her head with a smile. \"Nope.\"","Just idle thinking.","And in fact, with just a little more thought, she would know it wasn't possible.","Seeing her response, Cheng Zhuo still didn't leave. Instead, he pulled up a chair and sat down, an expression of great curiosity on his face as he said:","\"Oh right, Sis, do you still remember what I told you last time?\"","Sheng Mumu blinked blankly, not knowing what he meant. \"What thing?\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"I said I have an older sister about your age who also has 'Mumu' in her name.\"","\"Oh-\" Sheng Mumu recalled it now.","They got interrupted halfway through the conversation last time when Cheng Zhuo's phone rang.","Recalling how panicked and terrified he looked back then, Sheng Mumu's gossip radar was immediately activated.","\"What happened anyway? Who called you last time that you were so afraid to answer the phone?\"","Cheng Zhuo's eyes lit up.","Sensing this was the perfect chance, he deliberately replied in Cantonese:","\"My big bro called.\"","He said it this way on purpose to test if Sheng Mumu had any childhood memories.","When they were young, he and his sister would address their elder brother this way.","Sheng Mumu froze.","Die lao?","After a few seconds, she understood he meant \"big bro\".","Suddenly, her brows knitted together.","Two images flashed in her mind.","A long time ago, she had once caught a glimpse of Cheng Zhuo driving a Maserati into a luxury residential complex.","And during the movie premiere, Cheng Zhuo had also arrived in that car.","She had been curious before about how Cheng Zhuo could afford such an expensive car and home while working at her flower shop.","Now, it suddenly dawned on her.","Combining it with what she saw last time - Cheng Zhuo receiving a call from \"Big Bro\" and looking absolutely terrified.","Sheng Mumu tapped her chin in serious, meticulous analysis.","Growing increasingly convinced of her guess.","Across from her, Cheng Zhuo sat nervously with his hands on his thighs.","His eyes brimmed with anticipation, fervently hoping Sheng Mumu would make some connection to confirm his suspicions.","\"Cheng Zhuo, oh Cheng Zhuo-\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly spoke up with a profoundly mysterious expression.","\"Turns out your family is involved in shady underground activities and you work for Big Bro!\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"Huhhhhh???\"","Sheng Mumu continued imagining: \"In order to launder your background, you came to work at the flower shop to create a good, law-abiding citizen image, right?!\"","\"No, Sis, listen to me.\" Cheng Zhuo stood up, hands braced on the desk, desperate to explain this huge misunderstanding. \"Actually, Big Bro is-\"","\"Don't tell me!\" Sheng Mumu cut him off loudly. \"I've seen it in TV dramas, the less I know the better! You absolutely must not tell me!\"","She didn't want to know the identity of the mafia boss behind Cheng Zhuo.","Hurriedly covered her ears.","Cheng Zhuo's expression grew increasingly pained and anguished. He desperately wanted to grab Sheng Mumu's shoulders and roar, \"Sis, please just listen to my explanation!\"","But Sheng Mumu didn't give him the chance. She hustled him out of the office, coaxing and pushing.","Shutting the office door.","Sheng Mumu patted her chest and heaved a long sigh of relief.","\"Phew- that was close.\"","She wanted to be a good, law-abiding citizen and didn't want anything to do with illegal activities.","Just then, her phone on the desk buzzed a few times.","It was a WeChat message from Qi Mo.","Opening it, there was a photo.","The photo showed a luxury yacht docked at the seaside.","Just as Sheng Mumu was about to send a question mark back, her phone vibrated again.","A new message came through.","Qi Mo: \"Something you like, for you.\""]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Good for you, loser man.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu directly sent him a string of question marks:","\"???\"","On the other end of the phone, the man in a suit and leather shoes looked at his phone, his eyes flickering slightly.","He wasn't sure if she was sleep talking about a yacht or fried dough sticks.","He prepared both, just in case.","Now it looked like.","It wasn't a yacht.","The more Sheng Mumu thought about it, the more she felt something was wrong.","She suddenly thought of something and started tapping on her screen.","\"When did I ever say I liked yachts? If you want to frivolously spend money, just say so. Don't use me as an excuse. You're really something, spending money like a wealthy playboy.\"","She had seen similar short videos online.","Things like a guy buying shoes in size 43 as a gift for his girlfriend, but they didn't fit her feet so he had to wear them himself.","It was all a scam!","She didn't expect the esteemed President Qi of the renowned Qi Group to use such childish tricks!","Upon receiving the message, Qi Mo's eyes narrowed and he read Sheng Mumu's messages over and over.","Suddenly, a hint of delight appeared in his dark eyes and the corners of his eyes curved up slightly.","He could taste a subtle sweetness between the lines of her message.","His slender fingers gently tapped as he slowly typed his reply.","Qi Mo: \"Okay, I won't frivolously spend money next time. I'll let you know in advance.\"","On the other end.","Sheng Mumu looked at her phone, her body stiffening.","Ouch~","Such a gentle reply.","It even seemed apologetic.","Did she go too far with her words earlier?","A strong sense of guilt suddenly arose within her.","She slapped her forehead with a crisp \"pia\" sound.","Oh no.","Would her image be forever changed into that of a tyrannical, despotic tigress?","Sheng Mumu wasn't one to take things to heart.","By the end of work, she had already forgotten about it.","Her thoughts gradually changed from \"I shouldn't have called him a wealthy playboy\" to \"that jerk, if he can spend money, so can I.\"","On her way home, she went shopping at the mall.","She bought a bunch of new scented bath gels, shampoos, and scented candles.","Carrying two big bags of spoils, she hummed a cheerful tune as she headed home in high spirits.","She carefully organized these little happiness-boosting items she loved so much along the edge of the bathtub.","Waiting for her to randomly pick and pamper one each time she took a bath.","Halfway through organizing, she suddenly stopped.","Her gaze fell upon the half-empty bottles and jars on the counter. Her brows furrowed slightly as she felt it was unfair.","Why did that man get to spend hundreds of thousands buying a yacht with a flick of his hand?","While she still had to use up her old bath gels after buying new ones.","That made no sense!","Immersed in indignation, Sheng Mumu didn't notice the bedroom door open.","Qi Mo was home from work.","Hearing the clinking sounds coming from the bathroom,","whose door was wide open, Qi Mo was puzzled.","His slender fingers hooked around his undone collar as he leisurely loosened his tie, glancing towards the bathroom.","Suddenly, his deep eyes narrowed.","Before him,","Sheng Mumu was hugging a pile of bottles and jars, walking towards the shower area.","The bathroom was huge. They tacitly used separate areas, she used the bathtub side, he used the shower side.","At this moment, Sheng Mumu had just taken a few steps into the shower area.","Sensing someone at the door, she slowly turned her head.","Seeing the man's tall, imposing figure at the bathroom door,","she froze, body stiffening.","Holding too many half-empty bath gels and shampoos, when she stopped, one bottle dropped out from the side.","It fell to the ground, bouncing a few times.","The muffled sound echoed between them.","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","The man's brow quirked slightly.","Seeming to express confusion with his eyes.","Sheng Mumu: \"......\" Although she had sneaked him gifts like this many times before.","This was the first time she had been caught red-handed.","She couldn't help but feel... embarrassed.","The corner's of Sheng Mumu's mouth twitched awkwardly.","\"Uh... looks like you're running out of shampoo?\"","A smile spread across Qi Mo's handsome face.","With a slight exertion of his wrist, he fully undid his tie.","Lowering his head to hide his smile, he spoke as if he didn't care at all:","\"Yeah, I'm almost out.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Ah... great, I'll share some with you.\"","Qi Mo's eyes smiled as he nodded, \"Okay.\"","Upon his words.","Sheng Mumu relaxed.","As she arranged the half-empty bath gels on the shower shelf, she secretly glanced at Qi Mo.","She saw Qi Mo walk into the bathroom.","He stood lazily yet casually in front of the mirror.","Head lowered, he leisurely rolled up his sleeves.","Moving unhurriedly.","Viewed from the side, his figure was slender yet lazy, his silhouette perfect.","An indescribable charm.","Having finally rolled up his sleeves, he gently flicked his wrist to turn on the sink faucet, then slowly bent down.","He scooped some water to splash his face.","Then unhurriedly dried it with a towel.","He turned and left the bathroom.","The whole time, utterly indifferent.","His face didn't show any unwillingness to use her half-used products.","Sheng Mumu even saw the corners of his mouth curve up slightly as he dried his face.","As if he was... happy?","This in turn made Sheng Mumu's guilt grow heavier.","Her heart felt gripped and very uncomfortable.","Added to what happened this morning.","In front of Qi Mo, her image as a tyrannical and stingy wife was becoming more and more ingrained.","What should she do?"]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: The old Lady's Report.","paragraphs":["Recently, I've been attending weddings, Qi Shaobai's coming of age ceremony, and Jing City No.1 Middle School's art festival.","I’ve left most of the company matters for Qin Jiamu and Cheng Zhuo to handle, which makes Sheng Mumu feel a little embarrassed.","These last couple of days, since I've had some free time, I took the initiative to give them two days off.","Today, after dealing with things at hand, she glanced at the clock on her desk.","She was surprised to find it was already seven o’clock.","She got up to pour herself a glass of water, and just as she brought it to her lips, her cell phone rang urgently.","The name “Jiang Doctor” flashed on the screen.","Sheng Mumu’s heart skipped a beat.","She had squeezed the paper cup so hard that she crumpled it.","A few drops splashed out accidentally.","She answered the call.","Jiang Doctor’s voice sounded rushed and somewhat heavy.","\"Mrs. Qi, the test results for your mother-in-law came back. Do you have time to come over?\"","Sheng Mumu’s lips were drawn in a straight line. “I’ll come over right now.”","At the clinic, Jiang Doctor and her senior brother sat across the desk and slid the test report over.","Jiang Doctor had her hands clasped together and looked solemn. “Mrs. Qi, take a look. This time the test found a shadow in your mother-in-law's brain. It's a tumor.\"","Sheng Mumu hadn’t even opened the report yet when she suddenly looked up at Jiang Doctor, tense.","Her fingertips sunk into her palms but she didn’t feel any pain at all.","Her senior brother added, “The location of your mother-in-law's tumor is not good. It’s hard to detect through routine examinations. If the tumor grows bigger and starts compressing nerves, it would be impossible to remove through surgery.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly remembered the description of the old lady's condition in the original book.","The book mentioned that the old lady was diagnosed with a tumor before Qi Shaobai started college.","Her condition deteriorated rapidly within a week, and she passed away without getting to see her grandson and great-grandson one last time.","There's a saying that the passing of a loved one is not a downpour but a lifelong dampness.","But for Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai, the old lady's sudden death was torrential rain, as well as lifelong dampness.","After that, Qi Shaobai suffered a huge blow, and his personality became even more moody.","Jiang Doctor’s senior brother said that if the tumor grew bigger, it would be impossible to remove through surgery.","Doesn't that mean it can still be treated now?","Sheng Mumu clenched her fists tightly and looked over. “So can it be completely removed through surgery now?”","Her senior brother had the usual calm expression of doctors on his face. He slowly said,","“It's still early stage for the tumor. Surgery is not the only option.”","Sheng Mumu didn’t know anything about medicine, so she listened to him quietly.","“My mentor professor in Germany is an internationally top tumor expert. Earlier this year, he had just researched a new conservative treatment method for early-stage brain tumors.”","When Sheng Mumu heard this, the wrinkles on her forehead relaxed, and her face showed joy. “Can it be completely cured without surgery?”","“Based on your mother-in-law’s current condition, yes it can.”","He nodded, but then suddenly changed the topic.","“However—”","As his tone shifted, Sheng Mumu’s relaxed eyebrows twisted together again. She anxiously asked,","“What’s the matter?”","The senior brother said, “The treatment is expensive—”","“Don’t worry about the money,” Sheng Mumu interrupted him impatiently and lost her usual calm composure.","The senior brother nodded slightly.","He knew the financial situation of Qi's family, so he was just informing the family as a matter of course.","What he really wanted to convey was in his next sentence.","“—and your mother-in-law needs to be sent to Germany for treatment for about two months.”","“Many elderly who have lived in China all their lives have an innate resistance to going abroad. The family needs to do some work...”","“To prevent the elderly from becoming depressed or even feeling abandoned in a foreign country because they've left their hometown.”","“Okay, okay.” Sheng Mumu kept nodding. She stood up to thank Jiang Doctor and the senior brother, and said, “This is very important. I have to discuss it with my family.”","The senior brother expressed understanding, “Of course.”","When she left the clinic, it was close to eight o’clock. Jiang Doctor walked Sheng Mumu downstairs.","Sensing that Sheng Mumu was still very upset, she patted her on the shoulder and gently gave her a comforting hug.","She patted her back a few times, her voice gentle,","“Mrs. Qi, given my senior brother’s personality, if there was even a 0.01% negative possibility, he would not say outright that he could cure it.”","“If he says he can cure it, then he must be very confident.”","Sheng Mumu was hugged, surrounded by warmth.","The faint antiseptic smell from Jiang Doctor's body entered her nose.","Sheng Mumu's empty heart ever since she got the call was instantly healed by this hug.","Jiang Doctor released the embrace and smiled warmly. She added,","“Back when I was your mother-in-law’s private nurse, she always took good care of me. Mr. Qi also paid me far more than other places.”","“If it wasn’t for your mother-in-law and Mr. Qi, I wouldn't have my own clinic or been able to buy a place in Jing City.”","Sheng Mumu blinked blankly at Jiang Doctor, who had an extremely gentle smile.","Jiang Doctor's hair ends were blown up by the wind, free and beautiful.","Her warm, firm voice floated over,","“If your mother-in-law goes to Germany, I’m willing to go with her and take care of her.”","She paused for a moment, a hint of shyness on her face.","“My senior brother would probably be willing to go with me too.”","On the drive back, Sheng Mumu kept thinking about what Jiang Doctor and her senior brother said.","The traffic light ahead turned green from red.","She didn't react to drive forward until the car behind honked at her.","In just an hour,","she went from nervous worry at the beginning, to joy when she learned it could be treated, to being deeply moved by Jiang Doctor's words.","It was an enormous emotional rollercoaster.","Now relaxing, she suddenly felt extremely tired.","Her hands on the steering wheel felt weak and lifeless.","The car entered the villa area.","When she parked in the garage, she finally let out a long breath.","She suddenly noticed her palm was purplish red.","The nail marks from her tight grip looked terrifying.","She ignored the pain, slumping over the steering wheel.","Staring blankly out the window, her eyes dazed.","On one hand, she organized how she would explain the situation with her mother-in-law's test results to Qi Mo later. On the other, her mind drifted.","Ever since coming here, there hadn't been a single day like today,","where she so strongly felt the storyline change because of her existence.","It was related to life and death.","That kind of thing always strikes at the heart most directly.","Without even realizing it herself, her emotions had been completely stirred by this world and she was thoroughly immersed in it.","After resting for a bit, she got out of the car and went back inside.","Passing through the foyer, Qi Shaobai happened to come out of his room and greeted her as usual.","Because of the old lady's condition, Sheng Mumu couldn't respond to Qi Shaobai with her usual composure.","She just tilted the corner of her mouth slightly and turned away, not wanting Qi Shaobai to notice anything wrong.","However, the sensitive teenager still felt something was off.","He walked closer to her and peered over.","“What’s up with you? You're acting weird. Did something happen?”"]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: She Knows, This is a vulnerable moment for Men.","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai's mind flashed with various guesses.","Could it be that he had made some mistake at school again, and the head teacher had told on him to her?","Or did she have a fight with Dad?","Neither seemed likely.","Qi Shaobai searched his conscience and found his recent behavior satisfactory.","His English scores kept improving, and his science subjects were stable.","Even his weak reading comprehension in Chinese, he had been losing fewer points lately.","That the young stepmother quarreled with Dad?","Qi Shaobai thought it even more impossible.","He had never seen Dad get really angry and quarrel with anyone. Usually Dad just had a cold face, an intimidating aura.","Moreover, in his humble opinion,","If Dad really quarreled with the young stepmother, it was hard to say who would prevail.","Dad was more likely to be silently unhappy and sullen.","Of course Sheng Mumu didn't know Qi Shaobai had imagined so much in a few seconds.","Her gaze turned on the boy's puzzled face.","Her lips moved a few times, but she just couldn't tell Qi Shaobai the truth.","She only said, \"Nothing, just a little tired from work today.\"","She forced a smile and lifted the corners of her lips.","Without meeting Qi Shaobai's doubtful eyes, she went straight to the kitchen.","To make the lie more believable, more casual.","She randomly grabbed some snacks and drinks, went upstairs with them, taking care to quicken her steps.","...","Qi Shaobai stood in the middle of the living room, frowning after her.","Seeing her relaxed back, he gradually dismissed the doubts in his heart.","After a few seconds of hesitation, he shrugged.","Maybe he had read too hard recently and muddled his mind, overthinking things.","When Qi Mo returned home after dinner, it was ten o'clock.","Pushing open the bedroom door, his chiseled features suddenly froze.","The room was not brightly lit, only a strip of lights around the edges glowed dimly.","Sheng Mumu sat on the sofa by the floor-to-ceiling window.","Holding some papers in her hands, head bowed looking out the window, her profile seemed very dejected.","He had never seen such a solemn expression on her bright, cheerful face.","His eyes darkened as he walked toward her.","The tall man's shadow gradually enveloped her slender figure.","As if making small talk, he spoke first:","\"I'm back, why didn't you turn on the lights?\"","Hearing the sound, Sheng Mumu looked up.","The air around her seemed to be shrouded in gloom.","Qi Mo's gaze shifted downwards, and his eyes suddenly narrowed.","At first he didn't notice the papers in her hand, but saw her palms flushed purple-red.","Qi Mo's brows knitted together. He half-squatted down, took her hands in his.","His calloused fingertips gently rubbed her palms.","Gently massaging them, he asked:","\"How did you hurt your hands?\"","Squatting as he was, his gaze was lower than hers.","From Sheng Mumu's perspective, the man's eyes were pitch-black, inscrutable.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips. Letting him hold her hands.","After organizing her thoughts for a while, she slowly began:","\"I went to Dr. Jiang's clinic today. Old Lady's test results came out.\"","She handed him the crumpled report.","\"Old Lady has a brain tumor.\"","As she finished speaking, the hand gently massaging her palm stilled.","Qi Mo looked sharply at her. His shoulders visibly sank a little, and his already dark eyes grew even more unfathomable.","Sheng Mumu suddenly forgot what she wanted to say next.","It was the first time she saw a mix of panic and helplessness on Qi Mo's face.","Seeing him like this, Sheng Mumu's heart felt like it was smashed by a boulder, suffocating her.","Qi Mo's voice was low and deep: \"Is the tumor malignant or benign?\"","Sheng Mumu looked straight at him: \"Benign, very small, it can be cured.\"","As she spoke, Qi Mo's expression relaxed a little, but still couldn't hide the gloom.","Sheng Mumu withdrew her hand from Qi Mo's.","The next second, she turned her palm over to cover the back of his hand.","Her tone was calm:","\"Dr. Jiang's mentor, and his mentor's professor, are experts in treating brain tumors. They suggest sending Old Lady to Germany for conservative treatment for two months, she can recover. Dr. Jiang will go along to care for Old Lady.\"","Sheng Mumu's small hand obviously couldn't wrap around the man's.","She could only rely on gradually increasing force to convey her emotions, to reassure him.","Qi Mo stared at her unwaveringly.","The back of his hand felt her warm touch.","Her gentle, unhurried voice floated over:","\"I'll go too.\"","Those simple four words seemed to have a soothing magic.","In an instant, Qi Mo's throat tightened, and his nose felt sour.","Hearing the news of the old lady's illness, he had almost collapsed.","But the hands firmly holding his now soothed his anxiety and panic.","He looked at her smiling, gentle face, and a softness rippled through his heart.","Suddenly he grasped her wrist and pulled her into his embrace.","Before Sheng Mumu could react, her head was buried in the man's chest.","His clean, crisp, cool scent enveloped her completely.","The back of her head was controlled by his big hand, as if he wanted to press her into his chest.","Sheng Mumu could feel his chin on her head, his presence extremely strong.","Qi Mo's low, hoarse voice carried a barely detectable tremor.","\"Mumu, thank you.\"","If it weren't for her insistence on multiple checks for Old Lady...","The consequences were unthinkable to Qi Mo.","The pain of losing his sister when he was young was still vivid.","It was Old Lady who had pulled him out of the mire and restored his confidence.","He couldn't bear even a shred of bad news about Old Lady.","Sheng Mumu felt she could hardly breathe.","She was about to be kneaded into his bones.","The man's chest was very hard, not comfortable to lean on.","But she didn't push away, letting him hold her.","She knew this was the man's moment of fragility.","He would certainly recover, and become the indestructible giant again.","Become composed, assured, nonchalant Boss Qi again.","But right now,","He was just Old Lady's worried grandson.","An ordinary man who had longed for a hug, always afraid of losing something.","Just staying quietly with him would be enough.","The surroundings were exceptionally quiet.","In her ears was the strong, steady beat of his heart.","Outside the floor-to-ceiling window, the moonlight was clear and bright.","It cast their silhouettes in a misty silver glow."]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: 【 Gathering of Talents, Radish Meeting 】","paragraphs":["The next day.","Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu together explained her condition to the old lady.","The old lady seemed to be at that age and had long anticipated that there would be such a day.","The surprised expression stayed on her face for only a moment before disappearing.","Knowing that the tumor was benign and could be cured, she was even more relaxed, with a completely calm appearance.","However, when she heard that her grandson and granddaughter-in-law said they would accompany her to Germany for treatment, she frowned and slammed the table to stand up.","\"No, if you go, I won't go.\"","Sheng Mumu looked at Qi Mo, at a loss for what to do...","Qi Mo seemed to have long anticipated that the old lady would react this way. He gave Sheng Mumu a \"don't worry\" look.","\"Grandma, I—\"","\"Don't say anything, I know what you want to say.\" The old lady suddenly raised her voice, interrupting her grandson before he could finish speaking, \"I said no, so no.\"","Having lived to this age, how could she not see the subtle expressions of the younger generation.","She was touched by her thoughtful grandson and granddaughter-in-law, but didn't want to affect the normal lives of the younger generation by having them fuss over an old lady like her.","She had always felt that people have their own ways of living.","Just like before, she had always lived alone in Yue City, with maids and caregivers around, and went to a university for the elderly to take classes when she was free, and was quite content.","Now it was just a temporary stay in Jing City. If she had to have her grandson and granddaughter-in-law waiting on her every day, she would feel uncomfortable instead.","\"It's fine if little Jiang accompanies me. If you all follow me, it would be as if I had a terminal illness.\"","Qi Mo didn't say anything more, knowing that once the old lady's stubborn temper came up, no one could persuade her otherwise.","The old lady sat down and suddenly seemed to recall something very important. Her expression became serious as she exhorted:","\"No matter what, don't tell Xiaobudian about my illness. He's in his critical third year of high school.\"","Qi Mo spoke in a coaxing tone, \"Okay, we won't tell him.\"","\"Hmm.\" Satisfied with the reply, the old lady nodded at ease.","Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu were still worried, trying to persuade the old lady from different angles.","Pleading, reasoning, cajoling.","Qi Mo patiently reasoned with her.","Sheng Mumu hugged her arm and acted cute.","But neither soft words nor hard ones worked.","The old lady had only one firm response:","\"As long as you dare to follow me, I will not cooperate with any treatment.\"","In the end, they still couldn't overcome the stubborn old lady and had to compromise.","The day of the old lady's departure for Germany was set for a week later.","During that week, Qi Mo personally arranged all the living and treatment related matters during the old lady’s stay in Germany in minute detail.","Sheng Mumu was responsible for explaining the situation to her mother-in-law Feng Yaoqin, who was on vacation.","According to the old lady's thinking, she repeatedly emphasized to be especially careful not to let Qi Shaobai know the truth.","As for Qi Shaobai, it was the old lady who went to speak to him personally.","The reason she gave was: At such an old age, she had never seen the world before, so she wanted to go out and take a look while she still had the strength.","Qi Shaobai was reluctant to part, \"Grandma, don't go. Wait until I finish the college entrance exam and I'll go with you.\"","The old ginger was still spicy. The old lady lied without revealing any flaws.","On the contrary, she turned it around and said, \"When you were little, you clamored for me to take you to the Children's Palace to play on the slides. Now that you've grown into a big boy, you still want grandma to take you out to play? Aren't you ashamed?\"","Qi Shaobai was rendered speechless for a moment: \"...\"","A week later.","Under the accompaniment of Dr. Jiang and a team of maids and caregivers, the old lady boarded the plane bound for Germany.","As soon as Qi Mo, Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai sent her off and got into the car to go home, all three of their cell phones rang at the same time.","Qi Mo was driving and did not immediately look at his phone, but he could understand what happened from the conversation between Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai said in surprise, \"Grandma started a family group chat.\"","Sheng Mumu hadn't opened WeChat yet. She laughed and asked, \"What's the group name, 'Loving Family'?\"","\"No.\" Qi Shaobai paused, \"It's called 'Outstanding Gathering, Radish Conference', what does that mean?\"","Sheng Mumu chuckled. It was a classic line from the skit that she had watched with the old lady.","She didn't explain much to Qi Shaobai, only sighed leisurely,","\"Ah, this is the generation gap.\"","As she spoke, she turned to look at Qi Mo and lamented,","\"Kids these days don't understand anything.\"","Qi Mo was focused on driving, glanced at Qi Shaobai from the rearview mirror and coldly added,","\"Hmm, don't understand at all.\"","Qi Shaobai was used to his father and stepmother ganging up on him as a target. He didn't take much offense and continued looking at his phone.","Suddenly his expression changed.","\"This is not good, the group name is in danger of being changed.\"","Sheng Mumu heard this and opened the group chat.","【Outstanding Gathering, Radish Conference (6)】","——【Feng Yaoqin: Mom, why did you name the group like this? It should be called \"Loving Family\" to reflect the warmth and harmony of our family. [Flower][Coffee cup][Sun]】","——【Qiao Li: Auntie, if you randomly grab ten people on the street, at least half of their family group chats are called \"Loving Family\". It's not original enough.】","——【Feng Yaoqin: Oh, then Qiao Li, suggest a more original name. You even dared to dye your hair green, so the name you come up with surely won't be old-fashioned. [Smile]】","Sheng Mumu grinned from ear to ear, eyes curving into crescents.","Her mother-in-law was probably still shocked by seeing Qiao Li's grayish-green hair at the bar last time, and it left a lasting impression.","Now catching the opportunity, she was being sarcastic to Qiao Li.","The smile emoji at the end, she knew her mother-in-law just used it out of habit.","But now it looked especially sarcastic, full of humor.","She laughed heartily.","Qi Mo was infected by her laughter and glanced at her from the corner of his eye, involuntarily raising the corners of his lips slightly.","——【Qiao Li: Um... My bandmates are urging me to go practice, talk later.】","——【Qi Shaobai: Qiao Li you're such a coward.】","——【Qiao Li: Qi Shaobai, don't think that just because you're a spirited young man I won't beat you up.】","——【Feng Yaoqin: Shaobai, watch how you speak to Qiao Li. You should at least call her cousin.】","——【Qi Shaobai: ...】","Sheng Mumu turned to look at Qi Shaobai with a teasing face.","\"Young Qi, how about we don't go home first and I'll take you to shake a bottle at the mall entrance to practice calling 'my father’s niece'.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","He was speechless at this moment.","On the plane.","The old lady squinted and held her phone farther away to see the younger generations joking in the group. A benevolent smile appeared on her face.","Then she slowly modified her own nickname in the group using the handwriting function.","She sent out the first message in the group.","——【Xiaobudian’s Grandma: You guys can change the group name to whatever you want yourselves.】","As soon as she sent it, a series of replies popped up below:","——【Qi Shaobai: What grandma came up with is the best.】","——【Sheng Mumu: +10086 [Jumping puppy.jpg]】","——【Qiao Li: Very special name.】","——【Feng Yaoqin: Mom, this name is good, let's not change it.】","——【Xiaobudian’s Grandma: A bunch of radishes [Smile][Thumbs up][Thumbs up]】","*","The second week after Grandma went abroad.","Jing City No. 1 Middle School adjusted the schedule for third year high school students.","The self-study session that previously ended at 8:30pm was changed to 10pm.","That day.","Qi Shaobai dragged his weary body back home. As soon as he reached the front door, his body suddenly stiffened.","He lifted his chin and sniffed.","A familiar smell lingered in the air, going straight up his nostrils.","His eyes widened abruptly as he quickened his pace in the direction of the aroma.","It was the smell of meatballs fried by Grandma.","Could Grandma have come back early?","Thinking this, he couldn't help but feel greatly cheered up.","Before he even reached the kitchen, a voice rang out.","\"Grandma?\"","\"Young Qi is back?\" A clear voice responded from the kitchen.","Qi Shaobai froze on the spot.","This was obviously not Grandma's voice.","The only one who liked to call him Young Qi was his stepmother.","Sure enough, Sheng Mumu pushed open the kitchen door and walked out from inside.","She was holding a plate of freshly fried meatballs and placed them on the table, waving her hand at him.","\"Come try them and see if they taste different from Grandma's meatballs.\"","Qi Shaobai stared blankly for a few seconds, then pulled out a chair and sat down. Without washing his hands, he grabbed one and took a bite.","After just a few chews, a clean smile appeared on his cold, aloof face.","His tone was full of affirmation.","\"Delicious, exactly the same as Grandma's.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyebrows quirked up, the ending of her words curling up proudly,","\"Of course, hand-taught by Granny herself.\"","Seeing Qi Shaobai wolfing them down, Sheng Mumu's smile grew increasingly smug.","Her thoughts went back two weeks ago.","The day before the old lady was leaving...","She had mysteriously pulled her into the kitchen.","\"Mu Mu, I'm going to teach you how to make fried meatballs. If...if anything happens to me...\"","The old lady hesitated, a fleeting look of sadness passing over her face, quickly replaced by a benevolent smile as she finished what she had to say:","\"My little one will still be able to taste this flavor.\""]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: Before She knew it, She looked more and more like him.","paragraphs":["Time always comes in waves, in a rolling pattern.","There are busy times, and relaxing times.","Recently, it just so happened to be a time when the Qi family were all busy with their own things.","On the blackboard in the high school classroom, there was a countdown to the college entrance exam.","The numbers got smaller day by day.","Along with that, Qi Shaobai's level of diligence in studying increased day by day.","Other than going to the gym with his dad Qi Mo and stepmom twice a week to exercise and keep fit, there were almost no other recreational activities.","He completely immersed himself in the ocean of knowledge.","On the other hand.","Sheng Mumu accepted an interview with Finance Magazine.","On the day of the interview, the effect was surprisingly good.","Because she had prepared well in advance, when facing the industry-related questions raised by the reporters, her answers were concise, professional, and maintained the aura of a CEO.","In addition, her outgoing and easygoing personality added to the effect.","During the breaks in the interview, she chatted happily with the beautiful female reporter.","In the second half of the interview, the female reporter made some spur-of-the-moment creative little questions.","Relying on her sense of humor and quick reflexes, Sheng Mumu defused the questions and gave answers that were wonderful and funny.","Throughout the entire interview, the photographer laughed out loud several times, and his hands shook occasionally as he held the SLR camera.","When work is conducted in a pleasant atmosphere, it often yields good results.","The on-site photos taken by the photographers during the interview looked especially good.","Even though they were still images, they managed to capture Sheng Mumu's lively beauty and charm.","Her smiles lit up her face beautifully.","The magazine that published this interview came out 5 days later, and sold a lot more copies than planned.","Because of this, Sheng Mumu even received phone calls from professional talent agents of several entertainment companies.","The agents did not address her as Mrs. Qi, but called her \"President Sheng\".","\"President Sheng, sorry to bother you, but I'm wondering if you've ever thought about giving the entertainment industry a try?\"","\"With your looks, eloquence and knowledge, you'll definitely be hugely popular.\"","\"No matter if it's acting or advertising, you'll shine brightly wherever you go, just like a beautiful painting.\"","\"It could also help expand your company's fame.\"","So many words of flattery made Sheng Mumu bloom joyfully on the inside.","But that's as far as it went.","If they really wanted her to go give the entertainment industry a try, that was absolutely impossible.","She knew deeply that in order to gain people's love in any industry, one had to put in tremendous effort.","It wasn't possible to become popular relying solely on looks.","What's more, compared to acting in shows or doing endorsements to earn money, she still felt that the sense of accomplishment from being a businesswoman and achieving success was greater and more thrilling.","So she politely declined those agents:","\"I'll have to decline~\"","As soon as she finished with that, matters on the other side came up.","She had planned earlier to open a branch of Happy Yourself Flower Shop in Shen City.","As the flower shop gradually became more corporate, the \"branches\" also turned into \"subsidiaries\".","A few months ago, she handed the project to the marketing department to carry out.","Soon afterwards, they rented a 300 square meters small office space in the CBD area of Shen City.","The subsidiary was set up.","As the boss, Sheng Mumu decided to go over personally and spend two weeks working together with the local colleagues over there.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai were both busy with their own things.","As the man in the family with the strongest hardworking tendencies, Qi Mo was naturally unwilling to fall behind.","On the same day Sheng Mumu set off for Shen City, it just so happened to be the day he flew abroad for business talks.","Xiao Wang drove them to the airport in Jing City.","Dropping them off at the domestic terminal and international terminal separately.","Qi Mo went on frequent business trips, so Sheng Mumu was long used to it.","She didn't ask where he was going this time, or how long he'd be gone.","Her mind was fully occupied with thoughts about what needed to be handled after arriving in Shen City.","The plane rushed into the clouds.","A few hours later, it landed at Shen City Airport.","\"Phew--\"","Sheng Mumu had just gotten off the plane when she sucked in a breath of cold air.","The sudden gust of chilly air made her shrink back and wrap her coat tightly around herself.","The temperature in Shen City was far lower than in Jing City.","She suddenly thought of the last time she came here, it was with Qi Mo and Qi Shaobai.","That time, a vacation resort owned by the Qi Group in Shen City had just opened.","Qi Mo said it was a vacation for leisure, but in reality he didn't let up on work either. And now, coming back to Shen City again.","Her mood was very different, without any thoughts of wanting to take a vacation at all. Her mind was completely preoccupied with work.","Sheng Mumu lowered her head and glanced at the small carry-on luggage she had with her.","It contained nothing but work documents.","She suddenly softened her gaze, and gave a self-deprecating chuckle.","She used to always privately complain and ridicule Qi Mo for being a workaholic.","Now, unknowingly, she was becoming more and more like him.","After leaving her luggage at the hotel, Sheng Mumu didn't linger. She went straight to the subsidiary office.","On the plane earlier, she had already flipped through the employee profiles Cheng Zhuo gave her several times, and memorized the names and positions of each employee.","As soon as she pushed the door open, she lightly nodded at the receptionist and gave her a smile, calling out her name.","The receptionist was taken aback. She had only started at the company for a week, yet the big boss far away in Jing City already knew her name.","Right after that, colleagues from other departments came out to greet her.","Everyone was originally a little nervous about the big boss who suddenly came to inspect them, but their nervousness gradually melted away in Sheng Mumu's bright smiles.","After interacting for a day, they quickly became familiar with each other.","When work ended, the employees sent a representative to knock on her office door.","\"Boss Sheng, everyone made reservations at a restaurant and wants to treat you to a meal to welcome you.\"","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips in a faint smile and declined:","\"I just arrived today and my luggage is still at the hotel unpacked. I won't be joining you for dinner.\"","Her eyes curved into crescent moons.","\"It doesn't make sense for the boss to let employees treat her to meals tonight. Just let everyone know to have fun and enjoy yourselves.\"","When the representative relayed her words to the others outside, it elicited a burst of excited cheers.","Sheng Mumu had maintained a high-spirited state the entire day, and finally relaxed when she pushed open the door to her hotel room.","After hurriedly taking a shower, she lay down to rest on the bed.","She had originally intended to just \"close her eyes for 5 minutes\", but when she awoke, 3 hours had already passed.","Today had really worn her out.","She gave a yawn and turned on her phone, ordering some delivery food.","She planned to eat something first before continuing to sleep.","While waiting for the food delivery to arrive, she started unpacking.","She had just hung up half her clothes when her phone vibrated.","Qi Shaobai: \"I'll tell you something\"","Sheng Mumu's brow twitched faintly.","From the text alone, she could imagine Qi Shaobai's arrogant tsundere tone.","She could roughly guess what Qi Shaobai was going to say.","Sure enough.","The next second, Qi Shaobai sent over a photo of his midterm exam report card.","He had edited the picture to specially circle the \"Class Ranking\" column in red.","To emphasize it.","Afraid that Sheng Mumu would just glance over it and not notice.","Class Ranking: 58","Sheng Mumu's face revealed joy. Mimicking her mother-in-law Feng Yaoqin's style, she sent over a string of thumbs up and smiling sun emojis.","Jing City No.1 Middle School was an aristocratic school, and also a key high school.","Getting into the top 58 in the grade meant he would definitely get into a top university.","If he could charge forward a little more, he might even become a candidate for Tsinghua or Peking University.","Sheng Mumu was in an elated mood, and also somewhat proudly.","She boldly messaged back: \"Go on, say what reward you want, don't hold back!\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Really?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"When have I ever lied to you?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"Oh there's so many times, should I list them out for you?\"","Sheng Mumu: ......","She took a deep breath, suppressing the urge to reflexively fire back a retort.","The corners of her lips curled back into a motherly smile.","She slowly typed: \"It's different this time. Pick any gift you like, go ahead, good boy.\"","On the other side.","Qi Shaobai, who was leisurely sitting in a computer chair, suddenly shuddered violently.","Because of the three words \"good boy\", he broke out in goosebumps.","His defiant face wore a look of disgust, but his heart felt wonderful.","He quickly typed and told Sheng Mumu the reward he wanted."]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: Damn She just got hit on.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu looked at the screen and fell silent.","Thinking to herself: Again? Can you be a little more thoughtful, Qi Shaobai?","What she received on her phone was a Lego picture.","It was in the style of a huge interstellar warship.","Sheng Mumu quickly searched for it online.","Unsurprisingly, it was a set that had already been discontinued over ten years ago.","But Sheng Mumu was totally calm about it.","She casually texted back to Qi Shaobai:","“Ok, leave it to me. Good boy, keep working hard, you're doing great!”","When Qi Shaobai received the message, his body stiffened for a moment.","He had just gotten over being called a “good boy” when those three words “you're doing great” shook him again.","His eyes quaked.","In his seventeen years of life, no one had ever said those three words to him before.","It felt so unfamiliar.","He swallowed and with difficulty accepted this new reality.","After a long pause, he murmured in resignation:","“Fine, I’ll try to get used to it.”","Sheng Mumu opened the WeChat conversation tagged “Master Dreamer.”","Last time, in order to help Qi Shaobai find the discontinued Lego set, she had added this otaku uncle with an anime character as his profile picture.","She started off politely, the same as last time—","“Hello Brother, my son is doing much better now. His legs have started moving a little bit. Thank you for selling me that discontinued Lego set last time. The internet really connects people.”","After a while, a reply came from “Master Dreamer”—","Just three simple words: “That’s good.”","Sheng Mumu paused for a moment, then shamelessly continued typing:","“Brother, I wanted to ask if you have this model? I’d like to get my son another gift.”","“[picture of a puppy blinking]”","Master Dreamer: “I have it.”","A few minutes later.","Master Dreamer: “I’ll mail it to you tomorrow.”","Sheng Mumu: “!!!”","Sheng Mumu excitedly clenched her fist.","Just as people online had said.","She might have gotten his name wrong, but never his nickname or tag.","The tag she had given this otaku uncle, “Master Dreamer”, suited him perfectly.","He really could make dreams come true!","She immediately responded with a string of flattering compliments, praising Master Dreamer to the high heavens.","But he didn’t reply anymore after that.","She guessed there were two possibilities:","One, Master Dreamer must be really cool, a man of few words.","Two, like most otaku uncles, he was shy and embarrassed.","No matter which was true, Sheng Mumu felt that the otaku uncle was such a nice person.","The more she thought this, the more guilty she felt.","Just like last time.","She tapped an electronic wooden fish for ten minutes.","Asking the Buddha to forgive her for lying.","After attaining inner peace, there was a knock at her door.","She got up to open the door, and right at that moment her phone rang.","The caller ID showed Qi Mo.","As she walked to the door, she gently slid her finger across the screen to answer.","“Hello?”","Qi Mo, “Hello.”","She opened the door. It was the food delivery she had ordered earlier.","She took the food from the delivery guy and said thanks, then closed the door.","Qi Mo paused for a moment. “I just got off the plane.”","Sheng Mumu was used to this by now. Whenever Qi Mo went on a business trip, he would let her know as soon as he arrived at his destination.","Sheng Mumu checked the time, calculating roughly how many hours he had been on the plane.","It was nearly ten hours.","She couldn’t help asking with concern: “That’s a long time on a plane, must’ve been tiring huh?”","Over the phone, Qi Mo’s voice lifted a little at the end. “Not tiring.”","Sheng Mumu put the food delivery on the coffee table and sat cross-legged on the carpet. “That’s good then.”","Qi Mo changed the subject. “Actually I’m in Germany this time.”","“What?” Sheng Mumu’s hands paused while unpacking the food. “You’re in Germany?”","Qi Mo: “Mm...” Qi Mo explained to Sheng Mumu over the phone that he had decided to accompany his grandmother for a while.","Using business talks as an excuse, so his grandmother couldn’t kick him out.","He hadn’t told Sheng Mumu in advance.","Firstly because he knew she was busy with work these days and didn’t want to disturb her.","Secondly because he could anticipate his grandmother’s temper.","If the two of them really showed up together in Germany, his grandmother would surely be angry and refuse to cooperate with treatment.","While listening to Qi Mo speak, Sheng Mumu felt a slight tremor in her heart.","She was moved by his filial piety towards his grandmother, and also by his respect and support for her career.","She kept these feelings buried in her heart. By the time they reached her mouth, they had turned into sharing the events of her day.","On the phone.","Sheng Mumu chattered on and on.","She couldn’t help complaining:","“You don’t know how cold the Shen city weather is. The wind at the airport made me want to die.”","She also couldn’t help bragging:","“Today I memorized the names, positions, and specialties of all the employees in less than an hour. Impressive, right?”","Qi Mo laughed softly. “You’ve always been impressive.”","Sheng Mumu spoke arrogantly, dragging out her words, “Of course~”","As Sheng Mumu ate her delivery food, she chatted with Qi Mo.","Until she yawned for the third time, and suddenly realized something. She said:","“Let’s not talk anymore. You were on a plane for so long, go back to your hotel and rest.”","She had just woken up from a three hour nap, while he had barely even arrived in Germany.","Getting caught up in talking about herself, she had forgotten about that.","Qi Mo spoke calmly: “Alright.”","Sheng Mumu: “Mm mm, bye now—”","“Wait,” Qi Mo interrupted her. “I’ll have someone arrange your meals tomorrow. Don’t order takeout anymore, it’s not healthy.”","Sheng Mumu was about to say there was no need to trouble him, but then thought for him it probably wasn’t troublesome at all. So she said: “Okay.”","Thinking that was the last thing, she was just about to say “Bye bye, go get some sleep.”","But then she heard Qi Mo say:","“Also, remember to tuck a blanket at the foot of your bed when you sleep at night. That way the comforter won’t slide off as easily.”","Sheng Mumu blinked slowly.","A warm current rippled into her heart.","“Got it?” Qi Mo asked when she didn’t respond.","“Weird—” Sheng Mumu hesitated a few seconds. “Why don’t you remind me about tucking a blanket when we’re at home?”","Over the phone, a brief silence.","Then she heard him laugh softly.","She could hear the undisguised laughter and candor in his voice as he said:","“Because when I’m next to you, you don’t need those things.”","Sheng Mumu's heart strings quivered abruptly.","Her fingers holding the phone curled slightly.","As if struck by something.","Her left chest thumped a few times, then grew increasingly soft.","The line was quiet for a long while, as if waiting for her response.","For an instant, everything around her was perfectly silent.","It felt like a lot of time passed, but also just a few seconds.","She heard his voice over the phone again.","“You were yawning a lot just now. Go to bed early.” Qi Mo said. “Good night.”","The receiver was pressed to Sheng Mumu's ear. The man's voice was magnetic and low, as if he was whispering right next to her ear.","The \"Good night\" especially warm and smooth, stroking the depths of her heart.","Light, ticklish.","Sheng Mumu spoke haltingly, belatedly. \"Good night.\"","She hung up the phone.","She shoved her head into the pillow.","Her fair, porcelain arms thrashed around wildly for a few moments.","Qi Mo's \"Good night\" seemed to echo in her ears still.","She had to admit it.","She had just been stirred up.","A strange thought suddenly popped into her head.","What if...","She meant, what if...","If she and Qi Mo were dating, could she order him to repeat \"Good night\" by her ear in different tones a hundred times everyday?","Not for anything else.","Just to give her eardrums a spa treatment."]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Push and pull, right Come on, who's afraid of who.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu raised her head from the pillow.","Resting her chin on her fist, she reminded herself to stay calm and poised.","Yet she could not ignore the fact that her heartbeat was gradually speeding up.","Unable to control herself, she opened her phone again.","Having just ended a long call, her phone was a little hot.","Her earlobes and palms were also hot, but she hadn't noticed.","She tapped into her WeChat conversation with Qi Mo.","Her fingers scrolled up and down a few times.","She read through their chat history from the very beginning of their plain conversations, all the way to the latest message.","She pressed her lips together lightly, her long eyelashes slowly drooping down.","To cover up the continuously rising pink bubbles in her eyes.","So it's already been half a year, she mused.","But it was only...half a year.","The topics, tones, and even reckless use of emojis in their chats.","Had obvious changes.","Adhering to rational thinking, she carefully reviewed this man's merits.","She had only listed up to the eighth point.","When his handsome visage suddenly popped into her mind, completely disrupting her train of thought.","It was as if a movie was playing before her eyes, frame by frame.","All of him.","His frown when thinking of marketing strategies for her flower shop opening.","His slow, starry eyes opening in the darkness when she was caught peeking at him sleeping.","His shirt cuffs rolled up as he slowly paced by the floor-to-ceiling windows during a work call.","Later, his handsome face gradually blurred.","Replaced by more abstract snippets.","It was his warm, smooth palm that lingered briefly in her hair before withdrawing.","It was his suit jacket laid over her legs to shield her from the cold at the No. 1 Middle School stadium.","It was his broad chest her back collided with when Shenglei pounced at her in madness.","It was his steady heartbeat when he held her after she fell into the water.","It was the gentle evening breeze when they strolled through Flower Plaza.","In just a few minutes.","Sheng Mumu had slowly painted every image of Qi Mo in her heart.","The contours becoming clearer.","Her thoughts returned to the present.","She leaned her chin on her phone.","After a pause, she lightly pursed her lips.","Her eyes gradually filled with determination.","At first, what attracted her to Qi Mo was his perfect face and physique that appealed to her aesthetic.","Gradually, it was his intelligence, emotional stability, and rationality that she valued.","Later, she was moved by his gentleness, sincerity, and directness.","And today.","Learning he went to Germany.","The \"filial\" and \"reliable\" columns in her imagination of an ideal partner were also filled with Qi Mo's name.","At this thought, her heart quivered lightly.","Her eyes grew moist and soft.","Some unnamed emotion inside her began to clamor, wanting to flip open the lid named \"rationality\" and pour out in one go.","Her finger hovered over the phone screen.","She paused, then slowly typed a line and sent it to Qi Mo.","Though her heart was full of tenderness, for some reason, the message she sent unconsciously mimicked Shengbai Qi's petulant tone.","Sheng Mumu: \"Let me tell you something.\"","At that time.","Qi Mo had just returned to his hotel, taking a quick shower before coming out of the bathroom.","Seeing the message, his still damp eyes filled with confusion.","Just as he was about to ask what it was about, a new message popped up on the screen.","Sheng Mumu: \"Qi player, just now, your favorability has accumulated to 97 points.\"","Qi Mo was suddenly stunned in place.","His movements stopped as he dried his hair.","His dark, ink-like eyes slowly lit up.","He clearly remembered.","It was only 67 points before, barely passing.","How did it suddenly...increase so much.","The corners of his lips turned up in pleasure, and he casually threw the towel aside. Ignoring his still dripping hair, he carefully typed a reply.","Qi Mo: \"Judge, are you going easy on me?\"","He was deliberately teasing her.","Qi Mo: \"I'm not afraid of points increasing slowly, I'm just afraid of getting points illegally, and you won't acknowledge them later.\"","It was also to confirm with her again.","Was this real?","On the other side.","Sheng Mumu's eyebrows suddenly furrowed.","???","After interacting for so long, she understood Qi Mo's hidden slyness and possessiveness to some extent.","She was certain this crafty man was subtly teasing her with his rhetorical questions, wanting to implicitly elicit gentle, conciliatory words from her.","Push and pull, wasn't it?","Come on then, she wasn't afraid of him!","Sheng Mumu suddenly felt rebellious.","The corners of her lips curled up in a faint sneer as she replied:","\"Qi player, why don't you ask how high the total score is?\"","Qi Mo: ......","Qi Mo: \"Isn't it a percentage system?\"","Sheng Mumu didn't reply immediately, deliberately leaving the sly man hanging for a minute.","After tidying up the takeout trash on the table, she slowly picked up her phone.","Pretending nothing had happened, she casually asked:","\"By the way, what's the total score for the college entrance exam again?\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","His hair was still wet.","Droplets slid down his hair strands, dripping onto his broad shoulders, leaving damp patches on his dark shirt.","The dampness wasn't too obvious.","But his calm heart lake was clearly disrupted by Sheng Mumu's words.","After a long pause, it was as if he had accepted reality, a low chuckle emerging from deep in his throat.","His jet black eyes flashed with determined light.","No matter.","Even if it was based on the college entrance exam scoring system, he was confident he could get full marks.","As long as she gave him the chance to take the exam.","Qi Mo went along with her words and asked again:","\"Judge, I'd like to understand the scope of assessment, so I can better grasp the key points for scoring.\"","Sheng Mumu gave a soft laugh.","The phone screen light shone on her face, her dimples brimming with sweet laughter.","She pictured Qi Mo's helpless yet humble and willing to learn appearance through the texts.","The Qi Mo in her mind had completely lost his usual aloof CEO air.","The more she thought about it, the more amusing she found it.","But gradually.","Her smile disappeared bit by bit.","Her lips slowly straightened.","She couldn't help thinking, was she going a bit overboard?","Teasing him like this didn't seem right.","It was Sheng Mumu's good habit to correct mistakes as soon as she became aware of them.","She slowly typed on her phone:","\"I'm kidding, the full mark is 100.\"","On the other side.","The man who had been waiting for a reply, griping his phone, relaxed his shoulders.","His eyes instantly filled with laughter.","Staring intently at the message on the screen, the corners of his lips quirked up.","He was not angry at Sheng Mumu's teasing, on the contrary, it gave him a bit of an opening to take liberties and obstinately continue the previous topic.","Qi Mo: \"I still want to consult on the scope of assessment.\"","Sheng Mumu flipped over to lie on the bed. The ceiling light shining down illuminated her faintly flushed cheeks even more clearly.","She took a light breath, bringing the phone close to her lips, and pressed the voice message button.","Her voice was tinged with some reproach:","\"Just three points short and you still want to cheat, aren't you ashamed? Qi Zong.\"","She deliberately emphasized \"Qi Zong.\"","She thought her tone for this line was cool and sarcastic.","After pressing play to listen back.","She suddenly widened her eyes.","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","That's not right.","How come...","It sounds more like...whining?"]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: Push-pull Daily","paragraphs":["After that day.","Sheng Mumu realized that the relationship between her and Qi Mo had subtly changed.","The two still sent each other messages every day.","But between the lines, there was always a hint of ambiguous and indescribable intimacy.","No matter what they talked about, it was like they were confessing their affection.","For example.","Sheng Mumu happened to hear a nice song in the daily recommendations on a music app.","She shared it with Qi Mo.","Sheng Mumu: \"[Music]\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Come, let's refresh our ears together.\"","Five minutes later.","Sheng Mumu: \"How is it?\"","Qi Mo: \"Pretty good.\"","Sheng Mumu fished for compliments and asked on purpose: \"Are you saying the song is good, or my musical taste is good?\"","Qi Mo replied casually: \"Both are good, but the best is my vision.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned.","It took her a good while to react to what he was implying.","She couldn't help but sigh inwardly: You little...","Tsk tsk, you're so slick.","But her inner voice was stopped as soon as it spoke.","No.","Strictly speaking, Qi Mo could no longer be called a little one.","It should be, you old...","Uh... weird.","Or another time.","Sheng Mumu had meetings at work all day and was starving by the time she got back to the hotel.","She sent Qi Mo her usual random musings.","It was a sticker that she particularly loved using recently.","Sheng Mumu: \"I'm back from goofing off.jpg\"","Fifteen minutes later.","The dinner arranged by Qi Mo was delivered to Sheng Mumu's room.","It was exquisite, with five dishes and a soup, plus fruit for dessert.","And as if on cue, his message came through:","Qi Mo: \"Do you want to try something different tomorrow?\"","The private chef had been sending meals to her for three days. He was worried she might get tired of the food.","After devouring the meal happily, Sheng Mumu replied: \"No need to change. I'm Sheng Mumu (workaholic version) now. To me, any gourmet food is just fuel.\"","After laying the groundwork, Sheng Mumu changed the subject:","\"Speaking of work, I'm trying to find ways to lower Yueji's transportation costs for flowers in Shen City.\"","\"President Qi, share some tips with me, please? [handing the mic.jpg]\"","Qi Mo teased her: \"There's a fee. Prices vary based on the tips.\"","Sheng Mumu cursed under her breath.","He's actually asking her for a consulting fee!?","As expected of a businessman.","Gritting her teeth, she transferred 100 yuan to Qi Mo.","Sheng Mumu: \"Here's 100 first. Let's see what you've got.\"","Qi Mo: \"Okay.\"","After a while, the head of the biggest transportation company in Shen City called Sheng Mumu.","He respectfully told her that Qi Group had just contracted them, and from now on, they would handle all logistics and transportation for Yueji in Shen City. He guaranteed the lowest costs.","Sheng Mumu was stunned.","After probing further, she learned that Qi Group had given them a small transportation contract in Shen City.","Sheng Mumu didn't ask further.","She knew that what Qi Group gave was definitely not a \"small\" contract.","After hanging up, she immediately called Qi Mo, meaning to admonish him for acting rashly:","\"You... the costs didn't go down. You just shifted them. How is that experience?\"","Qi Mo's tone suddenly became serious, as if he was really imparting 100-yuan advice.","\"The best way to reduce costs is to utilize connections. Qi Group would have outsourced that transportation contract anyway. Since we were going to outsource it, why not take the opportunity.\"","\"...\" Sheng Mumu was taken aback.","She couldn't refute him for the moment.","She understood the favors and unspoken rules in the business world.","This approach was actually very common.","Just as she was pondering it further, she heard that magnetic, low voice come through the phone:","\"We're husband and wife. I'm your connection, available anytime, no need to feel bad about it.\"","\"We're just nominally married for now,\" Sheng Mumu retorted without missing a beat.","Qi Mo was silent for two seconds before seizing on the key point in her words.","He chuckled lowly, drawing out the last note: \"Hmm, just for now.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"............\"","Scenes like this happened many times in the week since Sheng Mumu arrived in Shen City.","Their conversations kept taking subtle turns.","Sheng Mumu thought about it.","Perhaps this subtle change had to do with them being in different places now.","Although Qi Mo was always away on business trips before, and they didn't see each other for half a month at a time, back then she was in Jing City.","She was surrounded by familiar people and places, so loneliness wasn't so obvious.","Now, she was alone in Shen City.","The loneliness she didn't notice before reared its head.","And spiraled out of control.","She was outgoing and extroverted by nature. At work, she had to maintain her boss image before employees, so she couldn't fully be herself.","So...","She could only pour everything she wanted to share onto Qi Mo.","And every time, he caught it steadily.","He would respond to all her random musings, gossip, and trivial matters.","With their chatting frequency increasing.","Plus...","Qi's scores were going up.","The atmosphere was becoming more and more ambiguous and subtle, as if it was natural.","On the other hand, apart from her daily back-and-forth with Qi Mo, Sheng Mumu also had some snarky exchanges with Qi Shaobai.","One day.","Qi Shaobai suddenly sent her a message.","Three in a row, buzzing her palm.","Qi Shaobai: \"When are you guys coming back to Jing City?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"If you don't come back soon, I might go crazy.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"I'm not joking.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"???\"","Qi Shaobai immediately sent a photo.","It showed a box of lo mai fan (螺蛳粉, snail rice noodles).","Vacuum-sealed to preserve the original broth.","From the photo, half the box had been eaten.","Qi Shaobai was in despair: \"Grandma sent this back. It only keeps for a week. I've been eating it every day these days. I'm almost pickled through. Come back quick, I saved the other half for you.\"","Sheng Mumu laughed her head off.","She felt sorry for Qi Shaobai for one second.","Then mischievously opened their family group chat.","【Illustrious Radish Meeting (6)】——","【Sheng Mumu: @Feng Yaoqin, mom, Qi Shaobai said he really likes the lo mai fan you sent.】","【Feng Yaoqin: [Smile] Really? Then I'll send him another box.】","Seeing the group message, Qi Shaobai was stunned.","He frantically tapped the screen.","【Qi Shaobai (Pickled Version): @Feng Yaoqin No, grandma, I actually don't like it that much.】","【Feng Yaoqin: This child, really grown up and sensible, too polite to admit what he likes. [Thumbs up][Thumbs up][Thumbs up]】","【Qi Shaobai (Pickled Version): ......】","【Feng Yaoqin: My next stop is Yunnan. Lots of local specialties there, anything you guys want me to send?】","Qi Shaobai couldn't swallow this.","He immediately retaliated.","【Qi Shaobai (Pickled Version): @Sheng Mumu, didn't you say you really like eating cicada pupa?】","【Sheng Mumu: I never said that!】","【Feng Yaoqin: Mumu loves cicada pupa? I'll send some. [Smile]】","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!!!\"","【Sheng Mumu: Mom, I really don't eat that.】","【Feng Yaoqin: What's with you two? Each trying to out-polite the other. It's convenient for me to send things, no trouble at all.】","Sheng Mumu knew her mother-in-law had completely misunderstood.","She thought Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai were just being politely modest.","It would be hard to explain clearly right away.","She angrily sent Qi Shaobai a private message.","Sheng Mumu: \"Qi, you have no honor.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"You started it. If we go down, we go down together. I eat lo mai fan, you get the cicadas.\"","Sheng Mumu took a deep breath, eyes narrowing.","She slowly opened their family group chat again.","【Sheng Mumu: @Qi Mo, control your son.】"]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: Sheng Mu Mu: High and High","paragraphs":["Qi Shaobai leaned back in his computer chair.","His lazy and arrogant sitting posture made him feel very smug about his witty retort just now.","He felt like he had gained the upper hand.","His cold eyes lazily glanced at his phone.","Seeing the message Sheng Mumu had just sent in the group chat, his face suddenly froze.","-【Sheng Mumu:@Qi Silent, control your son.】","Qi Shaobai: \"!!!\"","No way.","Tattling?","This...","Although his relationship with Dad had become much closer in recent years, the innate fear of Dad over the past decade had become a conditioned reflex, a muscular memory.","His fingers reacted faster than his brain, hurriedly replying with cowardice:","-【Qi Shaobai (Flavorful Version): Let's not chat anymore, I'm going to do test questions.】","After saying this, he felt it was not enough.","To demonstrate his changed lazy ways and show his hard work and diligence, he added:","-【Qi Shaobai (Flavorful Version): I plan to do three more sets of test papers today.】","Qiao Li also saw the group messages and instantly saw through Qi Shaobai's guilty conscience.","She ruthlessly mocked:","-【Qiao Li: Hahahaha So passionate and confused】","-【Qiao Li: @Qi Shaobai (Flavorful Version), you'd better really go do test questions.】","-【Qi Shaobai (Flavorful Version): Of course】","-【Sheng Mumu: Send them to me to check after you finish the test papers.】","Qi Shaobai gritted his teeth and replied: 【Okay】","Then he felt that was not enough.","In order to show his diligence and hard work, he added:","-【Qi Shaobai (Flavorful Version): I plan to do three more sets of test papers today.】","As always, Feng Yaoqin took the conversation off topic:","-【Feng Yaoqin: Shaobai, your enthusiasm for studying is praiseworthy [clap] but remember to let your eyes rest every half hour by looking at green plants. [smile]】","-【Feng Yaoqin: [Public Account Article: Five amazing tips for protecting your vision. Read this and you'll understand]】","-【Feng Yaoqin: Go on, work hard preparing for the college entrance exam [thumbs up][thumbs up][thumbs up]】","-【Qiao Li: Under the guidance of Cousin and Cousin-in-law, Qi Shaobai is becoming more and more diligent. Keep it up!】","Qi Shaobai stared at his phone.","He noticed that several minutes had passed and Dad still hadn't said anything in the group chat, so he finally felt relieved.","On the other hand,","Sheng Mumu had a faint smile of victory on her face.","She private messaged Qi Shaobai.","Sheng Mumu: \"The whole world cares about how high you can fly, only I care about how tough your wings are.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"I can't laugh .jpg\"","*","The two weeks passed more quickly than imagined.","After getting the branch company business in order, Sheng Mumu boarded the plane back to Beijing.","Walking out of the airport exit, she assumed Zhang the butler and the driver would be waiting for her outside.","She didn't expect to see two familiar figures in the distance.","Qiao Li was the first to spot her and her eyes lit up. She waved to Sheng Mumu:","\"Sister-in-law, we're over here!\"","Cheng Zhuo was a bit slower to react. Hearing Qiao Li's excited voice, he finally turned his head and saw Sheng Mumu.","He immediately broke into a cheerful smile.","He jogged over and took the luggage from her hands.","\"Sis, let me get that for you.\"","Sheng Mumu was confused but pleasantly surprised, \"Why are you guys here? You didn't tell me in advance.\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"Li Li said she wanted to surprise you. She booked the restaurant in advance and said we'd pick you up and head straight there.\"","He paused and shrugged helplessly at Sheng Mumu, continuing:","\"I wanted to let you know in advance, Sis, but she insisted on keeping it a surprise.\"","Sheng Mumu looked back and forth between Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li.","She vaguely sensed something was off between the two.","But this wasn't the time and place to gossip, so she pushed down her curiosity and looped her arm through Qiao Li's.","\"You really get me, Li Li. The plane food was so bad I barely ate anything. Now I'm starving.\"","Right on cue, her stomach let out a \"gurgle\" as if to play along.","Qiao Li laughed and picked up the pace, \"Then let's hurry. This restaurant is really popular lately. Cheng Zhuo waited an hour to get a reservation.\"","Hearing this, Sheng Mumu became even more excited and walked faster with Qiao Li, chatting all the while.","She ignored Cheng Zhuo behind them pushing two suitcases.","Cheng Zhuo: \"......\"","Just as he was about to quicken his steps to catch up, Qiao Li looked back and urged impatiently:","\"Cheng Zhuo, walk faster! Sister-in-law is hungry but you're dawdling.\"","Cheng Zhuo paused for half a second.","A helpless yet affectionate smile appeared on his face and he sighed, \"Coming.\"","Out of the corner of her eye, Sheng Mumu glanced at Cheng Zhuo.","Her eyes narrowed.","These two...","Something's off.","When they arrived at the underground parking garage and headed towards Cheng Zhuo's Maserati, Sheng Mumu noticed Qiao Li slow her steps as she passed the front passenger door.","Almost instinctively, Qiao Li raised her hand as if to open the door.","Then, as if suddenly remembering something, she stopped herself mid-air, retracted her hand, and opened the rear door instead.","Qiao Li's unconscious actions did not escape Sheng Mumu's sharp eyes.","A flash of deep meaning shone in her eyes.","Something's definitely off x2","The restaurant wasn't far from the airport, about twenty minutes away.","Sure enough, as Qiao Li said, the restaurant was extremely popular.","There was a long line outside of people waiting to get reservation numbers.","Booming business had brought customers to the neighboring milk tea shop as well.","Having already reserved a table, the trio straightened their backs and headed inside.","Passing the milk tea shop entrance, Qiao Li turned her head and her gaze lingered for a few seconds.","\"Do you want milk tea? I'll go buy some. You guys head to the restaurant and grab our table.\" Cheng Zhuo suddenly said.","Qiao Li answered with a smile, \"Yes, I want some!\"","Cheng Zhuo looked at Sheng Mumu, \"Sis, what do you want?\"","Sheng Mumu knew this chain without even looking at the menu and ordered directly:","\"I want a strawberry milk foam, 30% sweet, less ice, thanks!\"","\"Got it.\" Cheng Zhuo glanced at his watch, saying, \"Our reservation time is almost up. Why don't you two head in first?\"","Qiao Li gave an \"OK\" gesture with her hand and linked arms with Sheng Mumu as they entered the restaurant.","Sheng Mumu felt something was off but couldn't quite pinpoint what.","With lingering doubts, she entered the private room in the restaurant.","Soon, Cheng Zhuo came carrying three milk teas and sat down across from them.","He passed the strawberry milk foam to Sheng Mumu and the other cup to Qiao Li.","His actions seemed natural.","While waiting for the food, Sheng Mumu's gaze inadvertently fell upon the label on Qiao Li's cup:","【Brown sugar pearls, jasmine tea, normal ice, 50% sugar, no tapioca】","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","Her eyes abruptly narrowed.","Her keen radar started beeping.","Like Conan had possessed her, a flash of lightning went through her mind.","That's it!","The odd thing she'd noticed all along was this.","Earlier when Cheng Zhuo offered to buy milk tea, he hadn't asked Qiao Li what she wanted.","As if he already knew her preferences.","The previous times she sensed something off could be dismissed as Sheng Mumu being oversensitive.","But the small label on the milk tea cup was practically \"ironclad evidence\" in her eyes.","Sheng Mumu rested her chin on her hand and her eyes shifted around.","She thought to herself:","Qiao Li instinctively moved to sit in the passenger seat of Cheng Zhuo's car. Cheng Zhuo knew Qiao Li's preferences without even asking.","Adding everything up, she concluded - the two must have gone out together many times privately.","The corners of Sheng Mumu's mouth slowly curved up in a knowing smile.","She's discovered their secret."]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: Know one's Relatives","paragraphs":["Cheng Zhuo was very troubled.","Recently, his relationship with Qiao Li had gradually become closer, reaching the stage where they were just one layer away from breaking through the paper window.","On several occasions, he had almost confessed his feelings to Qiao Li.","But he shrank back at the critical moment, swallowing his words back into his stomach.","It wasn't that he lacked courage.","Rather, he felt that before doing so, he had to get one thing clear – whether Sheng Mumu really was his biological elder sister.","If she was, he could happily find his sister and have a clear conscience calling her \"Sis\".","If she wasn't, then in the future he could also happily call her \"Sister-in-law\" together with Qiao Li.","Although he hadn't even successfully confessed to Qiao Li yet, in his heart he had already rehearsed it many times – how he would address the entire Qi family.","All this time, he had wanted to reveal his suspicions to Sheng Mumu, but always hesitated, afraid of being too abrupt, and afraid that the result would not be what he imagined.","He could only carefully test the waters, hoping to find more small pieces of evidence to prove that \"Sheng Mumu is his sister\".","And now, because of his feelings, it had finally become the last push he needed to recognize their kinship.","He could not wait any longer.","On the third day after Sheng Mumu returned to the capital city,","Cheng Zhuo knocked on the door of her office during his lunch break.","\"Come in.\"","Hearing the response from inside, Cheng Zhuo took a deep breath and pushed open the door, getting straight to the point as he asked:","\"Sis, are you free to have dinner together tonight? I have something very, very important I want to tell you.\"","Sheng Mumu was in the middle of signing some documents. Upon hearing this, she stopped her pen and raised her eyes to look over, \"Something very, very important?\"","Cheng Zhuo nodded heavily, \"Mm-hmm!\"","Sheng Mumu blinked and asked, \"That important, why don't you just tell me now?\"","Sheng Mumu's curiosity was piqued, she couldn't wait until dinner, she wanted to know right away.","Cheng Zhuo hesitated for a few seconds, \"Uh...well...\"","Seeing his hesitation, Sheng Mumu suddenly lit up.","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","Oh my, could this kid want to confess about him and Li Li?","No, I can't wait.","I want to hear this couple's love story right now, what should I do?","In the blink of an eye, Sheng Mumu took big steps to stand behind Cheng Zhuo.","Before Cheng Zhuo could react, she had already pushed him into the office and pressed down on his shoulders to make him sit on the reception couch.","Cheng Zhuo was confused: \"?\"","Sheng Mumu seemed oblivious as she busied herself.","First she called the intercom to have someone bring in a pot of tea.","Then she took out a bag of potato chips and a bag of melon seeds from the small fridge in her office.","She ripped open the packages and placed them on the coffee table.","With all the preparations to hear the gossip done, she finally sat down opposite Cheng Zhuo.","She blinked her eyes rapidly twice, revealing an expectant grin, and said:","\"What's this important thing, tell me all about it.\"","Her actions were so smooth, her preparations so thorough, it was just like those housewives in the villa district during their gossip tea time.","Cheng Zhuo was clearly shocked by her streamlined operation.","The words he had planned to say at dinner now had to be brought out prematurely.","Facing Sheng Mumu's expectant gaze, Cheng Zhuo couldn't help but stumble over his words:","\"...Sis, I might be...\"","Sheng Mumu encouraged him with her eyes, \"Mm-hmm, you might what?\"","Say it, say it!","Tell me all about your love affair.","Cheng Zhuo's lips pressed into a straight line as he clenched his fists and said:","\"Sis, I might be your long lost biological younger brother.\"","\"???\" Sheng Mumu, \"Huh???\"","Now that the words were out, Cheng Zhuo figured he might as well go all the way.","Ignoring Sheng Mumu's dumbfounded expression, he clutched his fists and spilled out the words he had kept pent up for so long.","\"Sis, I told you before that I have an older sister who is the same age as you and whose name also contains the character 'Mu'.\"","\"Actually, I didn't say it outright several times, but when I was little my sister...got separated from our family.\"","Sheng Mumu was still trying to shake off her suspicion that Cheng Zhuo's brain was malfunctioning, and looked at him with a complicated expression. Under her doubtful gaze, Cheng Zhuo continued:","\"The first time I saw your photo was a photo taken by the media of you and brother-in-law attending a banquet.\"","\"I was stunned at that time. You look so, so similar to what my mother looked like when she was young, even your dimples are exactly the same.\"","\"From the media coverage, I learned your name and secretly followed your news, knowing that you opened a flower shop, so I came to apply for a job...\"","\"Wait a minute—\" Sheng Mumu interrupted him, \"Let me get this straight.\"","\"You're saying, just because I'm the same age as your lost sister, and we both have dimples, plus our names both contain the character 'Mu', so I must be your sister?\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Cheng Zhuo's gaze was frank and ardent as he nodded, \"Don't you think so many similarities can adequately explain the situation?\"","\"This is...\" Sheng Mumu still felt it was a bit hasty and didn't answer Cheng Zhuo's words.","Her mind was chaotic.","She had expected to hear gossip, but it had abruptly turned into kinship recognition.","Her mindset hadn't switched over yet.","\"It's fine if you think my speculation is too preposterous, there is other corroborating evidence.\" Cheng Zhuo said.","Sheng Mumu looked at him seriously, \"What evidence?\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"Last time when your scumbag brother smashed up the flower shop, when I saw what he looked like, he didn't resemble you at all. Logically speaking, if you were really his sister, there's no reason you two wouldn't look anything alike, right?\"","\"Also, I asked you that day whether you grew up in the capital city since you were little, and you said no. What a coincidence, before our family immigrated, we had always lived in a small southern town.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment.","She recalled that when the flower shop was smashed, she did indeed chat with Cheng Zhuo for a few sentences.","She also thought back to the original owner's experience, living in a small southern town when she was little with her parents and Sheng Lei.","Thinking of this, Sheng Mumu's expression gradually became more serious.","In the original book, there were only a few cursory descriptions about the original owner, with no mention of any hidden family background.","But combined with the things Sheng Lei had said and done to her, it really didn't seem like how one would treat a biological younger sister.","Sheng Mumu pursed her lips, looking straight at Cheng Zhuo.","She had been persuaded by Cheng Zhuo's speculation. She pursed her lips and slowly said:","\"Then...what now? Go get tested?\"","According to typical conventions in novels and TV dramas, at this point they should proceed to DNA testing.","Hearing this, the suspense that had been hanging over Cheng Zhuo's heart finally relaxed.","There was irrepressible joy on his face as he nodded heavily, \"Mm-hmm! Let's test!\"","After he spoke, Cheng Zhuo smiled and confessed candidly:","\"Sis, I'll be honest, I did think about secretly pulling some of your hair before.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyebrows suddenly furrowed.","Cheng Zhuo didn't see her expression and continued confessing:","\"But after I looked it up online, to do kinship testing, you need at least fifteen hairs with the follicle. If I really pulled them, it would surely be quite painful.\"","Sheng Mumu was shocked and subconsciously covered her head.","Just listening to Cheng Zhuo's description made her scalp tingle painfully in imagination.","As everyone knows, a person has three thousand strands of worry.","But as one grows older, many people will gradually decrease to one thousand five...","One thousand...","Then five hundred...","She didn't dare think any further, and glared at Cheng Zhuo, slowly saying:","\"Cheng Zhuo, congratulations.\"","Cheng Zhuo looked puzzled, \"Congratulations to me?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Congratulations on narrowly escaping disaster. If you had really secretly pulled fifteen of my hairs when I wasn't paying attention, even if we did recognize each other as kin, our relationship would be over.\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"......\"","Sheng Mumu: \"You might even suffer a vicious beating.\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"............\""]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: Sheng Mumu: I am not only a wealth addict, but also a sex addict","paragraphs":["That night, Cheng Zhuo gave Sheng Mumu a detailed account of his family situation over the phone.","Including how his parents Cheng Father and Cheng Mother had passed away early on, and he had been raised by his elder brother Cheng Xin all this time.","When he talked about his elder brother, pride was evident in Cheng Zhuo's tone:","\"Sis, have you heard of Fangcheng Group?\"","Sheng Mumu thought for a moment.","The name rang a bell but she couldn't quite remember what it was.","She hazarded a guess:","\"Fangcheng...is it a math tutoring institute?\"","As soon as she finished speaking, there was a moment of silence over the phone.","Then the person on the other end raised his voice in exclamation:","\"No, Fangcheng Group! One of the top 30 Chinese companies in the US after just 5 short years, Fangcheng Group!\"","As Sheng Mumu listened to Cheng Zhuo speak faster and faster, proudly and excitedly announcing to her:","\"Fangcheng Group's current CEO, Cheng Xin, is my elder brother!\"","He paused for a second, then corrected himself:","\"―Our elder brother.\"","\"We haven't had a DNA test yet, don't get ahead of yourself.\" Sheng Mumu calmly interrupted.","But Cheng Zhuo's floodgates had already opened, and he continued on, oblivious:","\"Although my brother is very strict with me, I actually really look up to him.\"","\"He's so smart and capable, already established on Wall Street at just 34, he's awesome.\"","\"Damn it, and he's more handsome than me too!\"","\"It really is difficult being his younger brother.\"","Hearing Cheng Zhuo simultaneously praise and complain about him, Sheng Mumu belatedly realized she had misunderstood.","So it turns out...Cheng Zhuo wasn't involved in shady dealings after all.","The \"boss\" he referred to was a legitimate tycoon.","Thinking that someone so outstanding according to Cheng Zhuo's description might be her brother, Sheng Mumu suddenly felt a sense of surrealism.","By the end of the call, the two agreed to take a DNA test the next day.","After hanging up, Sheng Mumu reflexively opened her WeChat conversation with Qi Mo.","Sheng Mumu: \"Let me tell you a joke, I might not be surnamed Sheng after all.\"","Not even half a minute after the message was sent, Qi Mo called her.","His voice concealed a barely detectable unease:","\"Cheng Zhuo talked to you?\"","\"Yeah, he told me―\" Sheng Mumu answered naturally, but then her brows twitched and she stopped. \"Wait, why do you sound like you already knew??\"","Silence over the phone for a few seconds.","Qi Mo didn't intend to hide it from her.","He had anticipated this day would come.","Even so, when this day arrived, his feelings were far more complicated than he had imagined.","After a long pause, Sheng Mumu finally heard the low, husky voice over the phone.","Tinged with a hint of indiscernible melancholy.","\"I'm sorry, Mumu.\"","Sheng Mumu was puzzled. \"Why are you suddenly apologizing?\"","\"I found out a few months ago,\" Qi Mo's voice slowed. \"Back then, I thought he was approaching you with ulterior motives, so I secretly met with him once...\"","Standing in front of the window, Qi Mo's deep gaze looked outside vacantly.","Not really focusing on anything.","As he confessed to Sheng Mumu, he also counted the thoughts in his own heart.","He had known long ago why Cheng Zhuo was approaching her.","He also had countless opportunities to verify things and confess to her.","But he never did any of that.","He was selfish.","Afraid that she really was a member of the Cheng family.","With a marriage certificate and monetary agreement, he would no longer be able to keep her by his side.","He was despicable.","Secretly hoping Cheng Zhuo wouldn't bring up recognizing kinship so quickly.","The slower the better.","Slow enough for her to fully accept him.","By then, regardless of the outcome, he wouldn't be afraid.","The deep as fog pupils churned with dark undercurrents.","These unscrupulous thoughts were like moss growing in the dark, always hidden in his heart.","Now, he had confessed them in one breath.","Qi Mo's shoulders sank, as if a weight had been lifted.","Then immediately wrapped up again in feelings of unease.","Standing tall and straight beside the window, his handsome features failed to conceal the gloom.","His fingertips curled slightly, grip tightening on the phone.","Afraid of missing the slightest sound from the other end.","It felt like a long time, but also just a few seconds.","He heard Sheng Mumu give a soft chuckle over the phone.","Then her delightful voice, still containing vestiges of laughter, spoke:","\"So President Qi...the reason you met with Cheng Zhuo was because you mistook him for my suitor?\"","Qi Mo hesitated briefly before answering, \"Yes, that's right.\"","\"How could you―\" Sheng Mumu drew out the last word, filled with bewilderment and amusement:","\"―be so adorable?\"","Qi Mo was suddenly taken aback. \"......\"","The boulder weighing on his heart crashed down in an instant.","The moss in the dark was as if finally illuminated by sunlight.","Disintegrating inch by inch.","\"You're not mad at me for keeping it from you?\" he asked.","\"I'm not mad about that.\" She said.","Qi Mo's gaze tightened. He only felt his heart rapidly soar then fall with her words.","It was agonizing.","In all his years, no matter how complex or difficult a problem he encountered in his career,","he could always remain calm and composed.","He had long perfected the skill of maintaining an impassive demeanor.","Yet now, with just four simple words from her,","he was thrown into turmoil.","The cold, expressionless handsome face openly revealed the surging undercurrents.","Qi Mo lowered his voice, \"Then what are you mad about?\"","\"I'm mad that someone as smart as you has no self-awareness.\" Sheng Mumu sighed lightly. \"Did you really think you could only keep me by your side with money?\"","As her words trailed off, the gloom in the man's eyes slowly receded, replaced by a piercing bright light.","Every crease that had formed in his heart due to unease was instantly smoothed out by her words.","The corners of his eyes and mouth all revealed his elation and smugness.","She wasn't mad at him after all.","Not only was she not mad at him...","She also said... she liked him...","Sheng Mumu didn't mean to tease Qi Mo on purpose.","It was just in that context, she blurted out her true feelings unthinkingly.","She never could have imagined that Qi Mo had feelings for her so long ago.","That he childishly assumed Cheng Zhuo was her suitor and arranged a private meeting.","She had only seen storylines like this on TV dramas before.","Experiencing it herself now felt completely different.","If she was just an observer,","she probably would have mercilessly mocked―","A private meeting? How hilarious!","What for, a dance battle?","The dance studio's already packed!","But as the person involved, this feeling was indescribable.","It felt like...","Like when she was extremely thirsty, someone handed her half a chilled watermelon with a sugar cube inside.","Sweet and refreshing.","Most importantly, the one who gave her the watermelon was a hottie.","A seemingly cool and composed hottie who was actually secretly scheming to win her affections.","With all these factors combined,","she couldn't help but say those words.","Damn it, she really was bewitched by him.","That night, Sheng Mumu tossed and turned, unable to fall asleep for a long time.","She kept thinking about the end of that phone call.","She had mischievously, tentatively asked him:","\"What if, I'm just saying what if, Cheng Zhuo really was my suitor and didn't come to recognize kinship, how would you respond then?\"","After a long pause, she finally heard Qi Mo's blunt, decisive reply come through the phone.","Tinged with a hint of faint amusement.","\"I'll tell you when I get back.\"","With that, Sheng Mumu suddenly froze.","His low, attractive voice had drawn out the last word.","Somehow, it took on an enchanting nuance.","Sheng Mumu felt like feathers were brushing her earlobes.","Her heart also started pounding uncontrollably.","She finally managed to steady her breathing after much difficulty, and monotonously bid him good night.","As soon as she hung up the phone, she flopped onto her bed.","Burying her head in the blanket, she let out a muffled shriek.","Embarrassed because she had boldly teased Qi Mo.","Yet also heartbeat racing because Qi Mo told her to wait for him to get back.","She was looking forward to...the sense of occasion when starting a romantic relationship.","That irresistible moment when you just have to be together, no matter the cost.","It seemed to be getting closer and closer..."]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: Are you sure our big Brother is a cold, cold CEO","paragraphs":["The next day, Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo went to a professional genetic testing agency to do a DNA test.","The kinship test results came out after three days.","Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo sat at the table.","Across from them, the testing staff of the agency pushed the DNA identification report in front of them.","Cheng Zhuo's lips were pressed into a straight line, his body was tense, and he didn't dare look at it.","\"Sis, why don't you take a look.\"","\"Okay.\" Sheng Mumu picked up the report.","Skimming over the long string of professional data tables, she went directly to the \"Opinion\" section at the end.","At the moment she saw the genetic similarity value, her hand trembled slightly.","She had thought she could face the results calmly and composedly, but it turned out that at this moment, her heart was far from as calm as she had imagined.","She couldn't help but feel short of breath, with countless emotions welling up.","Observing her frozen expression, Cheng Zhuo became even more nervous, \"What are the results?\"","Sheng Mumu turned to look at Cheng Zhuo, nodded slowly, \"I'm your sister.\"","Cheng Zhuo's eyes gradually lit up and widened, he jumped up excitedly from the chair, waving his fists at the air, shouting loudly:","\"Sis, you really are my sister!\"","\"I finally found you!\"","\"That's great!!!!\"","Just after shouting a few times, he suddenly stopped short and stood still.","His body slowly tilted to one side as he lowered his head.","His gaze blurred in an instant as he lowered his head.","With a hint of choking in his tone, he said in a low voice:","\"Dad...Mom...I found my sister, did you see that?\"","Sheng Mumu heard a very low sob.","Then a teardrop fell, landing on Cheng Zhuo's shoes, and his shoulders began to tremble.","Cheng Zhuo's words slammed into Sheng Mumu's heart like a boulder.","It slammed her so hard that her nose soured and her tears welled up.","She wanted to say some words of comfort, but found she couldn't organize her speech for the moment.","Her hand moved faster than her thoughts, reaching out.","Gently patting Cheng Zhuo's back, one by one.","For a long time.","For the first time as an older sister, Sheng Mumu comforted her younger brother.","\"They must be able to see...\"","Regarding the test results, Sheng Mumu was not too surprised.","It was more of a feeling.","Comforting Cheng Zhuo, she was also calming her own emotions.","She suddenly felt a deep sense of guilt welling up in her heart.","She couldn't help but wonder, if she hadn't crossed over into this world, would it have been possible for the original owner to reunite with her family, to receive the love of her brothers, and to have a life completely different from the ending in the book.","\"Can you see it?\"","Sheng Mumu also asked in her heart.","Look.","Someone is actually thinking of you.","There is family looking for you.","They love you very much.","Her words sank in her heart.","Hollow, with no response.","Sheng Mumu gave a helpless sigh.","She had no way of knowing why she had such a strange experience of crossing into a book.","But she knew she had completely integrated here.","She would cry because of Cheng Zhuo's fragility, with her emotions stirred up.","It was as if they were truly blood-related siblings.","Sheng Mumu lowered her long lashes, concealing the light in her eyes.","She secretly, heavily, made a decision.","To properly love her family on behalf of the other Sheng Mumu.","After leaving the testing agency and getting into the car, Cheng Zhuo had already collected himself.","He called his older brother Cheng Xin who was far away in America.","He gestured animatedly to describe it all.","On the other end of the phone, Cheng Xin was in a meeting.","Upon receiving his younger brother's call, he abruptly stood up from his chair and walked straight out of the conference room, leaving behind the confounded subordinates.","After repeatedly confirming that the test results were accurate, Cheng Xin clenched his cell phone and said to Cheng Zhuo,","\"Let me talk to her.\"","Cheng Zhuo eagerly shoved the phone into Sheng Mumu's hand.","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment.","Cheng Zhuo said, \"It's my big brother, he wants to hear your voice.\"","Sheng Mumu slowly raised the phone to her ear and gently said \"Hello\".","On the other end of the phone, there were faint sounds.","Then a few seconds of silence.","A slightly hoarse voice came over, \"Mumu?\"","Sheng Mumu was startled, her heart suddenly fluttering lightly.","Even across thousands of miles, just over the phone, she could clearly feel the person on the other end of the phone trying hard to restrain his excitement.","It was as if he had prepared for many, many years just to say these two words.","The clear, cold, rich voice carried warmth all the way to Sheng Mumu's heart.","Unknowingly, Sheng Mumu curved her lips and responded, \"Brother.\"","Cheng Zhuo waited for about twenty minutes beside her.","Listening to Sheng Mumu talking with his big brother on the phone.","He really wanted to chime in and join their conversation.","But then he obediently retreated to the side.","Never mind.","It was rare to see his usually taciturn big brother talk to someone on the phone for so long.","In the past, even for very important work calls, his big brother would be succinct, wrapping it up in a few words.","With him, there was never a time they chatted for more than two minutes.","If it went over two minutes, it must be because he had made a big mistake, and his big brother thought two minutes was not enough to scold him.","It was rare to see his big brother open up, so Cheng Zhuo waited patiently beside with his brother-worship attribute on full display.","He didn't interrupt with even a word, only quietly observing.","From the corner of his eye he saw Sheng Mumu smiling the whole time.","She seemed to be getting happier the more they talked.","He also heard Sheng Mumu say with a delighted laugh:","\"No need, I have enough money to spend.\"","\"Bro, although this is the first time we've talked, you're my brother. I'm not afraid to reveal to you that, actually I'm super rich.\"","\"You really don't need to worry about me, I'm twenty-eight, not a child~\"","As Cheng Zhuo listened, a smile spread across his face.","He could probably guess what his big brother was saying.","In his big brother's eyes, they were all still kids.","He was the younger brother who grew up following his big brother, always making trouble with his ignorance.","And she, would forever be the little sister in his big brother's memory, who needed her big brother's care.","Cheng Zhuo leaned back in his seat and heaved a long sigh.","His hand shifted left to roll down the car window.","The cool autumn breeze gusted into the car.","The wind of late autumn should carry a desolate feeling.","But at this moment, it somehow smelled sweet.","Sheng Mumu's voice as she spoke on the phone floated over lightly and slowly.","\"Why would I want a house, I don't want to be a landlady at such a young age~\"","\"Big brother, don't say any more, if you keep this up, I'm afraid I won't be able to resist the lure of money and will retire immediately.\"","\"When you're done with work and have time to come back, we can meet up and chat more, ok?\"","\"Big brother, Cheng Zhuo told me before that you're aloof, fierce and handsome. In my opinion, the first two points are definitely inaccurate. Hmm...is that last point also nonsense he made up?\"","Cheng Zhuo burst out laughing.","Good heavens.","This was the first time he'd heard someone dare to talk to his big brother like that.","What kind of expression would his big brother have right now?","He couldn't imagine at all.","After a while longer, Sheng Mumu finally finished her phone call with her big brother.","When the phone returned to Cheng Zhuo's hand, the screen showed only 3% battery left.","Sheng Mumu looked over with a smile and asked:","\"Cheng Zhuo, are you sure our big brother is an icy cold, ruthless and taciturn elite CEO?\"","\"Before today I was very sure, but now...\" Cheng Zhuo shook his head, \"I'm not so sure anymore.\"","As his voice fell, they looked at each other.","Then the sound of their hearty laughter filled the car."]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: How big and Little White","paragraphs":["The news gradually spread to others within a few days.","Qi Mo was the first to find out, and the test results were as he expected.","Soon after, Madam Qiao and Feng Yaoqin also learned about it. They felt sorry for the early demise of Cheng's parents but were happy that Sheng Mumu had found her family.","Qiao Li heard about it from Cheng Zhuo and was shocked for a whole day.","Belatedly, Qiao Li said to Cheng Zhuo, \"No wonder I always felt that you and your sister-in-law have similar expressions, especially when you look lost and bewildered. It's like you were carved from the same mold.\"","Cheng Zhuo stiffened, catching the key point of the conversation accurately.","With a hint of meaning, he dragged out his tone and asked, \"You've been observing my subtle expressions seriously? You...\"","\"...,\" Qiao Li froze for a moment, immediately changing the subject, \"You're diverting the topic. I have to go for rehearsals now. Bye.\"","Among the people at the Qi family, Qi Shaobai had the strangest reaction upon hearing the news.","His brows furrowed momentarily before quickly relaxing.","He pondered for a moment, nodding his chin, and muttered to himself, \"That makes sense... that makes sense...\"","After speaking, he suddenly clicked his tongue, wearing a regretful expression.","Shaking his head, he murmured, \"What a pity, what a pity.\"","Sheng Mumu was confused and couldn't understand what Qi Shaobai was talking about. She asked, \"What makes sense? What's a pity? Little Qi, what are you mumbling about?\"","Qi Shaobai looked up and said, \"The last time I kicked your brother... No, not your brother, that guy named Lei. I regret that I didn't kick him harder. Now, I wish I could go and deliver a few more kicks.\"","These words touched Sheng Mumu, and she smiled, her eyes and eyebrows curved.","She originally intended to praise Qi Shaobai for his filial behavior, but it turned into a joking tone when it reached her lips.","\"Little Qi, I didn't expect you to be so eager to stand up for others. Have you been fighting for justice at school?\"","Qi Shaobai glanced to the side and lifted his chin.","In a lazy tone, he said, \"It depends on who it is. I don't meddle in other people's affairs that much.\"","Sheng Mumu was even more moved.","Her eyes instantly sparkled with tenderness.","Having an obedient son who was diligent in his studies, well-behaved, and filial was simply wonderful.","She took a step forward, grabbed Qi Shaobai's naturally stern face, and pulled it into an exaggerated angle.","Unable to help herself, she praised, \"Little Qi, you're such a good boy, always thinking of standing up for me.\"","Qi Shaobai froze, \"...\"","One second ago, he was lazily gazing at the sky, exuding an air of coolness and impatience.","But now, his pupils suddenly contracted.","Internally, he exclaimed, \"What are you doing??\"","Sheng Mumu seemed oblivious to his terrified gaze and the deep furrow between his brows.","Releasing her grip, she moved her fingers to his chin.","Like teasing a small dog, she gently scratched it twice.","\"You're such a good boy from our family.\"","Qi Shaobai, \"!!!!\"","Internally, he thought, \"Please don't come any closer!!\"","Sheng Mumu looked at him with a contented expression, smiling warmly as she asked, \"What would you like for a late-night snack? I'll personally cook for you tonight. Let's not have snail noodles.\"","Qi Shaobai tilted his neck backward.","He received Sheng Mumu's \"motherly love\" so directly, feeling somewhat uneasy.","He averted his gaze randomly, rubbing the back of his neck.","Lifting his leg, he walked toward his room and said, \"I'm not hungry. I'll go back to my room to study.\"","As the words fell, Qi Shaobai quickened his pace and returned to his room.","Closing the door behind him, he casually threw his backpack onto the chair.","He slowly raised his hand and touched his face, feeling the spot where Sheng Mumu had pinched him earlier.","Ouch, she really pinched hard.","He could sense a motherly love, but not much of it.","Sheng Mumu was still standing in the living room with a kind smile, thinking about Qi Shaobai's reaction just now, finding his shy and spoiled appearance quite amusing.","Just as she was about to take out her phone to share Qi Mo's daily shyness with Qi Mo, she suddenly heard the sound of the room door being pushed open.","Qi Shaobai's lazy voice floated out through the crack of the door:","\"If you insist on cooking, you can just make a bowl of noodles casually. I'll reluctantly eat some to save face.\"","After speaking, there was a \"slam\" as the door closed again.","Sheng Mumu's mouth twitched: \"...\"","She couldn't figure it out.","Would this kid die if he wasn't spoiled?","Sheng Mumu was the type of person who couldn't hold back her words.","She messaged Qin Jiamu and Su Tingran to briefly tell them about what had just happened.","She felt that they were good girlfriends now, so she should share such a big thing with them.","Qin Jiamu received the message and immediately came over from the next office.","She pulled out the chair opposite Sheng Mumu and sat down, and they chatted for a while.","After a while, Qin Jiamu said leisurely:","\"The names of you three siblings are quite interesting, one 'Xin', one 'Zhuo,' and one 'Mu'.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes brightened, \"Oh yeah, I didn't notice that until you mentioned it.\"","Qin Jiamu said, \"Gold, wood, water, fire, and earth. Your three names account for four of them.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled, \"I occupy two of them alone.\"","Qin Jiamu's eyes flickered as she said seriously, \"Your parents are good at giving names. Look at your older brother Cheng Xin, with three 'gold' characters in his name. He is also the same, very wealthy.\"","Sheng Mumu discovered a new world, \"Really?\"","Qin Jiamu used her finger to write and draw on the table, \"Look again, Cheng Zhuo, passionate like fire, and it suits his personality, cheerful, and loves to laugh.\"","\"Yes,\" Sheng Mumu continued the analysis, \"The 'Mu' character in my name has the radical for three dots, corresponding to my personality, gentle like water--\"","\"Wait, gentle like water?\" Before she could finish her sentence, Qin Jiamu interrupted her, \"Mumu, do you have a misunderstanding about yourself?\"","Sheng Mumu blinked in confusion, \"Am I not gentle? I think I'm quite gentle sometimes.\"","Just like yesterday, when she was cooking supper for Qi Shaobai, she accidentally caught a glimpse of herself in the mirror and felt that her gentle and motherly side was about to overflow.","\"You...\" Qin Jiamu sighed, got up and walked towards the door, and turned back, saying, \"Like a block of wood.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","\"Jiamu, wait a minute.\" Sheng Mumu chased after her and pulled Qin Jiamu back.","\"Where do I look like a block of wood?\"","She couldn't stand it when people only said half of something and vowed to get to the bottom of it.","Qin Jiamu looked her up and down and smiled without saying a word.","Qin Jiamu could come up with several pieces of evidence just by thinking about it casually.","For example, one time she, Sheng Mumu, and Su Tingran went shopping together.","After browsing through the women's clothing floor, she and Su Tingran instinctively headed towards the men's clothing stores, intending to buy something for their husbands as well.","Sheng Mumu trailed behind them, not looking or picking anything, idly playing with her phone.","She bought a few new pairs of underwear for her husband, and Su Tingran casually picked up a few pairs as well.","They asked Sheng Mumu, \"Since you're here, why don't you buy something?\"","Sheng Mumu blushed instantly and stammered, \"...Huh? He... he can buy them himself.\"","Qin Jiamu and Su Tingran exchanged puzzled looks: ???","Why would she feel shy about buying underwear for her husband?","Another instance comes to mind.","It was the three of them again, drinking red wine and chatting late into the night at Su Tingran's place.","After a few glasses, the topics became bolder and more daring.","They were all married, so of course, they would indulge in some improper conversations late at night.","Even Su Tingran, who had a gentle and docile personality, got caught up in the tipsy atmosphere and talked a lot.","But not Sheng Mumu.","No matter what they asked, she would evade and hesitate to speak.","In the end, she even made an excuse to go to the bathroom!","Qin Jiamu and Su Tingran, both married women, couldn't really understand.","Why would Sheng Mumu, after being married for so long, still be so shy?","After pondering for a while, they came to a conclusion:","Mumu, she's like a block of wood!","Suddenly, a phone ringing broke Qin Jiamu's train of thought.","The ringtone was coming from Sheng Mumu's pocket.","Sheng Mumu pulled out her phone, shook it in front of Qin Jiamu, and said, \"It's Tingran's call. Perfect timing, let's have her judge whether I'm being wooden or not.\"","Sheng Mumu smiled and put the phone on speaker, \"Tingran—\"","Before she could finish her greeting, a teary voice, tinged with sadness, came through the phone.","\"Mumu, my husband... he's having an affair.\""]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: The beginning is good, the end is gone.","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu quickly arrived at Su Tingran's house.","They didn't see the shadow of any housekeeper or servant. It was Su Tingran herself who opened the door.","There was fatigue in her eyes, and faint red bloodshot marks around her eye sockets, indicating that she hadn't had a good rest.","Her voice sounded weak:","\"I gave the housekeeper and the maid at home a few days off.\"","Upon hearing this, Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu exchanged glances.","They sensed the seriousness of the situation.","On their way here, the two of them speculated whether there was a conflict or misunderstanding between Tingran and her husband.","Now, seeing Tingran's dejected appearance and the expulsion of the servants, they felt increasingly uneasy.","It seemed that it wasn't simply a misunderstanding.","The three of them sat down on the small sofa in the side hall on the second floor.","Tingran had arranged this place very warmly, with a wool carpet on the floor and variously shaped wine glasses on the table, which she had specially collected from various places to occasionally entertain Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu.","However, today was not a night for girlfriends to chat and confide in each other.","The air was heavy with tension.","The previously warm and delicate arrangement now seemed to have a touch of desolation.","Sheng Mumu noticed that Tingran was dressed lightly. He quietly got up, brewed a cup of hot tea, and handed it to Tingran.","He also fetched a thin blanket and draped it over her legs.","After doing all this, he spoke slowly:","\"Tingran, what happened exactly?\"","Tingran held the teacup, her fingers curling.","The cup was hot, but a chill kept rising in her heart.","\"He went back to the capital city yesterday,\" Tingran said, her head slightly lowered. \"He didn't go alone. He brought another woman with him.\"","Qin Jiamu, who had an impatient personality, changed her expression instantly upon hearing these words and exclaimed:","\"What you mean is that he didn't have an affair that you accidentally discovered, but he shamelessly told you without intending to hide it?\"","\"Yes,\" Tingran nodded lightly, her voice like a wisp of air. \"He said our marriage had long lost its love and he wants a divorce.\"","\"What a despicable man!\" Qin Jiamu indignantly remarked. \"How shameless can he be?\"","Tingran fell into a melancholy silence, took a deep breath, and began to tell the story of her and her husband.","After graduating, Tingran married Song Yue.","At that time, they were an enviable couple in the eyes of others.","During their honeymoon period, they had experienced sweet and affectionate moments.","Later, Song Yue's company grew bigger, and they had more foreign trade projects.","They spent no more than three months together in a year.","They agreed that one would focus on the household while the other would focus on work.","Song Yue was responsible for earning money to support the family, while Tingran stayed in the capital city, taking care of the affairs of the extended Song family.","The Song family had many relatives, and each and every one of them relied on Song Yue. They would often cause trouble, either asking Song Yue to handle things or asking him to clean up the mess caused by the younger generation.","Tingran, with her gentle yet resilient character, managed to mediate and smooth things out, gradually ensuring Song Yue's stability and preventing the troublesome relatives from hindering his career development.","While Song Yue's career flourished, their relationship grew distant.","Tingran originally thought it was normal for a couple to have less and less to talk about as they spent more time together.","Trying to self-adjust and finding solutions.","Before her husband returned to Beijing, she planned a surprise at a romantic restaurant and organized a short-term travel itinerary, hoping to restore their relationship to what it was before.","Upon hearing this, Sheng Mumu couldn't help but sigh.","She remembered a conversation she had with Su Tingran some time ago.","During that conversation, Sheng Mumu sensed Su Tingran's sense of loss and suggested that when the Chinese New Year comes and Su Tingran's husband returns to Beijing, she should take the opportunity to visit him under the guise of New Year greetings and observe him on Su Tingran's behalf.","Little did she know that even before the arrival of the New Year, still in the deep autumn, Su Tingran's marriage was already on the verge of collapse.","From Su Tingran's narration, Sheng Mumu could imagine the scene.","A marriage that started off beautiful but eventually withered away.","Sheng Mumu felt a sense of desolation and loss.","In the eyes of Qin Jiamu and Su Tingran, the conversation among the three married individuals today was just that.","But only Sheng Mumu knew that she had not truly entered into marriage, nor had she ever been in a romantic relationship.","Hearing all this, she couldn't help but feel a sense of trepidation.","She began to contemplate the essence of an intimate relationship.","The initial attraction and the irresistible pull when getting closer...","These things, over a long period of time, only occupied a short segment and were insignificant.","Between men and women, what they truly face is the day-to-day routines, the mundane aspects of life.","Staying together for a long time without getting bored, that tests one's heart more than the excitement of a first encounter.","Sheng Mumu couldn't control the overwhelming emptiness and sense of loss welling up inside her. She picked up her teacup and took a sip, concealing the complex emotions in her eyes.","\"Yesterday, he confessed about that woman—\" Su Tingran's lips curled slightly, finally reaching the part that hurt her the most.","\"That woman's name is He Qing. She's twenty-four years old this year and she's his secretary. After graduating, she interned at their company and gradually rose to the position of secretary.\"","Su Tingran laughed bitterly at herself.","\"In the past, I heard him mention 'Xiao He' before, and I always thought it was a man. I never expected...\"","\"It's this kind of situation again!\" Qin Jiamu couldn't help but interject. \"Last year, I heard about three divorce cases around me, and two of them involved scumbag men having affairs with their secretaries or administrative staff. Why does this kind of rat feces keep happening? It's really unfortunate for someone to have their professional reputation affected by the actions of such a morally corrupt person.\"","A bitter taste spread across Su Tingran's face. \"He said they only developed feelings for each other in the past few months. Before that, they had a normal superior-subordinate relationship. I don't know whether I should believe him or not.\"","\"Don't believe him, of course,\" Sheng Mumu said sternly. \"If he can cheat, it shows that he lacks moral integrity. You can't fully trust someone with low moral integrity, no matter what they say. It's all just nonsense.\"","\"Yes, Mumu is right! That's the point,\" Qin Jiamu nodded emphatically, expressing her agreement.","\"Don't just listen to what he says, pay attention to his actions,\" Qin Jiamu spoke with the voice of experience. \"Maybe he's deliberately emphasizing that the affair is recent, just to gain your sympathy and pave the way for property division in the divorce.\"","Qin Jiamu was the oldest among the three and had witnessed many cases of cracks in her friends' marriages.","She offered sensible advice.","\"Su Tingran, what you need to do now is gather evidence of his infidelity within the marriage, to fight for yourself and gain more.\"","Su Tingran remained silent, biting her lip.","Then she lowered her gaze, her shoulders sinking.","With a trembling and suppressed voice, she slowly spoke:","\"Mumu, Jiamu, I understand the reasoning behind what you're saying, but... but I still feel heartbroken. Why... why would he do this?\"","Su Tingran could no longer control herself and burst into tears, covering her face.","Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu felt their hearts tighten.","They suddenly realized that they had overlooked Su Tingran's feelings.","Both of them were accustomed to analyzing the pros and cons from a rational perspective when faced with problems, figuring out how to minimize losses.","But they forgot that what Su Tingran needed at this moment wasn't that.","What she needed was help to overcome the emotional turmoil within her.","To overcome the sense of failure and lack of confidence resulting from a failed marriage.","Sheng Mumu embraced Su Tingran's shoulders, gently caressing them.","Su Tingran was enveloped in warmth, and the most fragile part of her heart completely gave way.","Her voice, tinged with a sob, became fragmented:","\"Song Yue said that he found a sense of youthfulness in that woman...\"","Su Tingran slowly moved her hands away from her face, tears blurring her vision, and buried herself in Sheng Mumu's embrace, uttering the words that hurt her the most from Song Yue.","\"He said, I can take care of myself alone, but that woman... he can't live without her...\""]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: Because of the company of girlfriends, she will get better faster","paragraphs":["After crying out a storm, Su Tingran fell into a deep sleep.","Since her husband had an affair and asked for a divorce, her nerves had never relaxed for a moment. Today she finally managed to sleep for a few hours.","Over the next week, Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu took turns accompanying Su Tingran.","During the day they would take her out for drives to get some fresh air and distract her.","At night they would find a comedy movie to curl up on the sofa and watch together.","Su Tingran's emotions were unstable, and she couldn't fully concentrate.","She would often start laughing while watching a movie, only to suddenly burst into tears.","Sometimes, just seeing a scene that was similar to her own experience, tears would uncontrollably start flowing, and she would immediately turn off the projector.","There was another time when she heard a certain song, and her whole body suddenly froze.","In the first few years of her marriage to Song Yue, that song was popular everywhere, and could be heard wherever they went.","The familiar music became an anchor for her memories, bringing a series of past scenes before her eyes.","As soon as the tears started flowing, they wouldn't stop.","Seeing this, Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu quickly came over to comfort her—","Speaking one after the other:","\"The reason you feel sad is because you're cherishing your own beautiful and sincere past self, it's not that related to that scumbag.\"","\"That's right, think about it, if it was someone else who went through those beautiful scenes with you, you would still find them beautiful.\"","\"Yeah, what you need to do now is slowly remove the filter you've put over those memories of that scumbag.\"","\"You're so good, so gentle and tender, being in love with anyone would give you many beautiful memories, it just happened to unfortunately be him.\"","Su Tingran felt they made sense, and although the tears didn't stop, their words of persuasion still sunk into her heart.","Over the next few days, one time while she was cleaning out her closet, she saw a skirt and suddenly shuddered all over.","Fragmented, scattered memories bubbled up again.","She was stunned for a long time.","She remembered that skirt.","She had worn it on their wedding anniversary one year.","Which year was it?","She suddenly couldn't remember.","No matter how hard she tried to recall, she could only remember her good mood at the time as she put on makeup and happily went to meet him.","She couldn't remember at all what he wore or what he said.","At that moment, Su Tingran suddenly realized.","Actually, cracks had appeared in her marriage to Song Yue a long time ago.","...It turned out that early on, she had been barely maintaining it by relying on a sense of self-sufficiency.","Although she realized this, it was far from easy to completely move on from the pain.","Like a severe cold—","Before the fever completely broke, there would always be recurring bouts.","Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu were with her as she went through the most excruciating period.","Sometimes they would curse Song Yue together as a scumbag.","Sometimes they would drink together as she cried and talked about the past.","Su Tingran knew that once the wound healed, new flesh would grow.","She would become stronger than before.","One day about a week later.","Su Tingran received a call from Song Yue.","\"Tingran, I've already prepared the divorce agreement, let me know when you have time and we can meet up and sign the agreement. Dragging it out isn't a solution.\"","On the phone, Song Yue spoke in a low voice.","He still felt a little reluctant to part with his wife who had diligently taken care of their household for so many years.","But this slight reluctance was just a tiny bit.","It was quickly diluted by his anticipation of his new life, and the youthful image that appeared in his mind.","Song Yue paused for a few seconds, then continued speaking:","\"Tingran, you haven't called me during this time, I can actually guess why—\"","Song Yue was confident he understood Su Tingran.","Su Tingran didn't make noise or cause trouble, she must be trying to put pressure on him in her own way, to make him reflect on himself with her gentle blade.","He laughed lightly.","Not arguing was being virtuous, it was Su Tingran's merit, but it was also extremely boring.","Their marriage was like a stagnant pond.","Just thinking about how He Qing would pout and act coquettishly because he couldn't accompany her, how she would throw herself into his arms refusing to let him leave, a long-absent sweetness rose in Song Yue's heart. The way He Qing looked at him was always full of admiration.","Nowadays, the company was developing well, and he had made quite a bit of money too.","What else was there to pursue?","It was just this bit of delight and sense of fulfillment.","What he wanted, Su Tingran couldn't give, but He Qing could.","Song Yue steadied his resolve, and when he spoke again, his tone was colder: \"I won't waver on getting divorced, even if you—\"","\"I have time now, just come straight to Xiyu Yue Court, we can sign the papers.\"","Before Song Yue could finish speaking, he was interrupted by Su Tingran's decisive, cheerful voice.","Song Yue was stunned, gripping his phone tightly as his eyebrows furrowed deeply.","After a long pause, he finally responded \"Okay.\"","Hanging up the phone.","Suddenly a wisp of loss crept into his heart.","Why didn't she try to keep him?","Or was pretending to be casual her last move to try to keep him?","\"Honey~\" a young, bright voice rang out, interrupting Song Yue's thoughts.","Pulling him back from his puzzlement and incomprehension.","\"Honey.\" He Qing came over and put her arms around Song Yue's waist, asking, \"Did she agree to sign it?\"","Song Yue was still thinking about Su Tingran's words just now. His tone was flat: \"Mm, she agreed, I'm going over now.\"","\"Can I go with you too? I want to accompany you there.\" He Qing cautiously asked.","Song Yue glanced down at her. \"What are you going there for?\"","He Qing's tone became weaker. \"If she's upset at you and goes back on her word, unwilling to sign, I can go beg her to let us be together, okay honey?\"","Song Yue was silent for a good few seconds, knowing it was very immature to bring He Qing along to discuss divorce, but his heart still softened under her gentle words.","\"Okay.\"","After he spoke, Song Yue's gaze slowly shifted aside.","He couldn't deny it.","Just now on the phone, Su Tingran had readily agreed to sign the divorce papers, and it made him feel a bit frustrated.","He had always believed firmly that Su Tingran couldn't live without him.","After graduating, Su Tingran had married him right away. If she left behind her identity as \"Mrs. Song,\" what else could she do? What would she do?","Song Yue had already thought up many persuasive arguments.","How to persuade Su Tingran to let go, how to get Su Tingran to accept that he no longer loved her.","But before he even had a chance to say any of this, Su Tingran had already agreed to sign the papers.","No matter how Song Yue thought about it, he couldn't figure out why.","After thinking it through repeatedly, there was only one possibility.","Su Tingran must be pretending on purpose, planning to try to keep him when they met face to face.","Since this was the case—","Bringing He Qing along would let Su Tingran completely give up hope.","On the other side.","After hanging up the phone, Su Tingran looked over at the two people beside her, took a deep breath, and said:","\"He said he'll come right over to sign the divorce agreement.\"","Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu exchanged glances.","\"Okay, we've prepared everything we need.\""]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: The man who cheats and philanderers, I know you're excited, but don't get excited just yet.","paragraphs":["They met at the coffee shop outside Xiyu Yue Courtyard.","On a weekday afternoon, there weren't many people at the coffee shop.","Sitting by the window booth, Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu accompanied Su Tingran sitting on the same side.","Song Yue pushed the door and entered.","Glancing left and right a few times, he quickly spotted Su Tingran, and his expression froze for a moment in surprise.","He hadn't seen the two women beside Su Tingran before.","He guessed they were probably Su Tingran's friends.","The surprised expression on Song Yue's face disappeared, and the corners of his mouth unconsciously turned up a bit.","In Song Yue's eyes, Su Tingran had always been gentle and well-behaved, rarely angry, and rarely argued with others.","Today, bringing two friends together to discuss a divorce agreement meant something obvious.","She still couldn't let go of him after all.","Calling two helpers to come together to persuade him to have a change of heart.","Song Yue secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","On one hand, he was proud that he knew Su Tingran too well.","On the other hand, what a pity.","No matter how Su Tingran wanted to try to salvage their relationship, his mind was already made up.","The decision to divorce would not waver.","\"Tingran,\" Song Yue settled his thoughts and called out to Su Tingran.","Hearing the man's familiar voice, Su Tingran looked up.","In that moment, it dawned on her.","Tingran...","He hadn't called her that in a long time.","After they got married, he had always called her \"wife\".","The man's changed form of address unconsciously conveyed to her that they could never go back to the past.","Su Tingran took a shallow breath and calmly nodded in response.","Sheng Mumu followed the voice and looked over.","She saw a petite woman half-hidden behind Song Yue.","The woman's expression held a trace of timidity, mixed with the joy of a \"victor\".","She must be He Qing.","She didn't expect the scumbag to actually bring the mistress.","He was really shameless, blatant, and disgusting.","Anger rose sharply in Sheng Mumu's heart, but she didn't say anything. Instead, she clenched the file folder in her hand a little tighter.","Song Yue and He Qing sat down across from them.","The air became rigid, undercurrents swirling.","Both sides seemed to be waiting for the other to speak first, to make the subsequent divorce agreement discussion less awkward.","But neither side expected that the first to speak would be her.","\"Sister, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to destroy your family. I...\"","He Qing's eyes dodged around, and she looked at Su Tingran tremblingly as she spoke.","Before she could finish one sentence, tears welled up in her eyes. She lowered her head with her hands clasped together.","Seeing this, Song Yue felt extremely distressed. He reached out and took He Qing's hand, stroking it comfortingly.","Encouraged by this, He Qing bit her lip and looked at Su Tingran again, pitifully.","\"Sister, I really love him, I love him deeply. Can you...can you let us be together?\"","Suddenly, two muffled knocks sounded.","Qin Jiamu knocked her knuckles twice on the wooden table and glanced at He Qing.","\"Is this a place for you to speak?\"","Her words fell like thunder, and He Qing immediately went silent, shrinking back towards Song Yue.","Song Yue looked at the speaker with a twitch between his brows.","He thought Su Tingran's helpers she brought along would be similar to Su Tingran's temperament, gentle and compliant.","He didn't expect such an unfriendly tone right from the start.","He looked at the other woman sitting by the window.","Although she hadn't spoken, her eyes gleamed with calm and piercing light.","Song Yue vaguely felt this woman would be even harder to deal with than the one who had just spoken.","Thinking of this, his brows furrowed.","Since when did Su Tingran get to know friends like these two? How come he didn't know?","Song Yue slowly withdrew his gaze and looked at Su Tingran, asking, \"Who are they?\"","\"They are my good friends, here to accompany me.\" Su Tingran's tone was extremely indifferent, with no discernible emotion.","\"Let's get right to the point, Song Yue,\" Su Tingran's gaze swept over He Qing's face. She said to Song Yue, \"Don't bring up anything else, it's a waste of time.\" Her implication was that she had no interest in hearing He Qing talk about how much in love they were.","He Qing was stunned for a moment, silently clenching her fists. That's fine, if the other party didn't want to hear her speak, she wouldn't say anything.","As long as the people across from her were willing to sign the divorce papers quickly.","When she decided to come along today, she had already expected she would suffer verbal grievances.","No matter how much grievance she suffered, it was fine, as long as the man beside her was willing to leave his wife for her - that was the goal she wanted to achieve.","\"Here is the property division agreement I had my lawyer draft. Take a look—\"","Song Yue took out two copies of the agreement from his briefcase and placed them on the table, pushing them over.","\"If there are no problems, we can sign now.\"","Su Tingran lowered her eyes to look at the agreement but didn't reach for it.","Instead, she took out a stack of documents from her own bag and handed them to Song Yue.","\"I drafted this one. Take a look.\"","Song Yue froze, eyes narrowing. \"You drafted an agreement too?\"","He couldn't believe Su Tingran had done this.","In the past, no matter what he said, she never had any objections.","How could she...","Suddenly, he couldn't control the loss that welled up in his heart.","Thinking that during the week and more they hadn't contacted each other, Su Tingran hadn't been thinking of ways to try to win him back, but rather finding a lawyer to draft a divorce agreement, his heart couldn't help but swell.","Was this still the wife he knew?","She seemed so unfamiliar to him.","Song Yue forcibly suppressed his shock and loss, maintaining an adult's dignity. He said lightly:","\"Alright, let me take a look.\"","Song Yue flipped open the agreement, his expression cold.","He Qing turned her head towards the man's side, pressing her lips tightly together.","Sheng Mumu noticed He Qing's gaze didn't linger on the man she claimed to \"love deeply\", but rather on the agreement in the man's hands.","After browsing just a few lines, Song Yue's brows furrowed and he looked up without reading further.","The dignified expression he had worn just a moment ago was now full of disbelief.","\"Eighty percent? You want eighty percent of my assets?\"","Song Yue flung the agreement onto the table after he spoke.","\"What makes you think I would give you eighty percent of my property?\"","Hearing his words, He Qing's body stiffened slightly, as if she had heard bad news. Her eyes stared at the agreement, wanting to read it more carefully.","In response to Song Yue's aggravated questioning, Su Tingran remained calm.","She nodded and said,","\"Yes, leaving you with twenty percent.\"","These years, Su Tingran didn't pay much attention to how much income Song Yue's company had or the scale it had reached, but she could estimate.","Even taking eighty percent of his assets, the remaining twenty percent would still not be a small amount.","\"Are you joking with me, Su Tingran?\"","Song Yue gave a mirthless laugh at Su Tingran's words, tossing the agreement onto the table.","\"On what grounds do you think I would give you eighty percent of my assets?\"","Hearing him say this, Su Tingran's eyes darkened slightly. She calmly repeated the man's words, \"On what grounds?\"","Song Yue was clearly more agitated than before. He slapped the table, making a muffled sound.","Before Su Tingran could speak, he said again:","\"During our marriage, you stayed home the whole time and never participated in company affairs. In terms of public morals, you have no right to ask for eighty percent.\"","\"In private—\"","Song Yue paused. What he was about to say next was somewhat hurtful, but he still decided to say it:","\"You didn't bear the Song family a son or daughter. If you had, it would make sense to allocate more assets to you. But as things stand now, don't you think this is going too far?\"","He suddenly had an enlightened expression, shaking his head.","\"Or could it be you don't actually want a divorce at all, and came up with this agreement that I would never agree to in order to make me turn back?\"","After saying all this, Song Yue stared fixedly at Su Tingran, trying to find signs of guilt from having her intentions seen through.","However, Su Tingran didn't even look at him. She just calmly took a sip of coffee, with no anger in her eyes at having her inner thoughts punctured, only disappointment.","Song Yue felt Su Tingran was becoming more and more unfamiliar to him.","Just as he was about to say something more, he heard the woman sitting by the window speak.","Her voice was neither rushed nor slow, wrapped in ridicule and disdain:","\"Mr. Scumbag, I know you are very agitated, but don't get agitated first.\""]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: Cheating on philandering Men and Concubines","paragraphs":["\"You just questioned, I answer you one by one.\"","Sheng Mumu's face was calm, forming a sharp contrast to the agitated expression of the man opposite her.","She slowly opened her mouth:","\"First, for justice, although Ting Ran did not participate in the company's operations, but over the years, she has gradually increased the assets that belonged to both of you through investment funds, trusts, real estate purchases, and so on. You don't mention any of this, do you?\"","\"Also, you said Ting Ran has been at home all these years...\"","\"Her contributions over the years cannot be brushed off lightly with just saying 'stayed at home'.\"","Sheng Mumu's tone paused, her eyes suddenly becoming chilly, and emphasized:","\"--I hope you understand one thing, she stayed at home and took care of the family, because she 'was willing' to do so at the beginning, not because she 'could only' do so.\"","\"Now, she is unwilling, so of course she has to settle these contributions properly.\"","Song Yue listened dumbfoundedly, unable to utter a word of rebuttal.","But Sheng Mumu was not finished yet.","\"Okay, we're done with 'justice', now let's talk about 'private'.\"","\"This is just basic biology--\"","Sheng Mumu chuckled lowly, her tone joking:","\"--Even elementary school kids know having children isn't something one person can accomplish alone. You're barely home all year, yet you still want to have kids? Dream more realistically.\"","\"Moreover, if you really had children, what was written in the agreement wouldn't be leaving 20% for you, but rather you'd be cut off with nothing. \"","\"After all, a father without moral sense or sense of responsibility would be hugely detrimental to the children, so huge compensation would be required to make up for the childhood trauma, right?\"","Sheng Mumu paused her words.","Not to give Song Yue a chance to speak, but to leisurely untie the string around the opening of the file folder in her hand, and take out several sheets of paper from it.","She placed them in front of Song Yue.","Her fingers brushed over the papers one by one, lightly tapping the surface.","\"This one is evidence of Ting Ran expanding your joint assets.\"","\"These two detail the profits from Ting Ran's real estate purchases over the years.\"","\"Here are the investment returns from the trust funds...\"","\"Oh, you'll need to look at this one closely.\"","Her finger fell on one of the piles of documents, her eyes sinking as her tone rose.","\"This is solid evidence of your extramarital affair with Miss He, records of getting a room together, WeChat romantic chat records, hotel surveillance screenshots--\"","\"Enough! Stop talking.\" Song Yue's body tensed with anger, and he snapped harshly, cutting her off.","\"On what grounds can you decide when I stop talking?\" Sheng Mumu found it amusing and retorted, \"Don't tell me listening to your little sister's sweet nothings too much made you feel like your words are especially compelling, especially manly?\"","\"Don't mess around.\" Sheng Mumu disregarded Song Yue's darkening expression and continued laughing, \"Raising your voice out of guilt will only make you appear less justified.\"","\"Sis, whatever fire you have, direct it at me. I was in the wrong, you can scold or hit me however you want, I won't make a peep--\"","Suddenly, He Qing's voice broke in.","\"--but isn't your agreement asking for too much...\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes narrowed as she glanced over, seeming very impatient at being interrupted while speaking.","Seeing this, He Qing immediately weakened her tone and tremulously finished the second half of her sentence: \"...isn't it too much?\"","Originally Sheng Mumu had no intention of giving her much attention.","When it came to cheating scumbags and their mistresses, the scumbag was even more in the wrong and deserved more condemnation.","But since the mistress wanted attention, Sheng Mumu was happy to give her a stage.","She and Qin Jiamu hadn't been idle these past days.","While accompanying Ting Ran to move past her troubles, they had also been gathering evidence of Song Yue's affair.","In the process, they had inadvertently discovered many surprises.","\"That's right, your surname is He, Miss He is it?\" Sheng Mumu brushed her fingers over the documents on the table until she found one in particular.","\"We discovered Mr. Song Yue spent company funds to buy you quite a lot of jewelry and handbags. These belong to marital joint property, so they're also included in the asset division.\"","He Qing's expression froze, her face looking worse and worse.","A ringing phone sounded.","The phone on the table in front of Song Yue lit up.","He looked at his phone, an unnatural expression flashing across his face.","The next second, he picked up the phone and stood up saying, \"I'm stepping out to take this call.\"","After Song Yue left the cafe, Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu exchanged a look.","They knew why this call had come.","Their booth was next to the window, so they could see Song Yue's expression as he took the call outside.","It went from cautious at first, to surprised and dumbfounded, then anxious and uneasy.","He paced back and forth with one hand on his waist, his footsteps betraying his inner panic.","Inside the cafe.","Facing the three of them alone, He Qing was no longer as delicate and weak as before.","Her attitude suddenly shifted.","\"Sisters, there's no need to go that far is there? If we all compromise a step, hurry and sign the agreement, it'll be easier for everyone right?\"","From the situation, He Qing had realized Ting Ran had no intention of reconciling with Song Yue at all.","That being the case, their goals were the same.","One wanted to get rid of this man, the other wanted to take his place.","Signing the divorce agreement was the most important thing.","Qin Jiamu looked at He Qing, breaking into a radiant smile, and said in a mocking tone:","\"Little sister, don't rush. Once he's done with his call and comes back, he'll be able to sign right away. We'll discuss your matters later.\"","\"!!!\" A chill went down He Qing's spine.","That sounded very strange, could it be...","Before she could think further, the cafe door was pushed open.","Song Yue hadn't even reached their table before his voice carried over.","\"You secretly investigated me!? Froze the money in my overseas account without my consent?\"","Song Yue stared fixedly at Ting Ran, his voice wrapped in anger and disbelief.","\"That's right--\" After a long silence, Ting Ran raised her eyes.","Those gentle, water-like eyes now held a coldness and resoluteness Song Yue had never seen before.","Ting Ran gave a faint smile and slowly said:","\"Didn't you also transfer assets secretly without my consent?","\"I simply did to you what you did to me. Why are you angry?\""]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: We usually call these people pure idiots.","paragraphs":["Song Yue's face was full of astonishment, his lips twitching, unable to utter a word for a long time. His complexion slowly turned ashen gray.","Song Yue now finally understood why Su Tingran had been so calm and composed from beginning to end.","It was because she held the key evidence of his extramarital affair and covert transfer of assets.","This was tantamount to grasping his lifeline.","\"Song Yue, signing the agreement is the decent thing to do,\" Su Tingran looked over, speaking calmly. \"If you don't want to divide the property according to this agreement, you know, there are also indecent ways...\"","As her words fell, Song Yue's body stiffened, his pupils suddenly tightened, silently clenching his fists.","After all, they had been husband and wife for many years. Su Tingran knew him all too well.","She knew he cared most about face, about image.","He would absolutely not be able to tolerate taking things to the point of tearing their faces apart.","If he chose not to sign and fought a divorce lawsuit, he might be able to gain more property.","But he still had to account to his parents, elders, relatives and friends.","Moreover, once litigation began, asset audits would likely restrict immediate access to accounts and funds, affecting company operations.","After a long pause, Song Yue's tightly clenched fists finally relaxed.","He squeezed out two words from between his lips with difficulty:","\"I'll sign.\"","As soon as the words fell, Qin Jiamu nimbly took out a pen from her bag and flung it over.","She also opened up her phone and started recording video.","Qin Jiamu and Sheng Mumu had previously consulted divorce lawyers who specialized in divorce lawsuits.","Although this scumbag Song Yue belonged to the party at fault in the marriage, if they really divided up the property, it would still be very difficult for Tingran to get eighty percent.","They could only use some tricks to make the scumbag voluntarily sign the agreement.","Only then could Tingran's interests be maximized.","To prevent any trouble in the future, Qin Jiamu recorded Song Yue voluntarily signing the agreement.","He Qing was dumbfounded watching this.","Before coming here, He Qing had been fantasizing about the wealthy madame life she would have after becoming Mrs. Song.","She didn't expect that before even becoming Mrs. Song, the Song family's wealth had already shrunk by a large margin.","She watched Song Yue sign the agreement out of the corner of her eye.","Glancing at the numbers on it.","Her suspended heart eased down a little.","Fortunately, Song Yue was still richer than she had imagined. Even if it was only twenty percent, it was still a huge sum.","Moreover, Song Yue still had his company and the ability to earn money.","As long as she held onto Song Yue's heart, she grasped the ticket to high society.","After Song Yue finished signing, Su Tingran quickly scribbled down her own name.","Closing the pen cap, Su Tingran stood up and said to Song Yue:","\"Let's go, now to the Civil Affairs Bureau, to process the divorce registration procedures.\"","Divorce agreements only took legal effect after the divorce registration procedures were completed.","She didn't want to drag it out any longer, only wanting to sever ties with Song Yue as soon as possible.","The group left the cafe and drove to the Civil Affairs Bureau.","In less than half an hour, the formalities were completed.","Walking out of the Civil Affairs Bureau's front door, Song Yue's mood was much calmer than before.","At this moment, no longer having to consider his identity as a husband, he held He Qing's hand and glanced at her.","As usual, He Qing looked up at him with a sweet smile.","A hint of warmth rippled through Song Yue's heart, sweeping away the gloom at the bottom of his heart.","He comforted himself in his heart, hoping this decision was the right one.","Now he only had her.","On the other side, Su Tingran stopped at the top of the steps, and let out a long breath.","She slightly tilted up her head, gazing into the distance.","It had rained that morning, leaving the weather humid and oppressive.","Now, the sun poked its head out from between the clouds.","Sunshine spilled down, and the stuffy heat in the air gradually dissipated.","How nice.","She closed her eyes, smiling contentedly at the corners of her lips, and laughed lightly in relief.","When she opened her eyes again, they were clear and bright.","These eyes had once been washed by tears, and now radiated renewed vitality.","\"Thank you, Tingran.\"","Suddenly, a familiar voice rang out. Su Tingran looked over.","Song Yue, holding He Qing's hand, had at some point walked over to stand in front of her.","\"Thank you for giving way to us, Tingran,\" Song Yue squeezed He Qing's hand tightly, as if speaking words of thanks, but more to prove something.","Su Tingran was stunned for a moment, then smiled.","Ha, it was still the Song Yue she knew so well.","Even at this point, he still had to pretend to be magnanimous.","Little did he know that his stiff demeanor and unnatural tone had long since given him away.","Losing most of the property, he was bleeding in his heart.","Yet he still had to keep up appearances, that so-called male dignity, and say hypocritical polite words.","Su Tingran was completely disillusioned with this man, too lazy to expose him, and did not respond.","\"It won't be too late to thank me more later—\"","Sheng Mumu's casual, relaxed voice rang out, responding on Su Tingran's behalf.","Song Yue and He Qing turned their heads in unison.","A look of puzzlement spread across their faces.","They didn't understand what Sheng Mumu meant.","They just saw Sheng Mumu hand an envelope to them, saying to Song Yue:","\"Take a look, no need to thank me.\"","After speaking, she looped her arm around Su Tingran's and walked towards the car without looking back.","The luxury car sped off, without a shred of reluctance.","On the way back to Xiyu Yue Courtyard, Sheng Mumu drove.","The car window was rolled down, and the cool breeze after the rain filled the car.","Su Tingran belatedly asked, \"Mumu, what did you give him? Are there other documents?\"","Sheng Mumu arched her brows, answering with laughter in her voice: \"A big gift package for the scumbag and his mistress.\"","Su Tingran blinked in confusion.","Qin Jiamu explained for Su Tingran's benefit: \"This morning, Mumu found some new information that she didn't get a chance to tell you about. She didn't take it out just now either, worried that after seeing it, that scumbag wouldn't be willing to sign the divorce papers.\"","\"It wasn't something I found,\" Sheng Mumu corrected. \"I had Brother Dong's assistant help investigate. How could I dig up such covert details?\"","Covert? Details?","Afraid that after seeing it Song Yue wouldn't be willing to sign?","Just what was it?","Su Tingran became increasingly curious.","Outside the Civil Affairs Bureau.","Song Yue's complexion was livid, his hands shaking uncontrollably.","The photos and documents in his hands also shook along with him.","There were around a dozen photos.","Every single one showed He Qing together in an intimate manner with a young man.","Entering and leaving hotels, walking arm in arm shopping, kissing in a car...","Song Yue's eyes bulged as his whole body went numb, forcibly suppressing his rage as he flipped open the document.","On it, was clearly He Qing's three-week pregnancy exam report.","As well as surveillance screenshots of He Qing and the young man going in and out of the hospital.","Even an idiot would know what this represented.","He pursed his lips tightly, blood raging unrestrainedly through his body, his neck bulging with veins from anger.","\"Honey, listen to me explain, it's not what you think!\" He Qing panicked, grabbing the man's arm. \"Honey! The photos are fake, they faked them to sabotage our relationship!\"","\"Do you think I'm an idiot?\" Song Yue fiercely shook her off.","\"Raising a boytoy behind my back, and still wanting to hide it from me, making me raise you two by myself?\"","\"Oh no, three, there's still one in your belly.\"","He Qing was pushed hard to the ground. She instinctively covered her lower abdomen.","Suddenly realizing her actions were being seen by Song Yue, she hurriedly moved her hands away.","Unwilling to give up on her wealthy family dreams, she could only continue lying:","\"Honey, the man in the photo is my ex-boyfriend, I don't have any contact with him anymore. I'm not pregnant, you misunderstood me, honey...\"","\"F*ck off!\" Song Yue's face was crimson, his head steaming green. He slapped her across the face.","No longer caring about so-called face, so-called manners.","On the other side.","The luxury car steadily drove along the lakeside road.","The cool autumn breeze wrapped up the conversation inside the car and drifted out slowly.","\"What? That woman used him as a sperm donor?\"","\"That's right.\"","\"Then isn't he an idiot?\"","\"He's not an idiot.\"","\"Hm?\"","\"We generally call this kind of person a pure cuckold.\"","\"Hahahaha—\""]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: No... Why doesn't she just play by the rules","paragraphs":["Germany, early morning.","In the central park of the villa district.","An old lady with white hair like a crane is practicing Tai Chi sword.","Foreigners passing by in twos and threes can't help gathering around.","Seeing the legendary oriental Tai Chi with their own eyes, the blue-eyed and blonde-haired international friends can't help but exclaim in admiration.","They give the old lady a thumbs up, the internationally recognized gesture.","Seeing this, a smile spreads across the old lady's face.","She remembers what Dr. Jiang told her yesterday, that the treatment is working well and the tumor is gradually shrinking. On a whim, the old lady decides to show off another set.","Let the foreigners get a taste of China's traditional culture.","Not far away on a bench, a man in casual all-black leisure wear sits lazily.","The leafy branches above his head weave shadows and light together.","The mottled light shines on the man's profile.","His features are sharp and his brows and eyes strikingly handsome.","Seeing the old lady getting better and better, Qi Mo's face shows a relieved expression as he lowers his eyes and draws back his gaze.","His long, slender fingers pull out a phone from his pocket.","As usual every day.","He sends Sheng Mumu an update on the old lady's recovery progress.","There is a seven hour time difference between here and Beijing.","He estimates that Sheng Mumu has probably just finished lunch now.","Qi Mo: [Picture]","The message is sent. He waits for a long time but no new messages pop up in the chat.","The man lazily drapes an arm over the back of the bench and turns his head to one side.","In the depths of his eyes a hint of confusion slowly surfaces.","Recently, she doesn't seem to be very willing to respond to him.","She always takes a long time to reply to his messages.","When he calls, she also often hangs up after a brief \"I'm busy with something here, let's talk later.\"","Just as he is puzzling over this.","His phone rings.","It's Director Dong, reporting on the progress of several ongoing projects at the group.","After finishing the business report, Director Dong suddenly changes the subject and asks:","\"By the way Mr. Qi, regarding that matter Madam asked me to investigate a few days ago, should I continue following up on it?\"","Director Dong works hard no matter what job he takes on.","Although it was just a simple task of investigating a person, he still upholds his principle of \"providing after-sales service to the end.\"","The Madam's orders are the same as Mr. Qi's orders.","Asking Mr. Qi now is the same as asking the Madam.","\"What matter?\" A low voice comes through the receiver.","Director Dong is stunned for a moment, blinking in confusion.","Uh... Could Mr. Qi not know about it?","As the president's personal assistant, reporting everything is also a basic responsibility.","So he carefully recounts how the Madam asked him to investigate Song Yue and He Qing.","After listening to Director Dong's account, Qi Mo's straight brows slightly furrow.","He finally finds a reason for Sheng Mumu's cold treatment of him.","To further confirm what he is thinking.","He makes another call.","\"Sir—\"","The receiver conveys Zhang Housekeeper's respectful, sonorous voice.","Qi Mo slowly opens his mouth:","\"Did she...\"","At the same time, at Xi Yu Yue Ting.","Sheng Mumu has just come out of the villa and is walking to Su Tingran's home.","She has been about to burst these past two days.","After working with Su Tingran to deal with that scumbag cheater, she really wants to share this with someone.","Brag a little about her thoughtful plan to help Su Tingran fight for the property.","However, thinking it over, there is no one she can chat freely with about this.","Usually, the first person she would think of is Qi Mo.","But for some reason, this time she hesitated.","Hearing the story of how Su Tingran and Song Yue's marriage went from blissful to shattered gave her newly grown lovey-dovey brain a shock, causing it to shrink back halfway.","A vague worry.","Barely starting a romance and already beginning to rely on him, none of it seems like a good sign.","So she grits her teeth and forcefully swallows back the strong urge to share.","Little Qi Shaobai noticed Sheng Mumu's abnormal behavior.","Last night when Qi Shaobai returned home from evening self-study, Sheng Mumu was casually leaning on the living room sofa, swinging her legs, watching TV while humming a tune.","Passing by the living room, Qi Shaobai stopped.","He looked at her for a moment, and his eyes suddenly narrowed. \"You're up to something.\"","Sheng Mumu blankly turned her head: \"?\"","Qi Shaobai spoke in a tone as if he had just cracked a case: \"These past two days you've had a smug look on your face, like you did something huge.\"","Sheng Mumu's pupils shook.","What? Was she looking smug so obviously?","Noticing her micro-expression, Qi Shaobai pulled out one earbud he had tucked in his ear.","As if proud of his keen observation, he lightly chuckled and lazily said:","\"I knew I guessed right. Go on, tell me, what is it?\"","Sheng Mumu glanced at him.","This kid has a look on his face like he's dying to hear the gossip but is trying hard to pretend he doesn't care if you say it or not.","The words that were almost past Sheng Mumu's lips were forcibly swallowed back.","After thinking it over, she decided against it.","Messy affairs like a scumbag cheating and wearing a green hat, telling these things to a seventeen-year-old flower of the motherland in his youth probably wasn't good.","The corners of Sheng Mumu's eyebrows slightly arched as she looked at Qi Shaobai and deliberately asked:","\"Little Qi, you're very curious and want to know, right?\"","\"I'm not curious, whatever, up to you—\" Qi Shaobai hadn't even finished saying \"up to you whether you say it or not\" before Sheng Mumu's voice cut him off.","\"Oh, since you don't care then I won't say.\"","Sheng Mumu shrugged, her expression calm:","\"After all, you don't care.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"!???\"","Wait...she's not following the script!","Sheng Mumu leisurely leaned back into the sofa again and lightly said:","\"Go back to your room and study, high schooler.\"","\"...Fine.\" Qi Shaobai took a deep breath, forcibly suppressed his curiosity, and turned back to his room.","And so, Sheng Mumu still hadn't found anyone to tell the words bottled up in her heart to.","Not until noon today.","While eating lunch, she heard Zhang Housekeeper muttering to himself nearby:","\"It looks like there might be a divorce next door at the Songs', sigh.\"","As soon as Sheng Mumu heard this, she immediately put down her chopsticks. \"Zhang Housekeeper, who did you hear that from?\"","Zhang Housekeeper waved his hand. \"Madam, I'm just guessing randomly, didn't hear it from anyone.\"","Sheng Mumu looked at him doubtfully, eyebrows raised: \"???\"","Could he really guess that accurately? She didn't believe it.","Zhang Housekeeper quickly explained: \"Yesterday morning I ran into Mrs. Song on the road. She looked refreshed and was all smiles, like she was a different person. That's why I randomly speculated and blindly guessed.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly became interested. \"Go on, tell me more.\"","Zhang Housekeeper was stunned for a few seconds before honestly opening his mouth:","\"Based on my life experience, the kind of relaxed and liberated expression on Mrs. Song's face usually only appears on people who have shaken off a burden.\"","Zhang Housekeeper lowered his voice a little and continued explaining his thought process:","\"But what burdens could Mrs. Song have? None other than Mr. Song who's rarely home.\"","\"I boldly guessed that shaking off a burden equals shaking off Mr. Song.\"","\"From that I concluded that there is likely trouble in the Song marriage.\"","\"Moreover, I thought through various possibilities and figured there's an 80% chance Mr. Song had an affair...\"","Sheng Mumu looked at him with an \"you're so amazing\" expression and couldn't help but pay her respects with folded hands:","\"Zhang Housekeeper, it's such a waste for you to just be a housekeeper!\"","Zhang Housekeeper bashfully waved his hand and chuckled:","\"No no, just random guessing, just random guessing.\"","Sheng Mumu finally couldn't hold it in anymore.","She lightly sighed and her expression was profound:","\"Well, since you've already guessed it pretty much spot on, let me tell you about that scumbag Su Tingran's glorious deeds.\"","Zhang Housekeeper's eyes widened in surprise as he listened to Sheng Mumu embellish and dramatize the tale."]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: He is very Approachable.","paragraphs":["When Sheng Mumu went to Su Tingran's house, she saw the servants moving things outside.","There were several cardboard boxes piled up on the front lawn.","Just as she was wondering, Su Tingran walked out from behind the door.","Seeing Sheng Mumu had arrived, Su Tingran smiled and said, \"Mumu, you're here.\"","\"Tingran, are you moving?\" Sheng Mumu pointed at the boxes on the ground.","She clearly remembered that the Xiaoyu Yue Ting villa was registered under Su Tingran's name, so she shouldn't have to move out, right?","Su Tingran smiled lightly and said indifferently, \"I'm not moving. Song Yue called me this morning and said he was coming to collect his belongings he left behind this afternoon.\"","When Sheng Mumu heard Song Yue's name, she instantly frowned,","\"What belongings could that scumbag have left behind? Green hats?\"","Su Tingran couldn't help but laugh out loud, thinking Sheng Mumu's indignant appearance on her behalf was particularly cute.","Su Tingran and Sheng Mumu went into the house together, leaving the housekeeper to take care of the rest.","At four o'clock in the afternoon.","Song Yue's car stopped outside the villa.","Just as Song Yue was about to drive into the yard, the housekeeper closed the iron gate.","\"I'm sorry, Mr. Song, external vehicles are not allowed to enter private residences.\"","Song Yue was stunned, pointed at himself, \"Me? Do you know who I am?\"","He suspected it was because he didn't go home much usually, so the housekeeper had gotten muddled and didn't recognize his face.","\"I see you clearly, Mr. Song.\" The housekeeper's expression remained unchanged as he raised his hand and pointed to the outside of the main gate, \"You can also take a look over here.\"","Song Yue looked in the direction the housekeeper was pointing.","At the gate, the sign that used to be engraved \"Song Residence\" had been replaced with \"Su Residence\" at some point without him noticing.","Song Yue was speechless for a long time, shocked beyond belief.","In just a few days.","The people in this house no longer recognized him.","\"Mr. Song, our mistress said that since you've come to collect your belongings, you should park your car outside and move them yourself.\"","Song Yue had nowhere to vent his grievances. He slammed the steering wheel heavily.","The car horn let out a long honk.","The sound startled Su Tingran and Sheng Mumu who were having tea on the second floor balcony.","Looking in the direction of the sound, they saw Song Yue get out of the car looking very upset and slam the car door shut.","Su Tingran withdrew her gaze and said to Sheng Mumu, \"Mumu, you were right, his face is all red from anger.\"","Fifteen minutes ago, Sheng Mumu had given Su Tingran the idea to not let the scumbag take his things so smoothly.","Sheng Mumu smiled, and her bad habit of talking nonsense when happy acted up,","\"Of course, my graduation thesis was called '108 Effective Ways to Anger Scumbags to Death'.\"","On the other side.","When Qi Mo heard about the whole situation from Butler Zhang,","Including the exaggerated parts added by Sheng Mumu.","With his understanding of Sheng Mumu, it wasn't hard to guess what kind of psychological process she had gone through these past few days.","A fleeting tension and loss flashed through his dark pupils.","In an instant, his heart ached to return home.","Not far away.","The Old Lady put away her sword sheath and walked towards the bench leisurely.","Suddenly, an excited and joyful voice came over.","\"Old Lady, Mr. Qi—\" Jiang Doctor ran over to them.","After stopping, he panted heavily and grabbed the Old Lady's shoulders, unable to conceal his excitement as he announced,","\"It's gone! The latest checkup report no longer shows any signs of the tumor. Old Lady, you've recovered! The treatment effect is even better and faster than expected.\"","The Old Lady was stunned and took several seconds to digest Jiang Doctor's words.","After a while, the wrinkles on her wrinkled face slowly lifted up, folding together happily.","\"Doctor Jiang, you and your master have taken great pains these days.\" With obvious joy in his eyes, Qi Mo didn't forget to thank Jiang Doctor amidst the happiness.","Jiang Doctor smiled, his gaze turning towards the distance.","At the end of his line of sight, his master stood under a tree, smiling lightly and nodding at them.","\"Mr. Qi, please, the remuneration you gave us is more than ten times that of outside jobs. It's our duty to take good care of the Old Lady.\" Jiang Doctor turned to look at the Old Lady, \"Although there are no longer any signs of the tumor now, it's best to stay here for observation for another half month just to be safe.\"","Qi Mo: \"Alright.\"","Just as he finished speaking, the Old Lady patted his arm.","\"Don't wait here for the remaining half month, you can go back now. Being away from home for so long, you must miss Mumu and Xiaodian a lot.\"","Qi Mo paused and didn't answer. At heart, he still felt uneasy.","The Old Lady looked up at her much taller grandson who was still hesitating, and pushed his arm again.","Her tone became impatient as she complained in quick succession,","\"Go, go, leave quickly, don't stay here and be a nuisance.\"","\"Staring at your phone all day long.\"","\"Your heart has flown who knows where when your person is in Germany.\"","Qi Mo's figure was tall and straight, yet he was pushed back half a step by the Old Lady's gentle force.","The corners of his mouth slowly curled up as he nodded lightly, \"Alright, I'll listen to you.\"","After arranging things in Germany, Qi Mo had Dong Assistant book the earliest flight.","He was expected to arrive in Jing City by night.","Xiaoyu Yue Ting.","When Su Tingran came to the front yard, Song Yue had already moved all the boxes but was still standing in the yard without leaving.","Last night, Song Yue had not slept at all and drank a bottle of red wine.","He replayed the scenes of getting acquainted with, falling in love with, and marrying Su Tingran over and over in his mind. The more he thought about it, the more regretful and remorseful he felt.","So he deliberately borrowed the excuse of collecting his clothes to say a face-to-face apology to Su Tingran.","They stood at the door of the villa.","Song Yue's lips moved, just about to speak.","Next door, Mrs. Xu passed by them.","Mrs. Xu didn't know the situation and greeted them, \"Mrs. Song, Mr. Song, are you going out for dinner?\"","Su Tingran looked over with a radiant smile, \"Sister Xu, we got divorced. I'm no longer Mrs. Song anymore. Just call me Little Su from now on.\"","Song Yue's body stiffened, suddenly feeling chilled to the bone, as if his heart was stabbed by an icicle.","Seeing Su Tingran's bright and lively smile, he could no longer get out that \"I'm sorry.\"","He knew that she no longer needed his apology now.","After Song Yue left, Su Tingran opened a bottle of expensive red wine, intending to celebrate their new life with Sheng Mumu.","As they sat down in the small side room and were choosing wine glasses, Sheng Mumu's phone vibrated with a new message.","Qi Mo: \"Do you still stand by what you said last time?\"","Sheng Mumu stopped what she was doing, and a question mark slowly rose in her heart.","Scrolling up to check the chat history, she realized she hadn't seen the message Qi Mo sent her a few hours ago.","Sheng Mumu jokingly replied:","\"What did I say? If it was about eating grass after weighing myself, then of course not. [laughing emoji]\"","Qi Mo: \"What you said about your two superficial preferences.\"","Sheng Mumu: ???","Before she could think more, a string of red packets with transfer amounts of several zeros suddenly popped up on the screen, one after another, seven or eight in a row.","Sheng Mumu was stunned, and her fingers reflexively clicked to accept the money transfer.","The red packets kept coming in. She quickly asked, \"What are you doing?\"","Qi Mo replied in one second: \"Giving in to your preferences.\"","Sheng Mumu's heartbeat slowed for a few seconds as her dimples sank in unknowingly.","She mocked in her heart: \"Sly old fox, always coming up with these fancy tricks.\"","On the side, Su Tingran had picked the wine glasses and turned to look at Sheng Mumu.","At this moment, the smile on Sheng Mumu's face had faded, replaced with a completely serious and solemn expression. She was frowning deeply, her fingers continuously poking the screen.","\"What's wrong, Mumu? Whose message is it?\" Su Tingran asked in puzzlement, feeling that Mumu looked very serious.","Sheng Mumu casually responded: \"Qi Mo.\"","Su Tingran looked worried: \"Mumu, you've been accompanying me recently, Qi Mo isn't mad at you for ignoring him, is he? I remember Qi Mo is quite aloof. What if he gets angry—\"","Before she could finish speaking, Sheng Mumu waved her hand with a laugh, interrupting:","\"How could he get angry? He's quite friendly.\""]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: Drunk and Full of Life","paragraphs":["The wine bottle tilted slightly.","Su Tingran was just about to pour wine into the glass.","A fair hand reached out and lifted up the bottle.","\"Don't drink this. Let's call Jiamu and Li and go out for drinks.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes curved, gleaming as if she had just won the lottery.","Having come into a large sum of unexpected wealth, she wanted to splurge.","\"To celebrate your return to singlehood, drinks are on me tonight. We won't stop until we're drunk!\"","On hearing this, Su Tingran also grew excited. \"We won't stop until we're drunk!\"","10pm. The top floor of a high-end club in the capital city.","Four women with graceful figures and charming temperaments walked out of the elevator.","Passing through the starry sky-themed hallway was like entering another world.","Dazzling, dizzying lights.","The air was infused with the smell of alcohol and tobacco.","The deafening music drowned out the sound of clinking glasses everywhere.","At the bar, the young and handsome bartender mixed strong drinks, moving as if performing magic tricks.","Qiao Li led the way, waving over a waiter to bring them to a private booth.","As the one most familiar with the bar scene, Qiao Li naturally took it upon herself to explain.","Mysteriously, she said:","\"This bar just newly opened not long ago. One word - amazing.\"","\"What's so amazing about it?\" Qin Jiamu curiously raised her brows.","Qiao Li: \"It's popular with the youth these days. So many good looking guys and girls. It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say this is the bar with the highest average attractiveness in the capital.\"","Qin Jiamu laughed confidently:","\"Of course, now that we're here, it's time to raise raise that average attractiveness?\"","The others laughed at Qin Jiamu's joke, nodding in agreement as they began pouring drinks, instantly settling into girls' night out mode.","Qiao Li turned to look at Su Tingran.","\"Sister Tingran, tonight we're mainly here for some eye candy.\"","\"Macho types, bookish types, bad boy types, cute types...\"","\"Whatever you're into, they have it here!\"","The introverted Su Tingran was a little embarrassed hearing this.","This was her first time at a bar. She had only gone to a few quiet bars and lounges with her ex-husband before. The atmosphere here was completely different.","Sheng Mumu noticed her discomfort and nudged her arm, joking:","\"Li's right, Tingran. You were cooped up at home before so you didn't know - young guys these days really go for older sisters, especially wealthy divorcées like you.\"","Sheng Mumu pointed around with her chin. \"I dare say if you yelled out right now 'I'm a rich divorcee worth billions', at least ten cute guys here would chase after you shouting 'Rich girl, hungry, food money!'\"","Su Tingran was taken aback, with an expression that said \"Don't go making things up now.\" She opened her mouth, \"Weren't we just here to drink and chat tonight?\"","She wasn't ready to meet someone new so soon.","Seeing that Su Tingran was finally engaging in conversation, Sheng Mumu felt relieved.","Just to liven things up, she teased her: \"Of course just drinking. Or did you want to spend money on some 'fun'...\"","Before she could get the words \"spend money on fun\" out, Su Tingran covered her mouth.","Su Tingran looked around warily:","\"Mumu, keep it down! Don't say too much, I don't want to be socially dead right after becoming newly single.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes smiled into crescents. With her mouth covered, her muffled voice leaked out:","\"Ok ok, I won't say it, I won't say it.\"","While they were joking around, two handsome young men walked by.","Their gazes kept shifting to their table, clearly wanting to come over and strike up a conversation. They even sat down at the empty booth next to them.","Seeing their less-than-honorable intentions, Qin Jiamu couldn't help but frown and glare at them.","\"What are you looking at? Finished your homework?\"","The two guys froze in surprise before quickly changing tables.","Seeing this, the other three women burst into laughter.","And so, the night really did become purely for \"looking\" at hunks.","Chatting, drinking, playing drinking games, they were having a blast.","At that time. Capital City International Airport.","A man walked out of the arrival hall.","Tall and well-built, with refined features.","He had casually draped his suit jacket over his arm, revealing his muscular frame through his crisp button-down shirt.","After reading project reports for his company the whole flight, he still had on silver wire-rimmed glasses.","An air of elegance and aloofness attracted the attention of those around him.","Qi Mo took out his phone from his pant pocket, lowering his eyes.","Opening WeChat, a hint of confusion flashed through his dark irises.","Sheng Mumu had taken all the money from the red envelope he sent her, but hadn't replied to the message he had put inside.","He told her on WeChat that he was coming home tonight.","She didn't seem to have seen it.","Qi Mo unhurriedly took off his glasses and pinched the bridge of his nose.","Outside the airport doors, Xiao Wang had been waiting for a while.","Seeing the boss come out, he quickly came forward to take his luggage and held the car door open.","After putting away the luggage, Xiao Wang got into the driver's seat.","He glanced slightly at the back.","He could see the boss looking at his phone with a faint frown on his brows.","After tapping a few times, he raised the phone to his ear.","After waiting a while, he put the phone down again.","Xiao Wang's observant eyes turned, but he didn't say anything. He started the car.","He had learned his lesson this time.","Without asking where the boss wanted to go, he drove straight towards Xiyu Yue Ting.","From what he observed, Chairman Qi hadn't stayed in the company residence for a long time now.","Whenever he had free time, it was always home.","This time it must be the same.","In the bar.","Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu were engrossed in playing drinking games.","Qiao Li was pulling Su Tingran to look at the hunks walking by.","None of the four noticed a phone lighting up on the table several times.","Sheng Mumu loved eating and drinking. She kept losing to Qin Jiamu at the drinking game and wasn't willing to admit defeat.","After a few more rounds, several cocktails had gone down.","Cocktails had a high alcohol content, but went down smooth.","Before she knew it, she was drunk.","Sheng Mumu's fair complexion already had a light blush, making her appear even more translucent.","But in the dim lighting of the bar, the red and purple hues masked her flushed face.","The four looked at each other, each thinking the others were not drunk yet.","So they waved extravagantly for another round of cocktails.","Su Tingran went to the bathroom midway.","Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiamu put down the drinking game.","They both pulled on the youngest Qiao Li on either side.","\"Li, tell us who you're interested in. Sis will go get his WeChat for you,\" Qin Jiamu patted her chest confidently.","Hearing this, Sheng Mumu was unhappy.","She picked up the phone from the table and quickly unlocked it.","Eager to see Cheng Zhuo's childhood photos, she didn't notice the missed call notifications on the screen.","After flipping through the album, she found the photo of little Cheng Zhuo sitting on a baby walker wearing split-crotch pants.","She shoved the phone in Qiao Li's face.","\"Don't listen to Jiamu. Li, look at this one, do you like him?\"","Qiao Li: \"......\"","Pupils trembling slightly.jpg","\"Sis, don't joke around, isn't this Cheng Zhuo?\"","Tipsy Sheng Mumu sat up straight in a split second.","As if catching Qiao Li red-handed, she slurred:","\"Ohhh, you can recognize him even dressed like this?\"","As she spoke, Qiao Li's ears suddenly turned red.","Seeing her reaction, Sheng Mumu was even more amused.","She didn't expect the rocker girl to blush too.","She pushed the phone closer, nearly hitting Qiao Li's nose.","Drunk, she interrogated:","\"Well, what do you think, is my brother handsome or not?\"","Just then, a message popped up on the screen.","Qiao Li's eyes lit up, finding an excuse to change the topic.","\"Sis, you have a new WeChat message.\"","Still tipsy, Sheng Mumu slowly clicked to open it.","Muttering resentfully:","\"Who is it, messaging so late and disturbing our drinking. It better be important.\""]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: Catching a Drunkard","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu opened WeChat.","On the screen was a message sent by Qi Shaobai:","\"Today's tasks:","English test paper 1/1","Science test paper 1/1","Tomorrow's plan:","Math test papers, one set","English cloze training, 10 articles\"","Alright, it was little Qi.","The scolding words had already reached her throat, but she swallowed them back down again, putting on a kind motherly smile.","Lately, this kid had been reporting to her every day on how many test papers he had done, and what content he was planning to reinforce learning tomorrow. His intention to be praised was all too obvious.","\"What a grown-up message.\"","Sheng Mumu blurted out a sentence for no reason.","Her whole demeanor gave off a feeling of being clearly drunk but forcing herself to act sober, making small talk for the sake of it.","She tapped at her phone randomly, replying to Qi Shaobai's message.","She didn't even know what she had replied.","The waiter brought over their third round of drinks.","Sheng Mumu's fingers lightly twisted the wine glass, and downed it in one gulp.","Still feeling it wasn't enough, she reached for more.","\"No more drinking.\"","Qin Jiamu slapped her hand away with a \"pa\".","Sheng Mumu obediently withdrew her hand, pouting, \"I'm thirsty...\"","Qin Jiamu pointed to the dance floor with a serious expression, \"If you're thirsty, look at the hunks over there. That'll make you salivate and quench your thirst.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned, \"... \"","She fell silent for a good long while, expression blank.","Suddenly, her eyes lit up brightly.","Raising her hand, she snapped her fingers crisply.","\"Good point, why didn't I think of that!\"","Qin Jiamu: \"............\"","Qin Jiamu took a light breath, stunned for a moment in disbelief.","It seemed Mumu really was a little drunk.","She observed for a while.","She saw Sheng Mumu resting her cheeks in her hands, staring blankly at the dance floor for a good long time.","Occasionally letting out a few silly laughs.","After a while, she also took out her phone, seeming to be sending Su Tingran voice messages.","Pressing the voice message button, she mumbled indistinctly:","\"Tingran, did you fall into the toilet? Come back quick and see the hunks!\"","\"Nevermind, it's fine, I'll take photos and send them to you.\"","\"... \"","Seeing that she was just fiddling with her phone alone, without any other drunken antics, Qin Jiamu gradually let down her guard.","On the other side.","The luxury car drove smoothly through Beijing's dazzling nightscape.","Almost arriving at the Xiyu Yue Pavilion villa area.","Qi Mo's gaze was faint as he looked out of the window.","His phone suddenly buzzed a few times.","Beneath his long lashes, a hint of delight rose in his eyes.","She had finally replied to his message.","Opening it.","There were two voice messages and a few short videos.","His cold, fair fingers bent slightly, lightly tapping to play them.","Sheng Mumu's drunken voice rang out—","\"Tingran, did you fall into the toilet? Come back quick and see the hunks!\"","\"Nevermind, it's fine, I'll take photos and send them to you.\"","Qi Mo's expression darkened, his lips pressing into a straight line.","Opening the videos.","The noisy music sounded in the quiet car interior.","On screen, men and women swayed their bodies on the dance floor.","Next, the camera zoomed in, closer and closer, focusing on a muscular hunk.","Sheng Mumu's voice accompanied it:","\"Hehehe~ His muscles must feel really springy, right?\"","\"Tingran, come back quick, this is like our happy hometown.\"","\"I'm sleeping over tonight, wheee~ \"","Next video.","The camera pointed at another man.","Sheng Mumu's voice was even more elated than before.","\"The previous one was too old, this one's more good-looking.\"","The camera suddenly swung around.","\"Whoops, I was rash, that pineapple head over there is quite attractive too.\"","\"Which one do you like?\"","\"... \"","Xiao Wang was driving, and accidentally overheard it all clearly. He didn't even dare breathe heavily, body tense.","Pricking up his ears to listen for a good while, sensing no more sounds, he cautiously glanced over through the rearview mirror.","With just a flash of a glance, Xiao Wang's body stiffened as he shuddered.","President Qi's expression was terrifyingly gloomy.","The bone-chilling cold aura he emitted was enough to freeze the air.","Qi Mo's voice was as if wrapped in ice cubes, speaking heavily:","\"Turn around.\"","Su Tingran finally came back from the bathroom.","When she returned, Sheng Mumu had already put down her phone and was mumbling softly to herself.","She went over, \"Mumu, what are you saying?\"","Sheng Mumu grabbed her, \"Come, let's compete on doing test papers! Whoever scores lower drinks!\"","Su Tingran: \"......???\"","Because Sheng Mumu had just received Qi Shaobai's message, her head was now full of the words \"math test paper, English test paper, science test paper\".","Even her drunken ramblings all revolved around \"test papers\".","Seeing that Su Tingran wouldn't compete with her on doing test papers, Sheng Mumu went to look for Qiao Li instead.","\"Li, wanna compete? Loser drinks, that kind of thing.\"","Qiao Li blinked blankly, not understanding what she was talking about.","Before she could even ask, she heard Sheng Mumu raise her hand to call the waiter.","\"Waiter, bring us two more sets of Chinese test papers here.\"","Qiao Li was also a little drunk. Only now did she understand her words, pausing before saying:","\"We can't finish two sets, can we?\"","It was still Qin Jiamu who kept her composure.","When the puzzled waiter came over, Qin Jiamu whispered a few words to him.","Afterwards, the waiter handed Sheng Mumu a blank piece of paper and a pen.","Sheng Mumu accepted the paper and pen, and earnestly started doing her \"test paper\".","As the soberest person present, Qin Jiamu calmly messaged Cheng Zhuo to come pick them up.","Twenty minutes later.","Sheng Mumu suddenly stood up, \"Teacher, I'm handing in my test paper!\"","The moment she stood, she felt dizzy and unsteady.","Staggering, she was about to fall over.","The next second, her waist was firmly supported by a large hand.","Her back bumped into the man's chest.","Qi Mo's familiar low voice brushed past her ear.","\"Mumu.\"","Sheng Mumu looked up, meeting Qi Mo's exquisite, handsome side profile.","\"Hehehe~\"","She suddenly laughed, trying to find a pocket on her pocketless dress.","Mumbling drunkenly: \"This is the most handsome, I'll take a photo to show Tingran.\"","The large hand circling her waist tightened, her waistline tightly adhering to the man's body.","Although drunk, she still reacted, reflexively trying to push him away, \"Who are you?\"","Qi Mo turned his head to look at her.","Her cheeks were flushed from the alcohol, gaze blurry yet bewitching.","Her soft body leaned weakly against him, her hands restless.","One moment pinching his arm, the next pushing at his waist and abdomen.","He pulled her in tighter, leaning his head over.","His magnetic, seductive voice carried a hint of command, reprimanding the drunkard.","\"Don't move around.\"","The fresh, pleasing scent intruded Sheng Mumu's nostrils.","In her muddled state, she realized it was a familiar scent, no longer struggling or resisting the man's increasingly tight embrace.","Instead, her hand hooked around his neck, burying her face in the crook of it.","Nuzzling against him like a kitten.","The warm breath spraying the crook of his neck caused the man's body to suddenly tense up.","His eyes darkened, voice gentle:","\"Come home with me.\""]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: Keemer, I want to be with you","paragraphs":["When Qi Mo carried Sheng Mumu back to the car, Xiao Wang had already raised the partition.","The spacious interior of the luxury car was divided into two separate spaces.","Leaving the noisy environment of the bar, Sheng Mumu felt as if the mute button had been pressed next to her ear.","In a daze, she couldn't find her bearings.","She could only cling tightly to the man beside her, seeking the familiar scent that comforted her.","She leaned her head against his chest.","One hand pinched the edge of the third button on his shirt.","The meticulously buttoned shirt was rumpled by her grip.","But the man was not annoyed in the slightest, gently patting her back to soothe her.","The car window opened, letting in a refreshing cool breeze.","Sheng Mumu's hair was blown about by the wind, the ends brushing against the man's neck one after another.","Qi Mo's breathing slowed, his thick lashes casting a shadow beneath his eyes.","As the angle of the dim yellow streetlights outside changed, the shadow flickered slightly.","Like his heart at this moment, unable to be still.","Xiao Wang didn't ask Qi Mo where to go, but drove straight towards Xiyu Yue Courtyard.","It was quiet in the car cabin.","The only movement was Sheng Mumu's increasingly restless hand.","At some point, it had come to the edge of the man's jawline.","Up to no good.","Using her soft fingertips, she traced the man's sharp, rugged jawline on and off.","Her voice drunk, she murmured:","\"Qi Mo?\"","Hearing his name called, the man's jet black eyes suddenly tightened.","Lowering his voice, he said:","\"Yes, I'm here.\"","After he spoke, Sheng Mumu grabbed his shirt a little tighter.","The head buried in his neck slowly lifted up.","Sheng Mumu had gone to the salon for a full body spa before going out today, leaving her smelling fragrant from head to toe.","Now as she moved, the sweetness in the air mixed with a faint scent of alcohol assaulted Qi Mo.","\"Qi Mo,\" she called his name again.","The warm air brushed past his ear, and Qi Mo's Adam's apple rolled up and down. Lowering his eyes to look at her, Sheng Mumu's slender brows knitted slightly.","She seemed to want to say something, her lips moving as she tried her best to organize her alcohol-jumbled language.","The man appeared extremely patient, not hurrying her at all.","His gaze slowly circled her face.","Gradually lowering, until finally settling on her rosy, moist, crystal clear lips.","Because she was thinking, the corners of her lips were lightly pursed, an extremely delicate outline, moist and lustrous.","\"Qi Mo, I want to be with you--\" Sheng Mumu stopped for a moment, dizzy and muddled, her drunk eyes half-closed.","Qi Mo's eyes flashed, as he quietly watched her.","After a long pause, she finally organized her words. Nodding her head, she said:","\"I want to compete with you.\"","Qi Mo didn't understand what she meant. His low, husky voice had a soothing tone as he asked:","\"Compete in what?\"","Sheng Mumu tilted her head to one side, uttering one word at a time:","\"Compete in...doing...sit ups...\"","\"I'll...give you...three points...\"","\"Compete with me...okay?\"","Even drunk, Sheng Mumu didn't forget the grievance that no one wanted to compete with her.","Compromising in her drunken state, the corners of her lips sank down sadly, pouting in disappointment that looked extremely pitiful.","However, before Qi Mo could react, her head heavily drooped down again as she leaned limply against his chest, her hand going soft and flopping down as she quietly closed her eyes.","Qi Mo's eyes flashed, staring at the troublemaker in his arms for a few seconds.","He smiled helplessly.","\"Drunkard.\"","Just as Qi Mo thought she had really fallen asleep this time, and slowly lightened his breathing, turning his gaze out the window.","Sheng Mumu suddenly raised her hand, using her fingertip to poke his pectoral muscle.","Qi Mo's brow twitched, his heart stung as if by a bee.","The tranquil eyes were stirred up with emotion, a hint of murkiness in his gaze.","Sheng Mumu narrowed her eyes, shamelessly poking and squeezing a few more times.","Pouting, she mumbled:","\"Not bouncy at all, so hard.\"","The next second, her hand was grabbed by a larger one.","The man lowered his eyes to look at the troublemaker in his arms, his voice somewhat hoarse:","\"Don't move.\" However, this warning was clearly useless for the drunkard.","Sheng Mumu easily slipped her hand out of the man's loose grip.","Opening her hand, she moved it back to his chest.","Using all five fingers, she pinched.","Lifting her drunk eyes, she unreasonably said:","\"What's wrong with touching a little?\"","Then, her slender fingers bent slightly.","Scratching and pinching two more times.","The shirt material was very thin, the seemingly ticklish and enticing sensation coming through the fabric.","Qi Mo's breathing slowed for a few beats.","The clear, cold black eyes were stirred up.","The suppressed emotions almost bursting out of his chest.","He took a deep breath, pressing down the drumming of his heart.","Once again grabbing her hand, firmly locking her in his embrace.","Not allowing her to continue stirring up trouble.","Nor allowing himself to take advantage of her inebriated state.","On the way, Xiao Wang stopped to buy some sobering medicine.","After Qi Mo fed it to Sheng Mumu, he pressed her against him to force her to be quiet.","By the time they reached the villa, the sobering medicine seemed to have taken some effect.","She was much calmer, no longer touching and fumbling.","But the hand wrapped around the man's neck still refused to let go.","Qi Mo carried her out of the car, intending to take her upstairs.","She frowned, pushing him away, insisting:","\"I can walk myself, I'll show you I can walk a straight line.\"","She had barely lifted her foot to take a step when an arm slipped around her slender, soft waist from behind, supporting her. Ignoring her repeated shouts, he strongly led her away.","The master bedroom was on the second floor.","Despite the short distance, it took them a full three minutes to get there.","Sheng Mumu was slightly more sober, able to grasp her current situation and regain some of her thinking ability. But she was even less quiet.","From \"getting handsy\" she turned into a \"problem girl.\"","Firing off questions the whole time:","\"Qi Mo? Why are you back?\"","\"Weren't you in Germany?\"","\"Am I dreaming?\"","\"Oh right, I remember, you came to the bar to catch me.\"","\"Why did you catch me.\"","\"All I wanted was to drink, what's wrong with that!\"","\"......\"","Her questions came one after another without response.","Qi Mo supported her, walking behind her.","His lowered eyes concealed the indistinct turmoil in his gaze.","Pushing open the bedroom door.","Qi Mo pulled out one arm to find the light switch on the wall.","Sheng Mumu seized the opportunity, twisting free of his hold.","Qi Mo's outstretched hand withdrew back into the air, caught by Sheng Mumu grabbing his arm.","Sheng Mumu leaned all her weight onto him.","She stared at him, puffed up indignantly.","Her drunken words mixed with truth and complaints.","\"I'm talking to you.\"","\"Why are you ignoring me.\"","\"Is it because I took advantage of you and you're angry?\"","\"You're so petty, you're treating me badly......\"","Qi Mo met her gaze.","The air froze for a moment.","Her eyes were brimming, a flush rising on her cheeks, adding to her charm.","Although questioning him, she had no aggression at all.","On the contrary, charming and bright, her gaze like silk.","Stared at by her, the string in the man's mind named \"reason\" finally snapped under her repeated unintentional provocations.","His eyes grew increasingly thick, his breathing hotter and hotter.","In an instant, the surroundings became as silent as a vacuum.","He could hear his own heartbeat, pounding as if about to burst from his chest.","Abruptly, his Adam's apple rolled.","His long arms circled her slender, soft waist, while his other hand clasped the back of her neck.","In just a flash, he turned and pinned her against the door."]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: Let's Be Together","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu gasped in surprise at his sudden action.","Trapped between the door and his chest, Sheng Mumu had nowhere to retreat. Her heart skipped a beat.","The bedroom was only illuminated by rings of light, giving off a dim glow.","The beam from an overhead spotlight shone down, bringing Qi Mo's handsome features into sharper relief.","His brows and eyes were deep set, his nose high-bridged.","Assailing her senses.","Her heart beat faster against her will.","The next second, Qi Mo's tall frame bowed slightly as his long fingers lazily loosened his tie.","Like a mountain, his imposing presence loomed over her.","Blocking out most of the light.","Ink-black eyes grew murky.","Drawing closer and closer.","A soft kiss landed.","Very light, tentatively.","Brushing her brow, the corners of her eyes, a light peck.","Finally stopping at her crimson lips, refusing to leave.","The hand cupping the back of her head held her in place, forcing her to tilt her head back.","Sheng Mumu's back was pressed against the icy door.","Her palms were tightly clenched at her sides, slick with a chill sweat.","Yet her lips were hot, and his breath was hot, impossible to ignore.","Dominance and tenderness intertwined.","It was a very Qi Mo-like kiss.","Her clenched fists gradually relaxed, long lashes fluttering lightly.","Her breath stolen away, words she wanted to say were swallowed up in soft moans.","The clean, refreshing scent that lingered around the man overwhelmed her senses.","Already drunk, and being kissed so gently, she was even more muddled, weak all over.","After some time, Qi Mo finally parted from her lips a little.","Sheng Mumu's face was flushed crimson.","Breathing unevenly, she turned her head aside.","Regaining her breath, she panted lightly.","The man's upright nose touched her cheek as he also breathed heavily.","His eyes had darkened with desire, his gaze shifting downward.","Seeing her delicate, curved collarbones rise and fall with each breath.","Sheng Mumu felt the breaths skimming her cheek grow hotter and hotter.","The temperature steadily climbed.","The man's low, tempting voice drifted over.","\"Didn't you just say to give you thirty percent?\"","Sheng Mumu's breath hitched. She abruptly turned to face him.","Their eyes met.","\"Now I'm at a hundred percent,\" he said.","Sheng Mumu froze at his words, her eyes complex.","There was shyness, disbelief.","The sly old fox had actually interpreted her drunken words that way.","Qi Mo's pitch-black pupils abruptly tightened, cutting her off.","Drawing out the last syllable,","\"I tore that up long ago.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","Having finally undone his right cufflink, Qi Mo raised his hand again to loosen his tie.","He slowly leaned in, his handsome face coming closer and closer.","With his shirt slightly unbuttoned, his exquisite, attractive collarbones were half-hidden.","But Sheng Mumu was too nervous to look, her heart about to leap out of her chest.","The man's breath washed over her like a tidal wave.","He grasped her hand.","With no pesky cufflinks to hinder him, he brought her hand over her head.","Pinned it against the door, clasping her wrist.","Her slender, snow-white arm and his muscular one formed a stark contrast.","His hand slid upward, parting her fingers one by one, interlacing them tightly. Sheng Mumu struggled a few times, realizing her hand was immobilized as if welded in place by an iron band.","She could only let the man's face inch closer and closer, right before her eyes.","\"You—\"","Her unfinished words were silenced once more.","His kiss landed.","Sheng Mumu's body instantly tensed, an involuntary cry escaping her throat.","This time, it was no longer a fleeting taste.","As ferocious as a caged beast set free.","He had been restraining himself for a long time.","The pent-up possessiveness roared out unchecked.","The still waters of his heart were thoroughly disturbed, swirling up in tumult.","The cunning man, a wolf in nature, finally revealed his predatory side.","Gradually deepening the kiss.","As if wanting to mark every inch of her body with his brand.","In the tangled breaths, Sheng Mumu's heart pounded heavily against her chest.","Unconsciously, she had closed her eyes.","Enduring his tempestuous onslaught.","There was no lingering tenderness, no restraint or self-control.","Just a tiny crumbling of her defenses.","Thrilling tremors permeated her.","After some time, Sheng Mumu noticed the large hand pinning her gradually relaxed its grip.","Callused fingertips gently squeezed her fingertips, gliding across her palm.","Tingling sensations spread from her palm outward.","She reflexively jerked her hand back.","The next second, she circled her arms around his neck.","Her boneless hands circled him so lightly, Qi Mo's gaze darkened.","His warm palms slid to her lower back, gently pulling her close.","The man's palms were scorching as a furnace.","Sheng Mumu's cheeks were just as fiery.","In her dazed state, Sheng Mumu even thought that if she struck a match now, her face could probably catch fire.","Her body was limp, a tremendous sense of weightlessness.","As if only by clinging to his broad shoulders could she keep from falling.","Her mind was in turmoil, yet her thoughts had never been clearer.","She was acutely aware that this was the moment.","The moment she was willing to throw all caution to the wind and be with him.","The moment she willingly submitted to his overbearing kiss, giving her no chance to shrink back.","The moment he finally lost control despite his restraint.","A long time passed.","Qi Mo slowly pulled back from the kiss, cradling her face in his hands to force her to look at him directly.","His obsidian eyes were like stars embedded in the night sky, flickering lights.","Because of his arousal, they also held a trace of barely discernible desire, flashing on and off.","Indescribably seductive.","His voice was low and hoarse as he asked,","\"Have I caught you yet?\"","A belated question—his obtuse attempt at expressing himself.","Unsure, he wanted to hear the answer from her own lips.","The air in the room was stifling, a thin sheen of sweat beading Sheng Mumu's forehead.","Wisps of hair curled alluringly onto her elegant, curved collarbones.","Long lashes fluttered lightly, her eyes filled with rippling waves.","A blush spread from her earlobes to her ears, reddening her fair face.","Breaths coming unevenly, her lips were unnaturally flushed, moist and soft.","She didn't know how utterly bewitching she looked in his eyes just then.","Making him unable to resist the urge to torment her a little.","Light glimmered in Qi Mo's deep, murky eyes.","His Adam's apple rolled as he swallowed tightly, breathing growing ragged as he watched her intently.","Waiting for her answer.","Sheng Mumu gazed into those pitch-black eyes.","She could clearly hear the pounding of her own heart, each beat shattering what remained of her heart's walls.","Over ten seconds ticked by.","But it felt like a century.","She softly exhaled, then steadfastly met his scorching eyes.","Her lids slowly closed, then opened again.","Her chin dipped ever so slightly, the corners of her lips curving up in tacit consent.","Meaning, yes.","Let's be together."]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: Just established relationship is so humiliating, how to sweet love in the future","paragraphs":["The next day.","Sheng Mumu was woken up by the sound of the maid cleaning the second floor hallway.","She rubbed her sleepy eyes as her mind cleared, and scenes from last night popped up in her head.","She suddenly flipped off the covers and sat up.","Unnatural flushes of red appeared on her cheeks that still had creases from sleeping.","She didn’t remember how long they had kissed last night.","She only remembered that finally, he was willing to move his lips away, and held her in his arms for a long time.","It was as if he could never hold her enough.","Her chin was on his broad shoulders, and the air that had been taken from her slowly recovered.","Her breathing was still very chaotic, panting the whole time.","He slowly patted her back, as if to help her calm her breathing.","However, the arm around her waist was tightening, making it even harder for her to breathe.","Counterproductive.","Sheng Mumu also remembered when Qi Mo left for work early in the morning.","At that time, she was half asleep.","She heard the rustling of the covers being lifted next to her, but was too lazy to open her eyes.","Although her eyes were closed, she could still feel someone staring at her.","In her grogginess, the mattress beside her sank, and the faint light on her eyelids was blocked by a dark shadow.","The shadow got closer and closer.","Her forehead was touched by a pair of warm lips.","It was fleeting, and quickly gone.","She wasn't fully awake, and mumbled as she turned over.","Then she felt someone tuck the covers around her tightly.","The warm, comfortable environment made her overwhelmed with drowsiness.","She didn't even have the energy to open her eyes to take a look.","Various rustling sounds continued around her ears.","The pitter-patter of water flowing in the bathroom.","The metallic click of a belt being buckled.","The extremely subtle clinks of adjusting a watchband.","And the sound of the lock clicking shut as the man left the bedroom.","Sheng Mumu scratched her already messy hair.","As her head gradually cleared, more and more memory fragments came bubbling up.","Extremely clear.","She remembered Qi Mo pinning her against the door and kissing her.","She remembered the slow, tantalizing way he undid the cuffs of his shirt before kissing her.","Both provocative and bewitching.","Oh my god!","It completely crushed her aesthetic standards.","It was as if instead of undoing cufflinks, he had undone the tight knots around her heart.","Letting the deer in her heart run wild for five kilometers.","Just as she had finally chased that image out of her mind and was about to get up and freshen up.","Her gaze suddenly stopped, and she halted her upward motion.","She suddenly remembered even earlier, in the car, when she had poked and pinched Qi Mo's chest.","And the wanton words she had said—","\"Not bad pecs, nice and hard.\"","\"What's wrong with touching them a bit!\"","Sheng Mumu: \"............\"","She bent down and buried her head in the covers.","Her fuzzy head thrashed around on the bed as she weakly punched the mattress a couple of times.","Ahhhhhhhhhhh!!!!","She didn't want to live anymore!!!!","It was so embarrassing, and they had just confirmed their relationship.","How could she have a sweet romance like this?","Annoying as hell.jpg","\"Knock knock—\"","Two knocks sounded from outside the door.","Her head emerged from the covers.","She heard Zhang Housekeeper's sonorous voice.","\"Mistress, you're awake now, right?\"","Zhang Housekeeper had estimated the time and was providing his wakeup call service.","He opened the door.","Zhang Housekeeper stood outside the door with his hands clasped.","\"Mistress, the master told me to prepare some hangover soup and millet porridge for your stomach.\"","Sheng Mumu was taken aback for a moment.","A surge of warmth suddenly welled up in her heart.","She was touched by that man's thoughtful arrangements.","\"Mistress, would you like breakfast served in the bedroom or the dining room?\" Zhang Housekeeper asked with a smile.","\"The dining room is fine.\"","After washing up, Sheng Mumu came to the dining room for breakfast.","Her mind was still reflecting on what had happened last night. She took a shallow breath.","She was trying hard to accept that her relationship with Qi Mo had changed.","Thinking about what she needed to do to reverse the wanton image she had in his eyes.","She mechanically raised her wrist to scoop another spoonful of porridge into her mouth.","Suddenly she paused, looking up at Zhang Housekeeper.","\"Isn't there too much sugar in today's porridge?\"","Zhang Housekeeper looked puzzled and stunned. \"Mistress, there's no sugar added to the porridge.\"","\"Hmm?\" Sheng Mumu scratched her head.","Why did it taste so sweet to her?","Before she could figure it out, the door to Qi Shaobai's room opened.","The teenager was wearing a black t-shirt and grey pants. He twisted his neck.","And yawned, stretching lazily.","The lazy yawn drifted over to this side of the dining room.","Sheng Mumu looked over, and happened to meet Qi Shaobai's glance coming her way too.","Their eyes met, and Qi Shaobai's lit up in an instant.","Sheng Mumu casually greeted:","\"Morning, Little Qi. Come have breakfast together.\"","Since today was Sunday, Qi Shaobai had a rare chance to sit down for a proper breakfast instead of rushing off to school.","Qi Shaobai came over and pulled out a chair to sit down.","He leaned forward, but didn't make a move to pick up his chopsticks and start eating.","Instead, he looked at Sheng Mumu expectantly.","He held out his hand and arrogantly said:","\"I've done everything you asked, now hand it over.\"","\"?\" Sheng Mumu looked at his outstretched palm, then back at him in confusion. \"Huh? Hand over what?\"","Qi Shaobai: \"What you said last night. As long as I did two more sets of practice questions, I'd get three limited edition Lego sets this morning.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"?????\" When had she ever said that?","Seeing her bewildered expression, Qi Shaobai tilted his fluffy head.","\"Hey, you're not going back on your word, are you?\"","Sheng Mumu blinked in puzzlement, swallowed her mouthful of breakfast, and asked:","\"First tell me if it exists, then ask why. When did I ever promise you that?\"","Qi Shaobai couldn't believe it as he shook his head, muttering to himself:","\"Reneging on a promise?\"","\"This must be the slippery nature of the adult world...\"","\"And here I was up until 4am last night...\"","He took out his phone as he grumbled under his breath, and held it out to her.","\"See for yourself.\"","Sheng Mumu leaned back to look at the screen.","It was her WeChat conversation with Qi Shaobai.","\"Little Wish Granter Stepmom: Little Qi, you're so amazing! What a good, well-behaved child! \"","\"Little Wish Granter Stepmom: Keep up the good work. Do two more sets of practice questions and you'll wake up tomorrow to three limited edition Lego sets.\"","\"Little Wish Granter Stepmom: I believe in you! .jpg\"","Sheng Mumu stared blankly: ......","Looking at the messages, they did seem to be sent by her.","Probably when she was drunk and replying randomly.","Sheng Mumu's gaze moved back to Qi Shaobai.","She hesitated, about to explain: \"Uh......this......well......actually......\"","Qi Shaobai put his phone away, his eyes darkening. \"Don't try to tell me you were drunk when you sent them. That excuse is super lame, I won't believe it.\"","Sheng Mumu: \".......\"","He saw right through her???","Qi Shaobai swiped at his screen a few times, and started lecturing in a sullen tone:","\"I won't even mention how childish those messages were, treating me like a three year old—\"","Sheng Mumu: \"???\"","Not mentioning it?","\"The main point is, I did the worksheets like you asked. You can't make me do them for nothing, right?\" Qi Shaobai argued righteously.","Sheng Mumu was silent for a few seconds, then slowly said:","\"I understand where you're coming from, but there's one thing I want to say.\"","Qi Shaobai waved his hand. \"Go ahead.\"","\"What exactly is Little Wish Granter Stepmom?\""]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Teach Me","paragraphs":["\"Oh, this?\"","Qi Shaobai leaned back in his chair, his innate unruly face taking on a gentle look as he laughed softly.","\"The note you gave me suits very well, doesn't it?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","It was more than just suitable.","It was practically identical to the way she wrote notes about people.","Thinking of the \"Dream Fulfiller\" lying quietly in her WeChat contacts, Sheng Mumu casually raised an eyebrow:","\"Ok, I said I wouldn't forget what I promised, don't worry. The Lego set is on its way and I'll have it for you in a couple days.\"","Hearing the reply he wanted, joy flashed through Qi Shaobai's eyes. Finally, he was able to focus on eating breakfast.","He ladled some porridge into a bowl for himself and drank directly from it without using a spoon.","But as soon as it entered his mouth, his brows knitted together instantly.","\"Why is it so sweet?\"","He looked to Butler Zhang beside him and asked:","\"Did you put in too much sugar?\"","\"......\" Butler Zhang's gaze shifted between the two people at the table.","He thought to himself, what's with this whole family?","Should he notify the kitchen from now on to not add any sugar when cooking for the young missus and young master?","They seem capable of \"creating sugar from nothing\".","\"Oh right, Little Qi.\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly called out to him.","Qi Shaobai put down the porridge and casually grabbed a piece of bread. \"Hmm?\"","\"You went to bed at four last night, right?\" Sheng Mumu narrowed her eyes slightly, casually asking.","\"Yeah, why?\"","Sheng Mumu gently softened her tone, \"Did you hear any noises before you fell asleep?\"","Last night, they had made quite a bit of noise against the door of the master bedroom.","When she jerked her hand back, Qi Mo pressed it down, pounding the door.","The master bedroom was right above Qi Shaobai's room downstairs. She was worried Little Qi might have heard something.","Making loud dull thuds against a door late at night.","It didn't seem like something good people would do.","Although she and Qi Mo had only shared kisses and nothing more.","Still...Little Qi was in high school after all, it wouldn't be good if he heard.","\"Noises?\"","Qi Shaobai's brow quirked as he asked back:","\"I was doing homework with headphones on so didn't notice anything. What noises?\"","Sheng Mumu observed Qi Shaobai's expression closely.","Confirming that there was nothing off about Qi Shaobai's face and his eyes shone with innocent ignorance, she smiled.","\"Nothing much, congratulations on passing the test.\"","\"......Huh?\" Qi Shaobai's eyes became even more clear.","\"I just wanted to test whether you really were doing homework last night.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"......\"","Adults really play strange games...","*","Strangely, previously even though Sheng Mumu knew Qi Mo's real age was thirty-two, subconsciously she always thought of him as thirty-eight.","Because he always wore a suit and tie, exuding a steady, mature aura all over.","But after the two had confirmed their relationship, this gradually changed bit by bit.","Recently, Sheng Mumu had started doubting in the opposite direction.","Was this man really thirty-two?","What if he had lied about his age?","Do mature thirty-two year old career men act so clingy when they start a relationship?","In the past week, anytime he didn't have work matters or social banquets to attend, he would without fail come pick her up from her company downstairs.","Rain or shine.","That day.","Sheng Mumu still had ten minutes until she was off work.","Her phone buzzed, receiving a message.","\"Qi Mo: I'm here.\"","Not wanting him to wait idly downstairs, Sheng Mumu left the company a few minutes early.","Stepping out of the revolving doors of the office building, she immediately spotted Qi Mo in the crowds.","Leaning casually against his car, his suit crisp and neat.","His cold, fair skin was draped in the remaining glow of the sunset, his side profile strikingly handsome.","The corners of his mouth curved up in a faint smile, his gaze cast into the distance, posture lazy and casual.","As if waiting was an extremely amusing thing to do.","His distinguished temperament formed a sharp contrast with the office workers around him rushing hurriedly to the subway.","He stood out as if he didn't belong.","Sheng Mumu quickened her pace and walked towards him.","Just then he turned his head, and saw her.","The dark depths of his eyes instantly lit up with laughter.","As Sheng Mumu drew near, the man opened the passenger door for her, then circled to the other side to get in himself.","He didn't start the car right away.","Instead he leaned over to buckle her seatbelt for her.","A series of familiar motions he had down pat.","By now, Sheng Mumu had gradually grown used to his attentive care.","At first, she would say it wasn't necessary and that she could do it herself since she had hands.","But each time, just as she was about to reach for the seatbelt, her wrist would be grabbed and pressed down by the man.","The disparity in strength between men and women was obvious to begin with, and Qi Mo was the type of man who diligently kept up with fitness.","She didn't even think about trying to break free of his large hand.","She could only allow the man to lean halfway over, easily pulling the seatbelt over with one sweep of his arm and buckling it securely.","This posture caused the distance between them to suddenly shrink.","His steady breaths lightly brushed her forehead, ticklish.","At times like this, Sheng Mumu would always have the vague feeling,","That if she insisted on not letting him buckle her seatbelt, maybe the next second, that man who had a wolf caged in his heart, would press her directly down onto the car seat.","\"What do you want to eat?\"","Qi Mo's magnetic, gentle voice snapped Sheng Mumu's drifting thoughts back.","\"Barbecue,\" Sheng Mumu answered without missing a beat. \"Heng Long Building 3rd floor, called...Ah, what was it called again...I just memorized it firmly this afternoon.\"","Amusement crept into the man's eyes as he chuckled lowly,","\"Alright, let me look it up and get us a queue number online.\"","After he finished speaking, he opened up the food review app on his phone that he had just downloaded less than a week ago.","In the past week, they had only eaten dinner at home twice.","The rest of the time they were always trying different restaurants.","That afternoon, Sheng Mumu had overheard two colleagues chatting during break about a newly opened barbecue restaurant nearby with amazing dipping sauces.","She decided then that she would go eat there with Qi Mo after work.","She had seen online discussions analyzing the stages of a couple's relationship.","That post had said:","The first step for a nauseating couple - become fixed dinner companions.","Sheng Mumu couldn't help but burst out laughing when she saw that post.","It was so accurate.","Now whenever she saw a restaurant she was interested in, her first reaction was to think about what time she could go pull up grass there with Qi Mo.","Sheng Mumu turned her head to look at the handsome man in the driver's seat.","She saw he had already searched up the accurate restaurant information and started the car.","With a light pull from his shapely, good-looking arm, he turned the steering wheel.","Sheng Mumu's eyes curved up slightly as she smiled watching him.","Noticing her looking at him, Qi Mo asked, \"What is it?\"","Sheng Mumu answered irrelevantly, \"Happy.\"","Qi Mo glanced at her from the side.","Seeing her smiling, the corners of his lips also couldn't help but lift up in a faint smile. He continued her thread of conversation and asked:","\"Happy about what?\"","Sheng Mumu lifted her chin arrogantly,","\"The grand Qi Group's President is being trained by me to become more down-to-earth, I feel so accomplished.\"","Sheng Mumu thought back to the awkward incident from a week ago -","She had sent him the name of the Xiang Cuisine restaurant she wanted to try.","\"Sheng Mumu: [Restaurant Info]\"","\"Sheng Mumu: I'll probably die if I don't eat here today, not kidding.\"","\"Sheng Mumu: Look at its high rating.\"","Qi Mo replied: \"Okay, I'll arrange it.\"","But when they arrived at that Xiang restaurant, Sheng Mumu was dumbfounded.","Without even getting close, they could see from afar that the restaurant had laid out a red carpet at its entrance.","All the service staff were lined up along both sides of the red carpet.","Bowed deferentially at a ninety degree angle, uniformly calling out:","\"Welcome Chairman Qi, welcome Madam Qi--\"","\"Welcome Chairman Qi, welcome Madam Qi--\"","Two deafening cracks sounded as strips of festive crackers were set off, ribbons fluttering down.","Sheng Mumu's eyes were wide, and she squeezed Qi Mo's arm and asked softly:","\"This is...something you arranged?\"","Qi Mo also clearly had no idea and his expression sank slightly as he answered:","\"I only asked my executive assistant to contact the restaurant for a location, didn't expect it would turn out like this.\"","Although afterwards they found out it was because that private Xiang restaurant had never welcomed a VIP of Qi Mo's stature before, and got overexcited, going overboard with the welcome.","It still took Sheng Mumu a long time to recover from the small shock to her mindset.","Ever since that time.","Qi Mo understood two things:","First, he had to personally arrange going out to eat with her, and not trust others.","Second, she didn't like restaurants treating them exceptionally compared to regular guests. It was best if they could line up and take a queue number just like everyone else.","As Sheng Mumu thought about how Qi Mo was still an elite President who hadn't even used a food review app just a week ago, and now could skillfully navigate all the app's functions, she felt a slight sense of accomplishment, arrogantly lifting her chin in satisfaction.","Suddenly, she saw Qi Mo prop his elbow on the armrest and turn his head to look at her, narrowing his eyes slightly.","Seeming to be pondering over a certain word in her previous sentence.","His voice was low and gravelly, wrapped in laughter as he asked:","\"Train me?\""]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: Love Brain Qi Zong","paragraphs":["Qi Mo's sharp eyes glimmered with a trace of a smile.","Sheng Mumu instantly realized she had bragged too much.","That word was rather ambiguous.","It made people subconsciously think of strange things.","\"Oh, not training—\"","Sheng Mumu racked her brains.","She struggled to organize her words to make up for it:","\"Practice? Not that either...\"","\"Uh... Let me think... A kind of subtle influence?\"","Qi Mo looked at her with interest, his brow tails slightly raised, his eyes seeming to hide hooks.","He let out a low laugh and decided to let her off the hook, slowly retracting his gaze, gently saying:","\"Don't think about it anymore, just think about what you want to drink later.\"","Having said that, he handed his phone over for her to take a look at the drink stores around the barbecue restaurant ahead of time.","Sheng Mumu blinked and breathed a faint sigh of relief.","Since Qi Mo had taken the initiative to change the subject, she wouldn't dwell on it either.","She took the phone and started browsing the drink stores.","The red light was ahead and the Bugatti stopped at the zebra crossing.","Sheng Mumu soon decided what she wanted to drink later. She turned off the phone and placed it in the center armrest box between them.","Just as she was about to retract her hand, the man's arm suddenly reached over.","Taking advantage of his arm length, he easily grasped her hand.","Sheng Mumu froze for a moment, looking up.","Qi Mo was staring straight ahead.","As if unaware of her gaze, he remained focused on the uncomplicated traffic conditions ahead.","The corners of his lips curled up imperceptibly.","Beneath the neon lights outside the window, his deep set eyes and sculpted features were so handsome it was unreal.","His slender, well-proportioned fingers slid up from her palm.","Gently caressing her fingertips.","Fiddling with them.","As if her hand was a little toy for him to pass the time at the red light.","Sheng Mumu's heart fluttered slightly and she leaned back into the leather seat.","Silently taking in the immaculately suited, refined profile of the man before her.","How this man went about romance was like a man in his early twenties.","Suddenly holding her hand and pretending it was no big deal.","Strangely, she didn't find it childish at all.","A trace of sweetness spread through her heart.","Her earlobes turned faintly red and she tilted her head towards the window.","Letting him toy with her fingertips.","The sunset gradually lowered, the wind blew into the car.","The autumn wind carried a desolate scent of grass and trees.","So dry it seemed to ignite at the slightest spark.","The wind blew her hair into disarray, but she didn't bother fixing it. Her lips pressed together lightly.","The feeling of her fingertips being gently rubbed was very subtle.","The action was extremely light, yet had an acute sense of presence.","Leaving her unable to pay attention to anything else.","A post she saw online suddenly popped into her mind:","Signs of a disgustingly lovey-dovey couple, step 2: Wanting physical contact all the time.","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Bullseye again.","When they came out after the meal, the night had fully descended.","Under the hazy night, the crescent moon hung like a hook.","The car was parked in an open lot.","The two leisurely strolled to get the car.","There were many pedestrians on the road, not a few of them couples walking hand in hand.","They were the best looking couple on the street.","With perfectly matched looks and physique, their temperament was even more outstanding.","Passersby occasionally glanced their way, unable to resist imagining the romantic, affectionate conversation between this beautiful pair.","However, reality was not as imagined—","Sheng Mumu turned her head, flipping her long hair over her chest.","She picked up a strand, leaned in to sniff.","In an instant her brows knitted:","\"My hair reeks of barbecue smoke, smells so bad!\"","No sooner had she finished speaking than a shoulder was wrapped around her, pulling her into his embrace.","He leaned down, smelled her hair, and calmly said:","\"Doesn't smell.\"","\"...Sheng Mumu was stunned speechless by the sudden close distance and his lovesick response.","After a few seconds of silence, she slowly looked up, glaring at him:","\"Because you smell too, so you can't tell.\"","\"...Qi Mo was briefly taken aback.","Not long after, his pitch black eyes lit up with flecks of laughter.","He nodded almost imperceptibly and said in a low voice, \"Then let's stink together.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Sheng Mumu gazed at his nonchalant face, finally unable to refrain from retorting:","\"Qi Mo, you're hopeless!\"","Upon hearing this, Qi Mo's brow quirked up in good spirits, using his eyes to ask: \"?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"You're clearly diagnosed with late-stage lovesickness, it's terrifying.\"","\"No I'm not.\" Qi Mo instantly refuted.","Sheng Mumu tilted her head back, an expression of \"And you still won't admit it?\"","In all the movies and TV shows she had seen, no family's CEO would say something like \"let's stink together\".","Just as she was thinking of how to poke fun at him, she heard his leisurely, slightly smug voice sound above her head:","\"Early stage at most.\"","Hadn't reached late-stage lovesickness yet.","\"..................\" Sheng Mumu's breath hitched.","666...","When older men fall in love, they really dare say any sappy thing!","The two arrived at the car. Qi Mo took out the car key.","With a beep, the Bugatti's headlights flashed twice.","After getting in the car, he buckled her seatbelt for her.","Sheng Mumu took out a small mirror from her bag, intending to touch up her lipstick that got eaten off during the meal.","Qi Mo leaned back in his seat without starting the car, patiently waiting.","Suddenly he asked, \"Want to watch a movie?\"","Hearing this, Sheng Mumu's lipstick application halted as she looked over.","She barely kept herself from laughing out loud.","She certainly knew why he had suddenly asked this.","During the meal earlier, the conversation from the couple at the next table had floated over.","The girl was complaining her boyfriend was too busy with work, demanding he clear his weekends to go see the new romantic film premiere.","The guy didn't seem interested in the genre, asking his girlfriend:","\"How about we switch to another one? Iron Blood Squad 2 is also opening soon.\"","The girl huffed angrily, \"What kind of person doesn't watch romantic movies when dating, being with you is completely devoid of romance!\"","At the time, Sheng Mumu's gaze had inadvertently swept over Qi Mo.","The elegant man was holding barbecue tongs, turning over a thick slice of skirt steak.","Eyes lowered, appearance unruffled, seemingly oblivious to the conversation at the next table.","Sheng Mumu couldn't help but smile, the corners of her eyes curving attractively.","She didn't expect he had heard it after all, then mulled it over for the entire ride before casually asking her now.","How...cute?","\"Work has been pretty busy at the company lately, I'll go with you to watch after it settles down.\" Sheng Mumu answered, then continued applying her lipstick.","Qi Mo paused briefly.","Go with him?","He chuckled lowly without responding.","Instead he propped his elbow and tilted his head, silently watching her apply lipstick.","Sheng Mumu's lips parted slightly, carefully outlining and filling in along the plump lip line.","The lipstick was a matte, true red.","Contrasting sharply with her fair complexion, making her lips appear moist and succulent, exuding an alluring sheen.","Qi Mo silently watched, a strangling tightness creeping into his eyes.","Sheng Mumu's peripheral vision caught Qi Mo's gaze. Sensing he was probably impatient, she sped up.","Finally finished, just as she was about to close the cap, the back of her head was suddenly enveloped in the man's warm large palm and she was pulled towards him.","Her lips met with softness.","The man's scorching presence overwhelmed her.","With her head firmly gripped she could only crane her neck to receive this extremely aggressive kiss.","Long and lingering.","The freshly applied lipstick was completely wiped off.","After some time they finally parted.","Sheng Mumu's breathing had yet to steady.","Her mind was left buzzing and somewhat breathless from the dizzying kiss.","The man's fingertips pressed against her lower lip, gently gliding over. Gazing straight at her.","His Adam's apple rolled once as his low, husky voice slowly teased her ear.","\"Sorry to make you reapply it again.\"","Sheng Mumu was annoyed, the heat in her cheeks yet to subside.","She lifted her eyes to glance at him, noticing the faint lipstick stain on the chest of the man's shirt. She must have accidentally smudged it earlier when capping the lipstick.","The white shirt now had a splash of crimson.","Faintly exuding an ambiguous air.","Somehow extremely evocative.","Qi Mo followed her line of sight, lowering his gaze to look at his shirt.","Then lightly lifted his eyes, a trace of nonchalance passing through his pitch black pupils.","He placed his hand on the steering wheel and started the car.","By the time they returned home.","This man had calmly gone upstairs under the strange looks of Butler Qi and the servants, loosely carrying his suit jacket in one hand.","Not making any move to put it on at all."]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: I like it","paragraphs":["The year end was approaching and festivals were increasing.","Ever since the exclusive interview of Sheng Mumu by Finance Magazine came out, orders for \"A Bouquet for Life\" surged.","For a time, everyone was a bit busy to handle them all.","Before the new year was the worst time to recruit people.","Most migrant workers would choose to jump ship only after getting their year-end bonuses from their old companies.","So everyone in the company, including bosses Sheng Mumu and Qin Jiaqiu, visibly became busy.","With this busyness, Sheng Mumu had to postpone again and again her promise to watch a movie with Qi Mo.","On the other hand, Qi Group also entered its busiest time of the year.","Qi Mo had a small meeting almost every three days and a big one every two days.","Every weekend, all kinds of socializing dinners and banquets only increased instead of decreasing.","But no matter how busy, he would always find time to send messages to Sheng Mumu.","Mundane ones like: \"Lunch [picture]\"","Detailed ones like: \"I'm going to talk with xx, xxx, xxx at the tea house.\"","Boring ones like: \"?\"","Sheng Mumu felt this was both funny and helpless.","Usually taciturn, Qi Mo wouldn't use long sentences if he could answer with a few words.","But with her it was like he had become a different person.","Carefully flipping through their WeChat conversation, Sheng Mumu found that this man's messaging frequency was almost catching up to hers with effort.","Once Sheng Mumu jokingly asked: \"President Qi, I didn't notice you were so lively before?\"","After a while, a reply came from the other side: \"Do I annoy you?\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes curved as she typed on the screen without thinking: \"I quite like it~\"","After the message was sent, the \"other side is typing...\" on the chat screen kept displaying, but Sheng Mumu didn't get a reply for a long time.","She didn't know that on the other end of the phone, the man who was listening to his subordinates give a report at the conference table slowly lowered his eyes.","His heart suddenly tightened, and a bright smile appeared between his handsome brows.","He stared at the screen for a good while.","*","That noon, Qi Mo was invited to a private dinner party.","Long-time business partner Old Yang hosted.","Everyone in Jing City's rich circle knew that Old Yang and his wife were the model couple of the circle.","During the dinner, someone joked:","\"Old Yang, I admire you the most, even more than Old Qi.\"","Hearing this, Old Yang's eyes lit up. The wine he was drinking halfway didn't make it down his throat as he hurriedly put down the glass.","\"Admire me for what? Tell me about it.\"","In terms of group scale and profitability, Qi Group's earnings had been far ahead for several consecutive years.","In terms of image and physique, several people at the table also admitted inferiority to Qi Mo.","So he was very curious what part of him was better than Old Qi.","\"You and Sister-in-law have been married for so many years but are still as affectionate as newlyweds. Not every man can do that.\"","Someone chimed in: \"I've been to their company a few times. It's full of beauties. Old Yang looks decent and is rich. I don't believe after so many years no women have had ideas about you. Have you never wavered?\"","Someone else exaggeratedly agreed: \"I've stayed out all night drinking with Old Yang several times. Sister-in-law didn't call once to check up on him. Don't you think that's weird?\"","\"Anyone else in his place, with such opportunity and circumstance, would have been gone long ago.\"","The one who started teasing brought the topic back: \"So that's why I admire Old Yang the most. He truly loves his wife from the bottom of his heart. He's a role model for us.\"","\"You flatter me, flatter me.\" Old Yang was very smug upon hearing this.","He leaned back in his chair to sell his secret:","\"There have indeed been many women trying to throw themselves at me over the years. Your sister-in-law has always trusted me very much. Why do you think so?\"","Others asked: \"Why?\"","Old Yang put on a meaningful expression:","\"Because I know to prevent problems before they happen. I convey in every possible way to those women outside: I'm a married man, don't get any crooked ideas.\"","As he spoke, he took out his phone and pointed at the screen for everyone to see.","\"Look, this, this, this, they're all the solid marriage fortress I built. Learn from it.\"","\"Awesome, awesome.\"","\"You flatter me.\"","\"...\"","The people at the table chatted spiritedly.","No one noticed Qi Mo next to them casually drinking tea and glancing over indifferently.","The usually tranquil eyes flashed a hint of inquisitiveness.","*","Jing City No.1 Middle School, lunch break.","In the hallway outside the grades for first and second year high school students, sounds of laughter and frolicking rose and fell.","In contrast, the upstairs floors for third year students were quiet.","There weren't many people coming and going in the hallway. Students were collapsed in the classrooms.","The soon-to-be high school graduates were cherishing every second of break time to rest up and preserve energy for review in the afternoon.","Qi Shaobai didn't get a lunch break.","Leaning on one arm on the desk, he lazily propped up his chin in a daze.","Just thinking about the three rare Lego sets Sheng Mumu sent him last night made him unable to stop feeling happy.","The Spring Festival was coming up soon. He could sneak open one box early to satisfy himself, that wouldn't count as breaking the flag he set before, right?","Just as he was thinking about which box to open first, his phone in his pocket buzzed continuously.","Reaching in lazily for the phone, he was startled.","Seeing the two big words \"Dad\" bouncing on the screen, he immediately sat up straight.","In the dozen or so seconds from the classroom to the hallway, all kinds of pessimistic thoughts popped up in his head.","His dad rarely called him.","If there was something, he would almost always just tell Qi Shaobai in person in a few words when they met.","Did something happen?","Why was Dad calling in the middle of the day?","He subconsciously worried.","Conditioned reflex made him start reflecting on his own recent behavior.","Did he do something wrong that his teacher ratted out to his dad?","He thought about it, then felt it was unlikely.","The previous times the school invited parents, his stepmother went instead of his dad. There was no reason the teacher would go to his dad this time.","Besides, his behavior had been decent recently.","Leaning against the railing, Qi Shaobai hesitantly picked up.","His dad's low voice came from the earpiece:","\"On lunch break?\"","The tone was flat with only three words.","But Qi Shaobai somehow felt his dad seemed to be in a good mood.","Qi Shaobai spoke cautiously: \"Yeah, I just finished lunch and I'm reading.\"","Regardless, he instantly buffed his diligent studying image.","The gene to cower before his dad seemed ingrained in his bones. Even though their relationship was much more harmonious than before, he still cowered instinctively.","Just then, Wei Zhaonan happened to come out of the bathroom and, without reading the air, loudly refuted while passing Qi Shaobai:","\"Qi Shaobai, what book are you reading? In your dreams?\"","Qi Shaobai hurriedly covered the earpiece, throwing a glare at Wei Zhaonan that frightened him into shuddering.","Qi Shaobai kicked Wei Zhaonan and used his eyes to curse him away before uncovering the earpiece and bringing the phone to his ear again.","He was anxious, not knowing if his dad heard Wei Zhaonan's words.","\"Dad, did you call because you have something for me?\"","Qi Shaobai softened his tone and tentatively asked.","Nervously awaiting the reply.","\"Yes, I have something—\"","His dad's voice slowly came through.","Qi Shaobai's expression changed from worry to relief.","Until he fully understood the purpose of this call from his dad.","His clear eyes widened in surprise."]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: Qi Shaobai: Am I a part of Your play","paragraphs":["\"Sister-in-law, has Brother's WeChat account been hacked?\"","When Sheng Mumu answered Qiao Li's phone call, the first thing she heard was this sentence.","Sheng Mumu was completely confused: \"Huh? What?\"","\"Brother changed his profile picture and posted on Moments. I suspect his account was hacked.\"","Qiao Li paused, then analyzed:","\"Or maybe it was you who used Brother's phone, Sister-in-law?\"","Qiao Li didn't know that they, this \"old couple\", had recently become \"new sweethearts\". She was understandably shocked by Brother's sudden change.","Sheng Mumu didn't get it. \"He just changed his profile picture and posted on Moments. What's so strange about that?\"","\"Of course it's strange!\" Qiao Li raised her voice a little. \"Brother's WeChat profile picture has been pure black for years. I've never seen him change it or post anything on Moments before.\"","\"Maybe he's in a good mood recently.\" Sheng Mumu evasively laughed and replied.","After hanging up Qiao Li's call, which was purely for gossip, Sheng Mumu opened WeChat.","In the pinned conversation, Qi Mo still had his original profile picture from the outside.","Pure black.","Just like him, pure and unfathomable.","Her finger lightly tapped to open it, and Sheng Mumu's eyes suddenly shrank.","The profile picture had changed.","She clicked to enlarge it.","This was...","It was the photo Qi Shaobai took of them against a backdrop of fireworks during the school arts festival at Qi Shaobai's school.","In the photo, their backs were to the camera.","Qi Mo had one hand in his pants pocket and the other draped over her shoulders.","He stood tall and slender, posing casually and comfortably.","The man's side profile was clear and sharp. The dazzling firework lights shone on his cold, pale skin, adding a touch of warmth to his aloof and indifferent temperament.","In the photo, her face was also turned to the side.","The lighting was dim, but you could still see her earlobes slightly flushed.","She was reaching out with one finger to poke his chin, making him straighten his head and not look at her.","Sheng Mumu recalled this scene in her mind.","Her heart softened.","Unconsciously, she rested her cheek in her hand. Her clear eyes rippled with smugness.","Murmuring to herself:","\"It's so nicely taken.\"","\"A rich gentleman and a beautiful lady.\"","Sheng Mumu shamelessly complimented her own looks and the noble aura Qi Mo naturally exuded.","Her slender, fair fingers tapped a few times to enter Qi Mo's Moment page.","There was one and only one Moment post.","A set of four photos in a grid.","She scrolled through them.","It was like watching a dynamic picture.","Photo 1: Qi Mo looking up at the sky while she looked at him, with a subtle affection in her eyes that she wasn't even aware of.","Photo 2: He must have said something. Her head tilted down slightly, her earlobes flushed almost instantly, illuminated by the firework lights and captured on camera.","Photo 3: Their eyes met. He looked down, she looked up. Both had smiles on their lips.","Photo 4: Now she was looking up at the sky and he was looking at her, his gaze scorching and unabashed.","Qi Shaobai captured the scene seamlessly in this series of candid shots.","Sheng Mumu's smile grew.","She exited Moments and thought blankly for a while.","Unable to resist, she messaged Qi Mo.","Teasingly asking: \"President Qi, is it necessary to show off your lovey-dovey side like this? [pointing fingers emoji]\"","The reply came quickly face-to-face: \"Yes.\"","Sheng Mumu blinked blankly for a moment. Through that one word, it was as if she could see the sly old fox's tail curling up smugly.","She pursed her lips and continued typing: \"If I remember correctly, didn't we miss one photo?\"","Qi Mo: \"Which one?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"I remember I hit you then. Qi Shaobai wouldn't have missed that shot, right?\"","Qi Mo: \"......\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Wait.\"","Qi Shaobai's phone buzzed again.","In the quiet classroom during lunch break, the vibration sounded out of place.","He covered his pocket and went into the hallway.","Inner OS: What's going on today, so many calls.","Seeing the flashing \"Wishing Pool\" on the screen, Qi Shaobai's pupils widened slightly.","No way.","Again?","\"Hello?\" His voice was lazy, as if he already knew the purpose of Sheng Mumu's call.","\"You have—\"","\"I have it.\" Without letting Sheng Mumu finish, Qi Shaobai jumped to answer.","In the earpiece, Sheng Mumu was stunned for a second, then said:","\"Then send it to—\"","\"Okay.\" Qi Shaobai interrupted her again.","Qi Shaobai felt they were being too lovey-dovey.","It felt like his mouth was stuffed with dog food, and before he could swallow it down, someone stuffed in another spoonful.","After hanging up, Qi Shaobai sent Sheng Mumu the photos he had just forwarded to Dad once.","Putting his phone back in his pocket, he sighed helplessly with a smile.","Inner OS: Am I just part of your play too?","I didn't expect Mom to be just as lovey-dovey as Dad.","Oh well.","That's adults for you?","The Rolls-Royce drove on the road.","Xiao Wang glanced at the backseat from the rearview mirror.","Earlier, Dong Assistant had called specially to remind him that President Qi had several meetings to attend that afternoon.","He told Xiao Wang to drive slower if possible, to allow President Qi more rest time.","Having worked around President Qi for years, they knew well how much importance he placed on his work.","If he got back to the company early, President Qi would surely not rest and dive right back into the endless work.","Seeing that President Qi did not close his eyes to rest, but lowered his gaze at his phone, Xiao Wang looked worried.","Hesitating on whether to remind President Qi to rest, he suddenly glimpsed from the rearview mirror President Qi's lips slowly curving up.","The man with the cold and ominous aura was looking at his phone and smiling, eyes lowered.","The surrounding air seemed to become gentler.","On the screen in view —","Sheng Mumu: \"Look, I changed my profile picture too, to match yours.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"I posted a 5-pic grid offhand too. [laughing businesswoman emoji]\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Tehee gif\"","The car parked in the underground parking lot of Qi Corporation.","Only after President Qi entered the president's private elevator did Xiao Wang see Dong Assistant's message.","Dong Assistant asked with concern: \"How was it? Did President Qi get some rest? There's still a lot to do this afternoon.\"","A competent assistant not only handles work matters for the boss, but also attends to daily life needs.","Dong Assistant understood this well and always practiced it.","Seeing the message, Xiao Wang looked troubled and replied: \"No, President Qi didn't close his eyes the entire journey.\"","Dong Assistant: \"Oh...\"","Xiao Wang: \"But President Qi didn't seem tired. You'll understand when you see him later.\"","Dong Assistant put away his phone and scratched his head in confusion.","At this moment, there was a \"ding\" from the elevator lobby.","He turned to see President Qi stride out.","Overpowering, spirited and vigorous.","His steps were steady and forceful, his brows and eyes visibly delighted.","He did not look like someone who had arrived at the company at 8am, attended a lunch meeting, and was now back for the afternoon.","It was as if he was fully charged.","Dong Assistant: ???","As expected of President Qi, infinite energy.","Small skit:","Rewind a few hours ago —","After Qi Shaobai sent the photos to Dad, he casually asked:","\"I also took many other shots, like... me, Dad, should I send those to you too?\"","After a few seconds of silence in the earpiece, the clear answer came:","\"No need.\""]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: Don't move. Let me hold you.","paragraphs":["Not long after Sheng Mumu posted on her friend circle, she received a flurry of comments.","Shen Lan, as a severe introvert who was rarely seen and was always online, was the first to reply.","- Shen Lan (Do Not Disturb, Gaming): 【Good looking】","- Su Tingran: 【Mumu looks so pretty, I love watching, post more!】","- Qi Shaobai: 【Who took these? They really know how to take photos.】","- Qiao Li: 【Hahahah burp, one more picture than what cousin posted, with soul injected hahahaha.】","- Feng Yaoqin: 【Scenery and beauty complement each other [thumbs up][thumbs up][thumbs up], held together by fate [handshake], happy forever [heart][rose][heart][rose]】","- Old lady: 【Mumu, did Xiaobudian take these? Took very well!】","Seeing this comment, Sheng Mumu's eyes instantly curved up, filling with laughter.","She noticed the typo in the old lady's comment.","She guessed the old lady must have accidentally added an extra stroke when using handwriting input to type.","Sheng Mumu smiled and replied to everyone's comments.","Suddenly, urgent knocking sounds came from outside the door.","She looked up, \"Come in.\"","Cheng Zhuo pushed the door open and entered swiftly, looking anxious and walking faster.","\"Sis, trouble.\"","Seeing his flustered look, Sheng Mumu also felt her heart tighten.","\"What's wrong?\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"That batch of orders we placed with tk were intercepted halfway.\"","tk was the largest rose garden in Bulgaria, enjoying fame internationally.","Yueji had always purchased from them before.","Cross-border orders often required intermediaries to broker the deal. tk's domestic business was entirely handled by a trading company called LeiRui.","Previously, Yueji and LeiRui's partnership had been very smooth.","But just now, Cheng Zhuo received news that LeiRui intended to sign the exclusive supply contract with tk for the next quarter to another company instead.","The \"A Bouquet for Life\" sub-brand was just established not long ago, and many customers came for the headline \"Bulgaria's Largest Rose Garden\".","Now nearing year end, the peak season for order volume.","If supply chain issues cropped up at this time, it would be a huge blow to Yueji.","Right after Cheng Zhuo finished telling Sheng Mumu about this, Qin Jiamu rushed into the office windswept.","Before Sheng Mumu could ask, from Qin Jiamu's anxious expression, she could already infer that she knew about this matter.","Sheng Mumu was anxious inside, but didn't show it on her face.","Maintaining the composure a company decision maker should have, she shrugged nonchalantly and said,","\"No worries, no rush, we'll think of something.\"","Qin Jiamu and Cheng Zhuo replied in unison: \"Okay.\"","The three held an emergency meeting for a few hours in Sheng Mumu's office.","Together, they came up with two plans.","First, contact LeiRui.","Understand why they changed their minds at the last minute, and try to renew the contract.","Second, start preparing a plan B.","Contact other rose gardens in Bulgaria, and connect with their domestic distributors.","At the same time, come up with several marketing plans tailored to the new rose gardens.","This way, if the supplier really has to be switched, they can promptly replace the existing website pages and copy.","After the meeting, the three got busy with their respective tasks.","Cheng Zhuo called LeiRui's people, but the line was constantly busy.","Calling from his mobile phone, the other party still didn't pick up, seeming intent on avoidance.","Qin Jiamu led the marketing team to design new promotion plans.","Sheng Mumu was responsible for contacting other Bulgarian rose gardens.","Partnerships aren't built overnight.","From afternoon to night, Sheng Mumu made dozens of calls, pacing by the floor-to-ceiling windows.","Often, right after hanging up one call, another would come in.","Switching between English and Mandarin back and forth.","Constantly comparing prices, looking at materials sent over, communicating partnership intentions.","Her hands were busy too, typing and clicking away at the keyboard.","Compiling the detailed information into tables for easy comparison and summary. She was occupied with this until 10pm at night.","She didn't even have time to eat dinner.","Her mouth and throat were parched before she remembered to drink some water.","In between, Qi Mo sent her a WeChat message.","She briefly replied, telling him she would be working overtime tonight, so he didn't have to come pick her up.","She had just sent the message without waiting for a reply, when the screen lit up with another overseas call flashing in.","She pressed her lips together, blinked her eyes slightly.","Pulling herself together, she picked up the call.","After the last call,","Sheng Mumu leaned against the window and heaved a long sigh of relief.","While thinking about what else needed to be handled tomorrow, she put on her coat and left the office.","Having not eaten dinner, her stomach felt uneasy and her steps were unsteady.","Even the light cashmere coat felt heavy, weighing down her shoulders, so tired she didn't want to speak a word.","Stepping out of the revolving doors of the office building.","Sheng Mumu looked up and only then noticed it was raining outside.","The underground parking lot was several dozen meters away.","Just thinking about going upstairs to get an umbrella, she felt exhausted from all directions.","Right as she decided to just brave the rain and walk to the parking lot, she suddenly saw a Rolls Royce parked at the roadside not far away.","Its headlights were brightly lit, with rain trailing through the beams of light, falling to the ground in splashes of watery ripples.","A man in a black coat held an umbrella, standing in front of the car.","Seeing someone emerge from the office building doors, he slightly lifted his umbrella.","A crisp silhouette gradually revealed itself from bottom to top.","Their gazes collided in midair through the rain curtain.","A trace of relaxed smile instantly rose on the man's handsome brow, and he walked towards her.","The night was very dark, and moonlight faint.","The heavy rain obscured what little light came from the already dim street lamps.","Sheng Mumu gazed at the approaching man's figure.","Tall and upright, like a refreshing breeze under the bright moon.","As if all moonlight was cast upon him.","Captivating.","When Qi Mo came to a stop in front of her, just as he was about to speak, Sheng Mumu suddenly wrapped her arms around his waist, burying her head in his chest.","The man's taut waist and abdomen abruptly tensed, his heart also quivering once.","The damp air mingled with his clean and crisp scent, lingering around Sheng Mumu's nose.","She comfortably closed her eyes.","Enjoying a moment of tranquility.","The man's body was very warm, the temperature inside his coat reassuring.","She snuggled into him like a cat afraid of the cold.","Smelling the familiar, safe scent, her fatigue slowly dissipated bit by bit.","Qi Mo was somewhat at a loss.","He wanted to lower his head to see her expression, but had just moved when his waist was held even tighter.","\"Don't move, just let me hug you for a bit,\" she said.","Receiving the order, the man's rigid posture gradually relaxed.","The corners of his lips slowly curled up into a helpless yet indulgent smile.","Standing upright without moving, letting her hold him.","He very gently pried her bag off her shoulders and grasped it in his own hand.","The next second, he wrapped her slender body up entirely in his coat, in a completely possessive manner, hugging her tightly.","His jaw lightly resting atop her head.","His deep, mellow voice sounded especially gentle amidst the pattering rain.","\"You can hug me for as long as you need.\""]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: Big Man Comes to Beijing","paragraphs":["The fully charged Sheng Mumu quickly regained her energy.","When she returned home, she was bending down to change her shoes when her cell phone rang.","It was Cheng Zhuo calling.","He started speaking in a joyful tone, saying in quick succession:","\"Sis, the people at Lairui finally took my call...\"","\"We made an appointment to meet tomorrow...\"","\"I'm going there tomorrow.\"","Sheng Mumu said in a low voice: \"I'm going too.\"","*","The next day.","Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo arrived at the hotel conference room appointed by Lairui, and many people from other companies were already there.","The conference room was luxuriously and impressively decorated, with four long sofas in the middle and several single sofas on the sides.","There were tea tables on the east and west sides and a snack counter.","Tea, snacks and everything were available.","But the people present apparently had no mind to drink tea or eat snacks.","They gathered in groups of three or two, with anxious expressions on their faces.","Without exception, they were all worried about Lairui's sudden change of the TK supply contract into an exclusive one.","They whispered to each other:","\"We've been cooperating so well in the past, how can they just say exclusive?\"","\"For small companies like us, it's already very difficult to get a little bit of TK goods every year. Now they're making an exclusive contract, how are we small companies supposed to survive?\"","\"What exactly does President Lairui mean by calling us all here today? Could he change his mind at the last minute and continue contracting with us?\"","\"I don't think so. If he wanted to renew the contracts, he would have said so directly on the phone. There's no need to specifically ask everyone to come.\"","\"What a pity that Lairui is the only agent for TK in China. If we want to order roses from the top Rose Garden, we can only go through them.\"","Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo found an empty sofa and sat down.","Glancing around, Sheng Mumu noticed that one middle-aged man among the group had a different expression from the others.","The man was in his forties or so, sitting on the sofa with his arms crossed, looking very confident.","Sheng Mumu's eyes flickered slightly.","With her keen observational skills, she noticed something unusual.","She asked Cheng Zhuo, \"Is that man over there the one Lairui wants to sign an exclusive contract with?\"","Cheng Zhuo looked over following Sheng Mumu's line of sight and shook his head.","\"I don't know who exactly Lairui wants to sign with. The only rumor going around is that they want to sign exclusively with one company.\"","Sheng Mumu asked again, \"Which company is that man from?\"","Cheng Zhuo knew this. He had done a detailed investigation last night and knew which company representatives would come today.","Cheng Zhuo said, \"He is Chairman Wan of the WanChuan Group, Wanchuan.\"","Wanchuan?","Sheng Mumu pondered.","She had heard of Wanchuan before. The company's main business was cultural industries.","Publishing books, opening chain bookstores and cafés in major cities.","It had some floral related businesses, but they accounted for a very small proportion.","Sheng Mumu's gaze moved to Wanchuan, giving him a glance.","At the same time, the other party also looked over and nodded lightly at her.","Wanchuan's expression was polite, with a hint of smugness in his eyes and the corners of his mouth.","The buzz around the room continued.","But after Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo came in, people started guessing in another direction.","\"Hey, do you think the company Lairui wants to sign an exclusive contract with could be Yueji?\"","\"Very likely. Who doesn't know Yueji is all the rage now?\"","\"But big companies want to make money, and we small companies need to survive too. The market is so big, they can't be so authoritarian as to not leave a piece of the pie for others.\"","\"This is too overbearing.\"","\"Keep your voice down, don't let Chairman Sheng hear you. She has the Qi Group backing her, can't afford to offend them.\"","The speakers instantly lowered their voices.","But those words had already floated into Sheng Mumu's ears.","Sheng Mumu felt speechless.","She hadn't done anything yet, but in the eyes of others, Yueji was already relying on the Qi Group's background to bully others.","This was really unjust.","Suddenly, the heavy doors of the conference room were pushed open.","A man with a Mediterranean hairstyle walked in, his face full of greasy, obsequious smiles.","\"Sis, this is Lairui's boss, Peng Lairui,\" Cheng Zhuo introduced to Sheng Mumu. \"Because Lairui is part of his name, he lets people call him President Lairui externally.\"","Sheng Mumu just \"hmm\"ed in response.","When Peng Lairui appeared, the rest of the people surrounded him.","It was instantly noisy.","Only Sheng Mumu, Cheng Zhuo, and the man named Wanchuan remained seated calmly.","\"Everyone, please don't worry,\" Peng Lairui waved his hand and said loudly.","He then instructed his subordinates to pour tea for everyone to calm their emotions:","\"Please sit down, Lairui has cooperated with you for so long, we are all old friends. Let's sit down and talk slowly about anything.\"","After speaking, Peng Lairui scanned the room. His gaze paused.","Seeing that even Sheng Mumu had come, he politely smiled and greeted, \"Mrs. Qi, hello, pardon my lack of courtesy.\"","Sheng Mumu didn't reply, just nodded in response.","This further convinced the others that their earlier guesses were correct.","It seemed that Lairui really wanted to please the Qi Group by giving the TK exclusive supply contract to Yueji.","Everyone didn't dare to show their anger openly, and the looks they gave Sheng Mumu contained silent resentment.","Peng Lairui's eyes went past Sheng Mumu and stopped on Wanchuan again.","The two exchanged a furtive glance.","After everyone sat down, Peng Lairui began with an official sounding opening:","\"I invited everyone here today to talk about the issue of the TK supply contract.\"","\"As the largest rose garden in Bulgaria, TK has always trusted Lairui and granted us full authority to handle domestic flower sales.\"","\"Previously, Lairui cooperated very happily with everyone, but... the thing is...\"","He paused, and his tone changed as he showed an awkward expression.","\"I'm sure the bosses and managers of the companies present understand one thing - if a company wants to develop and expand, it can't always stick to the old ways.\"","\"Making the decision to change the TK order into an exclusive contract, our Lairui discussed it many times internally.\"","Someone couldn't hold back and interrupted him, \"President Lairui, stop beating around the bush. Just tell us directly which company you want to sign the exclusive contract with. Is it open bidding or have you already negotiated privately? Did we come here today for nothing?\"","The speaker's eyes briefly glanced at Sheng Mumu before quickly looking away again.","The implication was obvious.","Peng Lairui didn't beat around the bush anymore and candidly said,","\"This time, Lairui wants to sign the TK exclusive contract with—\"","At the same time.","At the international terminal of the airport in Jing City.","A tall man strode out, walking briskly.","Behind him was a blonde foreigner who appeared to be his assistant, pushing a suitcase to follow him.","The man had an imposing aura, outstanding looks and temperament, immediately attracting the attention of people around.","His slightly brown hair made his chiseled face even more handsome.","He lowered his eyes and glanced at his watch.","In his narrow, long eyes was a hint of indifference.","The assistant had arranged for a car to be waiting outside the airport.","After getting in the car, the man looked at his watch again.","He seemed extremely sensitive and attentive to time.","Because of his work at the group, he needed to fly to Northern Europe and could only stay in Jing City for a few days.","Every minute and second was precious.","The assistant had followed him for many years and was well aware of his temperament and habits. Switching to Chinese, he said,","\"Chairman Cheng, we can arrive at the CBD in ten minutes.\"","Hearing the precise reply, Cheng Xin's eyes drooped slightly as he murmured in affirmation."]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: This is what being a big brother does.","paragraphs":["Cheng Xin had already clearly understood that Mu Mu's company was near the CBD.","He wanted to give Mu Mu and Cheng Zhuo a surprise, planning to notify them only after the plane landed.","Just as he was about to call Cheng Zhuo, a cell phone ringtone sounded in the carriage.","It was the work cell phone he had left with his assistant that was ringing.","The assistant glanced at the phone and handed it over:","\"TK's CEO Anthony called again, Chairman Cheng, do you want to answer it?\"","Cheng Xin's eyebrows wrinkled.","The previously slightly softened face immediately sank, revealing irritation.","TK's CEO Anthony called him every now and then.","It was either inviting him to visit Bulgaria, or saying he would send him newly brewed red wine from his winery.","It was all about wanting to cooperate with Fangcheng Group to help TK's newly expanded wine business enter the North American market.","Cheng Xin was extremely annoyed by this.","\"Don't answer.\"","Compared to dealing with these things, at the moment he just wanted to think about what to say when he saw Mu Mu later.","Previously when he wanted to give Mu Mu property and money, she refused it all.","Cheng Xin's thin lips tightened slightly, and a trace of self-reproach appeared in his cold pupils.","Cheng Zhuo had grown up following him since childhood, with no worries about food and clothing. After graduating, Cheng Xin had arranged several properties and cars for him.","This was the proper responsibility of an elder brother.","But for Mu Mu, he hadn't fulfilled even a bit of care.","Even the money and property he wanted to give her could not be given.","Thinking of this, the feeling of guilt in his heart grew stronger.","At that time, in the reception hall.","\"This time, our Lairui wants to sign the exclusive contract with TK to--\"","Peng Lairui's gaze fell in one place, slowly announcing:","\"--Wanchuan, Chairman Wan.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone looked over there.","A burst of clamor sounded in the hall.","There was shock in everyone's eyes, as well as puzzlement.","Discussion broke out immediately:","\"Wanchuan Company has always been in the business of bookstores, cafés and coffee shops. How can they suddenly want to dip their toes into the flower industry?\"","\"Even if it's just dipping their toes in, wanting to swallow TK's exclusive contract, what is Wanchuan thinking?\"","\"I thought Lairui wanted to give the exclusive contract to Yueji, I didn't expect...\"","Amidst the clamor,","Chairman Wan of Wanchuan calmly glanced around at everyone.","His gaze finally fell on Peng Lairui's face.","The two looked at each other, a sly gleam appearing in both their eyes.","A week ago, he and Peng Lairui had already privately negotiated that this time, the exclusive contract would definitely be signed with Wanchuan.","Wanchuan's biggest plan next year was to enter the online high-end fresh flower industry.","In recent years, the bookstore and coffee shop businesses had been difficult, with the whole company betting on this decision.","He planned to emulate Yueji's \"one life, one bouquet\" concept.","Relying on the existing thousands of bookstores and coffee shops as a foothold, he would quickly enter the high-end flower industry and complete the company's transformation.","He had agreed with Peng Lairui.","He promised to take over Lairui's total supply volume last year, and increase the order volume by 50%, on the condition that Lairui sign an exclusive contract with him.","If they were going to play, they would play big.","Additionally, he would privately give Peng Lairui a sum of money as a benefit fee.","He would rather invest higher costs, just to get the title of \"TK's only cooperative brand\".","Before coming here today, he had asked his subordinates to write the draft announcements of \"Exclusively Securing TK's Contract\" and \"Overpowering Yueji and the Largest Rose Garden for Cooperation\".","He just had to release them.","He knew Yueji had the support of Qishi Group behind it.","But now it was a society ruled by law, and he was making reasonable use of the rules for commercial competition, what was wrong with that?","The clamor in the hall did not dissipate.","Peng Lairui pretended to explain the reasons to everyone.","\"It's like this, everyone listen to me.\"","\"Making this decision was also very difficult for us Lairui, but considering Wanchuan's business philosophy is consistent with TK Rose Garden's temperament—\"","Shen Mumu couldn't take in a single word of Peng Lairui's hypocritical speech.","She only planned to wait for the crowd to disperse, and talk to Peng Lairui alone, asking him directly how much it would cost to sign.","Within her ability to bear, she would fight for it.","If not, then no cooperation.","She could not cater to the rules arbitrarily changed by Lairui.","Moreover, she had no plans to bribe Peng Lairui and overpay in areas that she should not invest in.","Seeing that the crowd was still questioning Peng Lairui, it would probably not end for a while.","Shen Mumu boredly turned to ask Cheng Zhuo, \"What time is it now?\"","Cheng Zhuo looked at his watch, just about to answer, when his phone rang.","\"Your boss called you, your boss called you, your boss called you--\"","The luxury car was driving on the road, and had arrived near the CBD.","Cheng Xin put the handset to his ear, his gaze faintly glancing out the window.","In his heart he thought, is this where Mu Mu works every day?","The sound of waiting for the call to connect was in his ear.","At the third ring, his cold face faintly showed displeasure.","Just as the fourth \"du\" was about to ring out, the call connected.","\"Hello, boss.\" Cheng Zhuo found a quiet environment outside the reception hall to take the call.","\"I'm in Jing City now.\" Cheng Xin never had small talk with his brother, getting right to the point. \"Are you and Mu Mu at the company? I'm downstairs at your company building, come up now.\"","Cheng Zhuo hesitated for a few seconds, and asked back: \"Now?\"","Cheng Xin knew his brother who had followed him since childhood like the back of his hand.","From Cheng Zhuo's hesitation of a few seconds, he sensed something wrong.","His eyes narrowed slightly, and he said heavily:","\"Something happened over there with you.\"","After finishing the call, Cheng Zhuo returned to the reception hall, completely changing his demeanor, the corners of his eyes and mouth unable to hide his elation.","Shen Mumu used her eyes to ask: ?","Cheng Zhuo pretended to be mysterious and shook his head. \"Nothing, big brother asked if I had eaten.\"","Shen Mumu immediately had question marks in her heart.","???","Really? She didn't believe it.","Although she didn't talk to her big brother much on the phone, she determined that he wouldn't be so free and idle.","Before she could ask another question, from the corner of her eye she caught sight of the reception hall door being pushed open.","A young man with a hurried expression rushed towards Peng Lairui with urgent steps.","\"Chairman Peng, a call from TK.\"","The young man held a cell phone in both hands, as if holding a treasure, and handed it to Peng Lairui.","Peng Lairui's eyes immediately lit up.","His eyes gave off the same greasy gleam as the Mediterranean depression on the top of his head.","\"TK?\"","Peng Lairui had just mentioned to TK that morning that next year he would increase the order volume by 50%, and pay the full amount in one go.","He just hoped TK would consider giving Lairui the agency rights for other Asian countries as well.","Once he obtained TK's agency rights for Japan and Korea, Lairui's profits could go up another level.","Now TK was calling, could it be good news?","\"Chairman Peng, this call is from their CEO Anthony's number.\"","The young subordinate added.","\"Really?\" Peng Lairui was delighted inside.","It was actually TK's CEO who called personally!","In all these years of Lairui's cooperation with TK, it was the first time they had received a call from the CEO himself.","No matter how you looked at it, it was a good sign.","It looked like it was in the bag this time!","Peng Lairui couldn't control his excitement inside, and grabbed the phone as he walked towards the door.","Before even reaching the door, an obsequious smile had appeared on his face."]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: Big Brother, this is so awesome","paragraphs":["As Peng Lairui left, the noise in the reception room grew louder.","Some people, realizing that the chances of renewing the contract with Lairui were slim, changed their approach and tried to please Wanchuan by approaching him:","\"General Manager Wan, the amount of goods allocated to our company by TK has always been minimal. Can you consider distributing a bit more to us? Your company can't possibly consume such a large quantity alone, right?\"","Someone used flattering words to probe:","\"General Manager Wan, is your company making a full-fledged entry into the high-end flower sales market?\"","Wanchuan either smiled or nodded, giving perfunctory responses.","Then, under the gaze of everyone, he walked towards Sheng Mumu.","\"General Manager Sheng, I apologize for the inconvenience.\"","Sheng Mumu raised her eyes and saw Wanchuan approaching her with a fake smile.","Before she could speak, she heard Wanchuan say, \"Although you won't be able to get TK's goods in the future, there are plenty of roses in the rose garden. If we can't cooperate with TK, we can find other options.\"","\"General Manager Sheng, you won't be angry because of today's matter, right?\"","Sheng Mumu remained calm inside, and she even felt like laughing.","It was Cheng Zhuo who became impatient and stepped forward, blocking Sheng Mumu with half of his body.","Being half a head taller than Wanchuan, he asked with a restrained yet arrogant tone, \"General Manager Wan, is it too early to celebrate with champagne?\"","Wanchuan was taken aback, not understanding Cheng Zhuo's meaning. \"What do you mean?\"","Just then, the door to the reception room was pushed open.","Peng Lairui hurriedly walked in, wearing an expression that seemed like he had turned into a different person compared to when he left.","Peng Lairui quickly locked eyes with Wanchuan and pulled him aside.","Lowering his voice, he said, \"General Manager Wan, there have been some changes to what we discussed earlier. We can't sign an exclusive contract with you anymore.\"","\"What?\" Wanchuan showed an expression of disbelief.","Without an exclusive contract, all the accompanying promotional plans and press releases would be invalidated, resulting in huge losses.","Feeling guilty, Peng Lairui tried to appease him by patting his arm and whispered, \"Although there won't be an exclusive contract, we will definitely continue to supply you with TK's goods...\"","\"We had everything agreed upon, didn't we?\" Wanchuan shook off Peng Lairui's arm, expressing his dissatisfaction.","By now, the surrounding people had vaguely sensed that something was amiss.","Although they couldn't hear their conversation, they could tell from their actions and expressions that there must be something fishy between the two.","It was very likely to involve money.","Peng Lairui recalled the content of his recent phone call with Anthony from TK and felt a cold sweat on his back.","He had expected it to be news about securing the rights to distribute in Japan and South Korea.","But unexpectedly, not only were the rights for Japan and South Korea hopeless, but the existing distribution rights were also hanging by a thread.","In that phone call, Anthony asked him why he had changed the supply contract into an exclusive one.","Hearing this, he was startled.","Could it be that the matter of him accepting bribes in secret had been exposed?","But that shouldn't be possible.","After the call was abruptly ended by the other party, he tried to call back to explain, but there was no answer.","While he hadn't yet signed a contract with Wanchuan, Peng Lairui only wanted to remedy the situation promptly.","He left Wanchuan aside and glanced at the others present in the room.","With a greasy smile on his face, he raised his voice and announced,","\"Ladies and gentlemen, Lairui and everyone's supply contract remains the same as last year. We're renewing it!\"","As his words fell, a wave of commotion erupted in the reception room.","Some were puzzled, while others were pleasantly surprised.","Before the commotion could settle down,","a steady and imposing voice came closer from a distance.","\"What you said doesn't count—\"","Following the sound, everyone turned their heads and saw a handsome man with brownish hair entering the reception room.","He was wearing a light camel-colored trench coat, finely tailored with a sharp and sturdy silhouette that highlighted his extraordinary temperament.","His tall and upright figure exuded a powerful aura of confidence.","Someone recognized him and whispered in awe,","\"Isn't that Cheng Zhuo from Fangcheng Group? What is he doing here?\"","Another person chimed in, \"Fangcheng Group? The renowned company on Wall Street?\"","\"Yes, I've seen his interviews before, and he looks even more handsome and taller in person.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes widened in astonishment.","A... Big shot?","No, not quite.","\"Big brother?\"","Cheng Zhuo raised an eyebrow at Sheng Mumu and smiled,","\"Sis, you're right, he's our big brother. Handsome, isn't he?\"","While the siblings exchanged whispers, Cheng Xin's gaze shifted towards them.","He slightly furrowed his brows, his expression softened for a moment.","Then he looked away, returning to his cold and aloof demeanor.","It seemed like a greeting was exchanged, yet it also seemed like it wasn't.","Peng Lairui's eyes darted around, feeling uneasy.","Oh no.","Fangcheng Group had significant influence abroad, and even he had heard about TK's recent attempts to collaborate with them.","Why did Cheng Zhuo from Fangcheng Group suddenly appear here and say what he just said?","What could be the reason?","Before he could ponder further, Peng Lairui approached obsequiously, extending his hand,","\"Mr. Cheng, nice to meet you. I am—\"","Cheng Xin furrowed his brows, his gaze coldly swept over Peng Lairui as he approached.","It was clear displeasure.","With just a single glance, the blonde foreign assistant by his side immediately understood and stepped forward, blocking Peng Lairui's hand that was about to reach out, and said,","\"Sorry, Mr. Cheng is a germophobe and doesn't shake hands with strangers.\"","\"Uh... Ah...\" Peng Lairui's outstretched hand awkwardly hung in the air, slowly retracting with a smile, \"No problem, no problem...\"","As the crowd gradually recovered from their shock,","they began whispering to each other in small groups.","\"What did Mr. Cheng mean by his earlier words? What does he mean by 'what Peng said doesn't count'?\"","\"Is he referring to our contract renewal with TK?\"","\"It can't be, we can't lose the contract again, right?\"","The most puzzled ones were Peng Lairui and Wanchuan.","Wanchuan watched Cheng Xin vigilantly, feeling that the failure of their exclusive contract was definitely related to Cheng Xin suddenly appearing.","Peng Lairui forced a smile and asked Cheng Xin,","\"Mr. Cheng, what did you mean by your earlier words? I didn't quite understand.\"","At the mention, Cheng Xin narrowed his long, impatient eyes.","He didn't speak, but lifted his arm slightly and casually adjusted his trench coat collar.","The blonde assistant spoke on his behalf,","\"It means that TK's domestic agency rights will no longer have anything to do with you, Lairui. Can you understand it if I put it this way?\"","As the words fell, the whole room trembled.","The discussions grew louder.","Almost everyone was puzzled as to why Cheng Xin could replace TK in making decisions.","What's even more strange is that Cheng Xin suddenly appeared just to discuss this?","This doesn't make sense at all.","Among the crowd, Sheng Mumu stood out from the rest.","Her focus was different from others.","Her clear eyes emitted an admiring light.","Wow.","Big Brother has mastered the art of being a tyrant CEO to perfection.","There's someone speaking on his behalf even when it comes to talking.","He's so impressive.","Starry-eyed.jpg","Spending time with Qi Mo has changed Sheng Mumu's stereotypical impression of a \"tyrant CEO.\"","She always thought that someone like Qi Mo, calm and distant but gentle and polite, is how a CEO should be.","The ones portrayed in TV dramas were all fake.","But now, seeing Big Brother Cheng Xin,","That idea has been overturned.","There really are CEOs like that!","Every gesture and movement exudes disdain and a domineering arrogance of \"What can you do to me?\"","A bit... cool.","\"Oh no, oh no—\"","A voice suddenly came from outside the reception room."]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: Mu Mu, do you like my gift","paragraphs":["\"Oh no, oh no -\"","Peng Lairui's subordinate ran in anxiously, holding some freshly received faxes, the paper still warm.","Gasping for breath, he said before catching his breath:","\"President Rui, TK has cancelled our agency rights and sent a termination letter.\"","\"What did you say?\" Peng Lairui's eyes suddenly opened wide as he snatched the papers.","After quickly scanning them a few times, his expression instantly stiffened.","Mumbling:","\"How could this be? How could this be?\"","The termination letter stated that Lairui's agency rights with TK were terminated.","And it demanded that Peng Lairui personally pay compensation.","The reason was that he had illegally profited by abusing the agency rights, damaging TK's brand image.","Peng Lairui was so anxious that sweat poured down. He didn't care that there were still many people around, and walked to the side while constantly calling TK, trying to plead for mercy.","At this time, the people present also guessed what had happened.","It wasn't important who TK gave the agency rights to, what was important was whether they could continue to get TK's goods.","Peng Lairui had just promised everyone contract renewals, and then lost the agency rights in the next second.","What should they do now?","The crowd immediately became restless, like headless flies, and spoke out:","\"Doesn't that mean we came here for nothing today?\"","\"Who should we go to for contract renewals...\"","\"What a let down, we still didn't get the renewals in the end.\"","\"Everyone, don't panic,\" the blonde assistant suddenly spoke up, his face calm as he said to everyone, \"After TK transfers the agency rights to the new partner company, they will quickly discuss renewal matters with everyone.\"","\"Really?\" Everyone's expressions instantly switched from worried to delighted in a second.","The blonde assistant nodded, continuing to speak on behalf of Cheng Xin, \"On the way here, Boss Cheng has already contacted TK. He understands the situation here. Don't worry, everyone.\"","\"That's great!\"","\"Did Boss Cheng come today specifically to fight for our renewals?\" Someone felt incredulous.","Others asked the blonde assistant:","\"Oh yes, foreign brother, will our renewal order quantities remain the same as previous years?\"","The blonde assistant hesitated. He didn't know the answer to this question. He looked back at his boss for help.","Cheng Xin raised his narrow, handsome eyes and looked at the person who asked the question, answering concisely: \"No.\"","\"Ah...no?\"","\"Is it less or more?\"","\"Boss Cheng, may I ask if you know the inside details?\"","\"Can you give us a little hint?\"","Everyone knew it might be unreasonable to ask Cheng Xin this, but with no one else to ask now, they could only grab the only person who might know the situation.","Cheng Xin was no longer stingy with his words. His voice coldly and slowly said:","\"Not everyone's renewal contract is the same as before.\"","\"Except for Yueji, the others' renewal contracts remain the same.\"","Everyone was shocked: \"???\"","Their expressions changed from worried to relieved, then abruptly to gossip mode.","Why was Yueji the exception?","Could Yueji have offended TK too?","Before everyone could make wild guesses, they heard Cheng Xin's low, calm voice continue.","\"TK has given Yueji three of its Rose Gardens. From now on, Yueji can deal with TK directly without middlemen agents, so naturally there is no need for contracts.\"","Before he finished speaking, everyone's gazes shifted to Sheng Mumu.","Immediately, the room broke out in loud discussions:","\"Wow, what great fortune!\"","\"Good heavens, three Rose Gardens, how much are those worth?\"","\"Money can't buy them, this isn't something ordinary connections can achieve.\"","\"The Qi Group's connections can easily accomplish it.\"","\"But if the Qi Group was acting, they would've gotten them long ago. Chairwoman Sheng wouldn't have needed to come here today like the rest of us.\"","\"You're right.\"","Just as everyone was enviously chattering, Peng Lairui walked over dejectedly.","He hadn't been able to get through to TK. Now he could only grasp at the final lifeline, and asked Cheng Xin in an almost pleading tone:","\"Boss Cheng, I know you have a good relationship with TK's president. Can you please say some good words for me?\"","Cheng Xin glanced coldly at him without speaking.","Peng Lairui persisted:","\"Boss Cheng, have I offended you in some way, offended Fangcheng?\"","\"Lairui will be finished without TK's agency rights...\"","\"Boss Cheng, I beg you to help us...\"","\"You came from overseas, surely you have business to discuss in Jing City? I know Lairui is insignificant compared to Fangcheng Group, but as long as you say the word, no matter how small the matter, I will do my utmost.\"","\"Please say some good words for us to TK...\"","Cheng Xin looked at him with disdain, then laughed as if Peng Lairui was joking.","He said in a cold tone: \"I came to Jing City to see my sister. You can't help at all.\"","Everyone looked at each other after he finished speaking.","See his sister?","They had only heard that Fangcheng Group's Boss Cheng had a younger brother who wasn't introduced publicly. Since when did he have a sister too?","Peng Lairui was also stunned, eyes wide.","Unwilling to let go of any chance, he forced a smile and said:","\"I can help, I can help...\"","\"Boss Cheng, you just arrived in Jing City right? I'll have my people arrange hotel reception for you immediately, and send people to bring your sister over. I can also—\"","\"No need,\" Cheng Xin interrupted Peng Lairui's presumptuous words.","He strode towards the back of the reception hall.","Stopping in front of the confused and worshipful Sheng Mumu.","His deep brows and eyes gradually relaxed, showing a gentle smile. The corners of his lips revealed faint dimples as he asked:","\"Mumu, do you like my gifts?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","Sheng Mumu's current feelings could be described with one word — dazed.","Three Rose Gardens, how could she not like them?","She didn't even dare imagine it!","Seeing Sheng Mumu frozen in shock, Cheng Xin reached out and rubbed her head.","The previous cold and contemptuous expression was completely gone, his eyes full of doting affection as he chuckled:","\"What's wrong, so happy to see your brother that you're silly now?\"","Everyone was shocked: \"??????\"","What? Chairwoman Sheng is Boss Cheng's sister???","What a shocking turn of events!","Cheng Zhuo broke into a bright grin between Cheng Xin and Sheng Mumu.","He whispered on Sheng Mumu's behalf:","\"Bro, I guess sis isn't silly from happiness at seeing you, but from happiness at the three Rose Gardens.\"","With a \"pow\", a melon seed snapped on Cheng Zhuo's head.","Sheng Mumu came back to her senses, eyes curving into crescents. She gave Cheng Zhuo a look, \"What nonsense are you spouting.\"","Cheng Zhuo clutched his forehead: \"Sis...you didn't have to hit me, not in front of so many people...\"","\"......\" Cheng Xin was briefly stunned, then low rumbles of laughter sounded from his chest.","Under everyone's watch, the three turned and left the reception hall.","The discussions inside continued for a long time."]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: Big Brother's Greeting","paragraphs":["“Brother, why did you suddenly come to Jing City?”","“Were you trying to surprise us by not telling us earlier?”","“Brother, how many days are you staying in Jing City?”","“......”","As soon as he got in the car, Cheng Zhuo started bombarding Cheng Xin with questions non-stop.","Cheng Xin sat lazily in the back of the luxury car, legs crossed.","His brows were slightly furrowed, and he swept a cold glance over.","In a tone that was stern enough to silence Cheng Zhuo but not too harsh, he said:","“Can you be quieter?”","“......” Cheng Zhuo was stunned for a moment, and immediately shut his mouth.","He made a zipping motion over his lips and drooped back into his seat.","Seeing this, Cheng Xin lightly withdrew his gaze.","Suddenly, as if thinking of something, his eyes became even colder as he looked at Cheng Zhuo again.","\"Cheng Zhuo, is this your level of competence?\"","Cheng Zhuo was so frightened by this oppressive questioning that he jolted.","Not daring to \"talk too much,\" he stared back with wide eyes.","\"???\"","Cheng Xin's voice was as cold as ice:","\"If I hadn't come to Jing City and happened to call you, how were you planning to handle today's situation?\"","\"......\" Cheng Zhuo was rendered speechless, his lips moving but not able to get out half a word.","It wasn't that he didn't know how to answer.","But his innate fear of Big Brother came over him, and he temporarily forgot what to say.","It had been a long time since he was scolded face-to-face...","Cheng Xin continued to ask him, \"Is this how you look after Mumu? Hm?\"","Cheng Zhuo held his breath: \"......\"","His face suddenly showed great innocence.","He could only whimper to himself: But...brother, I'm your little brother...","Sheng Mumu had still been immersed in the joy of getting three rose gardens. Her mind went blank.","Now seeing Cheng Zhuo at a loss for words, she suddenly came back to her senses.","She quickly came to Cheng Zhuo's rescue:","\"Big brother, we had already thought of a plan B before coming over. Even if we couldn't negotiate properly with Leirui today, it would be fine.\"","Hearing her say this, Cheng Xin looked over.","His previously stern face instantly softened.","Flashing imperceptibly in his eyes were traces of guilt and distress.","Sheng Mumu didn't notice Cheng Xin's expression. She bit her lip and continued seriously:","\"In fact, I should reflect more―if I had contacted more rose gardens in the past, I wouldn't be in such a helpless situation when an emergency came up―\"","\"No, it's not your problem,\" Cheng Xin interrupted her words.","The self-reproach in his deep eyes grew thicker.","His normally steel-like resolute heart seemed to be grabbed by something, indescribably uncomfortable and remorseful.","In the years when Mumu was not with her family, she must have suffered a lot.","When encountering problems, her first reaction was to reflect on herself rather than rely on her family.","The more he thought about it, the more self-reproachful he became.","If his work hadn't been so busy and he had called Mumu and Cheng Zhuo more often, he should have resolved this matter long ago.","Cheng Xin's shoulders sank as he slowly said:","\"Mumu, it was my mistake for not considering this beforehand.\"","Upon hearing this, Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo couldn't help but glance at each other, blinking simultaneously.","One was bewildered.","The other was lamenting how biased Big Brother was.","Just then, Cheng Xin took out his phone from his coat pocket and made a call.","After speaking quickly for a few sentences, he put his phone away and looked at Sheng Mumu:","\"TK will transfer two more rose gardens under my name and give them to you.\"","He paused, his tone even gentler and warmer than before:","\"Mumu, if you encounter any problems in the future, you don't need to reflect or think of backup plans. Your family will always be your backup.\"","\"......\" Sheng Mumu's mind buzzed. She was struck by happiness and felt flattered. She hurriedly waved her hands, about to turn down his offer.","But then she saw Cheng Xin's brow twitch as he moved his hand towards his pocket, seeming like he was going to take out his phone again.","She stopped herself, swallowing the words that had come to her lips.","She wouldn't say anything more.","She had just expressed some self-reflection, yet Big Brother immediately offered her two more rose gardens.","If she outright declined, Big Brother might think she had suffered too much misfortune since childhood and was cautious, unaccustomed to other people's care.","If he got \"angry,\" he might even send ten more.","She could even imagine what the \"tycoon\" Big Brother would say if she refused―\"Not enough? Then ten it is.\"","Thinking of this, Sheng Mumu smoothly switched her expression. She suppressed all bewilderment and gave a sweet smile.","Adorable dimples appeared:","\"Thank you, Big Brother~\"","As her words fell, a broad palm touched the top of her head, gently rubbing it.","Accompanied by indistinct laughter, Cheng Xin's voice was mellow:","\"No need to say thanks to me.\"","The car was instantly immersed in a warm and harmonious atmosphere.","Cheng Xin started asking Sheng Mumu about her company's situation and whether there was anything he could help with. He also offered some professional suggestions for the future development direction of Yuxi, based on his expertise.","If the topic had shifted to something unfamiliar, Sheng Mumu might have felt somewhat estranged. After all, this was the first time meeting Big Brother today.","But when it came to career, Sheng Mumu's workaholic traits emerged, chattering away tirelessly.","Plus, she was an inherent social butterfly at heart. In no time, the distance between them faded away.","Her outgoing and cheerful personality was infectious.","The air even seemed to become fresh and comfortable.","However.","In an ignored corner of the luxury car.","Cheng Zhuo's eyes brightened. His gaze shifted between their faces several times.","Seeing Big Brother in high spirits, he chose an opportune time to insert himself into the conversation:","\"Oh right, brother, recently I――\"","Before he could finish speaking, Cheng Xin swept a cold glance over.","\"Don't you see me chatting with Mumu?\"","Cheng Zhuo's expression froze: \"........................\"","A song suddenly rang clearly in his mind―I should be under the car, not in the car.","Right? Brothers and sisters?","Too absorbed in talking, Sheng Mumu didn't notice the car arriving at a place she didn't recognize.","When she got out of the car, in front of her was a two-story European-style villa courtyard.","Against the lush greenery, the white walls and red roof exuded a classical and dignified air.","Not far away, roses entwined the fence, adding a touch of romantic color.","The air was infused with the fragrance of flowers and soil.","Although the location and area of this villa couldn't compare to Xiyu Yue Manor, it had its own charm of being far removed from the hustle and bustle of the city.","Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo were still dumbfounded when they followed Cheng Xin inside.","Upon reaching the lofty living room, looking around, the decoration seemed very new.","The brand new furniture was spotless, showing signs of regular cleaning.","\"I bought this villa a few years ago and left it empty since then.\"","Cheng Xin suddenly turned around, handing Sheng Mumu a set of keys.","His expression was somewhat stern as he said solemnly:","\"Mumu, Big Brother knows you are very capable and can support yourself, but you must accept this meeting gift.\"","\"From now on, this will be your maternal home in Jing City.\"","\"In the future, if you suffer even the slightest grievance in the Qi family, leave immediately instead of enduring it.\"","\"Big Brother will stand up for you.\"","Sheng Mumu's heart lurched violently, and warmth enclosed her from all sides.","Her nose instantly turned sour.","She couldn't tell if she was moved by this expensive \"meeting gift\" or by Big Brother's words.","Her bright eyes flashed with indescribable emotion. She didn't know what to say.","Before she could speak, that assured voice rang out again:","\"This place is somewhat outdated. The decoration is still the style from years ago. It would be best to renovate it completely.\"","\"Mumu, what style do you like? Tell me.\"","Cheng Xin deliberated for a few seconds before continuing. His tone slowed slightly:","\"Right, Mumu, would it be convenient to have dinner together tonight with your brother-in-law?\""]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: Wishing Fountain 2.0","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu suddenly felt relieved.","Fortunately, before her elder brother came, her \"fake\" marital relationship with Qi Mo had turned \"real.\"","Otherwise, with her elder brother's keen insight, she didn't dare guarantee that she wouldn't give the game away.","She gave Qi Mo a call to have dinner together.","She also invited little Qi along, not wanting him to pitifully eat lo mein noodles alone at home.","Cheng Zhuo finally found an opportunity to say a complete sentence:","\"Brother, sister, for dinner can I invite one more person to come along?\"","Cheng Xin glanced at him and asked: \"Who?\"","From Cheng Zhuo's careful yet sweetly concealed expression, Sheng Mumu had already guessed.","A smile blossomed, curving her eyes.","\"Sure, no problem.\"","Not waiting for Cheng Zhuo to answer his question, seeing that Sheng Mumu agreed, Cheng Xin also murmured an \"okay\" and lightly nodded his chin.","When the three people arrived at the arranged restaurant location,","Cheng Zhuo did not go in. He had just received a call from Qiao Li and was parking. He planned to go to the parking lot area to pick her up since Qiao Li wasn't very good at parking.","Sheng Mumu and Cheng Xin went into the restaurant together.","Just as they walked out of the revolving door, they saw Qi Mo standing there in a waiting posture.","Sheng Mumu quickened her pace by a few steps.","Perhaps it was out of guilt, afraid that her elder brother would find out about their previous contractual marriage.","She sweetly called out, \"Dear~ we're over here.\"","The tall and slender figure of the man suddenly froze, and he abruptly turned his head.","Pleasure he was unprepared for stained his handsome brows and eyes.","Qi Mo had booked the entire dining room of the restaurant. Inside the hall there only stood a few waiters, as if they too were startled by Sheng Mumu's ardent, sweet voice, quickly glancing over before professionally lowering their eyes.","\"When did you arrive?\" Sheng Mumu went over to cling to the man's firm arm, tilting her head towards him.","She put on an \"absolutely flawless\", \"old married couple\" act.","Subconsciously, Qi Mo put his arm around her slender waist, the corners of his lips curving up slightly, his eyes full of surprise:","\"Just now.\"","In fact, Qi Mo knew what this dinner signified.","Nothing more than Cheng Xin wanting to assess this brother-in-law of his.","Regarding this,","he didn't have the slightest discomfort or resistance.","On the contrary, when he received her call, his heart rose with a trace of reassurance.","Knowing that besides him, there was someone else who would treat her well with all his heart.","No matter how you looked at it, it was something that made one happy.","He smiled at Sheng Mumu, and the hand clasping her waist imperceptibly stroked her once.","It was as if saying: Wait a moment for me.","Next, the mature and steady man first turned his head and reached out a hand towards Cheng Xin.","Cheng Xin's cold eyes quivered slightly, surprise flashing by, as he shook Qi Mo's hand.","The two men were about the same height.","Their auras were similar, yet one could clearly sense the difference.","Cheng Xin increased the force of his grip somewhat, the attacking nature and probing meaning evident in his straightforward gaze at Qi Mo.","Qi Mo remained just as calm and unruffled as usual, with no intention of shrinking back.","Nor was there any hidden struggle to determine superiority.","A few seconds went by, and it also seemed to stretch on for a long time.","Both men had been fighting in the business arena for many years, with years of accumulated experience and prestige already evident without need for words.","One look said it all, observing and discerning intentions.","There were undercurrents swirling invisibly in the air.","But it was not tense undercurrents.","Their goal was the same, there was no opposition to begin with.","As long as one was good to Mumu, then he was good.","In an instant, the two men's cold, stern brows and eyes gradually relaxed, loosening their hands, both giving a faint smile.","Sheng Mumu was very clever, her ability to read expressions and mood no less than theirs.","She had stood to the side watching them intently.","Seeing Qi Mo and Cheng Xin's expressions both relax, she knew these two men who seemed strong on the outside but were actually childish on the inside had completed their first meeting.","Just as she was about to say something to ease up the atmosphere, an unruly, arrogant voice rang out from afar—","\"I have arrived, my lord. What are we eating today?\"","Dressed in a pure black hooded sweater, Qi Shaobai swaggeringly put on the hood, both hands in pockets.","He strode grandly into the restaurant, and upon seeing Sheng Mumu's familiar back figure, he subconsciously blurted out these words.","When his words fell, he only then realized it wasn't only Sheng Mumu present.","Dad was also there.","And there was also some stranger there who didn't seem easy to deal with.","At this time, all three people looked towards him simultaneously.","\"...\" Qi Shaobai's body went somewhat stiff. \"Dad...uh...\"","\"Pfft—\" Sheng Mumu laughed unabashedly and reached out to yank off his hood.","\"Little Qi, don't wear a hat indoors. Be careful not to grow tall.\"","\"Huh?\" Qi Shaobai looked at her doubtfully. \"Isn't that just like opening an umbrella indoors?\"","Sheng Mumu bluffed: \"The meaning is about the same.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"But I just measured recently, I grew taller again, already 1.86 meters.\"","Sheng Mumu's gaze swept over the top of Qi Shaobai's, Qi Mo's, and Cheng Xin's heads a few times. She said, \"You're still not as tall as your dad, still not as tall as my brother.\"","Qi Shaobai was rendered speechless for a few seconds, realizing the stranger's identity.","He responded late: \"But still taller than you.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Qi Shaobai and Sheng Mumu chatted away with each other, inexplicably diffusing the tense atmosphere, as if the earlier awkward entry lines were not said by him.","Seeing Mumu bickering with Qi Shaobai, Cheng Xin's heart which had still held some worry earlier was now completely relieved.","It seemed that Mumu was living quite happily in the Qi family.","Even when bickering with her stepson, she kept smiling the entire time.","The elevator gave a \"ding\" sound as it slowly opened.","The four people entered the elevator.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai were still continuing their bland conversation.","Qi Mo and Cheng Xin walked behind.","Very quickly switching from unfamiliarity to the appearance businessmen have when first meeting each other.","Chatting about things like:","\"I've heard your company's year-on-year revenue growth has been stable in recent years.\"","\"There'll be opportunities to collaborate in the future.\"","\"Blah blah blah...\"","\"@%$@ blah blah blah...\"","The kind of topics that sound very tiring for others to understand, yet they found joy in.","Sitting down in the private room.","Qi Mo passed the menu to Sheng Mumu for her to take a look and decide what dishes to order.","Sheng Mumu randomly chose a few, then passed the menu along to Qi Shaobai.","\"Take a look as well.\"","As the junior, and it also being Qi Shaobai's first time meeting the so-called \"uncle\" Cheng Xin, he was inevitably somewhat ill at ease.","Remembering the etiquette he had learned before, he pushed the menu away.","Soberly yet politely said:","\"Anything is fine with me, you all decide.\"","Sheng Mumu gave a slap to his arm, saying impatiently:","\"We're all family, don't pretend to be all proper with me. I told you to order so order!\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...\"","Qi Mo's lips curved into a faint smile, amused.","Cheng Xin then leaned forward slightly, all of the arrogant, CEO manner entirely gone as he looked at Qi Shaobai, a vague smile in his tone:","\"Qi Shaobai?\"","Called out by name, Qi Shaobai immediately raised his head.","He sat up straighter, looking over, \"Yes?\"","Cheng Xin's voice was calm: \"What Mumu said is right. From now on we're all one family, no need to be so restrained with me.\"","Qi Shaobai nodded.","Cheng Xin continued: \"Meeting for the first time, as uncle I should have prepared a meeting gift. I didn't think of it. Tell me what you usually like.\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned for a moment.","He looked towards his father who was silently, faintly smiling, and his little stepmother posing like a loving mother.","A few words instantly popped up in his mind:","Wow.","Wish Granter 2.0?"]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: The Secret Palpitations","paragraphs":["Although Qi Shaobai secretly defined Cheng Xin as \"Wish Granting Pool 2.0\" in his heart, he did not explicitly show his delight on his face.","It was like when an elder gives you red pockets during Chinese New Year. Even if you really want to accept them, you still have to politely and tactfully say something like \"Oh I couldn't possibly impose\".","He quickly glanced towards his dad Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu.","Then he put on a polite and docile expression, and gave a standard response:","\"No need to give me a gift, Uncle Cheng. I don't lack anything.\"","Cheng Xin laughed softly. His bangs lightly fluttered as he chuckled. He looked at his younger nephew whom he was meeting for the first time with great interest.","Ever since his parents passed away, Cheng Xin had raised Cheng Zhao. Among the three adults at the table, he understood teenagers the best.","He saw right through Qi Shaobai's desire to accept a gift but not wanting to vocalize it.","Not giving Qi Shaobai a chance to refuse again, Cheng Xin revealed his CEO personality and directly asked a series of questions:","\"Qi Shaobai, do you like sports?\"","\"Soccer, basketball, tennis, horse riding, golf?\"","\"Or are you more interested in reading, musical instruments or model building?\"","Cheng Xin quickly searched through the common interests and hobbies a high school boy might have.","Qi Shaobai leaned back into his chair.","He had an expression like \"If you insist on giving me a gift, it would be impolite for me to continue refusing.\"","He smiled widely, showing his teeth:","\"Hehe, I usually play more basketball. Occasionally I'll build some Lego sets at home too.\"","After he spoke, it was as if he suddenly recalled something. He hurriedly added:","\"But I haven't had time recently since I've been preparing for the college entrance exam. I plan to splurge on Lego again after the exam.\"","\"I see,\" Cheng Xin nodded his head.","He placed his hand on his crossed legs and tapped the back of his other hand with his fingertips.","After pondering for a few seconds, he finally said:","\"I have quite a lot of Lego sets in my overseas residence that you might like. Unfortunately I've gifted some of the rare vintage sets to others recently. But the remaining ones should still have stuff you'll enjoy.\"","Cheng Xin's tone was slightly regretful. He didn't notice Qi Shaobai perk up after hearing what he said.","\"Really, Uncle?\" Qi Shaobai's eyes were wide open. \"You collect Lego???\"","He couldn't believe it. His uncle seemed just as carefree and indifferent as his dad.","To think that he actually had a hobby of collecting Lego sets, and they were rare vintage ones too!","Cheng Xin smiled lightly. Rare mischievous dimples appeared as he said:","\"Yes, we have the same hobby. Looks like we'll get along very well in the future.\"","\"Yeah!\" Qi Shaobai nodded enthusiastically like pounding garlic.","Afterwards...","The uncle with no blood ties and the nephew started an encrypted conversation that only the two of them understood.","\"Uncle, I recently built an old vintage X-Wing Starfighter from Star Wars! Isn't it cool?\"","\"Cool. I used to have that set too but gifted it away recently.\"","\"What a pity. You can't buy that set anywhere nowadays.\"","\"It's not that much of a pity. I still have an unopened Hoth Imperial Probe Droid from Star Wars in mint condition.\"","\"OMG OMG!!!\" Qi Shaobai was so envious that his eyes went straight. In his excitement he momentarily forgot proper language and blurted out, \"That was released 20 years ago! Uncle you're so awesome!\"","After he spoke, Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu's gazes suddenly shot over from the other side of the round table.","Qi Mo's brow slightly contracted, vaguely showing displeasure.","One corner of Sheng Mumu's lips dropped. If they weren't separated by an empty seat, she might have already flicked his forehead.","However, Qi Shaobai was completely absorbed in the conversation.","He hadn't noticed their warning looks at all.","Because his Uncle had agreed to gift him that rare vintage Imperial Star Destroyer set.","The fact that he didn't cheer out loud already demonstrated admirable restraint.","As Sheng Mumu listened to their conversation, she felt it increasingly familiar.","The Old Series X-Wing Starfighter from Star Wars. The Millennium Falcon. 14K Gold C-3PO...","Hiss~","Why did the models her brother gifted away happen to be the same ones she asked the \"Dream Granting Master\" to help her find???","What a coincidence.","She remembered the IP address of \"Dream Granting Master\" seemed to be overseas.","Could it be...","A thought silently emerged in her mind.","Sheng Mumu took out her phone and placed it under the table.","She opened WeChat and entered the chat with \"Dream Granting Master\".","Below the anime avatar, the profile showed:","Region: North America","Sheng Mumu: \"!!!\"","Her pupils quaked violently.","She gasped in surprise and covered her almost dropping jaw.","\"What's wrong?\"","A gentle voice asked.","Qi Mo noticed her abnormal behavior and asked caringly.","Sheng Mumu raised her eyes. With the phone under the table, she pointed at it, then pointed at her brother.","Her bright eyes grew wider and wider.","She used expressions to replace words.","Qi Mo's tailing brow slightly quirked up. He looked back and forth between her finger and phone several times.","He roughly understood her meaning but still had some doubts.","He leaned closer to her side.","The distance between them narrowed.","The large hand grasping her shoulder slowly caressed it a few times.","Qi Mo had an amused smile as he asked in a volume only the two of them could hear:","\"Are you saying...the person in your phone, this...Dream Granting Master, is your brother?\"","His tone was gentle and lingering.","The lowered voice was magnetically husky, warming Sheng Mumu's eardrum.","In the spacious private room, the two had their heads together, huddled close whispering.","Thump Thump —","An inexplicable quickening heartbeat.","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips together and lightly breathed to steady her heart rate.","Under the table, she moved her phone onto Qi Mo's lap. Her hand brushed against his trousers.","In a small voice she said:","\"Why don't...you take a look at my chat with Dream Granting Master first...\"","She decided to come clean with Qi Mo.","Including how she had lied to \"Dream Granting Master\" previously.","Qi Mo's long lashes lowered. His Adam's apple lightly rolled.","He slowly scrolled through with his other empty hand.","The emotions in his eyes gradually changed from \"indifference\" to \"shock\".","After a long while, an amused smile played about his lips. He slowly tilted his head, with doting starlight shimmering in his eyes.","Suddenly, he lightly flicked her cute pert nose.","\"You little rascal.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","She seemed to be immobilized by his sudden action.","Sheng Mumu's earlobes blushed red. She blinked blankly a few times.","As if trying unsuccessfully to cover something up, she hastily lowered her head and touched her burning ears.","Her long curled lashes lightly fluttered as she stammered:","\"Help...help me figure something out first.\"","Qi Mo's voice was rich and smiling: \"Alright.\"","Over the next few minutes, the two continued scheming together as if nothing had happened."]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: Qi Shaobai: Are they afraid of Me","paragraphs":["Qi Mo and Mumu were whispering to each other, heads close together. In any other situation, this would not have seemed strange. But in that moment, it took on an entirely different meaning in Shaobai's eyes.","Shaobai's gaze happened to sweep over them. He paused abruptly. The excitement on his face froze, and his back stiffened.","Strange, why are they looking at me?","He quietly withdrew his gaze and continued chatting with his uncle.","After a while, his eyes surreptitiously drifted back over.","Shaobai: ???","Why are they looking at me again?","Could it be my imagination?","Puzzled, he averted his gaze.","Unsure, I'll check again.","After a while...","His eyeballs suddenly darted over for a split second before swiftly retracting.","Just then, Mumu happened to glance up and meet his eyes before lowering her head to continue murmuring with Qi Mo.","Shaobai: \"!!!\"","So they were looking at me!","What on earth happened?","His mind raced furiously.","Shaobai: Let me think back carefully about what I just did.","Ah!","I accidentally cursed a couple times.","I accepted uncle's gift without their permission.","Crap.","Are they annoyed that I embarrassed myself out there?","Are they secretly discussing how to punish me when we get back?","The more Shaobai pondered, the more uneasy he became. He kept sneaking glances over at them.","Finally, during his eighth furtive attempt at eavesdropping, he heard his father's voice ring out like a judge delivering a verdict.","\"Shaobai.\"","Having his full name called out, Shaobai instantly sat up straight and looked over.","Qi Mo casually jerked his chin towards the door and said naturally:","\"I think my car keys fell in the parking lot. Go help me find them.\"","\"Yes, dad.\" Shaobai got to his feet and also politely said to Cheng Xin, \"Uncle, I'll be right back after stepping out for a bit.\"","Just now, he had been engrossed in conversation with his uncle, who was recounting the time he saw an NBA game and took photos with the Philadelphia 76ers players in Philadelphia.","That was his favorite team!","He was eager to return so they could continue their enthusiastic discussion after finding his dad's car keys.","Anxious to get back, Shaobai jogged out of the private room.","It didn't occur to him at all how uncharacteristic it was for his usually meticulous father to have dropped his car keys in the parking lot.","Right after Mumu confirmed that Shaobai had gone far away and was about to properly ask her brother if he was a dream-fulfilling wizard, the private room door was suddenly pushed open.","Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li appeared at the entrance.","Cheng Zhuo: \"Bro, sis, brother-in-law, sorry we're late. I'm terrible at parking so it took me forever to maneuver in.\"","The three people inside the room simultaneously looked over at the sound.","\"Wasn't the parking lot pretty empty?\" The words slipped out of Mumu's mouth before she could stop them.","Seeing Cheng Zhuo's expression freeze for an instant, followed by Qiao Li's lowered eyes, Mumu: \"......\"","What more was there to misunderstand?","She now hated that she couldn't slap herself.","How could she not keep this mouth in check!","Actually pointing out Cheng Zhuo's very obvious lie.","She looked at the two old foxes on either side of her and opposite her.","Sure enough, they were casually yet faintly smiling, evidently having realized Cheng Zhuo was lying.","Only she had stupidly blurted out a retort!","Words spoken could not be taken back. To make up for her lack of perceptiveness in committing a blunder, Mumu could only remedy it herself.","\"Um...well...uh, we ordered some dishes, you can take a look at the menu and order more.\"","Mumu walked to Qiao Li's side and glanced at Cheng Xin. \"Li Li, this is my brother, Cheng Xin. Brother, this is Qiao Li, Qi Mo's cousin and also my cousin. We get along very well.\"","After the introductions, Qiao Li smiled demurely for the first time in a long while.","Revealing the obedient girl persona Mumu had first seen her adopt.","\"Pleased to meet you, brother.\"","A flicker of bewilderment passed through Cheng Xin's brow. He didn't speak right away.","Ever since Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li entered, he had felt somewhat disoriented.","Although Mumu had gossiped a little about Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li on the way over, seeing them in person still took some getting used to.","These unfamiliar feelings weren't directed at Qiao Li, but rather Cheng Zhuo.","In his eyes, Cheng Zhuo had always been his immature little brother.","In a blink, here he was standing in front of him with a girl at his side.","It gave him the surreal sense that his child had suddenly grown up.","Both gratification and reluctance that the little brother he had raised with his own hands had finally matured.","Seeing his brother silent, Cheng Zhuo's heart leaped halfway up his throat.","He tugged Qiao Li's sleeve and whispered:","\"Li Li, my brother doesn't talk much and looks a bit fierce, but he's actually very nice.\"","Cheng Zhuo's eyes were full of panic and sincerity.","He couldn't help feeling nervous.","Thoughts flashed back one minute ago—","The parking lot.","Cheng Zhuo coolly swung the steering wheel with one hand and quickly parked.","Qiao Li was about to get out of the car when he called for her to stop.","\"Li Li.\"","Qiao Li paused, her hand still on the car door. \"Hm?\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"Actually, there's something I've been wanting to tell you—\"","Qiao Li curled her fingers still resting on the door, already guessing what Cheng Zhuo was going to say.","Cheng Zhuo's burning gaze was frank, ardent, intense.","\"Before, I kept putting it off because I wasn't sure if my sister and I were blood-related. But now that that's cleared up...\"","He broke off, inhaling deeply.","\"I really, really, really like you a lot. Will you be my girlfriend?\"","The sincere, fervent voice rang out in the tranquil car.","Speaking quickly due to nervousness, Cheng Zhuo held his breath awaiting her response.","Qiao Li was stunned.","In the past, she had encountered many admirers during her years performing with her band at bars.","Most of those guys would repeatedly test the waters in their words, texting her good morning and good night every day, eager to ask her out to meals whenever they had the time.","Yet they would never actually say \"I like you.\"","As if in the adult world, things could only ever be ambiguous, always kept at arm's length. And whoever was the first to utter \"I like you\" would naturally be at a huge disadvantage in the relationship.","It was very pragmatic, very self-serving.","Not that it was wrong per se...","This was the first time she had seen a guy like Cheng Zhuo.","Direct, earnest, intense.","Before confirming the relationship, he absolutely refused to nudge their interactions toward ambiguity.","Now, in order to break through to an intimate relationship, he straightforwardly confessed.","Qiao Li felt her heart thump heavily.","After thinking for barely three seconds, she coolly tossed her hair and pushed open the car door, throwing over her shoulder:","\"Sure.\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"!!!\"","Too elated to react, Cheng Zhuo dumbly scrambled to lock the car and hurry after her footsteps.","\"Did you just say 'sure'??","\"Right??\"","\"I have very good hearing!\"","Qiao Li: \"If you keep jabbering I'm taking back what I just said!\"","\"......\"","Thoughts returned to the present. Cheng Zhuo still basked in joy.","At the same time, he was extremely apprehensive that Qiao Li had agreed on a momentary impulse and would get cold feet upon seeing his stern brother, going back on her word...","After quite some time, Cheng Xin finally accepted the \"little brother growing up\" reality and slowly stood, greeting them very gentlemanly.","\"Hello.\"","Seeing Qiao Li smile, Cheng Zhuo happily made a fist, unable to keep from announcing on the spot:","\"Bro, actually, we—\"","\"Hold on, Cheng Zhuo,\" Mumu suddenly interjected, hurriedly glancing at her watch.","\"I need to confirm something with brother while little Qi isn't back yet. Keep what you want to say bottled up for a few minutes, 'kay? Just a few minutes.\"","Time was running short."]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: Master of Dreams, It's you","paragraphs":["Time is running out.","Sheng Mumu directly lit up her phone and held it up in front of Cheng Xin.","\"Brother, Dream Master, is that you?\"","Cheng Xin looked at the phone held up in front of him.","When he saw the four words \"Dream Master,\" he didn't immediately realize it was a nickname.","It wasn't until he scanned the chat records in the conversation box.","His eyes suddenly brightened.","The more he looked, the more familiar it became.","He glanced at Sheng Mumu and asked, \"Mumu, the person I've been chatting with, is it you?\"","Sheng Mumu lightly pursed her lips and nodded slowly.","Although she was very reluctant to admit it, she had to admit:","\"It's me.\"","Cheng Xin: \"...\"","He gradually recalled the contents of their conversation.","As Cheng Xin reminisced, he asked, \"An accident took away my legs...\"","\"In recent times, things have improved, and I can move them a little bit...\"","\"Are you referring to... Qi Shaobai?\"","\"Well... um...\" Sheng Mumu embarrassingly wanted to bang her head against the wall. She took a deep breath and said, \"I made it all up.\"","Cheng Xin's narrow eyes suddenly curved, and a hint of amusement appeared at the corners of his eyes and eyebrows.","\"Your skill in making up stories isn't bad.\"","He had actually been deceived by her.","Sheng Mumu's mouth twitched. She glanced at another person who knew the truth, Qi Mo, and smiled awkwardly.","\"What?\" Cheng Zhuo looked at his older brother in confusion and then at his sister and brother-in-law, looking utterly lost. \"What are you talking about? Why don't I understand?\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"???\"","At what point did he lose track?","\"This is how it happened,\" Sheng Mumu calmly began.","She briefly explained the story that couldn't be told to Qi Shaobai to Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li.","Meanwhile, Qi Shaobai searched in the parking lot with his phone's flashlight for five minutes.","He didn't overlook even the bottom of the car.","He searched back and forth along the path from the parking lot to the elevator lobby.","But there was no trace of the car keys.","He had no choice but to return empty-handed.","He pushed open the door to the private room, about to say, \"Dad, I couldn't find the car...\"","But he suddenly stopped mid-sentence.","Inside the private room, laughter filled the air, and the atmosphere was lively.","\"...keys.\"","Qi Mo turned his head upon hearing the words. His hand naturally moved to his pocket, and a composed smile lingered on his face as he said, \"I just found them on me.\"","\"Ah... That's good then.\" Qi Shaobai didn't doubt his father's words and sat down, feeling relieved.","Around the table, the five people exchanged knowing glances, and laughter erupted once again.","Qi Shaobai looked at everyone in confusion, \"????\"","Seemingly influenced by the atmosphere, his naturally gloomy expression slowly curved into a gentle arc.","Although he didn't know what they were laughing about, it was always safe to laugh along.","Otherwise, he would stand out.","Qi Shaobai glanced at everyone on the table, adjusting his smile to match everyone else's.","The Qi Shaobai in his eyes: I'm super cheerful.jpg","The Qi Shaobai in everyone else's eyes: What is he doing???","During the meal, Qi Shaobai noticed Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li occasionally glancing at his legs.","They would then speak softly and burst into laughter.","Unable to bear it any longer, Qi Shaobai put down his chopsticks and asked Qiao Li, \"Why do you both keep looking at my legs?\"","Qiao Li blinked and activated her serious nonsense skills:","\"It's nothing. Cheng Zhuo envies your long legs, and I'm teasing him.\"","Qi Shaobai was skeptical as he asked, \"...Huh?\"","\"You better be telling the truth.jpg.\"","Cheng Zhuo leaned in and picked a piece of braised pork for Qiao Li's bowl.","Nodding as if nothing happened, he chimed in, \"Yeah, I envy you so much. I envy your healthy long legs.\"","Qi Shaobai: \"...???\"","Um...","Although he was praised,","It just felt... weird.","*Three days later.*","Cheng Xin left Beijing due to work reasons.","In the two days before his departure,","He had a total of four meals with Sheng Mumu and Cheng Zhuo.","Not wasting a single moment of sibling reunion time.","He also finalized a project collaboration with Qi Mo over the phone.","With Sheng Mumu acting as a bridge of trust between the two, the collaboration was almost effortless.","Their conversation was concise and efficient to a shocking degree. The entire phone call took less than five minutes.","And in the last two minutes, they didn't talk about work but about Sheng Mumu.","Cheng Xin suddenly said, \"By the way, tell Mumu for me that her villa has started renovation. Whenever it's ready, she can move in anytime.\"","Cheng Xin didn't emphasize his words, saying it casually.","But Qi Mo, clever as he was, couldn't fail to detect the strong reminder in Cheng Xin's words.","Every word struck him.","If Mumu wasn't living well at the Qi family's place, Cheng Xin would bring her back to his own home anytime.","There was a moment of silence on the other end of the phone, and Qi Mo calmly replied, his voice enveloped in a faint smile and certainty:","\"Sure, if Mumu gets tired of living at home, I'll go live with her.\"","This time, it was Cheng Xin who was taken aback.","After a while, a trace of satisfaction floated in his sharp gaze.","His evaluation of his brother-in-law had finally passed with flying colors.","And during this conversation between mature men, Sheng Mumu was completely clueless, kept in the dark.","If she knew, she would mock Qi Mo in person for being childish and naive fifty times over.","Before boarding the plane, Cheng Xin didn't forget to make a phone call to Qi Shaobai.","Over the phone, Cheng Xin instructed, \"Qi Shaobai, the package I had someone send you should arrive in Beijing tonight.\"","\"If there's anything you want in the future, just tell your uncle.\"","There was a pause in his voice, and Cheng Xin ignited an inexplicable desire for victory or defeat as he added:","\"What your dad can get, I can get. And what he doesn't want to get for you, your uncle will get for you.\"","\"!!!\" Qi Shaobai was so happy that he forgot about his physical education class and jumped up on the spot.","He shouted, \"Uncle, you're my god!\"","On the other end of the line, Cheng Xin's laughter was hearty, completely unlike his cold and aloof appearance. He replied in a warm voice:","\"I'm not a god, I'm your uncle.\"","\"Yes.\" Qi Shaobai immediately corrected himself, skillfully playing along, \"You're my one and only uncle!\"","\"...\"","\"Qi Shaobai! What are you doing?-\" The physical education teacher noticed him secretly making a phone call and yelled sternly.","\"Uncle, I have to hang up.\" Qi Shaobai quickly said goodbye to Cheng Xin.","As soon as he finished speaking, his body froze.","He realized that his choice of words was improper and could be misunderstood.","He slapped himself on the mouth and made amends:","\"No, I mean, I'll hang up first.\"","Cheng Xin: \"...\"","\"No, I mean, I'll hang up the phone first.\" Qi Shaobai was flustered, finally getting it right.","Cheng Xin chuckled, \"Okay, go back to your class--\"","\"Beep-beep-beep--\" The busy tone sounded from the receiver.","\"Class...\"","Cheng Xin uttered the last word to the air.","Qi Shaobai was ultimately subjected to punishment by the physical education teacher.","He was made to frog jump around the playground twice.","The physical education teacher had a good relationship with the students on a regular basis.","While supervising Qi Shaobai's frog jumps, he used him as an example to educate the other students.","\"You guys always complain that there are no physical education classes in the third year.\"","The teacher looked towards Wei Zhaonan and gestured, saying, \"That person, Wei Zhaonan, you just said I'm not competent enough to compete with other subject teachers, right?\"","\"Now that we finally have a physical education class, there are still people secretly making phone calls.\"","\"If this continues, will I fall sick every class from now on?\"","As the words fell, the whole class burst into laughter.","Laughter filled the autumn playground.","The laughter of the teenagers in their adolescence was as exuberant and unrestrained as their personalities.","The commotion startled the birds perched on the trees, causing them to flap their wings and fly away.","Even Qi Shaobai, who was in the midst of frog jumping, was laughing.","He didn't know whether it was because he was in a good mood about receiving a gift soon or because he heard what the physical education teacher said.","With a face full of joy, he continued frog jumping.","He resembled a big fool."]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: He Really Likes It","paragraphs":["Since hanging up the phone with Cheng Xin, Qi Shaobai's mind was filled with anticipation like a package waiting to be delivered.","He couldn't focus on his studies at all.","He skipped his evening self-study session for the first time in a long while and went home early to wait.","Every time a dog passed by the gate of the villa, he would approach and take a look, hoping it was a gift from his uncle.","However, several hours passed, and there was no sign of the delivery guy.","Zhang Housekeeper leisurely walked by him and casually asked, \"Young master, are you waiting at the gate to pick up Mr. Tai Tai from work?\"","\"Huh?\" Qi Shaobai was momentarily stunned, then replied, \"Yes.\"","He quickly suppressed his eager anticipation and pretended to stroll around as if nothing was amiss.","Zhang Housekeeper smiled with satisfaction and walked away, murmuring to himself, \"The young master has really grown up.\"","He's become considerate.","Thirty minutes later...","Zhang Housekeeper strolled back again.","\"Young master, would you like me to bring a chair for you to sit while you wait?\"","Zhang Housekeeper couldn't bear to see Qi Shaobai standing all the time and, out of his natural concern, asked.","Qi Shaobai raised his head to look outside and casually replied, \"Okay.\"","Zhang Housekeeper brought a chair from the side of the swimming pool.","He placed it behind Qi Shaobai.","\"Young master, please have a seat.\"","After saying that, he turned and walked towards the villa, muttering to himself, \"I'll go to the storage room. I haven't had a chance to organize the packages that arrived this afternoon. If you need anything, just call out to me. I'll go there first.\"","\"Huh?\" Qi Shaobai suddenly turned his head and called out to Zhang Housekeeper, \"Wait—\"","\"Are you saying that a package arrived this afternoon?\"","\"Yes,\" Zhang Housekeeper nodded in confusion, not understanding why the young master had such a strong reaction.","Zhang Housekeeper said, \"The delivery couldn't enter the villa area. I went to pick it up this afternoon but haven't had a chance to organize it yet.\"","Qi Shaobai immediately stood up and ran into the house.","His voice gradually faded away, \"Ah ah ah, why didn't you say so earlier...\"","Leaving Zhang Housekeeper scratching his head in confusion.","You didn't ask either...","Zhang Housekeeper followed the fast footsteps of Qi Shaobai.","When they reached the living room, Qi Shaobai was carrying several large boxes and walking towards his room door.","He used the packages to push open the door.","Then he swiftly entered.","Using the heel of his foot, he closed the door.","As soon as the door was closed, a satisfied cheer came from inside.","\"Yes!\"","Zhang Housekeeper: ?","Approximately an hour later...","A black Kurenan pulled into the front yard of the villa.","Qi Mo went to pick up Sheng Mumu from her company, and they returned after having dinner together.","Taking the hot towel handed over by the servant to wipe her hands, Sheng Mumu bent over to change her shoes.","Because she leaned forward slightly, her bag slipped down her shoulder.","Seeing that it was about to fall, a well-proportioned and slender hand reached out from behind and held it.","Qi Mo held her forearm, lifted it slightly, and took the bag off.","Sheng Mumu seemed accustomed to his daily caring gestures and only glanced at him. Then she thought of something and looked at Zhang Housekeeper, who was smiling beside them.","\"What time is it now, Zhang Housekeeper? Qi Shaobai should be back soon, right?\"","After changing her shoes, Sheng Mumu turned around, took a food bag from Qi Mo's hand, and handed it to Zhang Housekeeper.","\"We brought him some food. Heat it up for him when he comes back.\"","Zhang Housekeeper received the food bag with both hands and widened his eyes.","\"Master has returned home early.\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Huh? He came back early?\"","Don't we have evening self-study today?","Zhang Housekeeper took a few seconds to recall and answered with great professionalism:","\"Yes, Madam. Master returned home at 6:27 PM and is currently in his room.\"","Sheng Mumu pondered for a moment and immediately guessed the reason, asking:","\"Zhang Housekeeper, did we receive a delivery today? Did Qi Shaobai eagerly wait for the delivery before returning to his room?\"","Zhang Housekeeper showed a surprised expression and replied, \"Yes.\"","How could Madam predict everything and even guess Master's actions?","\"You naughty boy, he must have skipped self-study just to wait for the delivery,\" Sheng Mumu narrowed her eyes and turned to look at Qi Mo, furrowing her brows, \"Why don't you manage your son? He's in his final year of high school and still dares to skip classes.\"","\"...,\" Qi Mo froze.","He didn't expect the blame to shift to him.","Just as he was about to say something, he saw Sheng Mumu already calming down and walking upstairs.","Talking to herself, self-comforting:","\"Never mind, never mind, I'll let you off this time for your negligence.\"","\"I've been busy lately and let my guard down. Consider it a loophole exploited by little Qi.\"","\"But if I catch him doing it again, I won't go easy on him.\"","Qi Mo watched her ascend the stairs, wearing corgi-shaped cotton slippers, stepping heavily with each stride.","He couldn't help but smile.","Tiny specks of light shimmered in his dark eyes, and the corners of his eyes lifted slowly, resembling stars.","So vivacious.","He really liked her.","Sheng Mumu reached the doorway of their bedroom, but suddenly felt an arm wrapping around her waist from behind.","The man's arm had smooth and strong muscles, and because of the slight force, faint veins appeared, exuding a sense of masculine power.","After entering the room, he tightened his arm, pulling her into his embrace, forcing her to stop in her tracks.","Sheng Mumu was taken aback, raising her gaze in surprise.","\"What's the matter?\"","Qi Mo adjusted her body, facing him, and answered with a question, \"Did you forget what you promised me?\"","Sheng Mumu paused for a moment, searching her mind.","Lately, there had been a lot of work at the end of the year.","She felt like she had to remember ten thousand things every day and couldn't recall what she had promised Qi Mo.","She moved her hand to his forearm and pinched it lightly, indicating for him to loosen his grip.","Instead of asking directly, she said, \"Give me a hint, and I'll definitely remember.\"","The man's gaze paused for a moment, and the place where she pinched his arm seemed to have been scorched, emanating residual warmth.","The gentle force from the woman's hand was nothing to a man who regularly worked out.","Rather than protesting, it was more like a reminder for him to pay attention to the warm sensation spreading from his arm.","The scent of her sweet fragrance lingered around his nose.","Sheng Mumu looked up at him, waiting for him to give her a hint.","In her crystal-like eyes, there were shimmering ripples.","Vivid and bright.","More enchanting than the most beautiful sunset.","The man's eyes deepened.","Thinking that he should relax his grip a bit, his actions unconsciously contradicted his thoughts, tightening his arm even more.","Sheng Mumu had to press her hand against his chest to prevent herself from being pressed into his embrace.","\"Give me a hint quickly,\" she urged.","The man leaned in closer, his handsome face getting nearer.","Without beating around the bush, he directly gave her the answer:","\"You said you would accompany me to watch a movie.\"","\"!\" Sheng Mumu was stunned.","She completely forgot about it.","Her frozen expression gradually relaxed, and she raised her eyebrows, trying to coax and explain at the same time:","\"Work has been really busy lately, and I forgot. Just a moment ago, I overlooked it once, so don't hold it against me, okay? Hmm?\"","Qi Mo locked his gaze onto her, his deep and mellow voice wrapped in feigned anger, slowly speaking:","\"Well, if you forget again next time, I won't be so easily appeased.\""]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: Miss Sheng Wants to be Reasonable","paragraphs":["To avoid forgetting to watch movies again, Sheng Mumu set a schedule on her phone.","Promptly at 3:15 every afternoon, her phone would ring.","A text reminder popped up on the screen—","\"Did you watch a movie today?\"","But even with this silly method, watching movies was repeatedly postponed.","She was also very helpless.","There were simply too many things to handle at the company by the end of the year.","Entertainment items could only be put at the back.","Qi Mo was extremely patient about this and did not urge her at all.","He only had an VIP room in one of the Qi's movie theaters kept empty.","Whenever she wanted to meet him, they could go over.","One afternoon a week later.","Sheng Mumu finally finished today's work ahead of time.","She leaned back in her chair.","Casually picked up her phone and first sent Qi Mo two emojis expressing her happy mood.","Sheng Mumu: \"Happily jumping.gif\"","Sheng Mumu: “Good news, good news.gif\"","Without waiting for a reply, she continued to tap: \"I can go watch a mov\"","Before she could type out the last two characters, her palm suddenly vibrated.","An incoming call.","The caller ID—Qi Shaobai’s Class Teacher.","Sheng Mumu's breath hitched.","Her heart suddenly clenched.","During the college entrance examination mobilization meeting, Sheng Mumu had saved Qi Shaobai’s class teacher's phone number.","After saving it for so long, this was still the first time it lit up on the screen.","Looking at her phone, Sheng Mumu couldn't help but feel nervous.","In a few seconds, countless thoughts flashed through her mind.","The corners of her lips slowly pressed tight.","Usually when Qi Shaobai caused trouble at school, it was always Zhang Housekeeper who found out first before informing her.","Why was the class teacher calling her directly today?","Could it be that Qi Shaobai encountered some sudden incident???","Her palms instantly became slightly damp.","Without realizing it, she had completely stepped into the \"mother\" role.","Facing the sudden phone call, her first reaction was whether Qi Shaobai was safe.","She hadn't even answered but was already afraid.","After a long pause she finally moved the phone to her ear.","Her voice carried subtle nervousness:","\"Hello—\"","On the phone, the class teacher's voice was calm:","\"Hello, are you Qi Shaobai’s parent?\"","\"Yes, I am.\"","Ten minutes later.","As the class teacher slowly explained her intention, Sheng Mumu's furrowed brows finally relaxed.","On the phone, the class teacher and Sheng Mumu talked about Qi Shaobai's recent performance at school...","First, the class teacher affirmed Qi Shaobai's recent improvement in grades.","Then she got to the point.","Yesterday when patrolling, the class teacher discovered Qi Shaobai sleeping during English class.","The class teacher spoke gravely, \"It would be fine if it was only once, but he also fell asleep during math class this morning.\"","Sheng Mumu's brows that had just relaxed furrowed again.","Her knuckles holding the phone clenched tight as she earnestly listened to the class teacher.","After repeatedly emphasizing the seriousness of the matter, the class teacher sighed and earnestly said:","\"Starting next week, in accordance with the new regulations from the Municipal Education Bureau, extra classes will not allowed on Saturdays and Sundays, and evening study for high school seniors will end at 7:30.\"","\"This means whether students use time after returning home to review depends entirely on their self-discipline.\"","\"Judging from Qi Shaobai’s current learning attitude, sending him back home would likely—\"","The class teacher's tone softened.","Sheng Mumu understood the class teacher's implication and seriously promised:","\"Teacher, please rest assured. I will definitely talk seriously to Qi Shaobai and tighten supervision over him!\"","Promises are not weighed equally.","The promise to accompany Elder Qi to watch movies clearly didn't take priority over educating little Qi.","After hanging up the phone, Sheng Mumu grabbed her coat and bag.","She strode out of the office directly to a nearby bookstore.","She wandered around the book store for a full hour, purchasing everything needed.","Putting the items in the trunk, she sat in the car and glanced at her phone to discover Qi Mo had sent several messages.","Qi Mo: \"What good news? So happy.\"","Ten minutes later...","Qi Mo: \"What's the good news?\"","Three minutes later...","Qi Mo: \"?\"","Twenty minutes later...","Qi Mo: \"I regret agreeing to your terms and conditions.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned: \"......\"","She thought back to when she and Qi Mo had talked about terms and conditions before.","That was on a certain weekday afternoon.","Having lunch separately at their own companies, they started chatting on the phone for about an hour and a half after lunch.","They said \"Goodbye\" four or five times but still couldn't bear to end the call.","Just when Sheng Mumu happened to stand up to get some water and accidentally knocked a stack of documents onto the ground.","She bent over to pick them up and finished tidying the documents before realizing the phone was still connected.","Sheng Mumu brought the receiver to her ear to listen and check if Qi Mo was still there.","But she heard knocking sounds coming from the phone.","Qi Mo said, \"Come in.\"","President Chen's voice came through:","\"President Qi, President Chen from Huayuan Technology has already been waiting in the reception room for an hour...\"","Sheng Mumu hung up the phone and was silent for a long time.","Qi Mo's tone had been so relaxed when talking on the phone earlier, and he hadn't mentioned at all that he had an important guest waiting.","Sheng Mumu suddenly felt as if she was some kind of femme fatale*.","So she decisively proposed that very night:","\"Qi Mo, I think we should lay down three rules.\"","Qi Mo, who had been reading a magazine in bed, paused and raised his eyes to look over.","\"Lay down three rules?\"","\"Mm,\" Sheng Mumu set herself in work mode.","Pacing as she spoke:","\"First, no long phone calls during work hours.\"","\"Second, if there's work, work comes first—the same goes for me.\"","\"Third—\"","\"No.\" Qi Mo's brow furrowed, his voice sinking as he abruptly cut her off.","His expression also darkened, lips pressed in a straight line.","Every pore was emitting a cold and hard aura.","Silently protesting.","Sheng Mumu was stunned for a moment, suddenly feeling that he now resembled a petulant husband making unreasonable demands.","The corners of her lips curved up as she smiled and sat down next to him.","Suddenly, Qi Mo's distinct jawline was slowly lifted up by Sheng Mumu's slender fingers.","She asked teasingly:","\"Why not? You have to give reasons, Mr. Qi.\"","Qi Mo's gaze tightened, and the corners of his lips slowly curved up an interested smile.","Letting his chin be held up by her, he followed her words:","\"Miss Sheng wants to talk reason?\"","Sheng Mumu was slightly stunned: ......","Sensing the rising pressure in the man's eyes, Sheng Mumu found herself at a loss for words for a moment.","Just now still playfully provoking him, now shrinking back halfway.","She had just wanted to withdraw when Qi Mo single-handedly snapped the finance magazine he had been reading shut and casually threw it to the bedside.","His broad, warm palm instantly pressed against her back, pulling her into his arms. He leaned against the headboard, and Sheng Mumu nearly sprawled on top of him.","The magnetic appeal of the man's voice carried mockery to her ear.","It had a bewitching, spellbinding power.","Enunciating each word:","\"Then let's talk reason.\"","The distance between them suddenly shrank.","Sheng Mumu held her breath and looked at him blankly.","Her hand inadvertently pressed against the man's firm, lean waist.","The feeling was unfamiliar yet solid.","She saw a fleeting anomaly flash through his eyes.","\"As you know, businessmen never take losses.\"","Qi Mo looked straight at her, the shifting light in his pitch-black eyes flickering on and off.","It seemed he was asking for her opinion but every syllable oozed irrepressible dominance.","\"For you to agree to an unequal treaty, what are you planning to offer in exchange?\""]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: I'm not so generous. I have to get something back.","paragraphs":["The palm of the man's hand on her back was scalding hot.","Sheng Mumu was unexpectedly burned by his fiery gaze.","Her cheeks flew red.","She placed her palm against the man's muscular waist and abdomen, trying to widen the distance between them.","But she discovered that the hand behind her back didn’t allow her to move at all.","She attempted to push him away a few times, to no avail.","\"Not being reasonable anymore?\" Qi Mo raised an eyebrow at her.","\"I'm being reasonable,\" Sheng Mumu retorted.","She pinched him in passing.","Payback.","Then she looked up to see his reaction.","However, he didn't seem pained at all. On the contrary, a hint of a smile emerged from the corner of his eyes and mouth. He slowly said,","“Okay, you were saying?”","Sheng Mumu laughed mirthlessly. Recognizing the disparity in strength between men and women, she gave up struggling. Going limp, she leaned on him.","\"Let me think,\" she craned her neck to look at him, pondering how to refute him.","When thinking, she had the habit of tapping her chin with her fingers.","In this position, her fingers couldn’t reach her chin.","So her fingertips lightly tapped the side of the man's waist instead.","The man’s body stiffened, his gaze lowered as he looked at her, patiently waiting for a response.","At the same time enduring the unbearable sensation spreading from his waist.","His long eyelashes were clearly defined. In his eyes lay a stretch of shadows.","The lamp illuminated his excellently handsome face from the side.","Sheng Mumu's eyebrows knitted slightly.","Damn.","Even from this awful angle looking up, this man was still so dashing and good-looking.","Sheng Mumu took a light breath, not letting the man's allure influence her. She organized her logic.","After thinking for a bit, her eyes lit up.","She calmly refuted:","“What you said doesn’t stand.”","“And I wasn’t negotiating with you. I was informing you. I'm also upholding the treaty, so where is it unequal?”","She became increasingly justified, eloquently arguing:","“Besides, even if it were unequal, so what if I bullied you a bit? Not allowed?”","“......” Qi Mo was a little dumbfounded, gazing at her incredulously.","After a long pause, his complexion gradually relaxed.","Revealing a trace of indistinct grievance.","He was persuaded by her unreasonable logic.","What could he do with her?","Even if she openly bullied him, he wouldn’t complain.","Bullying him for a lifetime was also possible.","“Alright,” Qi Mo conceded, but only halfway. “However, I only accept the first article of the treaty. The second and third won’t do.”","This was already the biggest compromise the competitive businessman could accept.","Having her put work before him wasn’t possible.","Sheng Mumu slowly blinked. With an open-minded attitude she responded:","“Well, since you’re being so tolerant and reasonable, I’ll also be tolerant and won’t take too much advantage of you. We’ll keep just the first article.”","Actually, she also hadn't thought of what to propose for the third article.","Right after she finished speaking,","Qi Mo suddenly sat up straight and leaned forward.","Along with him, Sheng Mumu clinging to him also straightened up.","The hand previously pressed to her back shifted to support her.","Before Sheng Mumu could react, her lips softened. He kissed her.","His kiss held traces of retaliation, scorching hot.","His overwhelming aura engulfed her.","One hand steadily supported her back, while the other held the back of her head, completely locking her in his embrace.","He greedily stole her breath away,","The previously composed man forgot what restraint meant.","He seemed to be nibbling and biting her, kissing her deeper and deeper.","At first only focusing on her lips, later he gradually shifted, kissing her neck and collarbone.","His hot breath sprayed onto the nape of her neck. Sheng Mumu couldn’t escape it, nor did she want to that much.","Her palms were slightly sweaty. She couldn’t help but clench the edge of the man’s clothes.","Enduring his sudden possessiveness.","She took a deep breath, smelling his pleasant, clean scent.","Making her even dizzier. Her heart was like it had been thrown into a vacuum chamber, pounding heavily.","Her slender wrists unconsciously clung to his broad shoulders, softly resting upon them.","As if only this way could she find a foothold.","This action seemed to encourage Qi Mo, making it impossible for him to remain aloof.","Suddenly, Sheng Mumu felt the hand at her waist shift.","He slid his hand under her shirt hem.","There was suppressed darkness swirling in the man’s eyes. His breathing grew increasingly scorching.","But because he was nervous, his fingertips were slightly cool.","Sheng Mumu’s body stiffened as if shocked. She grabbed his powerful wrist.","And lightly shook her head.","She wasn’t ready yet for this.","The man stopped moving. He buried his head in the crook of her neck, breathing heavily, slowly settling down.","After a lengthy silence, he propped himself up.","His straight nose touched her nose.","His pitch black eyes were obscurely dark, an insoluble deep color.","His gaze gradually tightened as he moved back some distance.","He lightly pressed her moist, slightly swollen lips with his calloused fingertips.","Giving her time to catch her breath.","At the same time, he hoarsely declared:","“I’m not as tolerant as you said. I must get some benefits in return.”","Sheng Mumu’s eyelashes fluttered slightly, her breathing still not calmed down.","Staring into his piercing eyes made her heart thud loudly.","“What I got today is enough,” the corner of Qi Mo’s mouth slowly curved up, his voice raspy and sexy.","Even at this moment he maintained a gentleman’s demeanor.","Stopping after a taste.","Not crossing the line again.","Sheng Mumu’s cheeks were fiery hot as she looked straight at him.","Her heart had never beat so intensely before.","At this moment, Qi Mo’s self-restraint attracted her more deeply than ever.","She suddenly hooked her hands around his neck, stood on her tiptoes, and lightly pecked the corner of his mouth.","Quickly moving away after.","Smiling charmingly at him.","“I’ll give you a bit more, allowing you to kiss me for a while longer.”","The man’s body stiffened, delightful surprise emerging in his eyes as he leaned down.","Having obtained permission...","He gently and unhurriedly kissed her once more.","When thinking about the “first article” scene, Sheng Mumu’s face reddened.","She shook her head, pulling her thoughts back to the present.","She looked at the message on her phone from Qi Mo: “I regret agreeing to your ‘first article’ treaty.”","Sheng Mumu laughed to herself, muttering:","“You already got the benefits but want to go back on it. Humph, men.”","Just as she finished speaking, her phone rang.","The screen displayed “Husband”.","Qi Mo was calling her.","As expected, she shouldn't have insulted him even just in her thoughts.","Answering the call.","Qi Mo spoke faster than usual. His tone was still calm and composed. His first sentence was:","“It’s not work hours now.”","Sheng Mumu was astonished, glancing at her watch.","She discovered it had just turned five, with the seconds hand moving forward ten seconds.","She instantly understood Qi Mo was explaining he hadn’t violated their “first article” treaty, since he called her after work.","Sheng Mumu couldn’t help bursting into laughter.","Feeling this man was trained more and more adorably by her.","But she only dared say this in her heart, not telling Qi Mo.","She was afraid that if she arrogantly admitted it, who knew who would end up training whom.","“What’s the good news?” Qi Mo asked her.","“Oh, it’s like this—”","Sheng Mumu restrained her smile and answered him.","“—When I sent you the message it was still good news. But now it’s become bad news.”","“Hm?”","“Starting next week, we’ll take turns tutoring Qi Shao Bai.”","“......”","“No need to keep quiet. You’ll still need to tutor even if you’re silent.”"]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: Educating Xiao Qi","paragraphs":["Sheng Mumu said she would come the next week, but she knocked on Qi Shaobai's door that very night.","A burst of messy sounds came from inside the room.","After about a minute, Qi Shaobai came to open the door.","The door was opened halfway.","Qi Shaobai leaned against the door frame with an unruly look on his handsome face. He lazily said,","\"I'm doing worksheets. I don't want to eat anything.\"","Usually when Sheng Mumu knocked on his door, nine out of ten times it was to bring him food, so he reflexively answered as such.","Sheng Mumu's eyes narrowed as she glanced into the room.","Qi Shaobai warily shifted his body a little, as if to block Sheng Mumu's line of sight.","\"You...\" Sheng Mumu saw through him in a second. She held out her palm to Qi Shaobai and sternly said, \"Hand over the stuff before I get angry.\"","Qi Shaobai's pupils abruptly shrank. He pretended not to understand, \"...Huh?\"","Sheng Mumu's brow quirked up. Having caught his micro-expression, she crossed her arms over her chest.","She had an \"Are you still trying to fool me\" look on her face as she smiled at Qi Shaobai.","\"What are you talking about?\" Qi Shaobai said guiltily. In his panic he blurted out, \"I'm building with Lego. What worksheets?\"","As soon as the words left his mouth...","The air froze.","One second.","Two seconds.","Three seconds.","Sheng Mumu: \"...\"","Qi Shaobai's eyes grew wider and wider: \"!!!\"","How did I just expose myself, damn it!","\"Student Qi Shaobai, do you want to listen to what you just said?\"","Sheng Mumu calmly reached out and grabbed Qi Shaobai's hoodie. She pulled him out of the room with one firm yank.","\"Get out here!\"","\"Hey, don't pull--you're choking me--\"","In the midst of it, Qi Shaobai accidentally lost one of his slippers from walking backwards. Seeing Sheng Mumu's strict attitude, he didn't dare pause to pick it up.","Sheng Mumu ignored Qi Shaobai's shouts. She scanned the spacious living room, considering where would be best to drag Qi Shaobai.","Lately the little brat had grown taller. Having to look up to scold him diminished her imposing manner.","After a moment, Sheng Mumu pushed Qi Shaobai down onto the sofa in the adjoining room.","With the choking sensation around his neck gone, he coughed a few times.","\"Cough cough--\"","Sheng Mumu stood opposite him with arms crossed, face stern as she asked:","\"Speak. How many all-nighters have you pulled recently to build Lego?\"","\"None--\"","Qi Shaobai caught sight of Sheng Mumu balling her hands into fists. He gulped and didn't dare lie again.","\"I didn't stay up all night. I did rest.\"","\"You call sleeping during class rest?\" Sheng Mumu looked down at him, her volume not raised but still giving off an intimidating aura.","Qi Shaobai's gaze darted around uneasily. \"No...I slept two or three hours at night too.\"","Just as Sheng Mumu was about to explode with anger--","\"I know I was wrong!\"","Qi Shaobai raised his voice to cut her off and quickly admitted he was wrong.","He looked up at her. His usually unruly, handsome face now held an pitiful expression that Sheng Mumu had never seen him make before.","Qi Shaobai repeated himself: \"I know I was wrong.\"","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips. \"In the future--\"","\"I won't dare do it again!\" Qi Shaobai interrupted.","\"...\" Sheng Mumu was rendered speechless for a moment.","Her two rebukes were blocked.","She didn't know what else to scold him for.","This kid admitted defeat pretty quickly.","Wonder where he learned that.","Seeing Qi Shaobai's good attitude in admitting his mistake, Sheng Mumu's anger dissipated by more than half. But she still confiscated all his Lego and locked them away in the collection room. She would personally keep the key.","After taking care of everything, Sheng Mumu sat down opposite Qi Shaobai.","She heaved a deep sigh, still deciding they needed to properly talk things through.","Sheng Mumu relaxed her posture and patted Qi Shaobai's shoulder, signaling him to stop being so tense too.","\"Student Qi, I accept your apology. But we need to communicate the deeper significance behind what happened today.\"","\"Otherwise my anger today would be pointless, and your apology meaningless too.\"","\"Tell me your thoughts first, say whatever comes to mind.\"","Qi Shaobai hung his head low and reflected sincerely: \"I shouldn't have pulled all-nighters playing with Lego and let it impact my classes--\"","\"No.\" Sheng Mumu suddenly interrupted him.","Qi Shaobai froze and lifted his head to look directly at her.","No?","\"That's not the main issue here.\"","Sheng Mumu pressed her lips. Her gaze turned gentle as she slowly said:","\"Staying up all night does affect grades, but you can make up for lost time by putting in more effort later on.\"","\"If I guess correctly, that was your plan when deciding to pull those all-nighters. Right?\"","As if his thoughts were seen through, Qi Shaobai nodded slowly.","Sheng Mumu entered the crux of the matter:","\"I remember at the beginning of this semester when you packed up all your Lego into the collection room, you made a bold declaration that you 'would not touch them again until the college entrance exam'. Isn't that right?\"","\"Mm.\" Qi Shaobai remembered this incident.","But as time passed, he had gradually forgotten the flag he set back then.","Sheng Mumu said gently: \"Student Qi, more than your grades, I care about you keeping your word.\"","Qi Shaobai didn't grasp her meaning right away.","Sheng Mumu relaxed back into the sofa and handed him a grape soda.","She shared the life lessons she had summarized, in a not overly preachy way:","\"If you make a promise, you should see it through. If you feel unable to do it or sense you won't be able to keep it, best not to make the commitment in the first place.\"","\"When you grow up, there will be many misunderstandings because of careless words and willing ears. People will judge whether you are reliable and trustworthy often based on such details. Understand?\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned into silence for a long while before slowly reaching out to take the soda Sheng Mumu held out to him.","His long eyelashes fluttered. He digested her words.","The teenager who would soon turn eighteen had never in his decade-plus of life been taught such things by anyone.","Hearing them all of a sudden, it was as if that empty space in his heart labeled \"maternal love\" was wrapped up by a pair of warm hands, wisps of comforting warmth trailing through.","Not wanting the atmosphere to become too somber, Sheng Mumu shifted into a more casual sitting position, tucking her legs beneath her on the sofa. She nudged Qi Shaobai's arm with her elbow and asked:","\"By the way, student Qi, what kind of adult do you want to become in the future? I never asked you that before.\"","As soon as she finished speaking...","Qi Shaobai answered almost instantly.","\"Like my dad.\"","This was a question Qi Shaobai had asked himself many times in his heart.","Each time, his dad's silhouette would appear in his mind.","\"Awesome!\"","Sheng Mumu's bright eyes curved into crescents. She lavished praise without restraint:","\"Your dad is super incredibly awesome. With him as your goal, you will also become super incredibly awesome in the future. I believe in you!\"","Sheng Mumu wasn't only making judgments based on her reading of Qi Shaobai's future as a business tycoon and male lead.","After interacting with him for a long time, this was her sincere opinion.","She seized the chance to use Qi Mo's good qualities to educate Qi Shaobai.","Counting off on her fingers, she tallied it for him.","\"Student Qi, look. Firstly, your dad is an extremely reliable person. No matter how small, he remembers every promise he makes and sees them through. You definitely have to learn this from him.\"","Qi Shaobai nodded firmly. \"Mm!\"","Sheng Mumu held up a second finger:","\"Secondly, not only is your dad smart, he's hardworking too. He's earned so much money yet still works every day. If it were someone else, they might have given up long ago. Right?\"","Qi Shaobai, diehard dad fanboy, nodded frequently. \"Right, correct.\"","\"So you should learn this point too.\"","\"Mm.\"","\"Thirdly, he's handsome.\" While listing things off, Sheng Mumu oddly veered the focus.","\"...Uh, wait.\" Qi Shaobai tilted his head, confused. \"Do I have to learn this too? Is it because I'm not good-looking--\"","He didn't get to finish his sentence. Qi Shaobai's gaze abruptly froze in place.","His line of sight fell on a spot not far behind Sheng Mumu. His pupils slowly widened.","He exclaimed in surprise:","\"....Dad?\"","Sheng Mumu whirled around.","She saw Qi Mo's tall figure lazily leaning against the sofa backrest. His black coat was draped loosely over his forearms. His striking brows and eyes held a smiling expression as he watched them.","Sheng Mumu was dumbfounded.","\"When...when did you come back?\"","The corners of Qi Mo's lips threatened to lift. He slowly loosened his tie with one hand. His pitch black eyes narrowed slightly.","\"Let me think--\"","His voice softened at the end, betraying a hint of joy that could not be concealed.","\"It started when you praised me for being serious, dignified and prim and proper.\""]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: There's Something Wrong with Keyes.","paragraphs":["The words fell.","The atmosphere froze for a long time.","At this moment, the three people in the side hall.","Apart from Qi Mo's face being clear and calm, the remaining two felt awkward and suffocated to varying degrees.","Qi Shaobai had one foot wearing slippers and the other bare foot on the floor.","The drawstring hoodie he had just been pulled tight by Sheng Mumu had not had time to tidy up, bunched into a ball wrapping his head.","His face revealed the uncontrollable emotions of being moved + tearful + surprised + smiling + embarrassed all at once.","In a nutshell - his smile was uglier than crying.","What made Qi Shaobai grip his toes the most was that he had just confessed to Sheng Mumu that his struggle goal was his dad, and it had been heard by the goal itself.","For a proud Chinese man who wants to be strong all his life.","This was very f**king awkward.","And Sheng Mumu?","She was only slightly better than Qi Shaobai.","Clearly she was teaching little Qi a second ago, but happened to reveal her true colors as a pretty girl while counting.","It was...very socially dead.","But what is the difference between adults and minors?","Nothing more than thick facial skin.","Sheng Mumu gave Qi Shaobai another lesson in leading by example.","With a female idol group level facial expression management, she smiled at Qi Mo.","Then she patted her thigh lightly, pretending to relax, and stood up.","She turned her head to the still stunned Qi Shaobai and said,","\"I'll go find you some slippers, you just wait here for me, don't move.\"","\"Oh no-\" Qi Shaobai's mind caught up, reacting extremely quickly.","He got up in a hurry, chasing Sheng Mumu’s footsteps.","As one foot was not wearing shoes, he walked with a stagger, looking funny.","He used an exaggerated tone to cover his embarrassment, chasing behind Sheng Mumu chanting:","\"I'll find my own slippers, I'm the one who made the mistake, I don't dare trouble anyone.\"","\"No need, knowing your mistake means you’re still a good kid. Let me help you find them.\"","\"I should still be the one.\"","\"I’ll do it, I’ll do it.\"","\"I’ll do it.\"","Qi Mo's eyes followed the two of them, his chest trembling as he couldn’t hold back his smile.","The huge, luxury villa became incredibly warm because of their chattering voices.","Suddenly, Qi Mo strode towards them.","Taking advantage of his long legs, he reached them in just a few steps.","He asked jokingly:","\"Or should I do it?\"","Sheng Mumu: ......","Qi Shaobai: .........","*","The next day.","Executive Assistant Dong discovered that Chairman Qi was a bit strange.","But he couldn't say what was weird.","At noon, after he had finished sending documents to the CEO's office and was about to leave, he was called back by Chairman Qi.","\"Little Dong, wait a minute.\"","He stopped and respectfully responded:","\"Chairman Qi, do you have any other orders?\"","He saw that Chairman Qi did not immediately speak, but lowered his eyes and pondered for a while.","Then he asked an unexpected strange question that caught him off guard.","\"Little Dong, am I stiff?\"","Executive Assistant Dong was stunned.","CPU computing...","Stiff is a neutral term, right?","What does Chairman Qi mean by asking this?","In less than a few seconds, he cleverly answered:","\"Of course not, Chairman Qi you are calm and composed when dealing with anything, responding appropriately, how could you be sti... stiff...\"","The last few words slowed down as he observed Chairman Qi's expression.","Seeing his boss' stern, grim face sink down little by little, Dong felt shocked.","He felt that he had said the wrong thing, and changed track mid-speech:","\"Being stiff represents your prudence and carefulness, which is essential for corporate leaders—\"","Before he could finish speaking, the handsome man in the leather chair chuckled softly and slowly lifted his eyes to look over.","\"Alright, stop bullsh***ing. Asking you was pointless, you can go out.\"","\"Yes, Chairman Qi.\" Dong felt like he had just been pardoned.","After leaving the CEO's office and closing the door, he leaned against the wall and let out a long sigh of relief.","His face was slowly filled with confusion and chagrin. How strange.","As Chairman Qi's strongest executive assistant, he thought he knew Chairman Qi very well.","But he couldn't even answer such a simple question.","Dong thought to himself: I'm really useless! I've collected my salary for nothing all these years!","This feeling of chagrin continued until the afternoon.","In the afternoon, the manager of the media division of Qi Corporation came to report at the headquarters.","When introducing the artist they planned to vigorously promote recently, the manager said to Chairman Qi:","\"Jackson won the Best Actor award at the Gold Statue Awards last month. We plan to design a long-term development oriented image and persona more suitable for him. Our initial idea for the new persona is - a serious and stern senior official image.\"","The manager talked on and on, envisioning Jackson's future planning.","\"Although this persona is old-fashioned and lacks novelty, Jackson is almost forty years old after all. If he continues to mingle with a bunch of newcomers and keep taking romance and soap opera roles, it will gradually erode his fan appeal and be unsuitable for future development. Therefore—\"","\"Wait a minute.\"","A low voice interrupted the manager's words.","The handsome man who had been silent and lazily listening the whole time suddenly spun his chair around to look over.","He emanated an awe-inspiring aura that sent chills down one's spine.","The manager stiffened as the man's cold gaze made his back run cold.","Not knowing if something he said had displeased Chairman Qi.","That's not right, Chairman Qi usually doesn't care about minor matters in the divisions.","Then why would he get angry?","Before the manager could figure out the implication, he heard an icy voice speak again:","\"You explain to me what the necessary connection is between being 'serious' and being an 'old geezer'.\""]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: 【 Qi Shaobai Family Study Plan 】","paragraphs":["One night.","Qi Shaobai was in his room, head down doing homework, when a cheerful knock sounded at the door.","Opening the door, a piece of paper was held up to his face.","Sheng Mumu peeked her head out from behind the paper, smiling widely:","\"Classmate Qi, this is the supplementary study plan I made for you, take a look.\"","Qi Shaobai tilted his head back to look closely.","At the very top, written in colorful markers in a cute font:","【Qi Shaobai's Home Study Plan】","Qi Shaobai froze for a moment, then continued reading down:","Saturday: Chinese, Math","Sunday: Physics, English","Tutors: Sheng Mumu (Chinese, English); Qi Mo (Math, Physics)","Qi Shaobai reached out to take the paper.","He flipped it over to the back, then flipped it again to the front.","Puzzled, he asked:","\"Uh...were you planning on giving up on my Chemistry and Biology?\"","Before his words faded, Sheng Mumu flicked his forehead.","\"Don't get ahead of yourself, Chemistry and Biology can wait until later. You think your dad and I want to be worked to death?\" Sheng Mumu glared at him.","\"I wouldn't dare,\" Qi Shaobai's eyes flashed as he tilted up his chin slightly.","A smile spread across his cold and aloof face.","After Sheng Mumu finished saying what she needed to, she walked towards the door and threw over her shoulder:","\"Tutoring starts tomorrow, get yourself mentally prepared!\"","As her words fell, the door snapped shut.","Leaving Qi Shaobai alone in confusion.","Mental preparation?","What kind of mental preparation does tutoring require???","It wasn't until Saturday that Qi Shaobai understood what Sheng Mumu had meant as he pushed open the door to his dad's second floor study.","Qi Shaobai looked left, then looked right.","He froze in place, stunned.","He had come to his dad's study a couple times before.","What he saw before him now looked quite different from his impressions.","Recalling Sheng Mumu busily directing the butler Zhang these past couple days to work on the second floor.","Mystery solved.","She had renovated the study for his tutoring sessions.","Sheng Mumu waved her hand towards the left side, and started explaining:","\"The left side is your dad's desk and work area, we won't interfere with that.\"","Then she pointed to the right side.","\"The right side will be your learning heaven for the next month leading up to your final exams.\"","Qi Shaobai took a light breath as he looked over, his voice a little muffled:","\"Heaven?\"","Are you sure it's not hell?","The study was like it had been split into two halves, the left and right sides clearly demarcated by their contrasting styles.","The left side housed his dad's desk and towering bookshelves.","Spotless, with items neatly organized.","The right side.","A whiteboard.","Equipped with a projector screen that could be pulled up and down.","Next to it was a small lectern.","Sitting on the lectern was...a teaching rod.","Across from the whiteboard was a table and chair.","Piled next to the chair were three whole boxes of handouts and test papers.","As Qi Shaobai surveyed the scene, the butler Zhang carried in another box from outside.","But Qi Shaobai no longer had the mindset to be astonished by the sheer number of papers.","His attention was completely captured by the motivational posters for the college entrance exams that Sheng Mumu had custom-made for him, plastered on the right wall.","【Little Qi Little Qi, may your banner emerge victorious(*^▽^*)】","【It's okay to be lazy sometimes, but don't turn into a complete failure!】","【Great ambition, no right to stop】","【Fall behind, get a beating - I'm not joking】","【I\"mwatchingyou(。???。)】","\"...Qi Shaobai slowly turned his head towards Sheng Mumu, expression complicated.","Sheng Mumu looked back at him proudly.","Hands on her hips, extremely pleased with herself as she asked:","\"Well, doesn't it look impressively legit?\"","The corners of Qi Shaobai's lips tightened as he took a deep breath.","\"Yeah, great. Gives me the feeling that if I can't answer a question I'm about to get electroshocked.\"","Sheng Mumu's smile froze as her eyes narrowed.","She threatened in a severe tone:","\"If you say one more word, it might not end up being just a feeling.\"","\"!!!\" Qi Shaobai promptly shut his mouth.","Sheng Mumu strode over to the lectern.","Glancing at her watch, she solemnly announced:","\"It's time, class is starting, come take a seat.\"","Qi Shaobai slowly walked over and pulled out the chair to sit down.","Single-handedly propping up his cheek, he started twirling a pen in his other hand.","As soon as his rear hit the seat he immediately slipped into his lazy classroom mode.","Seeing this, Sheng Mumu placed a sheet in front of Qi Shaobai with three reading comprehension questions printed on it.","\"Knock knock-\"","She rapped her knuckles against the tabletop.","Reminding Qi Shaobai:","\"Today we'll start off targeting your weak points and focus on reading comprehension.\"","\"I'm saying this right off the bat - once class starts, no mother-son relationship. You little punk better behave yourself.\"","\"If I catch you spacing out or napping-\"","As Sheng Mumu spoke she picked up the expandable teaching rod and pulled it taut.","Revealing a wicked grin, she didn't finish her sentence.","Qi Shaobai's pupils widened.","Sensing impending danger, his back straightened in an instant.","Snapping to full alertness.","For the entire 90 minute class period, he was given a 10 minute bathroom break in the middle.","For the first 45 minutes Sheng Mumu still felt a little unsure whether she would be able to properly teach the high school Chinese curriculum content.","But as she continued lecturing, memories of when she used to study diligently and scored 700 on the college entrance exam were awakened.","She grew increasingly at ease.","She even recalled some of the tricks she had realized herself while preparing for the exam, and passed them onto Qi Shaobai.","When there were 5 minutes left of the Chinese tutoring session, the study door was suddenly pushed open.","A long pale male hand braced against the doorframe. Qi Mo walked into the room.","He wore house slippers, his steps almost soundless against the floor.","Sheng Mumu and Qi Shaobai were fully absorbed, one in teaching and the other in listening, and didn't notice the extra presence that had entered the study.","Qi Mo silently took a seat next to the desk on the left side, casually crossing his long legs.","Since it was the weekend he didn't have to dress formally in a suit.","But considering Sheng Mumu had arranged for him to teach Qi Shaobai math afterwards, before coming over from the bedroom he had deliberately changed into a nice shirt and trousers.","The well-fitted shirt accentuated the muscular lines of the man's arms.","His collar left unbuttoned, exposing a sliver of fair skin.","Sleeves rolled up to reveal sturdy, graceful wrists.","Palms casually draped over his knees.","He exuded composure and nobility with a hint of lazy elegance.","His gaze was fixed on Sheng Mumu.","Suddenly, his eyes flickered.","Surprised to discover her mindset surprisingly aligned with his own today.","Normally on weekends at home she dressed very casually.","Yet today, she exceptionally wore formal attire.","Sheng Mumu had a slender waist, even in the relatively loose white collared shirt and midi skirt that faintly outlined her perfect figure, graceful and charming.","Her bright eyes brimmed with liveliness, captivating.","Her hair neatly tied up, swaying lightly with her movements.","Fluttering into the man's heart.","Time was up.","Sheng Mumu dismissed class on time. As she tidied up the papers she said:","\"Alright, that concludes the Chinese lesson. Your dad will teach you math in 30 minutes.\"","Qi Shaobai pushed back his chair and stretched lazily, rotating his neck.","He suddenly stopped short when he noticed the person not far away.","In the middle of a yawn, eyes still wet, he uttered oddly:","\"Dad?\"","Sheng Mumu looked over towards the sound, also surprised:","\"When did you come in?\"","This man, why does he keep appearing and disappearing without a sound lately, like a ghost?","Qi Mo didn't answer Sheng Mumu. Instead he glanced at Qi Shaobai and instructed deeply:","\"You go out first.\"","Qi Shaobai's eyes widened in puzzlement. ???","Before he could react, he heard his dad give a reasonable explanation.","\"I need to prepare for class.\""]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: Sheng Mu Mu: \"You are becoming more and more like a gentle scum\"","paragraphs":["After Qi Shaobai left the study, Sheng Mumu walked to Qi Mo's side with a smile, teasing:","\"Mr. Qi, I didn't hear wrong, did I? You're going to prepare a lesson plan?\"","Last night before bed, Sheng Mumu had chewed through a few hours of teaching aids, while Qi Mo hadn't looked at them for even a second.","When Sheng Mumu asked him with concern, \"Aren't you going to get ready?\"","He said, \"No need.\"","Sheng Mumu had an expression on her face that said \"I see you're trying to act tough, but now you know you're panicking, don't you\" and kindly reminded:","\"There are only thirty more minutes, hurry up and look through the books. Right now for high school math--\" Ah--","She hadn't even finished speaking when her entire body was suddenly lifted into the air.","Qi Mo put his arm around her waist and picked her up.","Losing her balance all of a sudden, she reflexively put her hands on his shoulders, gripping his shirt tightly.","Because of the pulling, his shirt collar was opened up a little.","His exquisite collarbone appeared before her.","The next second, she was being carried by him and put on top of the desk.","The solid wood desk was very big, and the desktop was hard and slightly cool, the feeling coming through her clothes.","\"What are you doing?\" Sheng Mumu looked up at him, not knowing what to do.","Abruptly colliding with the pitch black, murky depths of the man's eyes.","He leaned down to her eye level.","The man's broad silhouette enveloped her slender figure.","A clean and sharp scent tinged with male pheromones wafted over.","Sheng Mumu's heart thudded.","Qi Mo didn't answer her words. His beguiling eyes slowly looked down, falling on her rosy lips, stopping there.","Using his gaze to answer her question.","He wanted to kiss her.","His warm palm clasped her slender waist, tightening by degrees.","Also giving her time to react.","Sheng Mumu braced one arm behind her on the tabletop, leaning back to widen the gap between them. Her eyes, shimmering with water, looked back at him.","She understood his meaning and glanced worriedly at the door, her heartbeat quickening.","The door was shut tight.","She knew that after Qi Mo had Qi Shaobai leave, Qi Shaobai wouldn't rashly burst in again. The housekeepers and servants wouldn't come into Qi Mo's study either.","But even if no one would come in, Sheng Mumu still felt a lingering fear that someone might walk in on them at any moment.","She pressed her lips together, gaze dodging around as she looked for some topic to divert Qi Mo's attention and not mess around with him.","Just saying something randomly to change the subject would do.","What should she say?","Sheng Mumu blinked. Facing the handsome visage right before her eyes, she suddenly opened her mouth:","\"You look quite dashing today.\"","Qi Mo's eyes narrowed slightly, a smile emerging from the depths as the corner of his lips curved up almost imperceptibly.","Still he gave no reply, using action to speak instead.","His palm clasped her even tighter.","Sheng Mumu felt like her waist was about to be crushed by his hand.","She hurried to think of another topic.","But the man before her, delighted by her words, no longer gave her a chance to speak.","Taking more liberties, he moved closer, leaning down to kiss her.","Her breath was replaced in an instant by his.","Sheng Mumu's eyes suddenly went wide as she stared worriedly at the study door.","Her heart pounded rapidly.","One arm braced behind her, the other hand pushing against him.","The man's chest was sturdy and completely immovable. Instead, his kiss only grew deeper.","Sheng Mumu's face burned.","This wasn't their first kiss.","But it was the first time kissing in the study.","This place was too weird!","Next to them were the tidy bookshelves, pen holder, fountain pens, ink bottles.","Those things had cold attributes.","But now, the temperature between the two people was scorching hot.","As they breathed each other in, the air was searing.","As if it could burn those cold items.","Sheng Mumu panted for air. Even immersed in his kisses that alternated between gentle and passionate, she still didn't dare let down her guard toward the door.","Glancing that way from time to time.","Worried that someone might suddenly burst in.","She was even thinking about what excuses she should make.","She definitely couldn't say they were exchanging academic ideas.","Compared to the mess in her mind, her body was honest. She unconsciously put her arms around his neck, responding to his kiss.","Qi Mo's palm supported her back while his other hand had at some point come to the back of her head.","Long, slender fingers lightly flicked up her hair tie.","Her long black hair instantly came loose, hanging loosely down her back.","He circled her waist, lingeringly leaving her lips.","Nose to nose, their heated breaths washed over her cheek, and Sheng Mumu's skin tingled and went numb.","Her lips were red and slightly swollen, glinting dots of moisture.","The aggressiveness in the man's gaze grew stronger and stronger.","She couldn't guess why he had undone her hair tie.","Suddenly--","The man's palm moved, his knuckles disappearing amid her black, lush hair.","Slowly separating the strands, cradling her head.","The next second, an even more overbearing, irresistible kiss sealed over her lips.","Sheng Mumu's heart quivered.","She could feel the subtle caressing sensation coming from her scalp behind her head.","Her heart surged with ripples.","Did he really like her hair that much?","What a strange...preference.","\"Don't get distracted.\"","Abruptly, the man's magnetic, husky voice came out almost murmuringly.","The low, rich vocal tones drilled into her eardrum along her cheek, and her whole body went soft.","She heard him continue:","\"There are only thirty minutes left.\"","He could only keep kissing her for thirty more minutes.","Sheng Mumu's earlobes grew even hotter.","Burning unbearably.","She felt as if her whole body had turned into water, about to evaporate from the heat at any moment.","Her neck arched back, the smooth lines of her fair neck displayed as her snow-white hands clung tightly to the man's broad shoulders.","As if only this way could she avoid melting away completely.","Sensing her change, Qi Mo's heart pounded heavily against his chest.","No longer aggressively kissing her.","Gently removing his lips.","Steadily and strongly holding her, then slowly, tenderly placing his kisses.","On her elegant brow, the corners of her eyes.","Bit by bit.","On the tip of her nose, the corners of her mouth, her earlobe.","Thirty minutes later, Qi Shaobai knocked on the study door and entered.","Sheng Mumu walked past him, face flushed red to her ears.","Qi Shaobai was about to ask why she was still here. His gaze happened to sweep over and see his father sitting upright and proper beside the desk, the corners of his eyes and mouth containing a smugness that Qi Shaobai couldn't comprehend.","The math tutoring session began.","Qi Mo assigned Qi Shaobai a few problems first for him to work on, and said he would go over them with Qi Shaobai afterward.","Qi Shaobai displayed an extremely well-behaved attitude completely unlike when he was in his language arts class.","Obediently and cleverly, he immediately responded:","\"Okay, Dad, you go take care of your things first. I'll work on this and call you when I'm done.\"","Then he lowered his head and earnestly worked on the math problems.","Qi Mo made a satisfied \"Mm\" sound and paced to the French windows.","His gaze wandered as he reminisced about something.","Suddenly, his cell phone vibrated in his pocket.","He took out his phone and glanced down with it dangling in his hand.","A gleam of light flashed through the pitch black depths of his eyes like ink.","Sheng Mumu: \"Anger.jpg\"","Sheng Mumu: \"Who prepares a lesson like that? Hm?\"","Sheng Mumu: \"You're becoming more and more of a hypocrite. [Humph.jpg]\""]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: Sheng Mu Mu: \"This is called... preparing... preparing lessons\"","paragraphs":["A few days ago, the man who would get tangled up over the terms \"solemn\" and \"strict\" now looked like a different person.","Head bowed slightly, long lashes lowering, he stared at his phone screen for a long time.","Faced with the clearly derogatory words \"hypocritical lecher\", he didn't get annoyed at all.","On the contrary, the corners of his lips curved up slightly, and his brow tips lifted, very smug.","Sunlight slanted through the floor-to-ceiling windows into the study.","Bathing his handsome profile in a layer of golden yellow.","It was as if his heart was also caressed by the sunlight.","Warm and soft all over.","After a while, the man's slender and bony hand finally moved.","He gently tapped to reply, shamelessly acting dumb.","Qi Mo: \"Then next time teach me how you prepare your lessons.\"","The message was sent.","Without waiting for a reply, he sent another one.","Responding to Sheng Mumu's evaluation of him as \"hypocritical lecher\".","Qi Mo: \"Like?\"","On the second floor on the other side.","Sheng Mumu went straight from the study into the master bedroom's bathroom.","Facing the mirror, she tidied up her rumpled clothes around her waist.","Her eyes suddenly froze.","She was shocked to discover two red marks on her clavicle.","Sheng Mumu: !!!","The scene of the two in the study just now suddenly flashed through her mind——","It started out as just kissing.","The man's head gradually buried into her neck.","Suddenly, the hand clasped around her waist rubbed a few times.","He lifted her up again.","Their breathing intertwined, heat rising steadily.","Then hugging her, he kissed her all the way from the desk to the sofa.","By the time she realized it, she was already calmly placed on the sofa.","Her heart raced like a drum.","Her thoughts were completely occupied by the man leaning down towards her.","Her throat tightened.","A sentence was forcibly split into three sections before she said it all:","\"Is this...preparing...lessons?\"","The man seemed oblivious, and didn't say a word.","As if her whispering voice had plucked his heartstrings.","Suddenly one arm braced up, directly facing her.","Sheng Mumu's long lashes quivered as she looked back.","Desire stained the man's deep and dark pupils.","Making them murky, seductive.","She could clearly feel the hand clasping her waist, sending heat through her clothes.","Hotter and hotter, burning unbearably.","She is an adult.","The natural development of intimacy between men and women did not overtly repulse her.","She also knew.","That now, here.","Nothing would really happen between them.","But even knowing all that.","She still shyly averted her eyes.","Too embarrassed to continue facing the man's intent gaze.","She could dodge the line of sight, but not the suffocating manly aura enveloping her.","His face got closer and closer, leaning down.","Something soft brushed her lips.","Causing her heart to tremble uncontrollably.","Two patches of red deepened on her fair face.","In a daze, the hand placed on her waist rubbed unintentionally.","Sheng Mumu's heart thumped extremely fast as she closed her eyes.","Tacitly permitting the man's hand slowly trailing down.","Recalling it all now.","Sheng Mumu's face was overwhelmed with heat waves.","In the mirror, her face was as red as could be.","She frowned staring at the red marks on her collarbone for a few seconds.","Inwardly scolding to herself:","Shouldn't have called this man an old fox.","He clearly belongs to the dog category!","She cupped some water to wash her face, cooling down her cheeks a little.","Only having sobered up a bit by the cold water, upon seeing Qi Mo's reply on the screen her face flushed again ——","Qi Mo: \"Like?\"","Sheng Mumu had red ears, brows knitted slightly: ???","Hey no...","Why didn't I realize earlier this man is so subtly flirtatious?!","Not only did he not think \"hypocritical lecher\" was an insult, he even seems very proud?","Sheng Mumu didn't have time to wipe the water droplets from her hands.","Pursed her lips tightly, fingers sliding across the screen.","Searching in her Favorites folder for a suitable reaction gif to respond with.","Buzz buzz——","The man standing by the window felt his palm buzz, lowering his eyes to look at the screen.","Sheng Mumu: \"You're so flirtatious gif (Hong Shi Xian version)\"","The man froze for half a second.","A wisp of sly smiling meaning imperceptibly unfurled in his ink-colored pupils.","*","In stark contrast to Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu utilizing \"lesson preparation\" time to date——was Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li.","Their age was barely younger than Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu's.","Yet when it came to romance, they were extremely similar to contemporary college students.","Their focus was announcing it to the world, with all kinds of tricks.","Just randomly browse either one's Moments.","And you could follow their relationship progression as if watching a drama.","Entering hungry but leaving with a mouthful of dog food, burping all the way.","As Qiao Li's maternal aunt, Feng Yaoqin deeply appreciated the young couple distributing sugar.","And took on the role of dog food follower team captain in the family group chat.","As always, her opening remarks carried strong personal characteristics.","【Group Assembly, Radish Meeting (6)】","——【Feng Yaoqin:[Pray] Greetings as light as a feather, care as deep as the ocean[Heart], the feelings between loved ones touches the soul.[Coffee cup][Flowers]】","——【Feng Yaoqin:@Qiao Li, Li Li, auntie wishes your love goes smoothly, be happy every day[Flowers], share more sweetness with us[Smile][Smile][Smile]】","The elderly lady in Germany seeing the messages stirred up trouble in the group chat.","After sending a few thumbs up emojis, she also sent a voice message. Expressing her greatest joy at seeing the younger generations pairing up.","At that time, Qiao Li happened to be with Cheng Zhuo.","They had just finished playing badminton, sitting by the court resting.","Qiao Li pulled Cheng Zhuo over, and casually took a selfie of their heads leaning against each other, both red-faced and drenched in sweat.","He posted it in the group chat.","——【Qiao Li:[Picture]】","——【Qiao Li: Hehe, since you guys love seeing, then I'll post every day.】","Very quickly pop-up replies came below.","——【Feng Yaoqin:[Clap][Clap][Clap]】","——【Feng Yaoqin: Great job exercising, more exercise retains youthful vigor[Sun]】","The elderly lady held her phone further away, squinting to take a look.","A smile spread on her kind face.","But suddenly seeming to remember something, her eyes slowly lit up.","Her index finger slid on the screen.","She hand wrote her reply:","——【Little Dot's Grandma: Big Dot, Mumu, how come I haven't seen you two go out dating? 】","——【Little Dot's Grandma: Even after getting married, you should still go out more often, don't stay cooped up at home all day. 】","——【Little Dot's Grandma: Bring Little Dot along too, he doesn't like basking in the sun, needs more sun.】","The young man named Qi Shaobai grasped his pen, his hand pausing as he glanced towards the phone screen popping up a prompt.","He had set a special reminder for grandma.","As long as grandma made a peep in the group, he'd definitely see it first thing.","His originally cool and aloof brows instantly softened, sweeping away all vexation over not solving math problems.","Qi Shaobai lifted his head to sneak a peek at his dad's back by the floor-to-ceiling windows.","Pursed his lips, deciding not to be the electric light bulb for dad and little stepmom.","He replied:","——【Qi Shaobai: Grandma, in a couple days I'm going out with classmates to play basketball, will definitely get enough sun.】","Nearly at the same time.","Qi Mo also responded to the old lady's words in the group chat. Replying succinctly:","——【Qi Mo: Mm.】","The message was sent, and somehow, as if by prior agreement, everyone minded their own business for quite a while, with no one following up the conversation.","What a coincidence.","After Sheng Mumu washed her face again and came out from the bathroom.","There were still beads of water clinging to her lashes.","Her vision was blurry, so she used the back of her hand to rub her eyes.","Then randomly clicked open her phone.","As soon as WeChat opened, she saw Qi Mo's \"Mm.\"","She didn't participate in the group chat, completely unaware it was the group conversation window.","Thinking it was Qi Mo's private chat reply to her message.","Her brow quirked up as her fingers rapidly tapped the screen.","Replying in the family group chat:","——【Sheng Mumu: You say \"Mm\" when I call you flirtatious??? My neck was nearly bitten through by you, do you belong to the dog category?!】"]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: \"Ginger or Old Hot Mo\"","paragraphs":["After sending the message, Sheng Mumu casually threw her phone into the mattress.","She went to the cloak room to rummage around, trying to find a set of casual home clothes with a tight collar to change into.","To cover up the marks on her neck.","She was just changing clothes.","Vaguely, she heard her phone vibrating.","Buzz Buzz Buzz","Buzzing nonstop...","On the other side.","Study room.","Qi Mo looked at his phone screen.","His lips tightened for a moment, his eyes flashed.","\"Snap!\"","It was the sound of Qi Shaobai's fountain pen falling to the ground.","Qi Mo turned his head.","Right on target, he met Qi Shaobai's embarrassed yet nervous gaze.","Qi Shaobai: ......","Qi Mo: ......","Silence echoed between the two.","The atmosphere in the quiet study froze for a moment.","\"Ahhhhhhh——!\"","Suddenly, a shriek broke the silence.","Sheng Mumu's screams pierced the air.","Despite two doors between them, the decibels were still ear-piercing.","Realizing she had sent the wrong message, Sheng Mumu's first reaction was to avoid reality.","Screaming, she threw her phone away and stared with wide eyes.","Then her toes curled up as she made a constipated expression.","Next she took a deep breath, with the look of someone ready to face death, and picked up her phone again.","Her fingers trembled as she mechanically and stiffly scrolled up.","To see everyone's reactions.","In just a few minutes.","There were already many new messages in the group.","Ever since being exposed by her aunt, Qiao Li dropped her good girl act.","She became more and more uninhibited with her words.","——【Qiao Li: Sister-in-law, what indecent words are you saying!!!!】","——【Qiao Li: Explain the bite marks in detail (whispers)】","——【Feng Yaoqin: [Shocked][Shocked][Shocked]】","——【Feng Yaoqin: Cough cough!】","——【Feng Yaoqin: @Qi Mo @Sheng Mumu, you two still need to pay attention to the occasion, Shaobai is still a child, you must withdraw the message immediately. [Angry]】","——【Qiao Li: Looks like the withdraw time has passed?】","——【Qiao Li: @Sheng Mumu @Sheng Mumu @Sheng Mumu, hurry sister-in-law! See if you can still withdraw it?】","——【Qi Shaobai: Looks around nervouslyjpg】","——【Feng Yaoqin: ......】","——【Qiao Li: ......】","——【Qi Shaobai: Pretends not here.jpg】","——【Qi Shaobai: Sprays amnesia spray into group.jpg】","——【Qiao Li: Qi Shaobai where do you get all these weird emoji packs?】","——【Qi Shaobai: Sprays hallucinogenic spray into group.jpg】","——【Qiao Li: Hahahahaha, today's happiness is given by the radish group.】","Qi Shaobai had already seen it, so Qiao Li tried to casually chat and divert the topic to help her absent cousin and his wife save face.","She suddenly remembered the dating topic grandmother had mentioned in the group before.","She secretly ***changed the topic:","——【Qiao Li: Oh right, cousin and cousin's wife, let's go out and play together in a few days?】","——【Qiao Li: Recently there are many popular camping grounds around the suburbs of Beijing, you can feed animals, you can fish, if you don't want outdoor activities, the four of us can also play mahjong together.】","——【Qi Shaobai: Pops head out.jpg】","——【Qi Shaobai: Sounds interesting.jpg】","——【Qiao Li: Go away, high schooler stay at home and study properly.】","——【Qi Shaobai: (The other party withdrew a message and threw out a bomb)】","On the other far side of the earth.","Grandma felt she couldn't keep up with the chatting pace of the young people.","So many messages popped up all of a sudden.","It was so tiring to scroll all the way to the top.","Seeing the first unread message, Sheng Mumu's post.","At first grandma didn't react to the meaning, only catching a few key words.","A confused look appeared on her wrinkled face. Frowning, she earnestly replied:","——【Qi's Grandma: The big one doesn't belong to a dog, I remember he's a horse?】","After the message was sent, grandma thought about it for a while.","Then nodded decisively.","She specially @ her daughter-in-law.","——【Qi's Grandma: @Sheng Mumu, Mumu, the big one is a horse, not a dog, you little confused one, remembered wrongly.】","Sheng Mumu: ......","She really wanted to die on the spot.","Or sprint at 100 meter speed to the greenhouse downstairs.","Stick her head in the soil, grab some dirt, and bury herself.","Hopefully next spring she could grow into a completely new self, without this socially dead memory.","\"Knock knock knock—\"","The bedroom door was suddenly knocked.","Housekeeper Zhang had heard Sheng Mumu's screams.","He stood outside asking loudly:","\"Madam, what's the matter? Do you need help?\"","Sheng Mumu said with difficulty: \"No need.\"","Worried, Housekeeper Zhang asked a few more sentences, quietly listening to the movement inside the door.","What responded was an increasingly plaintive: \"No need, let me be alone.\"","After a long while, Sheng Mumu finally braced herself and considered how to remedy the situation.","Just as she thought of something and slowly typed to reply.","Suddenly, a new message popped up in the group chat.","She froze, body stiffening.","Eyes slowly widening.","On the screen.","Qi Mo singled out the socially dead message she sent, emphasizing it by quoting it again.","And targeted reply:","【Qi Mo: Wife, did you send it to the wrong place?】","Sheng Mumu's head buzzed: ............","The deer in her heart was about to leap out, cursing:","Damn!","No shit!!!!","Isn't it obvious to anyone with eyes??","Why do you need to repeat it!!!???","Everyone already talked about it one round, do you want to restart the topic again!","Jerk!","Old jerk!!!","On the study side.","Seeing the silhouette by the floor-to-ceiling window move, Qi Shaobai immediately put away his phone.","Switching modes in a second.","As if nothing had happened, he casually leaned his head on one hand, frowning as he looked at the math test paper in front of him.","Although he had already chimed in on the group chat just now, dad must know he was playing on his phone.","But getting caught red-handed would still be a bit awkward.","So.","Little Qi, who really can't lie, started to show off amateur acting skills to Grand Master Qi Mo·Silent.","His youthful face took on a look of deep thought.","Long fingers fiddled with his pen as his head didn't dare tilt at all.","His gaze locked onto the last difficult problem on the test that had been bothering him for a long time.","With a frown, he mumbled:","\"Hiss—which method should I use?\"","\"Tsk, this question can be answered in at least three ways.\"","\"Let me think about it some more.\"","The tall figure by the floor-to-ceiling window slowly walked over.","His footsteps were steady, his presence strong.","The light and shadows on the test paper shifted.","Covered by the shadow, it darkened a layer.","The next second, a cold yet powerful hand appeared before Qi Shaobai's eyes.","The fingers slightly bent, tapping the table twice.","Tapping Qi Shaobai's body stiff.","The cold and sharp voice sounded from above his head.","\"Three methods, don't know which one to use right?\"","\"Then use all of them.\""]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: Qi Shaoqiang Invincible","paragraphs":["Intensive tutoring lasted for three weeks.","Although there were some setbacks (mainly referring to Qi Shaobai's setbacks), overall it went smoothly.","The final results were reflected in the last exam before the winter vacation.","This final exam was a city-wide standardized test.","Over forty thousand senior high school students in Beijing were ranked together.","On the day when the scores were released,","the entire senior year building was bustling with excitement.","The students shed their tiredness from the previous days.","Just the thought of the long-awaited winter vacation starting from today made them elated.","Although they were physically present in school, their hearts had already flown far beyond.","In the middle of the building, inside the offices,","the homeroom teachers seemed to have made an appointment and walked out at the same time.","With a teacup in their left hand and a stack of score sheets in their right hand,","they slowly made their way to their respective classrooms.","Inside the classroom with the sign \"Grade 12 Class 4,\" there was a lively atmosphere.","A few girls in the front row gathered together, discussing how to spend the winter vacation.","A girl with a ponytail announced cheerfully,","\"I've already packed my luggage. Tomorrow morning, I'll go to the airport and play until the Chinese New Year. Let's go, go, go~\"","The girl sitting next to her with long hair showed an incredulous expression and responded,","\"I admire your energy, but that's not for me. I have to spend a week at home first, regain my vitality, catch up on my anime, read novels, and eat all sorts of junk food. I won't go out no matter who calls me.\"","\"Ah, it's finally the time to rest, and you want to go out and have fun. Is that still called resting?\" the girl with the ponytail exclaimed.","\"Resting means not going out!\" another person interrupted their argument.","\"Stop! You're one 'i' person and one 'e' person, you're not going to agree,\" the person said, and everyone burst into laughter.","In the corridor behind the classroom's back door,","a few boys were fooling around.","You kick me, I kick you.","Both of them ended up hurting but had silly smiles on their faces.","With indignation, they shouted and prepared to retaliate.","Suddenly, the head of the homeroom teacher appeared outside the window of the back door, glaring inside with a stern face.","The boys were startled and immediately retracted their legs that were halfway through a kick.","One boy reacted slowly and didn't have time to retract his leg, so he slid out and stumbled, grabbing his cramped thigh in pain as he fell into a chair.","In the back row, by the window seat,","Qi Shaobai had his head buried on the desk, resting with his eyes closed.","His hair was messy, with a few strands sticking up like silly antennae.","Suddenly, a gust of wind blew in.","The cold wind made the curtains billow and then slowly settle.","The raised corner of the curtain brushed against Qi Shaobai's head.","The young man shivered and slowly lifted his head.","With laziness, he opened his eyes.","His handsome facial features were not at all affected by his hairstyle but instead added a touch of unruly handsomeness.","After a moment of hesitation, Qi Shaobai furrowed his brows.","He stretched his leg and kicked the chair in front of him.","With a cold and impatient tone, he said,","\"Damn it, can't you close the window? You're freezing your old man to death.\"","Wei Zhaonan, who was playing with his phone, turned his head at the words.","He reached out and closed the window.","Almost instinctively, he replied,","\"Dad forgot.\"","Qi Shaobai shot him a sharp glance.","Just as he was about to speak again, the homeroom teacher appeared at the podium, clearing his throat...","\"Cough cough—\"","Within a few seconds, everyone returned to their seats.","The homeroom teacher placed the score sheets on the podium and spoke up,","\"The final exam scores are out.\"","\"This time, our class has achieved overall good results, allowing most students to enjoy a peaceful holiday and relax a bit.\"","\"But...\"","The class teacher paused and glanced towards the back row by the window.","With a slightly stern tone:","\"...there are a few students who are extremely unaware!\"","\"After the school canceled evening self-study, it seems they haven't even touched a book at home.\"","As the words fell,","Everyone's gaze followed the direction pointed out by the class teacher.","In the center of their attention, Qi Shaobai's eyes dimmed imperceptibly.","\"Qi Shaobai,\" the class teacher suddenly spoke up.","Qi Shaobai raised an eyebrow and looked over.","His heart tightened suddenly.","Although he appeared indifferent on the surface, with a nonchalant expression on his face,","Internally, he was nervous to death.","His palm, hidden under the desk, clenched silently.","Could it be that the class teacher was referring to him with those words just now?","It seemed like it...","At this thought, a hint of desolation flickered in the young boy's eyes.","His father and stepmother personally tutored him, but not only did he fail to improve, he was even called out for criticism.","He felt ashamed to face them.","During his melancholic moment, the class teacher suddenly changed the direction of the conversation:","\"You did well on this exam...\"","Qi Shaobai's eyes froze: \"!!!!\"","The class teacher smiled at him.","Then, she took out a report card and handed it to him, nodding approvingly:","\"Qi Shaobai, you've made the most progress in the class.\"","\"Special commendation.\"","\"Wow!\"","As the class teacher's voice fell, a wave of commotion swept through the classroom.","The development of this plot caught everyone off guard, leaving them astonished.","Qi Shaobai was actually praised by the class teacher?","You see, previously, whenever Qi Shaobai was called out, it was only for criticism.","Did he suddenly turn things around?","Qi Shaobai had his day too?","Impressive.","Amidst the surprised gazes of everyone, Qi Shaobai pushed his chair back and walked through the aisle to the teacher's podium, where he received his report card.","His chin was slightly raised, still displaying an unruly demeanor.","But there was no trace of his former arrogance in the corners of his eyes and eyebrows.","Only a faint sense of pride could be discerned.","Just as he reached out to grab the report card, the paper suddenly tightened.","The class teacher held the other end, looking him straight in the eye:","\"Keep up the good work, don't get complacent, maintain this momentum in the next semester.\"","\"Sure,\" Qi Shaobai's lips curled up slightly, responding.","\"Amazing!\" Suddenly, a loud voice rang out.","Wei Zhaonan cupped his hands around his mouth, mimicking a megaphone.","He stood up and cheered:","\"Qi Shaobai is awesome!\"","\"Qi Shaobai is invincible!\"","The class teacher's mouth twitched, releasing her grip on the report card.","She fished out a short piece from the chalk box.","With a flick, she threw it.","\"Qi Shaobai is awesome... uh... ah!\" Wei Zhaonan's shouting abruptly stopped.","He covered his forehead, which had been accurately struck by the chalk.","The expression on his face was one of pain.","The class teacher: \"Wei Zhaonan, do you still have the audacity to cheer? Can't you tell that when I said 'certain students,' I was referring to you?\"","Wei Zhaonan: \"???\"","The class teacher: \"Was my expression not clear enough?\"","Wei Zhaonan: \"...\"","The whole class burst into laughter.","That evening,","As soon as school ended, Qi Shaobai picked up his backpack and headed out.","He declined Wei Zhaonan's invitation to \"celebrate a bit.\"","He just wanted to get home quickly.","To share the good news with his father and stepmother.","They would surely be very happy to hear it.","Qi Shaobai couldn't help but quicken his pace as he speculated about their reaction upon learning about his results.","As the school day came to an end, the playground was bathed in the warm orange glow of the setting sun.","Melodious music wafted through the air from the speakers.","The corridors of the teaching building buzzed with a lively and relaxed atmosphere.","A slender and upright figure of a young boy, carrying his bag on one shoulder, dashed past like the wind.","The crisp wintry air was suddenly swept away by this joyful figure.","Qi Shaobai's stray bangs lightly brushed against his forehead, tracing an arc of unrestrained freedom in the air.","Bold and vibrant.","Impatiently waiting."]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: Celebration","paragraphs":["The sound of the stream brought delight to the courtyard.","As soon as Qi Shaobai stepped through the door, he heard a resentful voice:","\"What's going on, brother-in-law? You're causing trouble again?\"","After listening more closely, he determined that the voice belonged to his only uncle - Cheng Zhuo.","Qiao Li's voice followed:","\"Cousin, is this really your first time playing mahjong? How come you're winning every hand?\"","Accompanying the shuffling sound of the mahjong machine, Qi Shaobai curiously walked out of the foyer.","Glancing in, he was stunned.","Qi Shaobai: ???","In the spacious living room, there was inexplicably an automatic mahjong table.","Sheng Mumu, Qiao Li, and Cheng Zhuo were taking money out of the tile sets and handing it to...his dad???","Not far from the mahjong table was a pile of camping gear scattered on the ground.","Zhang Housekeeper, who was standing by watching the game, was the first to notice Qi Shaobai's arrival. His eyes lit up and he warmly came over to greet him:","\"Young Master has returned.\"","Hearing this, the four at the mahjong table turned to look.","Sheng Mumu smiled brightly and waved her hand: \"Little Qi classmate is back?\"","Qi Shaobai rubbed the back of his head in confusion: \"What are you guys doing...?\"","\"As you can see, we're playing mahjong,\" Qiao Li said somewhat resentfully. \"My wallet is almost empty.\"","Cheng Zhuo spread his hands to explain things to Qi Shaobai:","\"We originally planned to go camping today, but we suddenly received some good news and changed our plans, so we're not going anymore.\"","Sheng Mumu took some of the little money left in the tile set, stood up, and started to say:","\"Little Qi classmate, you came back at just the right time—\"","Before she could finish speaking, her wrist was caught in a warm, large hand, stopping her words.","Qi Mo opened his own tile set and handed Sheng Mumu his share of money. It was a thick stack - he had won quite a bit.","Sheng Mumu looked at him in confusion: \"???\"","\"I don't need cash, you keep it,\" Qi Mo gently told her.","Qi Shaobai's eyes shifted slightly in shock.","He was still thinking about what his little uncle Cheng Zhuo had said - they suddenly received some good news.","Could it be...","They know about his final exam scores!","The corners of Qi Shaobai's lips slowly curled up. He was just about to open his mouth to confirm his guess, but Cheng Zhuo's arm went around his shoulder.","He held up his phone screen in front of Qi Shaobai's face.","Cheng Zhuo had a proud look on his face as he said:","\"The annual list rankings from Finance Magazine came out, and Yueji has successfully made the list.\"","Qi Shaobai was stunned for a moment, then slowly turned his head.","His eyes instantly darkened.","He remembered hearing his stepmom and dad talking before, and them mentioning that it was very difficult to make the annual Finance Magazine list.","Cheng Zhuo bared his teeth in a wide smile and shrugged Qi Shaobai's shoulder, laughing as he asked:","\"This is incredibly good news, right?\"","\"Ah?\" Qi Shaobai then came back to his senses. \"Yeah! Great news.\"","Compared to this good news, the thin final exam report card in his backpack suddenly became insignificant.","Cheng Zhuo said, \"We're going to barbecue in the yard to celebrate later. What do you like to eat? Your little uncle will personally grill it for you.\"","The light in Qi Shaobai's eyes gradually returned. Not standing on ceremony, he answered:","\"Chicken wings, extremely spicy.\"","Cheng Zhuo patted his chest: \"No problem.\"","Qi Shaobai said, \"I'll go put my backpack in my room first.\"","As he turned to leave, the teenager's broad shoulders sank down a little.","In a voice that only he could hear, he mumbled: \"What was I expecting...\"","\"Wait, Little Qi classmate, I almost forgot—\"","Sheng Mumu suddenly called out to stop him.","Qi Shaobai looked back, a spark of hope flashing in his eyes.","Sheng Mumu smiled, her eyes curving into crescents: \"You're also the star tonight at the barbecue party.\"","Qi Shaobai: The little spark grows into a bigger flame","Sheng Mumu walked over and patted his back as she passed by him. Her tone was cheerful:","\"You're officially starting winter break tomorrow - that's worth celebrating too!\"","\"Huh?\" Qi Shaobai's body stiffened slightly. \"Celebrating that?\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Sheng Mumu poked her head out from behind him and blinked: \"What else did you think we were celebrating?\"","\"......\" The light in Qi Shaobai's eyes completely went out. He forced a smile. \"Nothing...\"","Sheng Mumu withdrew her head. \"Go rest in your room first. I'll call you when the barbecue is almost ready.\"","\"Okay.\"","Qi Shaobai dragged his lazy steps back to his room.","He casually threw his backpack onto the floor.","Lying on his back on the bed, he let out a long sigh.","A hint of loss floated up in his pitch-black eyes.","In the quiet room, there were only two little people talking in his heart.","One voice was indignant:","\"So annoying, so annoying! They actually didn't care about my final exam scores at all, and I rushed back here expecting them to...\"","The other voice was more gentle:","\"Hey, it's normal. The adult world doesn't just revolve around you. They have their own careers and work...\"","The angry little person stamped his foot: \"I understand that, but it's still really frustrating.\"","The gentle little person patted the angry little person's head: \"Growing up means accepting that you're not the main character of the world.\"","His inner turmoil tugged back and forth. He didn't know how much time had passed.","Outside the window, dusk was falling.","Suddenly, there was a knock at his door from outside.","\"Little Qi classmate, come out! The extremely spicy chicken wings Cheng Zhuo grilled for you are ready. If you don't come out soon, I'll eat them myself!\" Sheng Mumu called him.","\"No, I'm coming right away—!\" Qi Shaobai responded loudly, bouncing up from the bed.","By the time he opened the door to his room, he had adjusted his state of mind.","The two little people in his heart hadn't debated to declare one side the winner.","Instead, a third little person named \"Why Think So Much\" had gained the upper hand.","Restoring his usual vigor.","After changing into casual clothes, he jogged towards the front yard of the villa.","Before even getting close, the scent of barbecue drifted into his nose.","Following the smell, he turned the corner—and his eyes suddenly widened.","He saw that the area around the pool had been lavishly decorated.","Fairy lights wound through the trees.","Clusters of light decorated the scene.","The outdoor table was piled high with his favorite snacks and drinks.","\"Pop!\"","Cheng Zhuo tilted back as he popped open a bottle of champagne, accidentally sending the cork into the pool. \"Whoops!\" he said, rubbing his head.","Ripples spread across the water's surface.","Just like the current restless state of Qi Shaobai's eyes.","Sheng Mumu smiled brightly at him: \"The star of tonight, Little Qi, is here!\"","Qi Shaobai's gaze paused slightly: \"???\"","\"Make way, make way—\" Qiao Li jokingly said as he wheeled out a cake from behind Qi Shaobai, \"Don't block the road, energetic boy.\"","\"???\" Qi Shaobai dazedly moved out of the way.","He looked at everyone in confusion.","Could someone tell him what was going on here?","Sheng Mumu used her finger to swipe some frosting and dabbed it onto Qi Shaobai's nose.","His expression changed from \"utterly bewildered\" to \"cutely utterly bewildered.\"","Sheng Mumu's eyes and brows happily opened as she said her lines that she had been holding in all afternoon:","\"Little Qi, are you surprised? Did you expect this?\"","\"We gathered here tonight to celebrate your awesome final exam scores!\"","\"Ever since we got the call from your teacher this afternoon, we started planning all this—\"","Qi Shaobai stood frozen in place, a buzzing sound exploding in his ears. He didn't hear the following words very clearly.","His mood, which had sunk to rock bottom, was like it was suddenly grabbed and flung up into the clouds.","It took him awhile to come back to his senses, his neck craning back and the corners of his lips slowly curling up.","\"So you mean just now you were...acting out my reactions?\"","\"That's right,\" Sheng Mumu instantly responded, raising her brows. \"I was the director. Pretty seamless acting, wouldn't you say?\"","Qi Shaobai's gaze shifted. Looking at the tall figure by the pool whose eyes and brows shone with laughter, he couldn't believe it as he asked:","\"Dad, you were acting as me too?\"","The smile touched the man's lips. After exchanging a glance with the proudly beaming Sheng Mumu, his gentle voice said, \"Mm, supporting role.\""]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: The Wolf with the Big Tail","paragraphs":["\"Wait a minute, sister—\"","Cheng Zhuo seemed to suddenly discover a blind spot and looked at Sheng Mumu doubtfully.","\"—Brother-in-law won three games in a row in the afternoon Mahjong game. Was that also part of you three plotting to put on a show?\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for half a second before the corners of her eyes curved up in a smile.","Her long lashes trembled slightly with her melodious laughter, and her eyes shone like a clear pond.","Her cream-smeared fingers casually wiped at her silly little brother's face.","She heartlessly mocked:","\"Are you stupid? He really is that good.\"","Her words fell.","In the next second, Qi Shaobai's previously disbelief-filled face relaxed, and he burst into a cheerful, unbridled laugh.","Casually picking up a spicy chicken wing from the table and taking a bite, he said:","\"Little uncle, I've discovered that you and big uncle are very different.\"","Cheng Zhuo was puzzled. \"Oh? How so?\"","Qi Shaobai gave a vulgar smile, his tone begging for a beating.","\"Big uncle is very smart.\"","Cheng Zhuo: \"???\"","Was he insulting me?.jpg","\"Qi Shaobai! How could you say something like that!\" Sheng Mumu sharply rebuked, then swiftly changed direction. \"You're only speaking the blunt truth.\"","Suddenly, laughter erupted from the yard.","Even the servants and Manager Zhang couldn't help covering their mouths to secretly laugh.","In the cheerful atmosphere,","Qiao Li rubbed his forehead with a soft sigh: Oh dear.","Not far away, the handsome man who had accidentally received Sheng Mumu’s praise, lifted the corners of his mouth in a shallow curve, his chest vibrating with a lazy laugh.","His imposing aura was no longer cold and aloof.","It blended into the crisp winter air.","*","Recently, Sheng Mumu has fallen into distress.","Ever since she and Qi Mo had developed some intimacy in their relationship, many things she used to take for granted changed flavor in her eyes.","Take her daily sleeping arrangements for example.","Although they slept on the same bed, they had always been proper and reserved.","She was used to it, and didn't feel there was anything ambiguous about the situation.","There seemed to be an invisible line dividing the spacious bed.","Each minded their own business.","But recently...","That little river between them seemed to have dried up.","Sometimes when she went to bed, as soon as the lights were off, the man would sling his arm around her waist","As if to circle her in his embrace while also pressing down the blanket she often kicked away.","At the same time, this also locked her in his arms.","But Sheng Mumu hadn't exactly remained still herself.","As she gradually got used to Qi Mo's arm that would inadvertently drape over her,","she retaliated.","Her sleeping habits became increasingly unruly.","Several times she woke up to find herself sprawled across the bed.","Although her side of the bed was very spacious, she had still somehow squeezed Qi Mo to the edge of the bed in her sleep.","The tall, well-built man barely maintained his balance to keep from falling off.","He looked strangely pitiful.","Meanwhile, her little feet were still shamelessly propped against the man’s sturdy calves...","Almost as if poised to kick him again at any moment...","Sheng Mumu felt guilty.","She wanted to move over to clear some space.","But every time she stirred, the man's arm would unerringly press over","And gather her into an embrace.","Sheng Mumu thought she had awoken him.","She held her breath and looked over.","The man's eyes were still closed, his distinct long lashes lowered.","His brows and eyes were relaxed and peaceful, lacking his usual breathtaking sharpness during the day.","His chest slowly rose and fell with steady breathing.","It was as if her movements hadn't disturbed him at all, and he had merely lifted his hand a bit in his sleep.","However...","When Sheng Mumu tried shifting again,","She couldn’t budge the man’s arm that felt like it weighed a thousand pounds.","Gradually, Sheng Mumu sensed something wasn’t right about this.","One day,","She wisened up.","After that arm had pressed over her, she didn’t go back to sleep immediately.","She silently narrowed her eyes to observe.","In the tranquil room, time seemed to slow down.","The lighting was dim, with only a few thin rays of light seeping in through the gaps in the curtains.","She could vaguely make out the man’s outstanding features.","One second...","Two seconds...","Three seconds...","After more than ten seconds had passed, she suddenly saw the corners of the supposedly sleeping man’s lips twitch.","Bit by bit...","Slowly curving up...","Bending into a gloating arc.","“Ah-ha! So you were pretending to be asleep!” Sheng Mumu exclaimed in surprise.","There was a flicker between Qi Mo’s brows. He hesitated for a few seconds before slowly opening his eyes.","Those eyes were brimming with undisguised, sly sparkles as he looked at her.","Sheng Mumu kicked him in irritation.","Yet the man didn’t react at all.","Sheng Mumu froze in astonishment, her bright eyes blinking rapidly—","How...","Even when she had kicked with all her might, she still couldn’t make him budge at all.","So how did this man allow himself to be squeezed to the edge of the bed by her every night?","Could it be...","Before she could finish her next sentence, the arm around her waist suddenly tightened.","Qi Mo pulled her into his embrace, pressing her head into the crook of his neck.","\"Yes, on purpose,\" his tone was leisurely.","Not the slightest bit embarrassed at being caught red-handed, in fact quite shameless.","\"... \" Sheng Mumu's breathing hitched as her nose brushed the man's collarbone.","The crisp, masculine scent invaded her nostrils.","Her gaze was level with his protruding Adam's apple as it lightly rolled up and then down.","Strangely bewitching.","She couldn't help but hold her breath, her eyes lowering.","Right then, the smooth muscular lines of the man's chest came into her line of sight.","The intimacy of the distance...","Pressed too close together, heat slowly rose between them.","The man chuckled lightly.","She could feel his chest vibrate slightly.","His magnetic, roguish voice slowly reached her ear:","\"It's winter, no need to get up early. Sleep a while longer.\"","Sheng Mumu lifted her head. Her crown bumped against the man's chin, her voice a little muffled:","\"But I can't fall back asleep now.\"","\"Keep me company,\" the man replied in a second, his lazy tone carrying a hint of shamelessness at making demands.","As his voice fell, Sheng Mumu felt her waist being circled more snugly.","The hand at the nape of her neck slid down to give her neck a squeeze.","Extremely gently, massaging it.","As if trying to stir her drowsiness.","Sheng Mumu took a light breath, relaxing as she narrowed her eyes.","Her breathing slowed.","The smooth, warm palm slowly moved up to stroke her messy bedhead back into place.","Lulling her to sleep.","In her heart, Sheng Mumu silently scolded the cunning old Qi dog.","Breathing in the reassuring scent of the man,","Gradually...drowsiness came.","At the last moment before her eyes closed,","She felt the man's slender fingertips gently burrow into her hair, tenderly caressing.","Especially soporific.","During that late morning nap in the winter, Sheng Mumu had a dream.","In the woods...","A handsome, aloof big gray wolf prowled around a rabbit's burrow.","Without a sound, inching closer bit by bit.","Plotting when would be the best time to swallow the rabbit in its belly.","Yet the rabbit was actually snoring away on its back, drooling without any vigilance.","In the dream, Sheng Mumu wiped some anxious sweat for the rabbit. Her body gave a jolt, and she subconsciously burrowed closer into the man's embrace."]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Keemer, You're a Real Dog","paragraphs":["There were five days left before New Year's Eve.","The schedule was set for Grandma and Feng Yaoqin to return to the capital.","It just so happened to be the day of the Lunar New Year.","That day, everyone went to pick them up at the airport merrily.","They arrived at the capital airport ahead of the flight's scheduled arrival time.","Qi Shaobai found the best position facing the exit.","He leaned on one hand and hopped up to sit on the railing.","Gripping the railing with both hands, he slightly raised his chin, craning to look inside.","His reckless, eager posture combined with his well-behaved sitting posture did not seem out of place at all.","Before long, Grandma's figure appeared.","The boy's eyes lit up. He couldn't wait to run over and throw his arms around Grandma.","In a loud, clear voice:","\"Grandma, I missed you so much!\"","Grandma was caught off guard and filled with warmth.","Smiling, she patted her great-grandson on the back,","\"Oh, my little one, slow down.\"","Looking over Qi Shaobai's enthusiastically lowered head, Grandma saw her grandson and granddaughter-in-law not far away. The wrinkles around her eyes crinkled deeper with her smile.","Qi Mo wore a dark gray shirt with a black overcoat over it. He stood tall among the crowd.","His right hand held Sheng Mumu's. They walked towards this side.","Sheng Mumu's eyes were filled with smiles. She happily trotted over in small steps, pulling Qi Mo's hand to make him walk faster.","Qi Mo smiled slightly, striding forward with his long legs.","Seeing this, Grandma's expression suddenly froze.","Her eyebrows quietly knitted together.","Strange...","The atmosphere between little Qi and Mumu seems a little different than before.","They used to hold hands and smile at each other too, very lovingly.","But today, they looked even more like a newlywed couple.","Grandma tilted her head, looking back and forth.","She keenly sensed a subtle change in her grandson and granddaughter-in-law's relationship, but couldn't figure out what exactly had changed.","Before she could think further, the two had come up to them.","Grandma was filled with warmth again with two more hugs.","Her grandson was consistently mature and steady. His embrace was powerful. Apart from a few customary polite greetings, there were no extra words.","Her granddaughter-in-law was completely different.","All smiles, she wrapped her arms around Grandma's. She chattered away incessantly in a sweet voice that seeped into one's heart.","One moment she asked if Grandma was tired from the long flight, the next she said she wanted to make fried meatballs for Grandma later to showcase what she had learned.","Grandma smiled as she gently patted her hand, saying \"Good, good, good\" repeatedly.","Seeing that Sheng Mumu was chatting with Grandma, Qi Shaobai quietly went over to Grandma's other side and pulled her over.","He took out his phone from his hoodie pocket and opened the photo album.","He showed Grandma the “evidence” of his grades improving over the past few months.","In an extremely proud voice:","“Grandma, this is my final exam transcript. Look, it's not bad, right...\"","Grandma squinted to look. She nodded approvingly:","“Not bad at all...your English has improved a lot...”","Qi Shaobai's eyebrows quirked up happily. His finger slid across the screen:","“My math and physics have also improved.”","“Oh yes, there’s also this one—”","“This was taken when our class performed at the school arts festival. Our act was selected as one of the top ten performances. The school gave us some useless stationery items. I randomly took a picture.”","“You brat, how can you call stationery useless,” Grandma lightly hit him. “I think the notebook and pens look quite nice.”","Qi Shaobai: “Then can I give them to you?”","Grandma gave him a look. “When you were little and didn’t want to eat certain dishes, Grandma would finish them for you. Now that you’ve grown up, you still want to give Grandma things you don’t need?”","Qi Shaobai laughed. “But these were prizes from the arts festival. They belong to both of us. You contributed too.”","Grandma: “Alright alright. Give them to me. I’ll take them back to Guangzhou and give them to my classmates.”","Qi Shaobai's eyes widened. “Your classmates?”","Grandma: “What, only you’re allowed to have classmates? My elder university classmates count too!”","“Of course they count,” Qi Shaobai laughed heartily. He flipped through his phone album again, introducing each photo, “See this one, it’s my grades from two months ago.”","Sheng Mumu and Qi Mo were left on the side. They quietly watched the overly eager Qi Shaobai.","Sheng Mumu used her elbow to nudge the man beside her, muttering:","“Young Master Qi is wagging his tail so hard I can see an afterimage. Can you see it?”","Qi Mo’s gaze lowered. He looked at Qi Shaobai’s “imaginary tail”.","The handsome arch of his brows slowly relaxed. He nodded seriously.","Lowering his voice, he said, \"I see it. He's wagging quite energetically.\"","Sheng Mumu was stunned for half a second before looking up with a smile curving her lips.","“President Qi, I didn't know you were so good at playing along.”","She had randomly joked around. She didn't expect him to smoothly follow up like that.","Qi Mo met her gaze. His brows suddenly relaxed as he laughed softly, his eyes gentle and serene.","In a low voice: “I learned from you.”","After he spoke, he didn't give Sheng Mumu a chance to respond. He held her hand again.","His knuckles rubbed gently at her soft fingertips, fiddling as his gaze slowly lowered elsewhere.","Sheng Mumu blinked blankly.","Looking at the man's refined, profound side profile, she exclaimed inwardly: Is he still that cold president?","How can he talk like that?","One set after another.","\"Qi Mo, your name is very fitting.\" Sheng Mumu said softly.","\"Hm?\" Qi Mo had just turned his head when Sheng Mumu’s hand pressed down on his shoulder.","She moved closer to his ear.","\"Mo, black dog. Recently I discovered, you really are a gentleman on the surface but extremely sly and scheming on the inside. An enormous scoundrel dog.\"","\"... \" Qi Mo's body stiffened. He froze for a few seconds.","Slowly turning his head, his body slightly leaned closer to be at eye level with her.","The handsome arch of his brow quirked up slowly. His smile turned subtle.","Dragging his words, he narrowed his eyes faintly, repeating the adjective she used: \"Enormous?\"","\"Yes, enormous.\" Sheng Mumu said.","Over thirty years old already, why would he still be a puppy?","Sheng Mumu was still feeling very pleased at her accurate description when a few seconds later, she suddenly stopped.","Wait...were they talking about the same thing?","His smile seemed ambiguous. As if he had misunderstood?","Sheng Mumu’s mind suddenly flashed back to a scene from earlier that morning before they left home—","Qi Mo was showering in the bathroom.","She was at her dresser happily humming a tune while putting on makeup.","Lost in song, her hand slipped and she smudged her lower eyelashes with mascara.","She had to carefully remove the area with a cotton swab and makeup remover before redoing it.","After searching around for half a day without finding any, she called out:","“Have you seen my cotton swab box? Is it there on the counter?”","The pitter-patter of water grew softer. His voice replied from inside: “I’ll bring it out for you.”","She only wanted to confirm the location of the cotton swabs, but hearing Qi Mo say that, she had no choice but to wait by the door.","Shortly after, the bathroom door opened from inside.","A box of cotton swabs was handed out towards Sheng Mumu.","Water droplets still clung to the man’s strong, muscular forearms, creating a misty effect.","As Sheng Mumu took the box, her gaze inadvertently shifted. Her breath suddenly tightened.","The scene before her eyes was intensely striking.","The man's upper body was bare. A not too thick bath towel was wrapped around his waist.","His chest and abs were exposed to the air, forming a lean and smooth inverted triangle from his broad shoulders to narrow waist.","The grooves on his abs were accented with light and shadows. His snaking hip lines were sensual.","Water droplets slid along the contours, disappearing into the depths of the towel.","The man raised a hand and casually rubbed his short wet hair with the towel. His eyes casually glanced over.","Sheng Mumu hadn’t retracted her gaze yet. It was still paused around his waist and abdomen.","The towel wasn’t too thick. She could vaguely make out a curve beneath.","Her ears instantly grew hot. She casually looked away, taking the box towards her dresser.","She had just turned when her pupils secretly shook.","How to put it.","It was...very exaggerated.","Recalling the present, Sheng Mumu felt her cheeks flush from the man's penetrating gaze beside her.","She knew he must be recalling that scene from before they left.","Otherwise, he wouldn't speak in such an ambiguous tone.","Sheng Mumu took a light breath, blushing to her ears. She glared at him:","\"...Qi Black Dog! You really are a dog!\"","The insulted man smiled and straightened up, his gaze slowly shifting elsewhere.","The hand holding hers moved.","His evenly shaped fingers pried her fingers open one by one, tightly interlacing them in his grip.","His tone was casual, as if to say it went without saying. \"To be precise, an enormous dog.\""]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: Do New Year shopping","paragraphs":["At the same time, on the other side of Jing City Airport.","The domestic terminal.","Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li went to pick up Feng Yaoqin.","Feng Yaoqin and the old lady's flights landed at the same time.","They had no choice but to split up with Cousin and Cousin-in-law, and then meet up in the parking lot.","Cheng Zhuo took the suitcase from Feng Yaoqin's hand.","Pushing the suitcase with one hand and holding Qiao Li's hand with the other, he naturally walked at the very edge.","He called Feng Yaoqin \"Auntie\" as he followed Qiao Li, constantly making conversation and laughing all the way to the parking lot.","In the middle of chatting, Feng Yaoqin suddenly stopped.","As if realizing something, she stared at the young couple for a long time.","She suddenly said suspiciously: \"Little Cheng, why do I feel like you two are different from before?\"","\"Huh?\" Cheng Zhuo's eyes widened in confusion, \"What's different?\"","Qiao Li showed the same puzzled expression: \"???\"","Feng Yaoqin looked them up and down. \"You two look...like your relationship has progressed a lot since I left Jing City.\"","Feng Yaoqin's gaze fell on the young couple's tightly held hands.","She also said:","\"Compared to this, it didn't even look like you were dating before, it was more like you were acting.\"","Cheng Zhuo's expression froze: \"!!!\"","\"!!!\" Qiao Li was shocked, and the corners of her mouth twitched slightly.","She quickly pointed to a corner of the parking lot to change the subject:","\"Ahahaha——Auntie, you must have been watching too many melodramatic shows lately, your imagination has become so rich ahaha......Oh, is that Cousin and Cousin-in-law over there?\"","\"Where?\" Feng Yaoqin's attention was successfully diverted as she turned to look.","What a coincidence.","The Qi family happened to appear in the direction Qiao Li was pointing.","Qiao Li and Cheng Zhuo secretly breathed a long sigh of relief at the same time.","As everyone chatted during the greetings, they exchanged a look of having narrowly escaped disaster.","Cheng Zhuo: Scared to death.jpg","Qiao Li: Who isn't? .jpg","The topic of the chat went from \"airplane food is not tasty\" to \"should we all go shopping for New Year's goods together.\"","Feng Yaoqin put her arm around the old lady and said, \"You young people go, I'll accompany the old lady home to rest and get over jet lag.\"","Qiao Li looked at the time and showed regret: \"I can't go either, the band has booked several performances in a row at the end of the year, I have to hurry to the rehearsal studio now.\"","\"I'll take you there.\" Cheng Zhuo took out his car keys, actively demonstrating the virtues a good boyfriend should have.","So in the end, the task of purchasing New Year's goods fell on the Qi family of three.","Feng Yaoqin roughly outlined what things need to be bought to create a New Year atmosphere.","Sheng Mumu listened carefully, glancing out of the corner of her eye to see that brat Qi Shaobai had taken out his phone.","He held the phone to Feng Yaoqin's mouth.","\"Grandma, say it again, I'll record it.\"","Qi Shaobai used his eyes to point at Sheng Mumu and added:","\"They definitely won't remember.\"","Sheng Mumu: ......","Qi Mo: ......","Feng Yaoqin nodded. \"You really are smart.\"","She then took the phone from Qi Shaobai's hand, subconsciously cleared her throat.","Then in an official-sounding voice, she recorded:","\"Ah...um, to buy——\"","\"No, not fluent.\"","\"Ahem...\"","\"No good, not coherent.\"","\"Ahem ahem......\"","\"Shopping list for the 30th day of the lunar year as follows——\"","\"balabala#$%@′′","Finally, she gave them a big thumbs up and smiled gently:","\"Thanks for your hard work.\"","Sheng Mumu chuckled softly.","She felt Feng Yaoqin's appearance at the moment was just like a real-life version of the \"wealth and nobility\" emoji pack.","It perfectly overlapped with the image of the cute granny who liked to send cheesy emojis in the group chat.","Doubly cute.","After detailing the specifics, everyone headed towards different cars.","Sheng Mumu had just grasped the passenger door handle, about to pull, when she suddenly stopped.","She said to the two Qi men:","\"Wait for me, I forgot something...\"","She turned around and got into Feng Yaoqin and the old lady's car, and didn't come back for several minutes.","On the way to the supermarket.","Qi Mo drove.","Qi Shaobai pulled his hoodie over his head and found a comfortable position, leaning back into the leather seat.","He was already prepared to serve as a shopping cart pusher at the supermarket later.","He was now seizing the time to rest.","\"Are you going to rest too?\" Qi Mo gently asked her, turning his head.","\"I won't rest.\" Sheng Mumu smiled lightly and shook her phone. \"I'll play on my phone for a bit.\"","Qi Mo: \"Okay.\"","He started the car with one hand on the steering wheel.","He unconsciously slowed down the speed.","On one hand.","He considered that Qi Shaobai was sleeping in the back.","More importantly.","He was worried that if the speed was too fast, she would get dizzy from looking down at her phone.","Sheng Mumu didn't notice the man's caring little details. Her fingers slid across the screen, attracted by the content of the conversations in the ladies' group chat.","Recently, the ladies' group chat had been very lively.","Almost every time she opened it, there were 99+ unread messages","As the Spring Festival approached, the ladies often made appointments to do beauty treatments and dye their hair together.","They would share which upscale restaurants had new dishes on the menu.","Talk about which haute couture coats would be good to wear for New Year.","They would also share the new hair colors they dyed to the group for everyone to see if it looked good or not.","Sheng Mumu's OCD was triggered.","She read from the very first unread message all the way to the latest one.","Just as she was about to exit the group chat with a \"seen by me\" mentality, a message related to her suddenly popped up.","——【Mrs. Zhao: Did everyone see it? Mrs. Qi's company made it onto the financial magazine's annual list.】","——【Mrs. Qian: Really? [Surprised]】","——【Mrs. Zhao: [Shared news link]】","——【Mrs. Qian: Wow, so awesome![Clapping][Clapping][Clapping]】","——【Su Tingran: Yes yes, Mumu is super great.】","——【Mrs. Sun: I really didn't expect that in less than a year, Mrs. Qi has made the company so good, very impressive.】","——【Su Tingran: Nodding like mad.jpg】","——【Mrs. Qian: As one of Yueji's first customers, I feel so proud too, it's like I got on the list with her [Haha]】","——【Mrs. Zhou: To tell the truth, when I first learned that Mrs. Qi was going to open a flower shop, my words were a bit inappropriate, verbally mocking, I'm really sorry.】","——【Mr. Wu's Baby: Me too, I looked down on Mrs. Qi for opening a flower shop at first. [Sigh]】","——【Mr. Wu's Baby: @Sheng Mumu, Mrs. Qi, sorry, sincerely apologizing.】","Sheng Mumu looked at the screen in surprise and blinked.","It was as if a line had formed behind these two messages.","The ladies who used to make sarcastic comments about her flower shop were coming out one by one to @ her and sincerely apologize."]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: I Don't Understand But I'm Shocked.","paragraphs":["She said she was going to buy groceries for the new year.","In reality, it was more about the feeling of ceremony than actually buying things.","The villa was usually kept tidy and well-stocked by Zhang Housekeeper, so it was close to having everything needed already.","This time, in addition to buying all the fish maw, abalone, ham etc. as instructed by Feng Yaoqin,","Sheng Mumu focused on small objects that would add to the festive atmosphere.","Sheng Mumu walked in front, picking and choosing.","Qi Mo followed half a step behind her, pushing the shopping cart.","Sheng Mumu would occasionally turn back, holding two different brands of the same item, shake them and ask him,","\"Which one of these two?\"","He seemed to think for a couple of seconds, then gave an unchanging standard answer:","“Whichever one you like.”","Sheng Mumu helplessly lowered her hand with a wry smile, “Can’t you change your line?”","\"I can.\" Qi Mo responded with a straight face, changing his line, “Then take both.”","Sheng Mumu: \"......\"","Oh Well.","As expected, she couldn’t rely on a man to go grocery shopping.","Qi Mo looked stylish and impeccable on the outside.","But in reality, he had very low material desires.","Other than spending his money on necessities like houses, cars, watches that a CEO would need, he didn’t have many other requirements for everyday goods.","Regarding daily supplies - as long as they’re not expired.","Regarding food - as long as it's not lethal.","But the less requirements he had, the more Sheng Mumu's enthusiasm grew, wanting to make things difficult for him.","Sheng Mumu shoved two bags of spiced peanuts in front of him and cocked an eyebrow.","In an slightly coquettish tone:","“Nope... today I’m determined to make you choose one.”","Qi Mo was stunned for a moment, looking straight at her.","The darkness in his eyes overflowed with laughter, his lips curled helplessly.","His gaze scanned over the package specifications on the two bags of spiced peanuts.","A few seconds later, he slowly opened his mouth, “Pick the bigger pack.”","\"......\" Sheng Mumu was taken aback, blinking blankly.","She wondered privately in her heart.","Why was this man so fixated on the word “big”?","It was just a bag of spiced peanuts, yet he still wanted the bigger one?","She didn’t get it, didn’t get it at all.","After this incident, Sheng Mumu completely gave up on asking Qi Mo for his opinion.","She would make her own decisions without asking him anymore.","Qi Shaobai lazily followed behind them with his shopping cart, ambling along, looking around.","For some reason, as he wandered around, he felt more and more uncomfortable. It was as if there was a 1000-watt light bulb shining above his head.","Qi Shaobai noticed his dad occasionally sticking close to his stepmother.","As long as his stepmother’s hands were free, his dad would seize every opportunity to reach out and hold hers.","If his stepmother was too busy to pay him any attention, he would just stand quietly beside her and watch her.","His usually aloof face would reveal an exceptionally patient and content expression.","It seemed as if grocery shopping was an especially relaxing and enjoyable event for him.","In Qi Shaobai’s nearly eighteen years of life, this was the first time he had seen his dad push a shopping cart.","Let alone push a shopping cart, even just entering a supermarket was a first.","Qi Shaobai was greatly shocked.","He quietly complained to himself: I didn’t expect you to be this kind of dad.","I don’t understand but I’m very shocked.","Qi Shaobai was trying to think of an appropriate and tactful excuse to slip away.","A few minutes later, he finally found an opportunity.","“Dad, I’m going over there to take a look—”","He suddenly said, taking advantage of the moment they were choosing new dinnerware.","To make the excuse more reasonable, he randomly pointed in a direction.","“—I have some personal items I want to buy. I’ll come find you afterwards.”","Qi Mo and Sheng Mumu turned to look at him at the same time.","And said in unison: “Okay.”","Qi Shaobai left without looking back.","Sheng Mumu hadn’t turned her head back yet to look in the direction Qi Shaobai had gone. A puzzled expression appeared on her face.","She used her arm to nudge the tall, cool CEO (former) standing unusually close beside her","“Uh... although... what “personal items” does little Qi want to buy?”","Following her gaze, Qi Mo’s eyes darkened for a moment, “......”","Not far ahead,","was a themed product showcase that the mall had specially set up to cater to the younger consumer crowd for the Spring Festival period.","The theme would change weekly to showcase featured products.","Over these days, the theme was “Barbie.”","At a glance, the advertising wall was awash in shades of pink and purple.","On a huge poster, a blonde Barbie in a pink dress was sweetly winking at the customers.","The slender youth in a black down jacket and gray sweatpants cut an abrupt figure amidst the sea of pink.","Sheng Mumu: ......","Qi Mo: ......","It wasn’t until a Barbie-clad sales promoter appeared before him that Qi Shaobai suddenly became aware something was off.","From behind, one could clearly see the slender and straight youth’s body visibly shudder.","He then hastily waved the promoter away.","The next second, his shopping cart made an abrupt 90 degree turn","And fled the product zone as if escaping for his life.","Sheng Mumu shook her head with an amused sigh:","“I used to think only girls would be attracted to Barbie dolls. I didn’t expect that even tough young men wouldn’t be immune.”","As soon as the words left her mouth, her wrist was grasped by Qi Mo with a slight force that pulled her forward, forcing her to keep walking.","“???” Sheng Mumu looked puzzled, “Where are we going? We haven’t finished choosing the dinnerware yet.”","Qi Mo turned to look at her, a faint smile on his lips.","Beneath the feathers of his long eyelashes, the obsidian eyes seemed to glow.","His palm slowly tightened, firmly encircling her slender wrist.","Laughter threaded through the magnetic quality of his voice:","“Going to help you pick a Barbie doll. Didn’t you say that no girl can resist them?”","Sheng Mumu’s heart-strings quivered violently.","By the time she regained her senses and refocused, she could only see the back of his head with the neatly trimmed hair.","Distracted by Qi Mo’s sudden words, Sheng Mumu’s thoughts spiraled into turmoil.","So he considered her a little girl?","What a joke.","But also inexplicably sweet.","The light and fluttery feeling of being pampered wrapped around her and settled in her heart.","After a long pause, a brilliant smile lit up Sheng Mumu’s exquisite, beautiful face.","She made no attempt to hide the sweetness that was currently permeating from the bottom of her heart.","With a twist of her wrist, she broke free of the man’s grasp.","Then she slid her hand down his sturdy forearm and turned the tables by firmly intertwining their fingers instead.","Surprised delight that was not easy to detect slipped through the composed mask of the man as he glanced back at her.","Sheng Mumu held his burning gaze directly and tipped up her chin, curving her lips.","“Yes, I like it.”","She left her words hanging for a bit, then suddenly stood on tiptoes to lightly peck the man’s lips.","In a fleeting moment, it was as if their world was isolated into its own little sphere.","The clamor of the crowd faded away.","So did the Spring Festival tune on constant loop over the mall’s sound system.","They saw only each other reflected in their eyes.","Qi Mo’s lips softened from the unexpected stolen kiss.","His hand on the shopping cart handle clenched violently as his pupils dilated in shock.","Before he could react, her warm, tender voice was heard again, now teasing and flirtatious.","A single, simple word.","“You.”","The man's whole body reacted as if he'd been electrified,","from the residual warmth at his lips all the way to his heart.","He gazed at her.","Those dark eyes melted completely into a pool of liquid gentleness."]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: The Middle Road Kills Shredded Beef.","paragraphs":["Return to Xiyu Yue Ting.","[Zhang Housekeeper] carries four large bags of New Year's goods from the trunk of the car.","Seeing an exquisitely packaged Barbie doll gift box, he plunges into confusion.","Just as he wants to ask Madam where to put away the gift box, in the master bedroom or Young Master's room, he sees Madam has already swiftly taken out some bags and walked towards the villa entrance.","She tosses over her shoulder:","\"I'm going over there, will be back later.\"","The \"over there\" in [Sheng Mumu]'s mouth refers to her mother-in-law [Feng Yaoqin]'s house.","Every time she accompanies [Feng Yaoqin] to the Garden Square to dance, she would casually say she's \"going over there.\"","\"Hey, wait, Madam—\" [Zhang Housekeeper] doesn't get to ask his question before [Sheng Mumu] is already out of sight.","[Qi Mo] has just gotten out of the driver's seat, car keys in hand. He closes the car door and exchanges silent looks with [Zhang Housekeeper].","[Zhang Housekeeper] picks up the Barbie gift box. \"Sir, should I put this in...?\"","\"Give it to me.\" [Qi Mo] reaches out to take the gift box and strides towards the villa entrance with his long legs.","[Zhang Housekeeper]'s eyes widen in silent astonishment. \"!!!\"","Oh my...","So I guessed wrong.","It belongs neither to Madam nor Young Master.","It turns out it's Sir's???","Uncle Smiley Face dot JPG","Yet another day unlocking new hobbies of the house owner.","In another villa kitchen, [Sheng Mumu] and [Feng Yaoqin] stand side by side in front of the counter.","Laid out before them are all the ingredients needed to make Dry Fried Beef.","Before leaving for the supermarket, [Sheng Mumu] had pulled [Feng Yaoqin] aside and whispered to her for a long time.","It was to finish what had been left undone previously.","The night [Feng Yaoqin] arrived in J City, she had wanted to teach [Sheng Mumu] how to make dishes her son-in-law [Qi Mo] likes to eat.","Back then, [Sheng Mumu] didn't want to learn at all.","They were pretending to be married couple anyway, just keeping up appearances.","Why would she really learn to cook for a man?","No way would she be willing.","Yet somehow...","When everyone brought up buying New Year's goods just now...","The thought to learn cooking suddenly popped up in her mind.","It even gave herself a fright.","The two tie on aprons and wash their hands clean.","[Feng Yaoqin] skillfully picks up a cleaver. With her left hand pressing on a slab of fresh beef and right hand holding the cleaver cutting downwards, she tilts her head to instruct:","\"Mumu, watch closely—\"","\"Beef should be cut against the grain like this—\"","\"Then for the chili peppers, snip off the ends—\"","\"Cilantro and green onion sections should be cut into 3 cm pieces, just need a little bit for nice presentation—\"","\"... \"","[Sheng Mumu] stands to [Feng Yaoqin]'s right, holding a smaller slab of fresh beef in her hands. Following along, she imitates her mother-in-law's posture to bring down the cleaver.","She is able to barely keep up at first. Although the seasoning ratios for marinating the beef are off, it still looks somewhat decent.","But when it gets to the \"stir frying\" step, she clearly becomes flustered.","Wielding the pot lid as a shield against oil splatters ready to fly out any time.","Seeing this, [Feng Yaoqin] heaves a helpless yet amused sigh. She pulls [Sheng Mumu] back a step.","And says solemnly:","\"Or how about we just don't learn anymore, Mumu.\"","\"While cooking isn't difficult, it does require some talent.\"","\"With your talents, it's already a miracle you managed to learn meatballs.\"","[Sheng Mumu]'s mouth twitches. She smiles awkwardly. \"......\"","[Feng Yaoqin] softly consoles, \"Anyway there are chefs at home. It's fine if you can't cook.\"","[Sheng Mumu] recalls her mother-in-law's past words and smiles as she asks back:","\"Mom, that's not what you used to say.\"","Back then, mother-in-law said being a daughter-in-law means having to know how to manage the household and take good care of the husband and children's three daily meals.","Yet now, she doesn't have a single expectation of [Sheng Mumu], and hasn't brought up talk of conceiving anymore.","\"I was deliberately trying to scare you, silly girl.\" [Feng Yaoqin] laughs it off.","She takes the pot lid from [Sheng Mumu]'s hands.","Giving the wok a few quick stirs with the spatula, she effortlessly calms the cooking situation that had distressed [Sheng Mumu].","\"Alright, stop messing around uselessly in the kitchen.\" [Feng Yaoqin] turns off the stove and pulls [Sheng Mumu] out of the kitchen.","\"If you're free with nothing to do, come with me to the Square tonight. Old Ye, Xu Auntie and even Yanzi Sister have all said it's been a long time since seeing you and they miss you.\"","Warmth spreads through [Sheng Mumu]'s heart. At a momentary loss for what to say.","Her best trait is being receptive to advice.","After brief consideration, she decides to heed [Feng Yaoqin]'s words.","Give up on learning Dry Fried Beef.","While she is giving up, the dish preparation was already halfway done, it would be a waste to not let the intended person know.","She takes out her phone and takes a photo of the half-made Dry Fried Beef to send to [Qi Mo].","Message sent.","The \"typing\" indicator above the chat stays on for a long time.","After a while, a new message pops up.","[Qi Mo]: \"My eyesight is poor. This is...?\"","[Sheng Mumu]'s smile freezes. ......","Glancing between the blackened wok and the picture.","She frowns doubtfully, as if questioning life itself.","It can't be unrecognizable even if unfinished right?","[Sheng Mumu] holds in her breath and taps out a reply.","Sending four messages in one furious go:","\"This is my half-way destroyed attempt at Dry Fried Beef!!!\"","\"Your favorite dish to eat!!!\"","\"Is it so bad you can't even make out what it is???\"","\"[anger emoticon] [hands on hips angry emoticon]\"","[Qi Mo] looks at the words she sent appearing on his phone screen, piecing together scattered fragments in an instant.","Recalling her sneaking off mysteriously into [Feng Yaoqin]'s car before leaving for the supermarket.","And remembering at the supermarket, she had seemingly casually wandered by the fresh section several times, getting ingredients for one dish in three separate trips.","So it turns out...","All her abnormal behaviors were just to learn how to make his favorite dish to eat.","The man's heart softens all at once. He leans back into the chair.","Eyes clear and eyelashes lifted at the corners.","He types: \"Not bad at all, if looking closely can make out...\"","Just as he is typing, he suddenly stops halfway, fingers suspended above the screen.","As if thinking of something, his brow flickers subtly, a flash of slyness in his eyes.","He deletes the typed out reply one by one.","And retypes, pretending not to know: \"Didn't you say you didn't want to learn before?\"","The subtext being, why do you want to learn now.","The message is sent out.","The man stares fixedly at the screen without blinking once.","Wanting to see her tell him the reason.","Greedily wanting to see more possibly expressed moments of her liking him.","\"Typing...\" appears in the chat.","The man doesn't even blink, anticipation in his eyes growing thicker by the second.","Soon, the typing status disappears.","A new message pops up in the chat box.","[Sheng Mumu]: \"Yeah, that's why I gave up. [clueless scratching head emoji]\"","[Sheng Mumu] doesn't pick up on the subtle implication behind his words.","She responds to the man's question containing shallow hints in the most straightforward way.","[Qi Mo] is silent. He stares at his phone.","Head lowered, he sighs lightly once.","A chest full of anticipation dissipates into thin air.","Oh well.","The setting sun outside the window shines on the man's distinct and sculpted face, cloaking it in a thin layer of warm light.","The feeling of disappointment only lingers for an instant.","The warm light curves out soft edges.","His fingers lightly glide across the screen as he browses online.","Gaze falling upon that photo of \"Half-Way Ruined Dry Fried Beef\", the corners of his lips lift up smiling.","Compared to \"how she answers\", \"what she did\" matters more.","Slender fingers press against the screen.","Clicking, and clicking again.","Saving the image.","He treasures her first attempt at wanting to learn to cook for him, collecting this heartfelt gesture like a precious jewel."]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: All Warm Colors","paragraphs":["\"Wonderful--.\"","On the morning of Chinese New Year's Eve.","As Sheng Mumu had just come out of the bedroom, she heard Qi Shaobai's voice coming from downstairs.","Leaning over the railing on the second floor looking down.","She saw in the living room, Granny and Qi Shaobai were writing spring couplets together.","The paperweights pressed on the top edges of the red fretwork spring couplet paper.","Granny rolled up her sleeves and lifted the brush to write calligraphy.","The golden ink shimmered brightly, following the movement of the brush tip falling on the paper.","The brushwork was powerful and unrestrained, with rhythm.","Vigorous yet not without gentleness.","Sheng Mumu looked at it admiringly, and hurried downstairs.","She stood in a line with Qi Shaobai, posing as Granny’s fan girl, joining the chorus of praise.","Last time at the Garden Square, she had witnessed Qi Shaobai’s calligraphy.","Qi Mo had told her then that Qi Shaobai had learned some superficial skills from Granny when he was little.","Now at the first sight,","Sheng Mumu realized how precise Qi Mo's words were.","Compared to Granny’s masterful calligraphy, Qi Shaobai's bit of shoddy work could only be described as \"superficial\".","While she was thinking, Granny had already put down the brush, looking satisfied at the newly written couplet.","Top line: Wish with snowy meaning to pray for a bountiful year","Bottom line: Glorious spring sees ten thousand things anew","Horizontal inscription: Fortune and joy fill the doors","\"Wow!\"","Qi Shaobai seemed to have discovered something and suddenly exclaimed, pointing at the table.","\"Granny, you hid names in the couplet!\"","Granny smiled and nodded gently, praising: \"Clever little one.\"","Qi Shaobai analyzed:","\"The character ‘wish’ in the top line looks similar to Qi, there is ‘Sheng’ in the bottom line, it’s obviously our family’s spring couplets, so suitable--\"","Sheng Mumu was pleasantly surprised, staring with rounded eyes.","She never thought her name would be included in the couplet.","\"Not only does it represent little one and Mumu.\" Granny smiled benevolently, looking at her great grandson, \"Little one, there is also your name, see if you can find it.\"","Qi Shaobai's eyebrows rose happily: \"Where, where?\"","\"I found it!\" Sheng Mumu answered quickly, \"Snowy meaning, white, Qi Shaobai.\"","\"That’s right~\" Granny's smile deepened.","Just then, Qi Mo pushed open the study door, stepped down the stairs casually.","Sheng Mumu glanced at him and waved her hand, \"Granny wrote spring couplets, come and see quickly.\"","When the man came down, Sheng Mumu said solemnly in a matter-of-fact tone:","\"This pair of couplets was written by Granny, little Qi and I stood by the side cheering, we can barely count as participating in the creation.\"","She paused briefly, looking up at the handsome side profile of the man.","\"As a member of the family, you can't shirk labour, you have to contribute as well.\"","Hearing this, the man was silent for a few seconds, and said slowly:","\"Then...shall I write a pair too?\"","He understood Sheng Mumu’s meaning clumsily.","He reached out to take the writing brush.","Just as he stretched out his hand, his wrist was pressed by a fair and slender hand. Sheng Mumu's slightly mischievous voice came:","\"It can't be that easy, what you have to do is manual labour--\"","Sheng Mumu pointed at the villa door with her chin and instructed:","\"Go, put up the spring couplets.\"","With her rational and justified manner, she was just like the exploiting landowners squeezing sweat from labourers in old society.","Qi Mo: \"......\"","On one side, Granny and Qi Shaobai were stunned for a moment.","They exchanged a tacit look silently.","Conveying brain waves without words.","Granny was surprised at first, then smiled with narrowed eyes: I’ve lived for so long and seen it all, this is the first time I've seen little one being ordered to work, oh ho ho.","Qi Shaobai stood straighter, chin raised slightly: I'm different, I’ve seen it many times before, nothing surprising.","Just as the grandmother and grandson were feeling emotional, the handsome man at the centre of the topic raised his brow.","His tone was light and lingering with laughter in response:","\"Alright, I’ll go put them up.\"","Hearing the reply, Sheng Mumu nodded satisfactorily.","She held up the dried spring couplets and walked outside.","When she passed Qi Shaobai, she stopped and jokingly said, \"Good boy, go get a chair and help steady your old dad.\"","Qi Shaobai responded happily: \"Okay.\"","Qi Mo’s steps faltered, frozen for a few seconds.","Then he continued walking forward.","At the front door.","Qi Shaobai held on to the chair back, craning his neck to watch his dad put up the spring couplets.","Granny and Sheng Mumu stood a little further away, overseeing the whole picture and directing positions.","\"To the left, a bit higher.\"","\"Shift right a bit, eh right there, stick it on!\"","After putting up the spring couplets, Qi Mo came down from the chair and went to stand next to Sheng Mumu.","His gaze looked towards the door as he naturally put his arm around her shoulders.","The spring couplets stuck on the modernly decorated villa doors were somewhat out of place.","But it didn’t affect the strong festive atmosphere and joy at all.","Just like the four people in the yard. Although their blood ties were distant,","it didn’t affect them being a family at all.","A wisp of unprecedented stability rose from the bottom of Qi Mo's heart.","Wrapping around his chest, with layers of warmth surging.","The present he was able to see.","And the future he could imagine.","Were all warm colours.","He subconsciously held her shoulder a little tighter.","His palm gently caressed her delicate shoulder smooth as porcelain.","Sheng Mumu turned her head, not stingy with praise:","\"You put them up very nicely.\"","With everyone participating in putting up the spring couplets, the words on it were no longer just hollow and cold texts, but were given more vivid implications.","Thinking this way, a misty smile emerged in Sheng Mumu's eyes.","In the afternoon, Cheng Zhuo and Qiao Li came together.","Cheng Zhuo carried bags full of gift boxes in both hands.","Both large and small, containing abalone, sea cucumber, fish maw, about six to seven bags.","After putting down his things, Cheng Zhuo took out two game disc cases from his body.","Without changing his shoes, he called towards the inside:","\"Qi Shaobai, Uncle brought you New Year gifts.\"","Qi Shaobai was accompanying Granny in watching the Nian Gen Xiao Pin Ji, a collection of CCTV New Year’s Gala skits from previous years. Ge You was sprawled paralyzed on the sofa.","Hearing there were gifts to collect, Qi Shaobai sprang up from the sofa like a carp.","\"What gifts?\"","Taking the game discs from Cheng Zhuo’s hands, Qi Shaobai scrutinized them front and back with interest, reading the game introductions in English.","He didn't notice at all a shrewd gleam flash across Cheng Zhuo's eyes for a moment.","Okay.","Qi Shaobai was interested in the game discs.","Cheng Zhuo thought inwardly: plan success.","Over the last few days, Cheng Zhuo had mulled over this for a long time.","Why was Qi Shaobai’s evaluation of his brother so different from his evaluation of him as uncles?","After thinking back and forth.","Perhaps it was because he had not shown his talents in front of Qi Shaobai.","Hmm, it must be so.","During high school, his brother was often busy with work and not at home. He was always alone at home, conquering various games. He was the game king of several blocks in the neighbourhood.","By gifting game discs as an opportunity to demonstrate to Qi Shaobai that his gaming talents were far above average.","It was a good plan.","\"Shall we compete?\" Cheng Zhuo smiled brilliantly, hooking Qi Shaobai.","Qi Shaobai nodded casually, saying offhandedly: \"Sure, let’s go.\"","A few hours later.","Feng Yaoqin walked to the entertainment room door and knocked, calling loudly:","\"Little Cheng, Shaobai, stop playing, come out for dinner, hurry up.\"","\"Coming.\" One voice answered happily.","\"Okay.\" Another voice was slightly frustrated.","After a while, the entertainment room door was pushed open.","Qi Shaobai walked lightly towards the dining room.","Cheng Zhuo followed slowly behind, patting the back of his head with a look on his face that showed he still could not figure things out at all.","How strange.","Skill level may decline but shouldn't lose every round to this little rascal Qi Shaobai.","What's going on. Where exactly was the problem.","Just as he was puzzling over this, Sheng Mumu came out from the kitchen next to him.","She held a few cans of the grape flavoured soda Qi Shaobai loved. Seeing the crestfallen look on her silly brother, she sighed and comforted with a smile: \"Silly, losing to little Qi is not embarrassing at all.\"","Cheng Zhuo looked up somewhat comprehendingly: \"?\"","Sheng Mumu looked towards the dining table.","At the end of her line of vision was Qi Shaobai’s slender and straight back.","That back used to always hide traces of stubbornness and loneliness.","Now, the shoulders naturally relaxed down.","Sitting between Granny and Qi Mo, Qi Shaobai looked carefree as he proudly announced:","\"I played games with Uncle just now and won five rounds in a row!\"","Sheng Mumu withdrew her gaze. Long lashes lowered to hide the distressed look in her eyes. Her lips turned up slightly as she said softly to Cheng Zhuo:","\"In terms of conquering games alone by oneself, he may have learned it earlier than you.\""]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: Sheng Mumu's Spring Festival Holiday","paragraphs":["The atmosphere of Spring Festival often feels the strongest on New Year's Eve.","<Sheng Mumu> always pays attention to ceremonial sense.","She prepared red envelopes for everyone.","The red envelopes were small so they could not fit too much cash.","The intention is more important than the money.","She wrote blessings on the back of each red envelope.","Everyone was overjoyed upon receiving them.","The <Old Lady> smiled brightly and said, \"I haven't received New Year's money in decades!\"","<Sheng Mumu> hooked the <Old Lady>'s arm, leaning her head closer.","She smelled the faint Six Gods Flower Cologne scent on the <Old Lady> and felt especially intimate, pulling her arm tighter.","Smiling, she said, \"Granny, you're just an old kid~ Receiving New Year's money is perfectly normal!\"","The <Old Lady> laughed loudly, \"Oh ho ho!\"","<Qi Shaobai> received the thickest red envelope. He waved it proudly in front of <Cheng Zhuo> and <Qiao Li>, bragging,","\"Mine is thicker than all of yours, don't be envious!\"","As soon as he finished talking, <Qi Mo> casually glanced at the red envelope in <Qi Shaobai>'s hand.","His gaze quickly shifted away, indifferent.","The corners of his lips raised slightly, a smug arc barely noticeable.","Envious?","A red envelope like this with blessings written on it...","This was only the second time he had received one.","Beside him, <Sheng Mumu> paused for a moment.","She was the only one who noticed a certain CEO's micro-expression.","She sighed to herself inwardly: Men.","His tail has perked up again.","After New Year's Eve, the leisurely holiday pace began.","But for the two workaholics and one high school senior at home, even an unscheduled break felt exceptionally precious.","Being able to while away time in tranquil, uneventful days was not an unhappy thing.","<Sheng Mumu> rare wrote in her e-diary, titling it — <Sheng Mumu>'s Spring Festival Holiday Diary.","Day 1 of New Year:","Plan for the morning, watch anime with <Qi Shaobai>.","But this kid actually binge watched all of \"Slam Dunk\" without me knowing and even secretly ordered the Nationals arc manga online.","Did he forget that he is still in high school? ̄へ ̄","I had prepared a bunch of snacks, ready to enjoy Sakuragi Hanamichi’s perfect three pointers. My plans were foiled.","Oh well.","Since it’s New Year, I’ll spare his life this time.","We can just watch something else.","Luckily he hasn’t seen \"Naruto\" yet.","This time, I must whisper spoilers in little Qi’s ear at the right moment.","Quietly tell him —","\"Oh, Jiraiya he—\"","\"Oh, Asuma he—\"","\"Oh, Neji he—\"","Hiahiahia~","Just thinking about it is fun already!","?(?>?<?)?","Day 2 of New Year:","My plans got interrupted halfway through.","I only got through the Scroll Battle after furiously binging yesterday.","I called <Qi Shaobai> over to continue watching today but <Cheng Zhuo> and <Qiao Li> came.","<Cheng Zhuo> was dissatisfied, thinking his mahjong loss last time was due to bad luck.","He came today to get revenge.","I laughed.","This silly brother seemed to have never tasted the bitterness of reality’s beatings before.","It was his brother-in-law’s first time playing mahjong last time. He only learned casually yet still wiped the floor with all three of them.","When someone is intelligent enough, luck and superstition don’t matter as much anymore.","I was about to advise my silly brother to rein himself in.","From the corner of my eye, I saw that man on the second floor.","<Qi Mo> had an unperturbed look on his face after overhearing <Cheng Zhuo>’s words.","<Cheng Zhuo> also saw <Qi Mo> and boldly threw down a gauntlet: “Brother-in-law, I challenge you!”","Me: ......","Alright then...","I’ll stop writing my diary here for today.","I’ll probably come back tomorrow to report the results of this battle that will last until midnight...","Day 3 of New Year:","I (with eye bags) am back.","As I expected.","That mahjong match yesterday lasted from 1 PM all the way to 1 AM.","The big winner — me again.","It wasn’t because my skills were exceptionally good.","It was because I had the strongest partner — <Qi Mo>.","Hmph~ No matter how much they win, in the end they still have to obediently hand it all over to me.","(~ ̄▽ ̄)~","Hehehe, I'm not bragging!","I’m just using this little corner of my diary to praise Mr. CEO Qi’s chivalry a bit.","He can’t see this diary, otherwise he’d pretend to be all proper while secretly feeling smug again.","He’s showering right now.","I’m writing my diary on the bed.","I’ll hurry up and finish recording today before he comes out...","Day 3 of New Year:","Still watching anime with little Qi in the afternoon.","He’s getting more and more into it.","During dinner he even discussed the characters animatedly with me.","I suddenly don’t have the heart to spoil anything for him.","Should I just give up whispering spoilers?","Ah, the shower has stopped. Qi Black Dog finished his shower.","I immediately make a big move of swiftly closing my laptop!","Day 4 of New Year:","After three days of watching anime and playing mahjong at home, I finally went out today!","Today’s theme: Sister tea party~","Refreshing and warm.","I made plans with sister <Jia Mu>, <Ting Ran>, <Li Li> to go get beauty treatments done together.","Wuhu~ヾ(??▽?)ノ","I feel like I’m fragrant from head to toe.","Before leaving, I asked <Shen Lan> if she wanted to join us.","As expected, she rejected me saying she wanted to stay home and raid, there would be epic gear drops today.","What on earth is that?","I don’t really understand the encrypted language of gamer girls.","Next time, I must get her out to participate in group activities! (clenches fist)","Oh right.","When I got home at night, little Qi was sitting resentfully in the living room.","I asked him why he didn’t call me to come home quicker.","He arrogantly threw out a CEO line: I wouldn’t be so bored.","Acting completely like an adult.","It was even funnier.","I can probably imagine what he’ll be like in the future already.","*sighs piously* Dear Lord, your disciple wishes to have a balanced diet of vegetarian and non-vegetarian dishes her whole life. Please let little Qi’s personality become gentler and less stubborn in the future.","Being too stubborn can lead to a rough life.","Oh wait.","I suddenly recalled something.","Earlier Qi Black Dog was also looking at me somewhat resentfully.","Could it be that he’s unhappy I haven’t had time to accompany him these past two days?"]}]);
